msgid "If you are playing a variant with reserve or waste stacks, cards may be moved onto the top of one or two five-card reserve/waste stacks. The top card of a reserve stack may be moved to the grid at any time, but if a card is moved to a waste stack, it cannot be moved."
msgstr "如果你玩的變體有預備堆或棄牌堆，可以把牌移到一到兩個五張的預備堆／棄牌堆頂端。預備堆最上面那張隨時都能移到網格上，但牌一旦移到棄牌堆就不能再動了。"

msgid "If you clear a space at the bottom it will be automatically filled with a card from the talon. But if the talon is gone and you clear a space at the bottom, then you can fill it with any card. You may move any card to the free cells from the tableau on top or the rows below, but only as long as there are cards left in the talon. When the talon is empty, you may only move cards from, not to the free cells. When no further moves are possible, click on the talon for a fresh row of cards at the bottom."
msgstr "若你清掉下面一排的空位，會自動從牌山補一張牌上去。但若牌山已經發完、你又清出下面的空位，就能用任意一張牌填滿。只要牌山還有牌，你可以把上方牌列或下方橫列的任意牌移到自由格；牌山一空，自由格就只能移出、不能移入。當再也沒有步可走時，點牌山就會在下面補上一整排新牌。"

