msgstr "紅與黑（The Red and the Black）"

msgid "The Wish"
msgstr "願望（The Wish）"

msgid "The cards build down by rank and by suit on the tableau. Any card may be played on an empty row. Only one card may be moved at a time."
msgstr "牌列的牌依點數與花色遞減疊放。空行可放任何牌。一次只能移動一張牌。"

msgid "The cards build down by rank only on the tableau, no more than twelve to a row. Only the Rajas may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "牌列只依點數遞減疊放，每行最多十二張。空行只能放羅闍（Rajas）。"

msgid "The cards must be arranged in the top three rows as follows:"
msgstr "上面三行的牌必須排列成下面的樣子："

msgid "The first priority is to empty a row. Then don't fill it unless it or another row can be emptied by doing so."
msgstr "首要目標是清空一行。之後不要補滿它，除非這麼做能讓該行或另一行清空。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by alternate color from ace to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區以紅黑交替從 A 遞增疊到 K。所有牌都移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit from ace to king, and the game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依同花色從 A 遞增疊到 K，所有牌都移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by same suit. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依同花色遞增疊放。所有牌都移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by suit from ace to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依同花色從 A 遞增疊到 K。所有牌都移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "The foundations are built up by suit. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依同花色遞增疊放。所有牌都移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "The foundations are less important early in the game than building movable stacks. Use the reserve stacks carefully."
msgstr "遊戲前期，建立可移動的牌堆比王牌區更重要。要好好運用預備堆。"

msgid "The foundations build up by rank ignoring suit."
msgstr "王牌區依點數遞增疊放，不分花色。"

msgid "The foundations build up in suit by steps of two."
msgstr "王牌區依同花色、每次隔兩點遞增疊放。"

msgid "The game is named after the reputed inventor of a twelve suited Ganjifa deck of singular splendor. It was engraved on ivory and hand painted by court artisans. No cards from this pack are known to still exist."
msgstr "這遊戲以傳說中十二花色 Ganjifa 牌的發明者命名。那副牌華美非凡，以象牙雕刻並由宮廷工匠手繪。目前已知沒有牌留存下來。"

msgid "The game is won if all cards are discarded except for the last card of each suit."
msgstr "除了每個花色最後一張牌，其他牌全部棄掉就獲勝。"

msgid "The game is won if all cards are moved to the tableau."
msgstr "所有牌都移到牌列就獲勝。"

msgid "The game is won if all the cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "所有牌都移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "The game is won when all cards are moved to the foundations. It doesn't matter how many cards are in each foundation."
msgstr "所有牌都移到王牌區就獲勝。每個王牌區有幾張牌並不重要。"

msgid "The number of cards you can move as a sequence is restricted by the number of free cells - the number of free cells required is the same as if you would make an equivalent sequence of moves with single cards. (As a shortcut, the computer also considers the number of free piles so that you can move even more cards as one single sequence.)"
msgstr "能一次移動幾張順子，受限於自由格的數量——所需自由格數，跟你一張一張移動同樣這段牌所需的自由格數一樣。（作為捷徑，程式也會一併計算空列數量，讓你一次能移更多張牌。）"

msgid "The object is to group the cards in sets of 13 cards, from King to Ace in an alternating color sequence. Such groups can be moved to the foundations."
msgstr "目標是把牌湊成 13 張一組、從 K 到 A 的紅黑交替順子。湊好的組可以移到王牌區。"

msgid "The object is to use up all the cards by placing them on the single foundation."
msgstr "目標是把所有牌都放到唯一那個王牌區上並用完。"

msgid "The rows build from first rank to fourth rank by suit. The foundations build in ascending suit order from Pine to Phoenix by rank. The third and fourth rank (trash) cards are interchangeable on the tableau. Cards may not be played from the foundations. Any card or correctly ordered pile may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "各行依花色從第一點疊到第四點。王牌區依花色順序從松樹（Pine）到鳳凰（Phoenix）按點數遞增疊放。第三點與第四點（廢牌）在牌列中可以互換。不可從王牌區出牌。空行可以放任何牌或順序正確的整堆。"

msgid "The rows build from first rank to fourth rank by suit. The foundations build in ascending suit order from Pine to Phoenix by rank. The third and fourth rank (trash) cards are not interchangeable on the tableau. Cards may not be played from the foundations. Only first rank cards or correctly ordered piles may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "各行依花色從第一點疊到第四點。王牌區依花色順序從松樹（Pine）到鳳凰（Phoenix）按點數遞增疊放。第三點與第四點（廢牌）在牌列中不可互換。不可從王牌區出牌。空行只能放第一點的牌或順序正確的整堆。"

msgid "The sequence wraps around, so aces can be played on kings, and vice versa."
msgstr "順子是循環的，所以 A 可以放到 K 上，K 也可以放到 A 上。"

msgid "The ten piles build"
msgstr "十堆的疊放方式"

msgid "The top row must start with a three and build by suit in increments of three,"
msgstr "最上面一行必須以 3 起頭，並依花色每次加三點疊放，"

msgid "The waste stack will be the biggest problem area. Play from it first."
msgstr "棄牌堆會是最麻煩的地方。優先從它出牌。"

msgid "There are eight foundations. At the start of the game, a king of each suit is placed on the bottom of four of them, and an ace on the other four. The foundations that start with a king are built down by suit, while the ones that start with an ace are built up."
msgstr "共有八個王牌區。遊戲開始時，其中四個的底部各放一個花色的一張 K，另外四個各放一張 A。以 K 起頭的王牌區依同花色遞減疊放，以 A 起頭的則遞增疊放。"

msgid "There is a new beta source release"
msgstr "有新版的 beta 原始碼發布"

msgid "There is no building on the tableau piles, and spaces are not filled. Only the top card can be moved."
msgstr "牌列堆不能疊放，空列也不補牌。只能移動最上面那張牌。"

msgid "There is no building on the tableau piles, and spaces are not filled. Only top cards from reach pile can be moved."
msgstr "牌列堆不能疊放，空列也不補牌。只能移動可及堆最上面的牌。"

msgid "There is no building on the tableau, except that an empty pile may be filled with any card."
msgstr "牌列不能疊放，但空列可以用任何一張牌補上。"

