msgid "(without scoring), but played with tarock cards. Trumps with a rank greater than 14 are treated as having 14 subtracted from their value."
msgstr "（不計分），但用塔羅克（tarock）牌來玩。點數大於 14 的將牌，其數值視為減掉 14。"

msgid ") builds up or down by rank ignoring color and suit, wrapping around from King to Ace and from Ace to King."
msgstr ") 不分顏色與花色，依點數遞增或遞減疊放，並從 K 循環到 A、從 A 循環到 K。"

msgid ") can hold any - and just one - card."
msgstr ") 可以放任何一張、且只能放一張牌。"

msgid ") with no redeal."
msgstr ") 不循環發牌。"

msgid ", and is named for star-shaped cells in the brain that are sometimes called \"spider cells\"."
msgstr "，命名來自腦中星形的細胞，那些細胞有時被稱為「蜘蛛細胞」。"

msgid ", and issues previously reported on GitHub, to ensure that the bug was not previously reported."
msgstr "，以及 GitHub 上先前回報過的問題，以確認這個錯誤沒有人回報過。"

msgid ", and sequences can be moved."
msgstr "，而且可以移動順子。"

msgid ", are checked using VirusTotal before they are uploaded, and at that point were considered to be malware clean."
msgstr "，在上傳前會用 VirusTotal 檢查，當時都判定為沒有惡意程式。"

msgid ", background table tiles and sound will somewhat improve the display speed."
msgstr "，桌布背景磚與音效多少能提升顯示速度。"

msgid ", but 10 piles, and 2 Aces are moved to the foundations at the start of the game."
msgstr "，但改為 10 堆，而且遊戲開始時有 2 張 A 會移到王牌區。"

msgid ", but 10 piles, no redeal, and an extra reserve that can hold up to 3 Kings."
msgstr "，但改為 10 堆、不循環發牌，另有一個最多可放 3 張 K 的額外預備堆。"

msgid ", but 10 piles, which are built down by alternate color, and any card can fill an empty space."
msgstr "，但改為 10 堆，以紅黑交替遞減疊放，且任何牌都能補空列。"

msgid ", but 16 piles, and the Aces are moved to the foundations at game start."
msgstr "，但改為 16 堆，而且 A 在遊戲開始時就移到王牌區。"

msgid ", but 6 piles, anything on an empty space, and no redeal."
msgstr "，但改為 6 堆，空列可放任何牌，且不循環發牌。"

msgid ", but 6 piles, anything on an empty space, and one redeal."
msgstr "，但改為 6 堆，空列可放任何牌，且可循環發牌 1 次。"

msgid ", but 9 piles and only Kings on empty spaces."
msgstr "，但改為 9 堆，空列只能放 K。"

msgid ", but Aces go off during dealing, and cards in the foundations are no longer in play."
msgstr "，但 A 會在發牌時被移出，而且王牌區的牌不再參與遊戲。"

msgid ", but a card is dealt to all nine tableau piles at the start of the game."
msgstr "，但遊戲開始時，九個牌列堆各發一張牌。"

msgid ", but a card is dealt to all nine tableau piles at the start. A single card is dealt to one of the foundations to determine the starting rank."
msgstr "，但開始時九個牌列堆各發一張牌，並送一張牌到某個王牌區，用來決定起始點數。"

msgid ", but a card is dealt to all nine tableau piles at the start. A single card is dealt to one of the foundations to determine the starting rank. Also, empty cards in the tableau are not automatically filled from the waste pile or stock. Instead, any other card from the tableau or waste can be used to fill empty piles."
msgstr "，但開始時九個牌列堆各發一張牌，並送一張牌到某個王牌區，用來決定起始點數。此外，牌列的空列不會自動由棄牌堆或牌山補上，改用牌列或棄牌堆的任何牌來補空列。"

msgid ", but a card is dealt to each foundation at the start of the game and building on the tableau is not allowed. Also, two redeals are allowed."
msgstr "，但遊戲開始時每個王牌區各發一張牌，而且牌列不可疊放。另外可循環發牌 2 次。"

msgid ", but a foundation can only be started with a card of the same suit as the queen dealt directly under it."
msgstr "，但王牌區只能用與正下方那張 Q 同花色的牌起頭。"

msgid ", but a king is not dealt to the foundation at the start."
msgstr "，但開始時不會發 K 到王牌區。"

msgid ", but a little bit easier because there are 2 free cells, each of which is blocked by the corresponding reserve stack."
msgstr "，但稍微簡單些，因為有 2 個自由格，只是每個自由格都被對應的預備堆擋住。"

msgid ", but a little bit easier due to the different layout, consisting of seven piles of three cards each."
msgstr "，但因佈局不同而稍微簡單：由七堆、每堆三張牌組成。"

msgid ", but adjacent tiles cannot be removed together, unless they can be connected in another way."
msgstr "，但相鄰的磚不能一起移除，除非它們能以另外的方式連接。"

msgid ", but all but the front row of the pyramid are dealt face-down, and no redeals are allowed."
msgstr "，但金字塔除了最前面那一行，其餘牌都面朝下發出，且不允許循環發牌。"

msgid ", but all cards are dealt at the beginning to the 10 piles in a triangular layout."
msgstr "，但開局就把所有牌發到 10 堆，排成三角形。"

msgid ", but all cards are dealt at the beginning to the 14 piles in a triangular layout. A two-deck variation of"
msgstr "，但開局就把所有牌發到 14 堆，排成三角形。這是下列玩法的兩副牌變化版："

msgid ", but all cards are dealt face-up, any card or sequence can be moved to an empty pile, and instead of dealing single cards from the talon, you deal one card to each tableau pile."
msgstr "，但所有牌都面朝上發出，任何牌或順子都能移到空列，而且不從牌山一張一張發，改成對每個牌列堆各發一張。"

msgid ", but all cards are dealt to the tableau at the start, in fourteen columns (twelve with eleven cards and two with twelve), and sequences are allowed to turn the corner from ace to king."
msgstr "，但開局就把所有牌發到牌列，共十四直行（十二行各十一張、兩行各十二張），且順子可以從 A 轉到 K。"

msgid ", but all cards are dealt to the tableau at the start, in twelve columns (four with eight cards and eight with nine), and sequences are allowed to turn the corner from ace to king."
msgstr "，但開局就把所有牌發到牌列，共十二直行（四行各八張、八行各九張），且順子可以從 A 轉到 K。"

msgid ", but all cards are visible, tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit, though only sequences of cards of the same suit can be moved together (in a similar manner to"
msgstr "，但所有牌都可見，牌列堆不分花色、依點數遞減疊放，只有同花色的順子能一起移動（方式類似下列玩法："

msgid ", but all cards are visible, tableau piles are built down by same suit, and cards are dealt from the talon three at a time with only two redeals allowed."
msgstr "，但所有牌都可見，牌列堆依同花色遞減疊放，牌山一次翻三張，且只允許循環發牌 2 次。"

msgid ", but all cards in the tableau are visible."
msgstr "，但牌列中所有牌都可見。"

msgid ", but all four foundations must be built in the same sequence of ranks. Additionally, the order of the foundations doesn't matter and cards are dealt one at a time from the stock."
msgstr "，但四個王牌區必須使用相同的點數順序。此外王牌區的先後順序不拘，牌山一次發一張。"

msgid ", but all of the foundations are built up from ace to king, and the tableau is built down. No cards are dealt to the foundations at the start of the game."
msgstr "，但所有王牌區都從 A 遞增疊到 K，牌列則遞減疊放。遊戲開始時不往王牌區發牌。"

msgid ", but all the cards are dealt and face-up at the start of the game."
msgstr "，但所有牌在遊戲開始時就全部發出且面朝上。"

msgid ", but all the cards in the tableau visible."
msgstr "，但牌列中所有牌都可見。"

msgid ", but all the tableau cards are dealt face-up, and an ace and king of each suit are dealt to the foundations at the start of the games. The foundations with the kings are built down by same suit from king to ace."
msgstr "，但牌列的牌全部面朝上發出，且每個花色的 A 與 K 在開局時就放到王牌區。放 K 的王牌區依同花色從 K 遞減疊到 A。"

msgid ", but an ace and a king of each suit is dealt to the foundations at the start of the game."
msgstr "，但開局時每個花色的 A 與 K 會先放到王牌區。"

msgid ", but an ace and king of each suit are dealt to the foundations at the start of the game. The foundations with the aces are built up by same suit, while the ones with the kings are built down. Also, there is an extra card in the braid."
msgstr "，但開局時每個花色的 A 與 K 會先放到王牌區。放 A 的王牌區依同花色遞增，放 K 的則遞減。此外辮子（Braid）堆多一張牌。"

msgid ", but any card can fill an empty space in the bottom row."
msgstr "，但最下面一行的空列可以放任何牌。"

msgid ", but any card or sequence can fill empty piles."
msgstr "，但任何牌或順子都能補滿空列。"

msgid ", but at the start of the game, a card is dealt to each of the twelve tableau piles. During this round, an empty tableau pile will be immediately filled from the talon. When no moves are left, the rest of the deck can be dealt."
msgstr "，但開局時十二個牌列堆各發一張牌。這一輪中，牌列一旦出現空列會立刻從牌山補牌。沒有步可走時，可以把剩下的牌發完。"

msgid ", but at the start of the game, a single card is randomly declared. This card must be the last remaining card in order to win the game."
msgstr "，但開局會隨機宣告一張牌。這張牌必須是最後剩下的那張才能獲勝。"

msgid ", but at the start of the game, the tableau is dealt as thirteen piles of three cards each."
msgstr "，但開局時牌列發成十三堆、每堆三張牌。"

msgid ", but before any other cards can be moved, any one card must be moved to the foundations. The foundations are then built up by suit starting from that rank, wrapping from king to ace as necessary."
msgstr "，但必須先把任意一張牌移到王牌區，才能移動其他牌。之後王牌區依同花色從那個點數開始遞增，必要時從 K 循環到 A。"

msgid ", but build a pile down"
msgstr "，但改為把牌遞減疊成一堆"

msgid ", but build down in any suit but the same."
msgstr "，但可遞減疊在任何非本身花色的花色上。"

msgid ", but build the tableau down by same suit, similar to"
msgstr "，但牌列改為同花色遞減疊放，類似"

msgid ", but cards and card sequences can be moved between reserve piles. Like the tableau piles, the reserve stacks are built down by same suit, but only a single card can be used to fill an empty reserve stack."
msgstr "，但牌與順子都可以在預備堆之間移動。預備堆和牌列堆一樣採同花色遞減疊放，只是空的預備堆只能用單張牌補。"

msgid ", but cards are dealt from the stock in threes, and unlimited redeals are allowed."
msgstr "，但牌山每次發 3 張，且可無限次循環發牌。"

msgid ", but cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and there is no redeal."
msgstr "，但牌山每次只發 1 張，且不循環發牌。"

msgid ", but cards are dealt from the talon three at a time, one to each of three waste piles. These cards can be moved to the tableau or foundations. No redeal is allowed. This is similar to"
msgstr "，但牌山每次發 3 張，3 個棄牌堆各分得 1 張。這些牌可以移到牌列或王牌區，不准循環發牌。這種玩法類似"

msgid ", but cards are dealt from the talon three at a time, with unlimited redeals allowed."
msgstr "，但牌山每次發 3 張，可無限次循環發牌。"

msgid ", but cards are dealt from the talon three at a time, with unlimited redeals allowed. You win as soon as the Pyramid is cleared."
msgstr "，但牌山每次發 3 張，可無限次循環發牌。金字塔一清空就算獲勝。"

msgid ", but cards are dealt singly, and two redeals."
msgstr "，但牌山每次發 1 張，並可循環發牌 2 次。"

msgid ", but cards are moved to the foundations differently. A full sequence of cards from king to ace can be moved to the foundation as a unit (similar to"
msgstr "，但牌進王牌區的方式不同：從 K 到 A 的完整順子可以整組一次移到王牌區（類似"

msgid ", but cards are paired off that total nine, with nines removed singly. Cards from 10 through King are removed in a sequence of one of each."
msgstr "，但配對的總和要為 9，9 可單張移除。10 到 K 則以每階各一張的順子移除。"

msgid ", but cards are removed if they total 12. Kings and queens are paired off together. Also, there are only six reserves, with four cards each."
msgstr "，但總和為 12 的牌即可移除，K 與 Q 互相配對。此外只有 6 個預備堆，各 4 張。"

msgid ", but cards are removed that total 11, with face cards removed in pairs of the same rank. Also, the cards from the talon are dealt to three waste piles (similar to"
msgstr "，但總和為 11 的牌即可移除，人頭牌要以相同點數成對移除。此外牌山的牌會分到 3 個棄牌堆（類似"

msgid ", but cards can only be moved to a foundation directly above a dealt queen."
msgstr "，但牌只能移到已有 Q 的正上方王牌區。"

msgid ", but cards cannot be moved to the reserve."
msgstr "，但牌不能移入預備堆。"

msgid ", but cards from the talon are dealt straight to the first tableau pile, and only same suit sequences can be moved between tableau piles."
msgstr "，但牌山的牌直接發到第 1 個牌列堆，且牌列堆之間只能移動同花色的順子。"

msgid ", but deal 24 cards to the Braid stack at game start."
msgstr "，但開局要發 24 張牌到編結（Braid）堆。"

msgid ", but deal 60 cards face up at game start."
msgstr "，但開局發 60 張正面朝上的牌。"

msgid ", but do not deal the Aces at game start."
msgstr "，但開局不發 A。"

msgid ", but during the initial deal, extra cards are dealt evenly to all piles, and the piles build down regardless of suit."
msgstr "，但初次發牌時多出的牌會平均分給所有牌堆，且牌堆遞減疊放但不計花色。"

msgid ", but easier because of a different initial layout with empty spaces dealt next to the aces."
msgstr "，但因為開局版面不同、空位發在 A 旁邊，所以更容易。"

msgid ", but empty cards in the tableau are not automatically filled from the waste pile or stock. Instead, any other card from the tableau or waste can be used to fill empty piles."
msgstr "，但牌列的空位不會自動從棄牌堆或牌山補上；改為可以用牌列或棄牌堆的其他任何牌來補空列。"

msgid ", but empty piles are automatically filled from the waste or talon."
msgstr "，但空列會自動從棄牌堆或牌山補滿。"

msgid ", but empty piles can be filled by any card."
msgstr "，但空列可以用任意一張牌補。"

msgid ", but empty piles can be filled by kings."
msgstr "，但空列只能由 K 補。"

msgid ", but empty spaces in the tableau are filled from the stock immediately."
msgstr "，但牌列的空位會立刻由牌山補上。"

msgid ", but empty tableau piles are filled immediately from the waste pile."
msgstr "，但空的牌列堆會立刻由棄牌堆補上。"

msgid ", but every other card in the tableau columns are dealt face-down (the first, third, and fifth cards are face-down while the second, fourth, and sixth are face-up), and the columns are built down by alternate color."
msgstr "，但牌列各行隔一張發一張反面（第 1、3、5 張反面，第 2、4、6 張正面），且各行採紅黑交替遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but five cards are dealt in each tableau pile, and empty tableau piles can only be filled by queens."
msgstr "，但每個牌列堆發 5 張，空的牌列堆只能由 Q 補。"

msgid ", but four cards are dealt on each tableau pile at the start of the game, and only kings and queens can be moved into empty tableau piles."
msgstr "，但開局每個牌列堆發 4 張，且只有 K 與 Q 能移入空的牌列堆。"

msgid ", but four cards of the same rank are dealt to the foundations at the start, and the foundations are built up from that rank, turning the corner from king to ace as necessary. Also, a cards is dealt to each of the four free cells at the start of the game."
msgstr "，但開局會把同點數的 4 張發到王牌區，王牌區從那個點數開始遞增疊放，必要時從 K 轉回 A。此外開局 4 個自由格各發 1 張牌。"

msgid ", but four of the tableau piles are only dealt three cards."
msgstr "，但其中 4 個牌列堆只發 3 張。"

msgid ", but hearts are moved to the foundation, and cards moved to the foundation are not filled."
msgstr "，但紅心會移到王牌區，且移到王牌區的牌不會補回。"

msgid ", but in addition to moving cards from the talon to the tableau, you are allowed to move single cards between tableau piles, building down by rank regardless of suit, and kings can be moved to empty piles."
msgstr "，但除了能把牌山的牌移到牌列，你還可以在牌列堆之間移動單張牌，依點數遞減疊放且不計花色，K 也能移到空列。"

msgid ", but instead of dealing cards from the stock one at a time, cards are dealt from the stock to all tableau piles at once."
msgstr "，但牌山不再一次只發 1 張，而是一次把牌發到所有牌列堆。"

msgid ", but kings and queens can be paired off if they are of the same suit."
msgstr "，但 K 與 Q 若同花色也能配對。"

msgid ", but kings are always dealt to the bottom of each tableau pile."
msgstr "，但每個牌列堆的最底層一定發 K。"

msgid ", but matching cards are moved to the foundations during initial dealing, and only kings can be placed in empty tableau piles."
msgstr "，但初次發牌時能配上的牌會先移到王牌區，且空的牌列堆只能放 K。"

msgid ", but matching cards are moved to the foundations during initial dealing."
msgstr "，但初次發牌時能配上的牌會移到王牌區。"

msgid ", but no cards are dealt to the foundations at the start of the game (like"
msgstr "，但開局不發任何牌到王牌區（類似"

msgid ", but no cards are dealt to the foundations at the start of the game - the foundations are built up from ace to king. The last three cards are dealt to the first, fourth, and seventh tableaus."
msgstr "，但開局不發任何牌到王牌區——王牌區從 A 遞增疊到 K。最後 3 張會發到第 1、4、7 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but no cards are dealt to the foundations at the start of the game, and no redeal is allowed."
msgstr "，但開局不發任何牌到王牌區，也不准循環發牌。"

msgid ", but no redeal."
msgstr "，但不循環發牌。"

msgid ", but once per game, after all four kings have been revealed, you are allowed to take a face-down card from another pile and continue playing."
msgstr "，但每局只有一次，在 4 張 K 全部翻開之後，你可以從別堆拿一張反面牌繼續玩。"

msgid ", but once the talon is empty, it can be used as a reserve. Any single card can be moved to this reserve, and the topmost card from this reserve can be moved to a relevant tableau pile or foundation."
msgstr "，但牌山發空後就能當作預備堆使用：任何單張牌都能移進去，而這個預備堆最上面那張可以移到合適的牌列堆或王牌區。"

msgid ", but only Jacks on empty spaces and the piles build down by rank ignoring suit."
msgstr "，但空列只能放 J，且牌堆依點數遞減疊放、不計花色。"

msgid ", but only Kings on empty spaces, and with an extra reserve stack that can be used once the talon is empty."
msgstr "，但空列只能放 K，另外多一個預備堆，要在牌山發空後才能使用。"

msgid ", but only Kings on empty spaces, and with four extra free cells."
msgstr "，但空列只能放 K，另外多 4 個自由格。"

msgid ", but only Kings on empty spaces."
msgstr "，但空列只能放 K。"

msgid ", but only a single card is dealt to each tableau pile at the start of the game."
msgstr "，但開局每個牌列堆只發 1 張。"

msgid ", but only kings can be played in empty tableau piles."
msgstr "，但空的牌列堆只能放 K。"

msgid ", but only kings, or sequences of cards starting with one, can be moved to empty tableau piles."
msgstr "，但只有 K、或以 K 開頭的順子能移到空的牌列堆。"

msgid ", but only one redeal and all cards face-up. A variant of"
msgstr "，但只可循環發牌 1 次且全牌正面朝上，為下列玩法的變體"

msgid ", but only one redeal."
msgstr "，但只可循環發牌 1 次。"

msgid ", but only played with cards from ace to six, and no redeal is allowed. The sixes are removed before play to form the four gaps."
msgstr "，但只用 A 到 6 的牌，且不准循環發牌。6 會在開打前先移除，形成 4 個空位。"

msgid ", but only played with cards from two to ten, and only one redeal is allowed."
msgstr "，但只用 2 到 10 的牌，且只可循環發牌 1 次。"

msgid ", but only played with the cards from ace to ten. Very easy."
msgstr "，但只用 A 到 10 的牌。非常容易。"

msgid ", but only single cards can be moved."
msgstr "，但只能移動單張牌。"

msgid ", but only six piles with a single card each, and one card is dealt to each reserve at the start of the game. When there are no moves left, you can deal one card to each tableau pile from the remaining stock."
msgstr "，但只有 6 堆、每堆 1 張，且開局每個預備堆各發 1 張。當沒有可走的步時，你可以從剩下的牌山發 1 張到每個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but only the top cards of each pile are dealt face-up."
msgstr "，但每堆只有最上面那張正面朝上。"

msgid ", but only three of the tableau piles contain face-down cards (similar to"
msgstr "，但只有 3 個牌列堆含有反面牌（類似"

msgid ", but only three of the tableau piles contain face-down cards."
msgstr "，但只有 3 個牌列堆含有反面牌。"

msgid ", but only two redeals."
msgstr "，但只可循環發牌 2 次。"

msgid ", but pairs must be of the same suit, including the jack-queen-king pairs sent to the reserves. Also, there are fifteen tableau cards."
msgstr "，但配對必須同花色，包含送入預備堆的 J、Q、K 對。此外牌列共有 15 張。"

msgid ", but pairs of cards are removed if they are the same or adjacent ranks, and no redeals are allowed."
msgstr "，但點數相同或相鄰的兩張就能配對移除，且不准循環發牌。"

msgid ", but piles are built down by alternate color."
msgstr "，但牌堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but piles are built up or down by alternate color."
msgstr "，但牌堆可採紅黑交替遞增或遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but piles build down by alternate color, only single cards can be moved between tableau piles, and only kings can be placed in empty spaces."
msgstr "，但牌堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放，牌列堆之間只能移動單張牌，且空列只能放 K。"

msgid ", but piles build down by alternate color."
msgstr "，但牌堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but piles build down by any suit but own, and three cards are dealt from the stock at a time with two redeals."
msgstr "，但牌堆可遞減疊在任何非本身花色的花色上，且牌山每次發 3 張、可循環發牌 2 次。"

msgid ", but piles build down by any suit but own, anything on an empty space, and no redeal."
msgstr "，但牌堆可遞減疊在任何非本身花色的花色上，空列可放任意牌，且不循環發牌。"

msgid ", but piles build down by rank, cards are dealt singly, and no redeal."
msgstr "，但牌堆依點數遞減疊放，牌山每次發 1 張，且不循環發牌。"

msgid ", but piles build down by same color (sequences can be moved only if they build down by same suit), and only two redeals."
msgstr "，但牌堆依同色遞減疊放（順子必須同花色且遞減才能移動），且只可循環發牌 2 次。"

msgid ", but piles build down by same color (sequences can be moved only if they build down by same suit), anything on an empty space, and no redeal."
msgstr "，但牌堆依同色遞減疊放（順子必須同花色且遞減才能移動），空列可放任意牌，且不循環發牌。"

msgid ", but piles build up or down by alternate color."
msgstr "，但牌堆可紅黑交替遞增或遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but played with cards from seven through king, plus the aces. During the initial deal, the sevens are dealt to the foundations, and if an eight or nine would be dealt that can be played to a foundation, it is dealt there immediately."
msgstr "，但只用 7 到 K 的牌，外加 A。初次發牌時 7 會發到王牌區；若原本要發的 8 或 9 剛好能放到王牌區，就直接發到那裡。"

msgid ", but played with two decks. Half of the cards are dealt at the start of the game and the other half are in a stock pile. When a card is removed from the tableau, a card is dealt from the stock to replace it until the stock is empty."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌。開局發一半的牌，另一半留在牌山。牌列有牌被移走時，就從牌山補發 1 張，直到牌山發空。"

msgid ", but remove pairs whose ranks total 15, or pairs of aces."
msgstr "，但移除總和為 15 的配對，或兩張 A 的配對。"

msgid ", but sequences are by alternate color, and four cards per pile."
msgstr "，但順子採紅黑交替，且每堆 4 張。"

msgid ", but sequences in the tableau can turn the corner, so kings can be played on aces."
msgstr "，但牌列中的順子可以首尾迴環，因此 A 上可以放 K。"

msgid ", but sequences of cards can be moved to empty tableau piles."
msgstr "，但順子可以一起移到空的牌列堆。"

msgid ", but sequences of cards can be moved, only kings can fill empty piles, and a single redeal is allowed. With this redeal, all of the remaining cards on the tableau are shuffled and a new tableau is dealt."
msgstr "，但順子可以一起移動，空列只能由 K 補，且允許循環發牌 1 次。這次循環發牌會把牌列剩下的牌全部洗過，重新發出一個牌列。"

msgid ", but sequences of cards may be moved together."
msgstr "，但順子可以一起移動。"

msgid ", but sequences of cards of the same suit can be moved as a unit."
msgstr "，但同花色的順子可以整組移動。"

msgid ", but sequences of cards of the same suit can be moved between tableau piles."
msgstr "，但同花色的順子可以在牌列堆之間移動。"

msgid ", but sequences of cards of the same suit can be moved together, and only two redeals are allowed."
msgstr "，但同花色的順子可以一起移動，且只可循環發牌 2 次。"

msgid ", but sequences wrap around from Ace to King, and no card will be dealt to an empty space."
msgstr "，但順子可從 A 到 K 首尾循環，且不會發牌到空位。"

msgid ", but seven piles, anything on an empty space, and one redeal."
msgstr "，但改為 7 堆、空列可放任意牌，並循環發牌 1 次。"

msgid ", but single cards can be moved between reserve piles. Like the tableau piles, the reserve stacks are built down by same suit."
msgstr "，但預備堆之間可以移動單張牌。預備堆和牌列堆一樣採同花色遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but tableau piles are built down by rank regardless of suit, though only sequences of the same suit can be moved as a unit (similar to"
msgstr "，但牌列堆依點數遞減疊放且不計花色，只有同花色的順子能整組移動（類似"

msgid ", but tableau piles are built down by same suit or by same rank. Combined sequences that contain groups that are both the same rank or suit cannot be moved as a unit."
msgstr "，但牌列堆以同花色或同點數遞減疊放。若順子中同時含有同點數與同花色的段落，就不能整組移動。"

msgid ", but tableau piles are built down by same suit, and sequences of cards can be moved together and kings can be played to empty piles. Foundations are built up by the same suit."
msgstr "，但牌列堆採同花色遞減疊放，順子可以一起移動，且 K 可以放進空列。王牌區則採同花色從 A 遞增疊到 K。"

msgid ", but tableau piles are built down by same suit, empty tableau piles are immediately filled from the stock, the foundations are built up from ace to king, and there is a five card reserve."
msgstr "，但牌列堆採同花色遞減疊放，空的牌列堆會立刻由牌山補滿，王牌區從 A 遞增疊到 K，另有 5 張的預備堆。"

msgid ", but tableau piles are built down in any suit but their own."
msgstr "，但牌列堆可遞減疊在任何非本身花色的花色上。"

msgid ", but tableau piles are built down regardless of suit, and only Kings can be played on empty spaces."
msgstr "，但牌列堆遞減疊放且不計花色，且空列只能放 K。"

msgid ", but tableau piles are built regardless of suit, only single cards can be moved to empty tableau piles, and there are two redeals allowed - during the first deal, cards are dealt in threes, and one fewer card is dealt from the talon at a time after each redeal."
msgstr "，但牌列堆疊放不計花色，只有單張牌能移到空的牌列堆，且允許 2 次循環發牌——首次發牌時每次發 3 張，之後每循環一次，每次發的張數就少 1 張。"

msgid ", but tableau piles are built up or down by rank, regardless of suit."
msgstr "，但牌列堆可依點數遞增或遞減疊放，不計花色。"

msgid ", but tableau piles can wrap from ace to king, and there are no redeals or restrictions as to which tableau piles cards can be moved to foundations from."
msgstr "，但牌列堆可從 A 迴環到 K，不循環發牌，且牌從哪個牌列堆移到王牌區也沒有限制。"

msgid ", but ten piles, and anything on an empty space."
msgstr "，但改為 10 堆，且空列可放任意牌。"

msgid ", but ten piles, anything on an empty space, and no redeal."
msgstr "，但改為 10 堆、空列可放任意牌，且不循環發牌。"

msgid ", but the"
msgstr ", but the"

msgid ", but the 12 piles build down by alternate color, empty rows are automatically filled from the Waste or Talon, and sequences can be moved."
msgstr "，但 12 個牌堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放，空排會自動從棄牌堆或牌山補滿，且順子可以移動。"

msgid ", but the 5 piles build down by rank ignoring suit, and sequences can be moved."
msgstr "，但 5 個牌堆依點數遞減疊放、不計花色，且順子可以移動。"

msgid ", but the 8 piles build down by rank ignoring suit, and sequences can be moved."
msgstr "，但 8 個牌堆依點數遞減疊放、不計花色，且順子可以移動。"

msgid ", but the 8 piles build down by rank ignoring suit, and two redeals are allowed."
msgstr "，但 8 個牌堆依點數遞減疊放、不計花色，且可循環發牌 2 次。"

msgid ", but the 8 piles build down by rank ignoring suit."
msgstr "，但 8 個牌堆依點數遞減疊放、不計花色。"

msgid ", but the 8 piles build down in suit, cards are dealt singly, the reserve is face-up, and only one redeal."
msgstr "，但 8 個牌堆依花色遞減疊放，牌山每次發 1 張，預備堆正面朝上，且只可循環發牌 1 次。"

msgid ", but the 8 piles build up or down by suit, and four foundations are built up by suit from ace to king while the other are built down from king to ace."
msgstr "，但 8 個牌堆可依花色遞增或遞減疊放；其中 4 個王牌區從 A 依花色遞增疊到 K，另外 4 個則從 K 遞減疊到 A。"

msgid ", but the 9 piles build down by alternate color."
msgstr "，但 9 個牌堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but the 9 piles build down by any suit but own."
msgstr "，但 9 個牌堆可遞減疊在任何非本身花色的花色上。"

msgid ", but the Aces are moved to the left."
msgstr "，但 A 會移到左側。"

msgid ", but the Aces are not dealt to the foundations at game start."
msgstr "，但開局不把 A 發到王牌區。"

msgid ", but the aces and kings are dealt to the foundations at the start of the game."
msgstr "，但開局會把 A 與 K 發到王牌區。"

msgid ", but the aces and twos are dealt at the bottom of each tableau column, and only kings can be used to fill empty tableau piles."
msgstr "，但 A 與 2 會發在每個牌列行的最底層，且空的牌列堆只能由 K 補。"

msgid ", but the aces and twos are dealt at the bottom of each tableau column."
msgstr "，但 A 與 2 會發在每個牌列行的最底層。"

msgid ", but the aces are dealt to the foundations at the start of the game, and there are only seven tableau piles."
msgstr "，但開局把 A 發到王牌區，且只有 7 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but the aces are dealt to the foundations at the start of the game, leaving one tableau pile that starts empty."
msgstr "，但開局把 A 發到王牌區，因此會留下 1 個牌列堆是空的。"

msgid ", but the aces are dealt to the foundations at the start of the game. In this variant, the reserve is known as the fly."
msgstr "，但開局把 A 發到王牌區。在此變體中，預備堆被稱為「蠅（fly）」。"

msgid ", but the aces are dealt to the foundations at the start, and the foundations are built up by suit. Also, six cards are dealt to reserve piles, which can be moved to appropriate foundations at any time."
msgstr "，但開局把 A 發到王牌區，王牌區再依花色遞增疊放。此外預備堆會發 6 張，任何時候都能移到適合的王牌區。"

msgid ", but the aces aren't dealt to the foundations at the start, and there's one more tableau pile."
msgstr "，但開局不把 A 發到王牌區，且多 1 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but the card layout is inverted, for a more difficult game."
msgstr "，但牌局配置上下顛倒，難度更高。"

msgid ", but the cards are built in reverse order. Tableau piles are built up while foundations are built down, starting from kings."
msgstr "，但疊放順序反過來：牌列堆採遞增疊放，王牌區則從 K 開始遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but the cards are dealt to thirteen piles of four cards."
msgstr "，但牌會發成 13 堆、每堆 4 張。"

msgid ", but the cards can be moved like in"
msgstr "，但牌的移動方式如同"

msgid ", but the cards from the stock are only dealt 4 at a time, and the foundations are built up regardless of suit."
msgstr "，但牌山每次只發 4 張，且王牌區遞增疊放不計花色。"

msgid ", but the first and last cards are not set."
msgstr "，但開頭與最後一張不預先固定。"

msgid ", but the foundations are built more traditionally, from ace to king of the same suit. Also, tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and there are five cards in each pile at the start of the game."
msgstr "，但王牌區改為較為傳統的疊法，依同花色從 A 遞增疊到 K。此外牌列堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放，開局每堆 5 張。"

msgid ", but the foundations are built up by same color, and wrap from king to ace. At the start of the game, a two through five are dealt to the foundations, in alternating colors."
msgstr "，但王牌區依同色遞增疊放，且可從 K 迴環到 A。開局會把 2 到 5 以交錯花色發到王牌區。"

msgid ", but the foundations build up from Jack to Ten, turning the corner from King to Ace when necessary. Only one card is dealt to each of only six tableau piles at the start of the game, and the Jacks are dealt to the foundations."
msgstr "，但王牌區從 J 遞增疊到 10，必要時從 K 轉回 A。開局只有 6 個牌列堆、各發 1 張，且 J 會發到王牌區。"

msgid ", but the foundations build up from Two to Ace, turning the corner from King to Ace when necessary. Only one card is dealt to each tableau pile at the start of the game, and the deuces are dealt to the foundations."
msgstr "，但王牌區從 2 遞增疊到 A，必要時從 K 轉回 A。開局每個牌列堆各發 1 張，且 2 會發到王牌區。"

msgid ", but the foundations build up in suit, and 6 row stacks."
msgstr "，但王牌區依花色遞增疊放，且有 6 個橫排堆。"

msgid ", but the foundations build up in suit."
msgstr "，但王牌區依花色遞增疊放。"

msgid ", but the foundations can be built up starting from any rank (determined by the first card you move to the foundations), wrapping from king to ace as necessary."
msgstr "，但王牌區可以從任意點數開始疊（以你先放進王牌區的第一張為準），必要時從 K 迴環到 A。"

msgid ", but the game starts with eleven cards in the reserve."
msgstr "，但開局預備堆有 11 張牌。"

msgid ", but the initial foundation cards are in club suit."
msgstr "，但王牌區的起始牌是梅花。"

msgid ", but the last two cards are dealt to the tableau instead of reserves, and there is only one free cell."
msgstr "，但最後 2 張改發到牌列而非預備堆，且只有 1 個自由格。"

msgid ", but the piles build down by alternate color and only the top card of each pile is face-up. A variant of"
msgstr "，但牌堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放，且每堆只有最上面那張正面朝上，為下列玩法的變體"

msgid ", but the piles build down by alternate color, and sequences can be moved."
msgstr "，但牌堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放，且順子可以移動。"

msgid ", but the piles build down by any suit but own."
msgstr "，但牌堆可遞減疊在任何非本身花色的花色上。"

msgid ", but the piles build down by rank ignoring suit."
msgstr "，但牌堆依點數遞減疊放、不計花色。"

msgid ", but the piles build down by rank only, sequences can be moved if they build down by suit and rank, empty piles are automatically filled from the waste or talon, deal 3 cards each time, and 3 redeals."
msgstr "，但牌堆只依點數遞減疊放；順子必須同花色且遞減才能移動；空列會自動從棄牌堆或牌山補滿；每次發 3 張，並可循環發牌 3 次。"

msgid ", but the piles build down by rank."
msgstr "，但牌堆依點數遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but the piles build down by suit, cards are dealt singly, and two redeals."
msgstr "，但牌堆依花色遞減疊放，牌山每次發 1 張，且可循環發牌 2 次。"

msgid ", but the piles build down by suit."
msgstr "，但牌堆依花色遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but the queens are not dealt separately, and the foundations are built up from ace to queen. Also, you can build the tableau piles down by rank, regardless of suit, but only once the talon is empty."
msgstr "，但 Q 不會分開發，王牌區從 A 遞增疊到 Q。此外牌山發空之後，牌列堆可以依點數遞減疊放且不計花色。"

msgid ", but the reserve consists of twelve cards, and only the top one is visible."
msgstr "，但預備堆有 12 張，且只有最上面那張可見。"

msgid ", but the reserve is dealt face-up, and empty rows are not automatically filled."
msgstr "，但預備堆正面朝上發，且空排不會自動補滿。"

msgid ", but the reserve is dealt face-up, and two redeals."
msgstr "，但預備堆正面朝上發，且可循環發牌 2 次。"

msgid ", but the reserve may hold only a single card."
msgstr "，但預備堆只能放 1 張牌。"

msgid ", but the reserves are filled at game start, and only Kings on empty spaces."
msgstr "，但開局就把預備堆填滿，且空列只能放 K。"

msgid ", but the reserves contain four piles of twelve cards each, and a card is dealt from the deck to any empty reserve piles."
msgstr "，但預備堆為 4 堆、每堆 12 張，且會從牌中發 1 張到任何空的預備堆。"

msgid ", but the reserves contain four piles of twelve cards each. The waste pile is built up or down regardless of suit."
msgstr "，但預備堆為 4 堆、每堆 12 張。棄牌堆可不限花色遞增或遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but the rows are dealt face-up, similar to"
msgstr "，但各排正面朝上發，類似"

msgid ", but the rows are dealt face-up."
msgstr "，但各排正面朝上發。"

msgid ", but the rows build"
msgstr "，但各排的疊法是"

msgid ", but the sequences can wrap from king to ace. In order to win, the cards need to be arranged in four columns, each wrapping around and containing two full sequences."
msgstr "，但順子可從 K 迴環到 A。要獲勝，牌必須排成 4 行，每行首尾相接且各含兩組完整順子。"

msgid ", but the spaces after each redeal are at the end of each row."
msgstr "，但每次循環發牌後的空位會落在各排的最末端。"

msgid ", but the suits in the foundations do not need to all be in the same sequence (just alternating colors)."
msgstr "，但王牌區的花色不必全是同一組順子（只要顏色交錯即可）。"

msgid ", but the tableau is built down by rank, regardless of suit."
msgstr "，但牌列依點數遞減疊放，不計花色。"

msgid ", but the tableau is built up or down by alternate color, with any card being able to be moved to empty piles, foundations are built down by same suit from king to ace, and only two redeals are allowed."
msgstr "，但牌列可紅黑交替遞增或遞減疊放，空列能放任意牌；王牌區依同花色從 K 遞減疊到 A，且只可循環發牌 2 次。"

msgid ", but the tableau is dealt in thirteen piles of three cards each, with the bottom card of each pile face-down, and the piles build down by any suit but own."
msgstr "，但牌列發成 13 堆、每堆 3 張，每堆最底那張反面朝下，且牌堆可遞減疊在任何非本身花色的花色上。"

msgid ", but the tableau piles are arranged so all cards in the tableau are visible. Gameplay is identical."
msgstr "，但牌列堆的排列方式讓所有牌列牌都看得到，玩法完全相同。"

msgid ", but the tableau piles are built down by alternate color."
msgstr "，但牌列堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but the tableau piles are built down regardless of suits, though only sequences of the same suit can be moved as a unit (similar to"
msgstr "，但牌列堆遞減疊放且不計花色，只有同花色的順子能整組移動（類似"

msgid ", but the tableau piles are built down, regardless of suit."
msgstr "，但牌列堆採遞減疊放，不計花色。"

msgid ", but the tableau piles are dealt in two rows of six cards, and are built down by alternating colors."
msgstr "，但牌列堆發成兩排、每排 6 張，並採紅黑交替遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but the tableau piles only have the top card exposed."
msgstr "，但牌列堆只露出最上面那張。"

msgid ", but the three piles build down by rank, cards are dealt singly, and no redeal."
msgstr "，但 3 個牌堆依點數遞減疊放，牌山每次發 1 張，且不循環發牌。"

msgid ", but the twos through fives are removed from the deck, and sixes are played after aces, with only one redeal."
msgstr "，但會先從牌中拿掉 2 到 5，6 要接在 A 之後，且只可循環發牌 1 次。"

msgid ", but there are 16 piles, built down by alternate color, and the aces are dealt to the foundations at the start."
msgstr "，但共有 16 堆、採紅黑交替遞減疊放，且開局把 A 發到王牌區。"

msgid ", but there are eight four-card reserves dealt face-down, one next to each foundation pile. If there is a card in the adjacent foundation, you can flip the top card of this reserve, and move it to the tableau or foundations."
msgstr "，但有 4 張一組的預備堆採反面朝下，每個王牌區旁各放一堆。若相鄰的王牌區已有牌，你就能翻開該預備堆最上面那張，移到牌列或王牌區。"

msgid ", but there are four waste piles. When drawing from the stock, one card is added to each pile. Cards from one waste pile can also be moved to another. When redealing, all of the piles are combined."
msgstr "，但有 4 個棄牌堆。從牌山抽牌時，每個棄牌堆各加 1 張。某個棄牌堆的牌也能移到另一個棄牌堆。循環發牌時會把所有棄牌堆合併。"

msgid ", but there are no restrictions when placing a tile next to two or more other tiles - they just have to match the color or symbol of each."
msgstr "，但把牌塊放到兩塊以上相鄰時沒有額外限制——只要顏色或符號都能對應上即可。"

msgid ", but there are twelve tableau piles, and the twos aren't dealt to the foundation at the start."
msgstr "，但牌列有 12 堆，且開局不把 2 發到王牌區。"

msgid ", but there are twenty-two tableau piled, all cards dealt from the stock must be played to tableau or foundation piles immediately, and there are four reserve piles."
msgstr "，但牌列有 22 堆，從牌山發出的牌都必須立刻移到牌列或王牌區，另有 4 個預備堆。"

msgid ", but there are two reserve stacks."
msgstr "，但有 2 個預備堆。"

msgid ", but there is no tableau."
msgstr "，但沒有牌列。"

msgid ", but there is no talon. Instead, all of the remaining cards are dealt to eight reserve piles of three cards each, the top of which can be paired with cards in the pyramid or on top of other reserves."
msgstr "，但沒有牌山。剩下的牌全部發成 8 個預備堆、每堆 3 張，其最上面那張可以跟金字塔中的牌、或其他預備堆的頂牌配對。"

msgid ", but three cards are dealt to each tableau pile, and sequences of cards can be moved together, but empty piles can only be filled with cards from the talon or reserves."
msgstr "，但每個牌列堆發 3 張，順子可以一起移動，只是空列只能由牌山或預備堆的牌補滿。"

msgid ", but tiles do not need to be placed adjacent to other tiles, and there are no restrictions when placing a tile next to two or more other tiles - they just have to match the color or symbol of each."
msgstr "，但牌塊不必緊貼其他牌塊放置；把牌塊放到兩塊以上相鄰時也沒有額外限制——只要顏色或符號都能對應上即可。"

msgid ", but tiles do not need to be placed adjacent to other tiles."
msgstr "，但牌塊不必緊貼其他牌塊放置。"

msgid ", but two cards are not dealt face-down to the crib. After moving two cards from the hand to the crib, a second six-card hand is dealt, and you move two cards from that hand to finish the crib. Then, all three hands are scored."
msgstr "，但不會先翻面發 2 張牌到捨牌堆（crib）。從手牌移 2 張進捨牌堆後，會再發一組 6 張的手牌，你從那組裡移 2 張把捨牌堆補滿，接著三組手牌一起計分。"

msgid ", but two decks and twenty-four playing piles."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 24 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but two redeals are allowed, in which the tableau piles are combined and placed on top of each other to form a new deck."
msgstr "，但可循環發牌 2 次；循環時牌列堆會合併後疊在一起，組成新的一副牌。"

msgid ", but two redeals are allowed, in which the tableau piles are shuffled together to form a new deck. Cards are arranged so only the top cards are visible."
msgstr "，但可循環發牌 2 次；循環時牌列堆會一起洗過組成新的一副牌，並排列成只露出各堆最上面那張。"

msgid ", but unlimited redeals are allowed."
msgstr "，但可無限次循環發牌。"

msgid ", but using a waste with 2 redeals instead of row stacks."
msgstr "，但改用附 2 次循環發牌的棄牌堆，取代橫排堆。"

msgid ", but using an eight column tableau instead of a stack and waste pile."
msgstr "，但改為 8 列的牌列，取代原本的牌堆與棄牌堆。"

msgid ", but using two 78 card Tarock decks, and the number of cards you can move as a sequence is not restricted."
msgstr "，但使用兩副 78 張的塔羅（Tarock）牌，且可移動的順子張數不受限制。"

msgid ", but when a king, queen, or jack is in the reserves, those tableau piles are not filled until they are discarded to the foundation. In other words, the King, Queen, and Jack must all be discarded at the same time."
msgstr "，但若 J、Q、K 還在預備堆裡，對應的牌列堆就不會補牌，要等它們被移到王牌區才補。換句話說，K、Q、J 要一次全部移走。"

msgid ", but when dealing from the talon, if there are any empty tableau piles, those are the only piles cards are dealt to."
msgstr "，但從牌山發牌時，只要有空的牌列堆，就只發到那些空堆。"

msgid ", but when dealing, the piles are started by the cards after aces are dealt, the tableau piles and foundations are built regardless of suit, and there are no free cells."
msgstr "，但發牌時各堆從 A 之後那張開始疊，牌列堆與王牌區都不限花色疊放，且沒有自由格。"

msgid ", but when you move a pile, both cards are removed."
msgstr "，但移動牌堆時，兩張會一併移走。"

msgid ", but while one foundation of each suit is built up from ace to king, the other is built down from king to ace."
msgstr "，但每個花色的兩個王牌區中，一個從 A 遞增疊到 K，另一個則從 K 遞減疊到 A。"

msgid ", but with 12 piles and one card in each pile."
msgstr "，但改為 12 堆、每堆 1 張。"

msgid ", but with 12 piles and three cards in each pile."
msgstr "，但改為 12 堆、每堆 3 張。"

msgid ", but with 12 piles of one card each, sequences can be moved, and empty piles are automatically filled from the waste or talon."
msgstr "，但改為 12 堆各 1 張，順子可以移動，且空列會自動從棄牌堆或牌山補滿。"

msgid ", but with 13 piles of 3 cards each."
msgstr "，但改為 13 堆、每堆 3 張。"

msgid ", but with 13 piles, and sequences can be moved."
msgstr "，但改為 13 堆，且順子可以移動。"

msgid ", but with 13 piles."
msgstr "，但改為 13 堆。"

msgid ", but with 2 decks and 8 foundations."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 8 個王牌區。"

msgid ", but with 6 piles."
msgstr "，但改為 6 堆。"

msgid ", but with 8 free cells."
msgstr "，但有 8 個自由格。"

msgid ", but with 8 tableau piles, with only the top cards face-up, and sequences of cards of the same suit can be moved together."
msgstr "，但有 8 個牌列堆，只有各堆最上面那張正面朝上，且同花色的順子可以一起移動。"

msgid ", but with 8 tableau piles, with only the top cards face-up, and the piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit, though sequences of cards of the same suit can be moved together."
msgstr "，但有 8 個牌列堆，只有各堆最上面那張正面朝上，牌堆依點數遞減疊放、不計花色，但同花色的順子可以一起移動。"

msgid ", but with Osmium rules."
msgstr "，但採鋨（Osmium）玩法的規則。"

msgid ", but with Tarock cards."
msgstr "，但改用塔羅（Tarock）牌。"

msgid ", but with a Hex A Deck. The initial column is dealt empty, and the sequences are built up from 1 to 16. Wizards are wild, and can be freely moved anywhere, except directly after another wizard or an empty space. Ultimately, the wizards must be in the column at the far right, adjacent to the 10s, at the end of the game."
msgstr "，但改用 Hex A Deck 牌組。開局第一列發成空的，順子從 1 遞增疊到 16。Wizard 是萬用牌，可以自由移到任何地方，但不能直接放在另一張 Wizard 或空位之後。遊戲結束時，Wizard 必須位於最右側那列、緊挨著 10。"

msgid ", but with a different layout (six stacks of six cards and one of seven, and nine reserve cards). Also, it is possible for two cards of the same rank to be in a single column, so extra care must be taken not to trap the last remaining pair of a given rank in the same column."
msgstr "，但版面不同（6 堆各 6 張、1 堆 7 張，外加 9 張預備牌）。同一列也可能出現兩張相同點數，所以要格外小心，別把某個點數最後剩下的一對卡在同一列裡。"

msgid ", but with a different layout consisting of eight piles of one card, the foundations in between. The 8 piles build down by rank, ignoring suit, and empty piles are automatically filled from the waste or talon."
msgstr "，但版面改為 8 堆各 1 張，王牌區夾在中間。這 8 堆依點數遞減疊放、不計花色，空列會自動從棄牌堆或牌山補滿。"

msgid ", but with a different layout consisting of eight piles of one card, the foundations in between. The 8 piles build down by same suit, and empty piles are automatically filled from the waste or talon."
msgstr "，但版面改為 8 堆各 1 張，王牌區夾在中間。這 8 堆採同花色遞減疊放，空列會自動從棄牌堆或牌山補滿。"

msgid ", but with a different layout consisting of four piles of seven cards and four piles of six, with the bottom four cards in the piles of six face-down, and the piles build down by same suit."
msgstr "，但版面改為 4 堆各 7 張、4 堆各 6 張，6 張那幾堆底下 4 張反面朝下，且牌堆採同花色遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but with a different layout consisting of one pile of eight cards, and sixteen piles of six cards."
msgstr "，但版面為 1 堆 8 張與 16 堆各 6 張。"

msgid ", but with a different layout consisting of seven piles of four cards each (with only the top card of each visible). The remaining cards are in the talon, and when there are no moves left, you can deal one to each tableau pile."
msgstr "，但版面為 7 堆各 4 張（每堆只露出最上面那張）。剩下的牌在牌山，當沒有可走的步時，你可以發 1 張到每個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with a different layout, consisting of six piles of six cards each - all cards are face-up in the leftmost pile, and each pile to the right has one more face-down card at the bottom of it than the one to its left. Additionally, no redeals are allowed."
msgstr "，但版面改為 6 堆各 6 張——最左那堆全部正面朝上，之後每往右一堆，底部就多 1 張反面牌。此外不准循環發牌。"

msgid ", but with a different layout, consisting of ten columns, with each of the first eight columns having one more card than the previous (1 card to 8 cards), and the last two also having eight cards, and with only two free cells."
msgstr "，但版面改為 10 列，前 8 列的張數逐列多 1（1 張到 8 張），最後兩列也各 8 張，且只有 2 個自由格。"

msgid ", but with a different layout, consisting of ten piles of five cards each. The bottom three cards of the rightmost tableau piles are face-down."
msgstr "，但版面改為 10 堆各 5 張，最右側牌列堆的底下 3 張反面朝下。"

msgid ", but with a different layout, consisting of three \"fir-trees\" of sixteen cards each, dealt in alternating rows of one and two cards. Cards from the fir-trees can only be moved to the waste if all their covered cards are gone."
msgstr "，但版面改為三棵「樅樹」，每棵 16 張，以 1 張與 2 張交錯發成各排。樅樹上的牌，只有在蓋住它的牌都清掉後才能移到棄牌堆。"

msgid ", but with a different layout, seven reserve cards, and the foundations start empty."
msgstr "，但版面不同，預備牌 7 張，且王牌區開局是空的。"

msgid ", but with a different layout, with four face-up cards in the first three piles and three in the left, and the piles are built down by same suit."
msgstr "，但版面不同：前 3 堆各 4 張正面朝上、左邊各 3 張，且牌堆採同花色遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but with a different layout, with piles containing 1, 3, 5, 7, 7, 5, 3, and 1 cards from left to right, and only every other card is face-down. Also, no redeals are allowed."
msgstr "，但版面不同，由左到右各堆依序為 1、3、5、7、7、5、3、1 張，且只有一半的牌反面朝下。此外不准循環發牌。"

msgid ", but with a different tableau layout (eight piles of six cards)."
msgstr "，但牌列版面不同（8 堆各 6 張）。"

msgid ", but with a full deck of cards, and eight rows of cards are dealt per redeal."
msgstr "，但使用整副牌，且每次循環發牌要發 8 排。"

msgid ", but with a layout, and tableau pile build style similar to"
msgstr "，但版面與牌列堆疊法類似"

msgid ", but with a maximum of eight cards allowed in the reserve."
msgstr "，但預備堆最多只能有 8 張。"

msgid ", but with a single free cell added. Any card may be moved to this free cell, but a card in this free cell cannot be moved to the foundation or used to move another card to the foundation. It can only be returned to the tableau by being moved to an empty column."
msgstr "，但多出一個自由格。任何牌都能移到這個自由格，但格裡的牌不能移到王牌區，也不能用來讓別的牌進王牌區；只能靠移到空列的方式放回牌列。"

msgid ", but with a single reserve cell added - a single card can be moved to or from this reserve at any time."
msgstr "，但多出一個預備格——任何時候都可以把單張牌移進或移出這個預備格。"

msgid ", but with a tableau consisting of seven piles of five cards each, and 13 cards in the reserves."
msgstr "，但牌列為 7 堆各 5 張，預備堆共 13 張。"

msgid ", but with a triangular layout, with ten tableau piles, with an increasing number of cards in each. Also, only kings can be moved to empty tableau piles."
msgstr "，但採三角形版面，共 10 個牌列堆且張數逐堆遞增。此外空的牌列堆只能放 K。"

msgid ", but with a varying base card - after dealing, the next card is dealt to the foundation to determine the base rank. Also, the foundations and the 12 piles wrap around, and empty piles are automatically filled from the waste or talon."
msgstr "，但基準牌會變動——發完牌後，會再發 1 張到王牌區來決定基準點數。此外王牌區與那 12 堆都可首尾循環，空列會自動從棄牌堆或牌山補滿。"

msgid ", but with all cards face-up."
msgstr "，但全部牌正面朝上。"

msgid ", but with all cards visible."
msgstr "，但全部牌都看得到。"

msgid ", but with an additional 13 card reserve. The top card of this reserve can be moved to any appropriate tableau or foundation pile."
msgstr "，但多一個 13 張的預備堆。這個預備堆最上面那張可以移到任何合適的牌列或王牌區。"

msgid ", but with an additional draw."
msgstr "，但可以多抽一次牌。"

msgid ", but with eight columns of eight cards each, plus four free cells."
msgstr "，但改為 8 列各 8 張，外加 4 個自由格。"

msgid ", but with eight foundations."
msgstr "，但有 8 個王牌區。"

msgid ", but with eight piles and one redeal."
msgstr "，但有 8 堆並循環發牌 1 次。"

msgid ", but with eight piles of five cards, and tableau piles are built up or down by alternate color."
msgstr "，但有 8 堆各 5 張，且牌列堆可紅黑交替遞增或遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but with eight piles of six cards each (arranged in a similar pattern, with five face-up and one face-down card on the outer piles, and two face-up cards with four face-downs in the center piles), and four cards in the reserve."
msgstr "，但有 8 堆各 6 張（排列方式相近，外側各堆為 5 張正面、1 張反面，中央各堆為 2 張正面、4 張反面），預備堆 4 張。"

msgid ", but with eight piles of three cards, that build down by rank ignoring suit. Also, during the deal, any card that can be moved to the foundation is immediately moved there."
msgstr "，但有 8 堆各 3 張，依點數遞減疊放、不計花色。此外發牌時，只要能移到王牌區的牌就會立刻移過去。"

msgid ", but with eight reserves."
msgstr "，但有 8 個預備堆。"

msgid ", but with eight rows and two redeals are allowed, in which the tableau piles are combined and placed on top of each other to form a new deck."
msgstr "，但有 8 排，且可循環發牌 2 次；循環時牌列堆會合併後疊在一起，組成新的一副牌。"

msgid ", but with eight tableau piles that can be built up or down by same suit, and no redeal."
msgstr "，但有 8 個牌列堆，可採同花色遞增或遞減疊放，且不循環發牌。"

msgid ", but with eight tableau piles with one card each, and no building is allowed on the tableau. The four reserve piles on the left can be built down by same suit, while the four on the right are single card free cells."
msgstr "，但有 8 個牌列堆、每堆 1 張，且牌列上不准疊放。左側 4 個預備堆可採同花色遞減疊放，右側 4 個則各只能放 1 張的自由格。"

msgid ", but with eight tableau piles, 40 cards in the initial reserve, and partial tableau stacks can be moved."
msgstr "，但有 8 個牌列堆，開局預備堆 40 張，且可以移動牌列的部分牌堆。"

msgid ", but with eleven cards in the \"Devil's Six\"."
msgstr "，但「惡魔六（Devil's Six）」中有 11 張。"

msgid ", but with eleven tableau piles dealt, with five cards in the centermost pile, and descending numbers of cards going left and right."
msgstr "，但發 11 個牌列堆，中央那堆 5 張，往左右兩側張數逐堆遞減。"

msgid ", but with fifteen piles of seven cards (the last pile has only six), no cards are dealt to the foundations at the start, and no redeals."
msgstr "，但有 15 堆各 7 張（最後一堆只有 6 張），開局不發牌到王牌區，也不循環發牌。"

msgid ", but with five cards in each pile."
msgstr "，但每堆改為 5 張。"

msgid ", but with five free cells and seven playing piles."
msgstr "，但有 5 個自由格與 7 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with five piles. Very easy."
msgstr "，但只有 5 堆。非常容易。"

msgid ", but with five tableau piles."
msgstr "，但有 5 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with four colors and symbols, and a 6X8 grid. The initial tiles are placed in the four corners only."
msgstr "，但改為 4 種顏色與符號，以及 6X8 的格陣。初始牌塊只放在四個角落。"

msgid ", but with four colors and symbols, and a 6X8 grid. The initial tiles are placed in the four corners only. Also, there are no restrictions when placing a tile next to two or more other tiles - they just have to match the color or symbol of each."
msgstr "，但改為 4 種顏色與符號，以及 6X8 的格陣。初始牌塊只放在四個角落。此外把牌塊放到兩塊以上相鄰時沒有額外限制——只要顏色或符號都能對應上即可。"

msgid ", but with four decks and 11 tableau piles. Also, the foundations build up in suit."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副牌與 11 個牌列堆。此外王牌區依花色遞增疊放。"

msgid ", but with four decks and 12 playing piles."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副牌與 12 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with four decks and 13 playing piles."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副牌與 13 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with four decks and eight playing piles."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副牌與 8 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with four decks and eighty dealt cards."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副牌、發 80 張牌。"

msgid ", but with four decks and eighty dealt cards. Also, sequences of cards may be moved together."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副牌、發 80 張牌。此外順子可以一起移動。"

msgid ", but with four decks and sixteen piles per row."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副牌，每排 16 堆。"

msgid ", but with four decks and twelve piles of three cards each."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副牌與 12 堆各 3 張。"

msgid ", but with four decks and twelve stacks of six cards."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副牌與 12 堆各 6 張。"

msgid ", but with four decks, 11 tableau piles, and 19 cards starting in the reserve."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副牌、11 個牌列堆，預備堆開局 19 張。"

msgid ", but with four decks, 11 tableau piles, and 19 cards starting in the reserve. Also, empty cards in the tableau are not automatically filled from the waste pile or stock. Instead, any other card from the tableau or waste can be used to fill empty piles."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副牌、11 個牌列堆，預備堆開局 19 張。此外牌列的空位不會自動從棄牌堆或牌山補上；改為可以用牌列或棄牌堆的其他任何牌來補空列。"

msgid ", but with four decks, 12 playing piles, and only one redeal allowed."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副牌、12 個牌列堆，且只可循環發牌 1 次。"

msgid ", but with four decks, 16 piles, and three cards in each pile."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副牌、16 堆，每堆 3 張。"

msgid ", but with four decks, eighteen piles, and sequences of cards can only be moved if they're of the same suit."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副牌、18 堆，且只有同花色的順子能移動。"

msgid ", but with four decks, three suits, and 13 playing piles of six cards each."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副牌、3 種花色，共 13 個牌列堆、每堆 6 張。"

msgid ", but with four extra free cells."
msgstr "，但多出 4 個自由格。"

msgid ", but with four free cells. Cards from the talon can be moved to the free cells instead of the tableau piles, but each free cell can only hold one card. Cards can be moved from the free cells to the tableau or foundations, but cards from the tableau cannot be moved to free cells."
msgstr "，但有 4 個自由格。牌山的牌可以改移到自由格而不進牌列堆，但每個自由格只能放 1 張。自由格的牌可以移到牌列或王牌區，但牌列的牌不能移到自由格。"

msgid ", but with four full decks, and seven tableau piles of seven cards each, with the second, fourth, and sixth card of each pile dealt face-down. The foundation piles are built up from ace to king."
msgstr "，但使用 4 副完整牌，7 個牌列堆各 7 張，每堆第 2、4、6 張反面朝下。王牌區從 A 遞增疊到 K。"

msgid ", but with four reserve piles of thirteen cards, only three tableau piles, and the foundations are built up by rank, regardless of suit."
msgstr "，但有 4 個預備堆各 13 張、只剩 3 個牌列堆，且王牌區依點數遞增疊放、不計花色。"

msgid ", but with jokers. Any card or sequence can be played on a joker, and a joker can be played on any card or sequence, or an empty space. Jokers can be moved to their foundation once all the other cards have been moved to the foundations."
msgstr "，但加入鬼牌。任何牌或順子都能壓在鬼牌上，鬼牌也能壓在任何牌、順子或空列上。其他牌都進王牌區之後，鬼牌才能移到它的王牌區。"

msgid ", but with jokers. Jokers can be removed at any time - if a joker is removed, all of the cards under it are removed and shuffled back into the talon."
msgstr "，但加入鬼牌。鬼牌隨時可以移除——移除鬼牌時，它下面的牌會一併移除並洗回牌山。"

msgid ", but with nine piles, and the base rank of the foundations is chosen by the first card you play to one. Foundations and tableau piles can turn the corner from king to ace as necessary, and empty tableau piles can only be filled with the rank one below the base foundation rank."
msgstr "，但有 9 堆，王牌區的基準點數由你放上第一張決定。王牌區與牌列堆必要時可從 K 轉回 A，空的牌列堆只能放比基準點數小 1 的牌。"

msgid ", but with nine tableau piles (the odd card is dealt to the first tableau pile), and cards do not need to be moved to the trumps foundation before the other foundations can be built."
msgstr "，但有 9 個牌列堆（多出的那張發到第 1 個牌列堆），而且不必先把牌移到將牌（trumps）王牌區，其他王牌區也能疊。"

msgid ", but with nine tableau piles, and cards do not need to be moved to the trumps foundation before the other foundations can be built."
msgstr "，但有 9 個牌列堆，而且不必先把牌移到將牌（trumps）王牌區，其他王牌區也能疊。"

msgid ", but with nineteen tableau piles."
msgstr "，但有 19 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with no foundations. To win the game, the cards must be organized into four piles, built down from king to ace by alternate color. Difficult."
msgstr "，但沒有王牌區。要獲勝必須把牌整理成 4 堆，採紅黑交替從 K 遞減疊到 A。難度很高。"

msgid ", but with no redeal, and any card can fill empty tableau piles."
msgstr "，但不循環發牌，且任何牌都能補空的牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with no redeal."
msgstr "，但不循環發牌。"

msgid ", but with no stock, and a layout dealt with three pyramids - one with seven rows, one with six, and one with two."
msgstr "，但沒有牌山，版面發成 3 個金字塔——分別為 7 排、6 排與 2 排。"

msgid ", but with one deck and 4 piles."
msgstr "，但只用 1 副牌與 4 堆。"

msgid ", but with one deck and 7 piles (3 with four cards, four with three, all face-up), and a single free cell. You may deal cards if there are empty rows."
msgstr "，但只用 1 副牌與 7 堆（3 堆各 4 張、4 堆各 3 張，全部正面朝上），另有 1 個自由格。有空排時你就可以發牌。"

msgid ", but with one deck and 7 piles. Very hard."
msgstr "，但只用 1 副牌與 7 堆。非常難。"

msgid ", but with one deck and seven tableau piles."
msgstr "，但只用 1 副牌與 7 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with one extra free cell."
msgstr "，但多出 1 個自由格。"

msgid ", but with one inverted similar to"
msgstr "，但其中一個採倒置排列，類似"

msgid ", but with one redeal allowed."
msgstr "，但可循環發牌 1 次。"

msgid ", but with only 24 foundation piles, and the remaining eight cards dealt to the free cells."
msgstr "，但只有 24 個王牌區，剩下的 8 張發到自由格。"

msgid ", but with only eight tableau piles."
msgstr "，但只有 8 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with only five reserves."
msgstr "，但預備堆只有 5 個。"

msgid ", but with only four tableau piles and only two redeals allowed."
msgstr "，但只有 4 個牌列堆，且只可循環發牌 2 次。"

msgid ", but with only four tableau piles."
msgstr "，但只有 4 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with only nine cards in each reserve."
msgstr "，但每個預備堆只有 9 張。"

msgid ", but with only nine cards in the reserve, no redeal, and any card can be played in empty tableau piles."
msgstr "，但預備堆只有 9 張，不循環發牌，且空的牌列堆可放任意牌。"

msgid ", but with only nine piles, and the tableau is built down by rank, regardless of suit."
msgstr "，但只有 9 堆，且牌列依點數遞減疊放、不計花色。"

msgid ", but with only nine tableau piles."
msgstr "，但只有 9 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with only one deck and eight tableau piles."
msgstr "，但只用 1 副牌與 8 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with only seven cards in the reserve, and no redeal."
msgstr "，但預備堆只有 7 張，且不循環發牌。"

msgid ", but with only six piles of one card each, and piles are built down by rank regardless of suit, with sequences of the same suit being able to be moved together (in a manner similar to"
msgstr "，但只有 6 堆各 1 張，牌堆依點數遞減疊放、不計花色，同花色的順子則可以一起移動（做法類似"

msgid ", but with only six tableau piles, and the aces aren't dealt to the foundations at the start, but are moved straight to the foundations when they turn up in the talon."
msgstr "，但只有 6 個牌列堆，開局不把 A 發到王牌區，而是在牌山翻出 A 時直接移到王牌區。"

msgid ", but with only the hearts and spades, and only four tableau piles."
msgstr "，但只用紅心與黑桃，且只有 4 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with random spaces after each redeal."
msgstr "，但每次循環發牌後的空位都是隨機位置。"

msgid ", but with scoring. Scoring works as follows:"
msgstr "，但加入計分。計分方式如下："

msgid ", but with seven piles of four cards each, dealt with alternating face-up and face-down cards."
msgstr "，但 7 堆各 4 張，以正面、反面交錯的方式發出。"

msgid ", but with seven piles with two cards each, the bottom card in each pile dealt face-down."
msgstr "，但 7 堆各 2 張，每堆最底那張反面朝下。"

msgid ", but with seven piles, and 24 reserve cards."
msgstr "，但有 7 堆，預備牌 24 張。"

msgid ", but with seven piles, and all cards are dealt face-up."
msgstr "，但有 7 堆，且全部正面朝上發出。"

msgid ", but with seven piles."
msgstr "，但有 7 堆。"

msgid ", but with seven playing piles, and only one card of each suit can be in the free cells at once."
msgstr "，但有 7 個牌列堆，且自由格裡每個花色同時只能放 1 張。"

msgid ", but with seven playing piles."
msgstr "，但有 7 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with seven tableau piles of four cards each, and the piles build down by alternate color."
msgstr "，但有 7 個牌列堆各 4 張，且牌堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but with seven tableau piles, with four cards in the middle one, and one fewer in each pile to the left and right (all cards dealt face-up). Also, cards cannot be dealt from the talon if there are any empty piles."
msgstr "，但有 7 個牌列堆，中央那堆 4 張，往左右兩側逐堆少 1 張（全部正面朝上發出）。此外只要還有空堆，就不能從牌山發牌。"

msgid ", but with seven tableau piles."
msgstr "，但有 7 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with seventeen ranks, and the first stack is hearts only."
msgstr "，但有 17 個點數，且第一堆只收紅心。"

msgid ", but with ten piles of four cards each (the bottom two cards of each pile are face-down), the piles build down by alternate color, and sequences can be moved."
msgstr "，但有 10 堆各 4 張（每堆底下 2 張反面朝下），牌堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放，且順子可以移動。"

msgid ", but with ten tableau piles, five cards per pile, and only kings can fill empty piles."
msgstr "，但有 10 個牌列堆、每堆 5 張，且空列只能由 K 補。"

msgid ", but with thirteen tableau piles of four cards each, all face-up, and piles are built down by same suit."
msgstr "，但有 13 個牌列堆各 4 張，全部正面朝上，且牌堆採同花色遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but with thirteen tableau piles."
msgstr "，但有 13 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with three decks and 9 piles."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌與 9 堆。"

msgid ", but with three decks and a max of six cards in the reserve."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌，預備堆上限 6 張。"

msgid ", but with three decks and eight reserve piles."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌與 8 個預備堆。"

msgid ", but with three decks and eleven free cells, two of which start with a card in them."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌與 11 個自由格，其中 2 個開局就有牌。"

msgid ", but with three decks and four free cells, and moving sequences is allowed."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌與 4 個自由格，且可以移動順子。"

msgid ", but with three decks and nine piles of nine cards."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌與 9 堆各 9 張。"

msgid ", but with three decks and seven playing piles."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌與 7 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with three decks and sixty dealt cards."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌、發 60 張牌。"

msgid ", but with three decks and sixty dealt cards. Also, sequences of cards may be moved together."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌、發 60 張牌。此外順子可以一起移動。"

msgid ", but with three decks and ten free cells."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌與 10 個自由格。"

msgid ", but with three decks and ten piles. For the third deck, the black foundations are built up from ace to king while the red foundations are built down from king to ace."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌與 10 堆。第 3 副牌中，黑色的王牌區從 A 遞增疊到 K，紅色的王牌區則從 K 遞減疊到 A。"

msgid ", but with three decks and thirteen piles of twelve cards (five face-down cards in five piles)."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌與 13 堆各 12 張（其中 5 堆有 5 張反面朝下）。"

msgid ", but with three decks and twelve tableau piles, and the piles build down by alternate color."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌與 12 個牌列堆，且牌堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放。"

msgid ", but with three decks and twelve tableau piles."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌與 12 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with three decks, 10 tableau piles, and 15 cards starting in the reserve. Plus, all tableau piles start with a card dealt in them."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌、10 個牌列堆，預備堆開局 15 張，且每個牌列堆開局都有 1 張。"

msgid ", but with three decks, 12 piles of one card each, sequences can be moved, and empty piles are automatically filled from the waste or talon."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌、12 堆各 1 張，順子可以移動，且空列會自動從棄牌堆或牌山補滿。"

msgid ", but with three decks, 14 piles, and three cards in each pile."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌、14 堆，每堆 3 張。"

msgid ", but with three decks, and sequences of cards can only be moved if they're of the same suit."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌，且只有同花色的順子能移動。"

msgid ", but with three decks, only three suits, and twelve tableau piles."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌、只有 3 種花色，共 12 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with three decks, three suits, and 13 playing piles. Each pile has one fewer card than"
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌、3 種花色，共 13 個牌列堆。每堆都比前一堆少 1 張"

msgid ", but with three decks, twelve piles of four cards each (the bottom two cards of each pile are face-down) the piles build down by alternate color, and sequences can be moved."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌與 12 堆各 4 張（每堆底下 2 張反面朝下），牌堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放，且順子可以移動。"

msgid ", but with three decks."
msgstr "，但使用 3 副牌。"

msgid ", but with three free cells. A card is dealt to each free cell at the start of the game."
msgstr "，但有 3 個自由格，開局每個自由格各發 1 張。"

msgid ", but with three reserves, and one set of foundations builds up from two to ace, and the other builds down from queen to king, both wrapping between king and ace as necessary."
msgstr "，但有 3 個預備堆；其中一組王牌區從 2 遞增疊到 A，另一組從 Q 遞減疊到 K，兩組必要時都在 K 與 A 之間首尾循環。"

msgid ", but with three waste piles. When drawing cards from the stock, one is dealt to all three waste piles."
msgstr "，但有 3 個棄牌堆。從牌山抽牌時，3 個棄牌堆各發 1 張。"

msgid ", but with twelve piles of four cards each."
msgstr "，但 12 堆各 4 張。"

msgid ", but with twelve piles, and cards from the talon are dealt one at a time and can be moved to appropriate tableau piles or foundations, with no redeal allowed. Also, empty tableau piles are immediately filled from the waste pile, and if the waste and talon are empty, empty tableau piles cannot be filled."
msgstr "，但有 12 堆，牌山的牌每次發 1 張，可移到合適的牌列堆或王牌區，不准循環發牌。此外空的牌列堆會立刻由棄牌堆補滿；若棄牌堆與牌山都空了，空的牌列堆就不能再補。"

msgid ", but with twelve piles, and during the initial deal, any card that can be moved to the foundations is moved there immediately after each row is dealt. Also, only kings can fill empty piles."
msgstr "，但有 12 堆，且初次發牌時每發完一排，能移到王牌區的牌就會立刻移過去。此外空列只能由 K 補。"

msgid ", but with twelve piles, and sequences of cards may be moved together."
msgstr "，但有 12 堆，且順子可以一起移動。"

msgid ", but with twelve piles, tableau piles are built down regardless of suit, and empty tableau piles can only be filled with a card from the waste."
msgstr "，但有 12 堆，牌列堆遞減疊放不計花色，且空的牌列堆只能用棄牌堆的牌補。"

msgid ", but with twelve tableau piles."
msgstr "，但有 12 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with twenty tableau piles, aces dealt to the foundations at the start, and empty tableau piles are immediately filled from the waste pile."
msgstr "，但有 20 個牌列堆，開局把 A 發到王牌區，且空的牌列堆會立刻由棄牌堆補滿。"

msgid ", but with two decks and 26 playing piles."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 26 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with two decks and eight free cells."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 8 個自由格。"

msgid ", but with two decks and eight piles of thirteen card each."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 8 堆各 13 張。"

msgid ", but with two decks and eight tableau piles."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 8 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with two decks and eighteen playing piles."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 18 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with two decks and five playing piles."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 5 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with two decks and nine dealt columns, and sequences do wrap around, i.e. Twos and Kings may be placed on Aces and Queens and Aces may be placed on Kings."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌並發 9 列，且順子確實可以首尾循環，也就是 A 上能放 2 或 K，K 上能放 Q 或 A。"

msgid ", but with two decks and nine dealt columns."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌並發 9 列。"

msgid ", but with two decks and nine tableau piles."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 9 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with two decks and six cards per pile. Additionally, due to the difference in the number of cards, the game is won when two cards are left."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌、每堆 6 張。此外由於牌數不同，剩下 2 張牌時就算獲勝。"

msgid ", but with two decks and six free cells. The aces are moved to the foundations at the start."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 6 個自由格。開局就把 A 移到王牌區。"

msgid ", but with two decks and six stacks."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 6 堆。"

msgid ", but with two decks and ten columns of ten cards."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 10 列各 10 張。"

msgid ", but with two decks and ten piles of ten cards (four cards are dealt to the free cells at the start), and valid sequences of cards can be moved freely between tableau piles."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 10 堆各 10 張（開局發 4 張到自由格），合法的順子可以在牌列堆之間自由移動。"

msgid ", but with two decks and ten piles of ten cards (four face-down cards in five piles)."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 10 堆各 10 張（其中 5 堆有 4 張反面朝下）。"

msgid ", but with two decks and ten tableau piles."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 10 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with two decks and the cards are arranged into two pyramids, similar to"
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌，牌排成兩個金字塔，類似"

msgid ", but with two decks and the cards are arranged into two pyramids."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌，牌排成兩個金字塔。"

msgid ", but with two decks and twelve piles of eight cards each, with all the free cells starting full."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 12 堆各 8 張，且所有自由格開局就填滿。"

msgid ", but with two decks and twenty-four tableau piles."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 24 個牌列堆。"

msgid ", but with two decks and two extra rows of cards on the pyramid."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌，金字塔再多兩排牌。"

msgid ", but with two decks, aces are included in the deal, leaving the leftmost spot in each row empty, and there is no redeal."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌，A 也一併發出，使每排最左邊的位置留空，且不循環發牌。"

msgid ", but with two decks, and eight foundations - two for each suit and four for each color."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 8 個王牌區——每個花色 2 個、每種顏色 4 個。"

msgid ", but with two decks, and eight piles of eight cards each."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 8 堆各 8 張。"

msgid ", but with two decks, and eight piles of seven cards each."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 8 堆各 7 張。"

msgid ", but with two decks, and thirty-two tableau cards (as the game's name suggests). Additionally, one set of foundations is built down from king to ace while the other is built up from ace to king."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 32 張牌列牌（正如遊戲名稱所示）。此外一組王牌區從 K 遞減疊到 A，另一組從 A 遞增疊到 K。"

msgid ", but with two decks, cards are dealt all face-up in ten piles of five cards each, and when dealing cards from the talon, empty piles are not filled."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌，全部正面朝上發成 10 堆各 5 張；從牌山發牌時不會補滿空堆。"

msgid ", but with two decks, eight piles of thirteen cards each, eight free cells, and sequences of cards can be moved together."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌、8 堆各 13 張、8 個自由格，且順子可以一起移動。"

msgid ", but with two decks, eight piles, with an increasing number of cards, from 3 - 10, and the piles are built down by alternate color. Plus, a full 52 cards is dealt to the reserves."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌與 8 堆，張數由 3 逐堆增加到 10，牌堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放。此外預備堆會發滿整整 52 張。"

msgid ", but with two decks, fourteen piles, and eight free cells (six of which start occupied)."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌、14 堆與 8 個自由格（其中 6 個開局就有牌）。"

msgid ", but with two decks, six cards per pile, and a second foundation, starting with a king of hearts. It does not matter how many cards end up in each foundation at the end of the game."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌、每堆 6 張，另有第二組王牌區，以紅心 K 起頭。結束時每組王牌區最後放幾張都無所謂。"

msgid ", but with two decks, ten play piles, and ten reserves."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌、10 個牌列堆與 10 個預備堆。"

msgid ", but with two decks, ten playing piles, and five free cells."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌、10 個牌列堆與 5 個自由格。"

msgid ", but with two decks, ten tableau piles, and five free cells."
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌、10 個牌列堆與 5 個自由格。"

msgid ", but with two decks. The foundations build up as follows:"
msgstr "，但使用 2 副牌。王牌區的疊法如下："

msgid ", but with two extra free cells."
msgstr "，但多出 2 個自由格。"

msgid ", but with two foundations. A card is dealt to the first one at the start of the game, and the second one can be started with any card from the waste pile."
msgstr "，但有 2 個王牌區。開局第 1 個王牌區會先發 1 張，第 2 個則可以由棄牌堆的任意一張起頭。"

msgid ", but with two free cells rather than four."
msgstr "，但只有 2 個自由格而非 4 個。"

msgid ", but with two free cells, and the foundations are built up by suit from ace to king."
msgstr "，但有 2 個自由格，且王牌區依同花色從 A 遞增疊到 K。"

msgid ", but with two free cells. Cards from the tableau can be moved to a free cell, but cards from a free cell can only be moved to a foundation."
msgstr "，但有 2 個自由格。牌列的牌可以移到自由格，但自由格的牌只能移到王牌區。"

msgid ", but with two jokers. Jokers are wild, any card can be played on a joker, and a joker can be played on any card."
msgstr "，但加入 2 張鬼牌。鬼牌是萬用牌，任何牌都能壓在鬼牌上，鬼牌也能壓在任何牌上。"

msgid ", but with two jokers. The jokers are obstacles - they can only be moved to the free cells, and any cards behind them are blocked until you do. Once there, the jokers can only be moved to the joker foundation, and only once all other cards have been moved to the foundations."
msgstr "，但加入 2 張鬼牌。這裡的鬼牌是障礙——只能移到自由格，壓在它下面的牌會一直被卡住。移過去之後，鬼牌也只能移到鬼牌王牌區，而且必須等其他牌全部進王牌區才行。"

msgid ", but with two redeals."
msgstr "，但可循環發牌 2 次。"

msgid ", but with unlimited redeals."
msgstr "，但可無限次循環發牌。"

msgid ", but without any free cells."
msgstr "，但完全沒有自由格。"

msgid ", but you are only permitted to move cards back out of the foundations if the talon is empty."
msgstr "，但只有在牌山發空之後，才可以把牌從王牌區移回來。"

msgid ", but you can also move cards into a gap that match the suit of the card directly to the right, and is one lower in rank, and empty spaces are dealt next to the aces."
msgstr "，但你也可以把花色相同、點數小 1 的牌移到右邊那張的左側空位，而且空位會發在 A 旁邊。"

msgid ", but you can also move cards into a gap to the left of a card, if the suit matches and it's one lower in rank."
msgstr "，但你也可以把牌移到某張牌左側的空位，只要花色相同且點數小 1。"

msgid ", but you can build in the tableau, down by rank, regardless of suit, turning the corner from ace to king as needed. The first two piles are built down by 1, the second two are built down by 2, the third two are built down by 3, and the last two are built down by 4."
msgstr "，但你可以自己在牌列上疊放，依點數遞減、不計花色，需要的話可從 A 轉到 K。前 2 堆每級遞減 1，第 3、4 堆遞減 2，第 5、6 堆遞減 3，最後 2 堆遞減 4。"

msgid ", but you can build on the stacks before the talon is empty."
msgstr "，但牌山還沒發空就能在牌堆上疊牌。"

msgid ", but you can move cards regardless of suit (though the sequences still need to be same suit to win the game)."
msgstr "，但你可以不計花色移動牌（不過要獲勝，順子仍必須同花色）。"

msgid ", but you can move piles to left and to right."
msgstr "，但你可以把牌堆往左也往右移動。"

msgid ", but you may deal new cards even if there are empty rows."
msgstr "，但即使有空排也能發新牌。"

msgid ", but you only move cards if they are separated by one or two cards, not if they are right next to each other."
msgstr "，但只有在兩張牌之間隔了 1 到 2 張時才能移動，緊鄰的兩張不行。"

msgid ", but you win as soon as the Pyramid is cleared."
msgstr "，但金字塔一清空就算獲勝。"

msgid ", containing the text that can be accessed via"
msgstr "，其中的文字可透過"

msgid ", empty piles are automatically filled from the waste or talon, and one redeal."
msgstr "，空列會自動從棄牌堆或牌山補滿，並循環發牌 1 次。"

msgid ", except any card can be played on an empty row and the Wizards (Jokers) are wild."
msgstr "，只是任何牌都能放到空的橫排堆上，且法師（鬼牌）是萬用牌。"

msgid ", except new deals are drawn from a pool of game numbers that have already been confirmed solvable (winnable with"
msgstr "，只是新的發牌是從已確認可解（可獲勝）的遊戲編號池中抽出"

msgid ", except the cards are shifted directly up, rather than across and then up."
msgstr "，只是牌會直接往上移，而不是先橫移再往上。"

msgid ", except the reserve piles can be used as free cells after their initial card has been played."
msgstr "，只是預備堆在發出第一張牌之後，就能當成自由格使用。"

msgid ", except the wizards are wild, but can only be moved as individual cards."
msgstr "，只是法師可當萬用牌，但只能一張一張移動。"

msgid ", have identified the Microsoft Windows downloads as containing malware. What we know is that they are generated from the"
msgstr "，指出微軟 Windows 的下載檔案含有惡意軟體。就我們所知，它們是由"

msgid ", in that a full sequence of cards from king to ace can be moved to each of these. Cards in the foundations cannot be moved back, or to other foundations."
msgstr "，差別在於每堆都能放進一整列從 K 到 A 的牌。王牌區裡的牌不能移回，也不能移到其他王牌區。"

msgid ", intended to be an improvement to that game."
msgstr "，旨在改進該玩法。"

msgid ", invented by David Parlett. It is played similarly, except all cards in the tableau are visible, and the foundations are built differently. The first four foundations have an ace of each suit dealt to them, and are built up by suit, while the other four foundations have a king dealt to them and are built down by suit."
msgstr "，由 David Parlett 發明。玩法大致相同，差別在於牌列的全部牌面可見，且王牌區的疊放方式不同。前四個王牌區各發入一張 A（每個花色各一張），並以同花色遞增疊放；後四個王牌區各發入一張 K，並以同花色遞減疊放。"

msgid ", only with a different initial card layout."
msgstr "，只是初始牌面配置不同。"

msgid ", only with a different layout."
msgstr "，只是版面配置不同。"

msgid ", the first one in almost 8 years."
msgstr "，近 8 年來的第一款。"

msgid ", the third and fourth rank cards are interchangeable for all suits except Rain. Only first rank cards can play on the canvas. First build the suits on the tableau. Then pick up all four cards at once and drop them on the foundation. The foundation will only accept a completed suit if the internal rank order is correct and it's played in suit order. Plum after Pine, Phoenix after Rain, etc. Stacks in the tableau can be moved if the cards in the stack are in order or not. There can be no more than twelve cards in a row. The play in this game is similar to Seahaven Towers, except there are no reserve stacks."
msgstr "，除雨（Rain）花色外，各花色的第三與第四級牌可互相替換。只有第一級牌能放到王牌區。先在牌列把各花色整理完成，然後一次拿起全部四張，放到王牌區。王牌區只接受內部點數順序正確、且依花色順序放上的完整花色：松（Pine）之後放梅（Plum）、雨之後放鳳（Phoenix），依此類推。牌列中的整疊牌無論順序是否正確都能移動。每排不得超過十二張牌。玩法類似 Seahaven Towers，只是沒有預備堆。"

msgid ", using the ten suit Dashavatara Ganjifa deck and the number of cards you can move as a sequence is not restricted."
msgstr "，使用十花色甘尼法牌組達沙阿凡答（Dashavatara Ganjifa），且可一起移動的順子張數不受限制。"

msgid ", with the Hanafuda deck, but the number of cards you can move as a sequence is not restricted and there are no \"free\" cells."
msgstr "，使用花札牌組，但可一起移動的順子張數不受限制，也沒有「自由」格。"

msgid ", with the entire deck shuffled and dealt out in four rows. However, unlike Montana, the aces are not removed. They may immediately be moved to empty spaces to the left of each row."
msgstr "，整副牌洗牌後發成四排。不過不同於蒙大拿（Montana），A 不會被移除，可以立即移到每排左側的空列。"

msgid "- Added the Kivy toolkit and all the Android app related code and build procedures."
msgstr "- 加入 Kivy 工具包，以及所有 Android app 相關程式碼與建置流程。"

msgid "- Author of PySolFC"
msgstr "- PySolFC 作者"

msgid "- Auto drop and face-up cards in one step"
msgstr "- 一步完成自動遞牌與翻開牌面"

msgid "- Automatically deal cards to the Waste stack if it is empty."
msgstr "- 棄牌堆空了就直接自動從牌山發牌進去。"

msgid "- Automatically drop cards to the Foundations."
msgstr "- 自動把牌遞到王牌區。"

msgid "- Automatically face-up all cards."
msgstr "- 自動把所有牌翻成面朝上。"

msgid "- Change card background"
msgstr "- 變更牌背背景"

msgid "- Change table tile"
msgstr "- 變更桌布"

msgid "- Continued PySolFC maintenance, port to python 3, test suite (Note: he places all his changes under the Expat license)."
msgstr "- 持續維護 PySolFC、移植到 Python 3、建立測試套件（注意：他把自己的所有變更都以 Expat 授權釋出）。"

msgid "- Contributed a new logo design."
msgstr "- 貢獻了新的商標設計。"

msgid "- Deal"
msgstr "- 發牌"

msgid "- Fixes and enhancements"
msgstr "- 修正與改進"

msgid "- How many cards are dealt face-down to each pile. Note that the top card of each tableau pile is always face-up."
msgstr "- 每個牌列堆發幾張面朝下的牌。注意每個牌列堆的頂牌一律面朝上。"

msgid "- How many cards are dealt face-up to each reserve."
msgstr "- 每個預備堆發幾張面朝上的牌。"

msgid "- How many cards can be dealt from the talon at the start of the game at most."
msgstr "- 開局時最多能從牌山發幾張牌。"

msgid "- How many cards you can move to each reserve."
msgstr "- 每個預備堆可以放幾張牌。"

msgid "- How many reserves there are."
msgstr "- 有幾個預備堆。"

msgid "- How many tableau piles there are."
msgstr "- 有幾個牌列堆。"

msgid "- How many times the player is allowed to redeal. In each redeal, the pile(s) where the cards from the talon are dealt are combined to form a new talon."
msgstr "- 允許玩家循環發牌幾次。每次循環發牌時，原本收到牌山牌的牌堆會合併成新的牌山。"

msgid "- How the cards are dealt to the tableau. Rectangular deals have the cards dealt relatively evenly, triangular deals involve each pile getting one more card than the previous, and pyramid deals are similar, but piles after the center one have one fewer than the previous."
msgstr "- 如何發牌到牌列。長方形發牌是各堆大致平均；三角形發牌是每堆比前一堆多一張；金字塔形發牌類似，只是中央之後的每堆比前一堆少一張。"

msgid "- If dealing cards from the talon to the waste, this indicates how many are dealt at once."
msgstr "- 若是從牌山發牌到棄牌堆，這裡指的是一次發幾張。"

msgid "- If sequences normally cannot be moved together, a \"Super Move\" allows you to move sequences regardless, if there are enough empty stacks/reserves to make the move normally."
msgstr "- 若順子原本不能一起移動，「Super Move」讓你在有空預備堆與空牌列、足以逐張完成移牌的情況下，仍可直接整疊移動。"

msgid "- If the base card is set to any, this indicates whether all four foundations must start with the same rank - once the first card is moved to the foundations, all other foundations must start from the same base rank."
msgstr "- 若基礎牌設為 any（任意），這裡指四個王牌區是否必須以相同點數開始——一旦第一張牌移入王牌區，其餘王牌區就都要從同一個基礎點數開始。"

msgid "- MacOS package maintainer"
msgstr "- MacOS 套件維護者"

msgid "- Many new games and continued PySolFC maintenance and development."
msgstr "- 大量新遊戲，並持續維護與開發 PySolFC。"

msgid "- Play the next music song"
msgstr "- 播放下一首音樂"

msgid "- Read a message with additional information specific to the current game (i.e. current score for games that use scoring, or the foundation base rank for games where this can vary)."
msgstr "- 讀取一條與目前遊戲相關的附加訊息（例如使用計分遊戲的目前分數，或基礎點數可變遊戲的王牌區基礎點數）。"

msgid "- Read a message with additional information specific to the stack currently selected by the keyboard (i.e. stack coordinates in grid-based games, or current poker or cribbage hand scores)."
msgstr "- 讀取一條與鍵盤目前選中疊牌相關的附加訊息（例如網格類遊戲的疊牌座標，或目前撲克或克里比牌戲牌手的分數）。"

msgid "- Refresh the game layout"
msgstr "- 重新整理遊戲版面配置"

msgid "- Select cardset, using search tab"
msgstr "- 使用搜尋頁籤選擇牌組"

msgid "- Select game, using old game select window"
msgstr "- 使用舊版選遊戲對話窗選擇遊戲"

msgid "- Select game, using search tab"
msgstr "- 使用搜尋頁籤選擇遊戲"

msgid "- Show internal rating when giving a hint"
msgstr "- 給提示時顯示內部評等"

msgid "- The initial setting automatically configures the Solitaire Wizard options to match one of several sample games."
msgstr "- 初始設定會自動把接龍法師的選項調整成與其中一個範例遊戲相符。"

msgid "- The number of decks used."
msgstr "- 使用的副牌數。"

msgid "- The physical layout of the card piles. This is purely aesthetic and doesn't affect gameplay."
msgstr "- 各牌堆的實體排列方式。純為美觀，不影響玩法。"

msgid "- This determines how foundations are built - by same suit, alternate color, same color, rank regardless of suit, any suit but the same, up or down, Spider style (can be built regardless of suit, but only sequences that match the suit option can be moved as a unit), Yukon style (cards can be moved regardless of sequence), or no building on the tableau allowed."
msgstr "- 這決定王牌區如何疊放——同花色、紅黑交替、同色、同點數不分花色、花色不拘但須相同、遞增或遞減、Spider 風格（不拘花色疊放，但只有符合花色選項的順子才能整疊移動）、Yukon 風格（不拘順子皆可移牌），或牌列完全不允許疊放。"

msgid "- This determines what cards can be moved to the foundations. Foundations can be built by same suit, same color, alternate color, any suit but the same, rank regardless of suit, or Spider style (move entire sequences to the foundations once complete)."
msgstr "- 這決定哪些牌可以移到王牌區。王牌區可按同花色、同色、紅黑交替、花色不拘但須相同、同點數不分花色，或 Spider 風格（順子完整後整疊移入王牌區）疊放。"

msgid "- This determines when and how cards are dealt from the talon. Cards can be dealt either all at the beginning, to a waste pile, reserves, or foundations, or to the tableau, either in normal style, Spider style (don't allow dealing from the talon if there are empty piles), or Grounds for a Divorce style (do not deal to empty tableau piles)."
msgstr "- 這決定何時以及如何從牌山發牌。牌可以在開局一次全發、發到棄牌堆、預備堆或王牌區，或發到牌列；發到牌列可採一般方式、Spider 風格（有空列時不允許從牌山發牌），或 Grounds for a Divorce 風格（不發到空的牌列堆）。"

msgid "- This is the name of the game you wish to create."
msgstr "- 這是你要建立的遊戲名稱。"

msgid "- Use the right mouse button to move piles around quickly. The logic involved is not too clever on purpose (i.e. it does not consult the hint system)."
msgstr "- 用滑鼠右鍵快速搬動牌堆。這套邏輯刻意做得不太聰明（例如它不會參考提示系統）。"

msgid "- What card can fill an empty tableau pile."
msgstr "- 哪種牌可以補進空的牌列堆。"

msgid "- Whether only a single card can be in the waste at once. If checked, you have to play whatever card is in the waste before dealing another."
msgstr "- 棄牌堆是否一次只能放一張牌。勾選後，必須先出掉棄牌堆裡那張，才能再發下一張。"

msgid "- Whether sequences can be moved together, or cards can only be moved singly."
msgstr "- 順子能否一起移動，或只能一張一張移動。"

msgid "- Whether the deck should be shuffled when doing a redeal."
msgstr "- 循環發牌時是否要洗牌。"

msgid "- Whether the first cards are dealt to the foundations at the start of the game."
msgstr "- 開局時第一輪牌是否發到王牌區。"

msgid "- Whether the foundation is built up or down."
msgstr "- 王牌區是遞增還是遞減疊放。"

msgid "- Whether the game is more luck or skill. This doesn't affect the actual game, but is used to categorize it in PySol, and to help with sorting."
msgstr "- 遊戲偏重運氣還是技巧。這不影響實際玩法，只用於在 PySol 中分類與便於排序。"

msgid "- Whether the tableau piles are built up or down."
msgstr "- 牌列堆是遞增還是遞減疊放。"

msgid "- Whether wrapping from king to ace or ace to king is allowed."
msgstr "- 是否允許從 K 接到 A 或從 A 接到 K 的回繞。"

msgid "- Whether you're allowed to move the top card from a foundation."
msgstr "- 是否允許移走王牌區的頂牌。"

msgid "- Which rank is used to start the foundations - either ace or king, or any card."
msgstr "- 王牌區以哪個點數開始——A、K 或任意牌。"

msgid "- background music tracks"
msgstr "- 背景音樂曲目"

msgid "- cardsets and card images"
msgstr "- 牌組與牌面圖片"

msgid "- plugins are executable Python scripts - see the security warning."
msgstr "- 插件是可執行的 Python 腳本——請參閱安全性警告。"

msgid "- table tile backgrounds"
msgstr "- 桌布背景"

msgid "- the biggest release in over 15 years. Additionally, there is a new Cardsets release"
msgstr "- 15 多年來最大的版本。此外也有新的 Cardsets 版本"

msgid "- used for many icons throughout the app."
msgstr "- 用於 app 中的許多圖示。"

msgid "- used in the logo."
msgstr "- 用於商標中。"

msgid "-- and your Stock and Waste are empty. The suits do not matter."
msgstr "-- 而且你的牌山與棄牌堆都空了。花色不拘。"

msgid "--help"
msgstr "--help"

msgid ". Also, cards are dealt from the talon three at a time with only one redeal allowed."
msgstr "。此外，牌每次從牌山發三張，且只允許一次循環發牌。"

msgid ". Also, some games disable certain features as they would be trivial otherwise."
msgstr "。此外，有些遊戲會停用特定功能，否則那些功能太容易了。"

msgid ". Anyone upgrading from a version prior to 2.15.0 should read the notes for that version before upgrading. New in this release:"
msgstr "。任何從 2.15.0 以前版本升級的人，都應該先讀該版本的說明。本次新版本加入："

msgid ". By moving cards this way, the goal is to arrange all the cards in sequences from ace through five, in rows of the same suit."
msgstr "。透過這樣移牌，目標是把全部的牌排成從 A 到 5 的順子，每排同花色。"

msgid ". Cards build down in rank on the rows and up in rank on the foundations. Third and fourth rank (trash) cards are not interchangeable. Only a first rank card or correctly ordered pile may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "。橫排堆按點數遞減疊放，王牌區按點數遞增疊放。第三與第四級（替換）牌不可互相替換。只有第一級牌或順序正確的整疊牌能放到空的橫排堆。"

msgid ". However, these are not checked as frequently as GitHub."
msgstr "。不過，這些網站的驗證不像 GitHub 那麼頻繁。"

msgid ". If such an app is installed and running, the screen reader will trigger as you navigate through the game and the app's interface."
msgstr "。若已安裝並執行這類 app，你在遊戲與該 app 的介面間操作時，螢幕報讀器就會發出提示。"

msgid ". It is also known as Beak and Flipper."
msgstr "。它也叫 Beak and Flipper。"

msgid ". It is also known as Ukrainian Solitaire."
msgstr "。它也叫烏克蘭接龍（Ukrainian Solitaire）。"

msgid ". It is also related to"
msgstr "。它也和"

msgid ". It is more frequently known by the name Suits Up."
msgstr "。它更常被人稱為 Suits Up。"

msgid ". It was invented by Thomas Warfield."
msgstr "。由 Thomas Warfield 發明。"

msgid ". It will run on Windows, Mac, Linux, Android, etc. The easiest way to run is to use a self-contained installer, which is available for most supported operating systems."
msgstr "。它能執行在 Windows、Mac、Linux、Android 等平台。最簡單的方式是使用自足式安裝程式，多數支援的作業系統都有。"

msgid ". Note that the solvers (for FreeCell/etc.) are not installed as part of it yet, but they are available separately."
msgstr "。注意解題器（FreeCell 等遊戲用的）尚未一併安裝在裡面，但可另行取得。"

msgid ". Run with the"
msgstr "。執行時請用"

msgid ". So we believe the downloads are nonetheless safe and free of malware."
msgstr "。因此我們相信這些下載檔案依然安全、不含惡意軟體。"

msgid ". The foundation is built up with cards of the same rank, starting with aces. Once all four cards of that rank are in the foundation, you may place cards with the next rank up."
msgstr "。王牌區以相同點數的牌遞增疊放，從 A 開始。該點數的四張牌都進入王牌區後，才能放下一點數的牌。"

msgid ". The game was a combination of a couple different variants of"
msgstr "。這遊戲結合了數種不同的變體玩法，源自"

msgid ". The installer includes the app, Python and all of the requirements to run PySolFC. A basic and a full installer are available - the full installer includes the app, plus the full set of cardsets and all of the extras."
msgstr "。安裝程式包含 app、Python 與執行 PySolFC 所需的全部依賴。有基本版與完整版兩種安裝程式——完整版除 app 外，還包含全套牌組與所有額外內容。"

msgid ". The layout consists of three rows of playing piles and a row for newly dealt cards."
msgstr "。版面配置由三列牌列堆與一排新發的牌組成。"

msgid ". The name came from \"Lord Love a Duck\", an expression of surprise from early 1900s London."
msgstr "。名字來自 \"Lord Love a Duck\"，這是二十世紀初倫敦表示驚訝的語。"

msgid ". The rows build down by rank and by suit."
msgstr "。橫排堆按點數與花色遞減疊放。"

msgid ". The rows build down by rank in the same suit."
msgstr "。橫排堆在同一花色內按點數遞減疊放。"

msgid ". The rows build down by rank in the same suit. The foundations build with cards of the same rank in suit order. Only first rank cards may be played on an empty row. Trash card ranks are interchangeable."
msgstr "。橫排堆在同一花色內按點數遞減疊放。王牌區以相同點數的牌依花色順序疊放。只有第一級牌能放到空的橫排堆。替換牌的點數可以互相替換。"

msgid ". The rows build down by rank only, no more than twelve to a row."
msgstr "。橫排堆只按點數遞減疊放，每排最多十二張。"

msgid ". The rows build down by suit and rank."
msgstr "。橫排堆按花色與點數遞減疊放。"

msgid ". The rows build down in rank by suit."
msgstr "。橫排堆依花色按點數遞減疊放。"

msgid ". The rows build down in rank in alternate color. Any card or sequence may be played on an empty row. The Wizards will play in their proper rank position on the tableau as the alternate of either red or black. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "。橫排堆按點數遞減疊放，採紅黑交替。任何牌或順子都能放到空的橫排堆。法師會以自己的正確點數位置擺在牌列中，充當紅色或黑色的交替牌。牌每次一張從牌山發出。王牌區的牌也能移回出牌。"

msgid ". The rows build down in rank in alternate color. The color of the Wizards is the alternate of either red or black. Only the Tens (top rank cards) may be played on an empty row. There is one reserve stack that will hold up to three Wizards. No suit cards can be played there. The Wizards will also play in their proper rank position on the tableau. They play as the alternate of either red or black. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "。橫排堆按點數遞減疊放，採紅黑交替。法師的顏色與紅色或黑色形成交替。只有 10（最高級牌）能放到空的橫排堆。有一個預備堆，最多可容納三張法師，普通花色的牌不能放到那裡。法師也會以自己的正確點數位置擺在牌列中，充當紅色或黑色的交替牌。牌每次一張從牌山發出。王牌區的牌也能移回出牌。"

msgid ". The rows build down in rank in the same suit. The foundations build with cards of the same rank in suit order."
msgstr "。橫排堆在同一花色內按點數遞減疊放。王牌區以相同點數的牌依花色順序疊放。"

msgid ". These plugins recreate a couple of PySol's more complex games, including"
msgstr "。這些插件重建了 PySol 較複雜的幾個遊戲，包括"

msgid ". These rules are free; you can redistribute them and/or modify them under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "。這些規則條款是自由的：你可以在自由軟體基金會公布的 GNU 通用公共授權條款第二版，或（任你選擇）任何後續版本的條件下，再散布及／或修改它。"

msgid ". This release fixes a number of bugs, including one that causes crashes for some users when opening the select game/cardset/table tile window."
msgstr "。這次發布修正了若干錯誤，其中包括部分使用者開啟選擇遊戲／牌組／桌布對話窗時會當機的問題。"

msgid ". Visit this page to find out a lot of interesting information about FreeCell its variants."
msgstr "。造訪這個網頁，可以找到許多關於 FreeCell 及其變體玩法的有趣資訊。"

