msgstr ": 牌組管理員中要顯示的牌組名稱。注意超過 50 個字元的牌組名稱會被截短。"

msgid "================================================================== User visible changes for PySol - a solitaire game collection ================================================================== Changes in 4.82 (02 Sep 2003, 202 games) * support Python 2.3 - a number of small bug fixes + stay tuned for Pysol 5 with *lots* of improvements :-) Changes in 4.81 (24 Jun 2002, 202 games) * adapted for new pysol-sound-server 3.00 - fixed Spider-type games Changes in 4.80 (28 Nov 2001, 202 games) * support Python 2.2 Changes in 4.73 (28 Sep 2001, 202 games) - fixed rules of Irmgard - a number of other bug fixes Changes in 4.72 (31 May 2001, 202 games) - fixed a problem when using hints in Black Hole Changes in 4.71 (20 Apr 2001, 202 games) * improved dynamic scrollbar handling * support both Python 1.5, Python 2.0 and Python 2.1 within one package Changes in 4.70 (05 Mar 2001, 202 games) * 1 new game * added dynamic scrollbars * support both Python 1.5 and Python 2.0 within one package * fixed some minor problems Changes in 4.60 (02 Aug 2000, 201 games) * 6 new games * added persistent bookmarks * implemented smart playing that keeps the redo history * new statistics dialog featuring real 3D bar charts - Windows: fixed a problem where the sound could cause crashes - corrected a number of game rules and descriptions Changes in 4.50 (11 Jun 2000, 195 games) * added support for small toolbar icons * added \"Alternate Names\" to the game selection dialog * improved the sound dialog - moved the Mahjongg games to the new PyJongg package Changes in 4.41 (30 May 2000, 195 games) * 6 new games - Windows: avoid loading incompatible DLLs from the system directory Changes in 4.30 (23 May 2000, 189 games) * 6 new games - fixed an internal error in Grasshopper and Double Grasshopper - corrected rules of Penguin Changes in 4.20 (27 Apr 2000, 183 games) * 14 new games, including HexADeck and Memory type variants * added a \"Recent games\" menubar entry * improved statistics dialog - really fixed the detection of Straights in Poker type games - fixed a problem when changing the card background Changes in 4.10 (18 Apr 2000, 169 games) - fixed a memory leak Changes in 4.00 (12 Apr 2000, 169 games) * PySol now plays Tarock type games * display a floating \"Demo\" logo while playing demo games * options are now saved automatically at program exit - Poker type games: cards for a Straight can now be in any sequence - fixed a scoring problem in Casino Klondike and Vegas Klondike Changes in 3.40 (12 Feb 2000, 161 games) * 3 new games * updated the pysol-sound-server - fixed a problem with winning in Golf type games - some other minor fixes Changes in 3.30 (26 Jan 2000, 158 games) * 7 new games * converted the pysol-sound-server into a Python extension module Changes in 3.21 (21 Jan 2000, 151 games) * 2 new games * updated the pysol-sound-server - Windows: added the missing PyWinTypes15.dll to the setup file Changes in 3.20 (18 Jan 2000, 149 games) * added 8 Hanafuda type games (Oonsoo, Pagoda, MatsuKiri, ...) * added 2 Poker type games (Poker Shuffle, Poker Square) * added 13 other new games (Der Katzenschwanz, Perpetual Motion, Die Schlange, Three Shuffles and a Draw, Vegas Klondike, ...) * background music is supported under Win32 as well - corrected redeal rules of La Belle Lucie and Trefoil - corrected rules of Aces Up Changes in 3.10 (21 Dec 1999, 126 games) * 17 new games * new sound support (including background MP3 and MOD music under Unix) * added a playable preview dialog (yes, you can play games there :-) * nice cardset and table-tile select dialogs * added \"Hold and quit\" to continue a game on next start - quite a number of bug and feature fixes Changes in 3.00 (04 Nov 1999, 111 games) * bought a new solitaire book and implemented 67 new games :-) * added a menubar entry for popular games * new assist function: highlight all cards with the same rank (shift-click the left mouse button) * added images for the Talon redeal state * FreeCell game numbers are now compatible to the FreeCell FAQ * added a \"Next number\" button to the game number dialog * improved statistics and log views * the bundled version now ships as pre-compiled Python bytecode because it loads faster and uses much less memory - corrected some layout problems Changes in 2.99 (13 Oct 1999, 44 games) * 1 new game: Lara's Game * re-enabled the relaxed game variants * due to popular demand I've finally implemented \"Quick play\" * statistics and logs can be exported to a file * a huge number of other improvements - saved games are not compatible with previous versions - some changes in key and mouse bindings Changes in 2.91 (23 Jun 1999, 43 games) - check for Python 1.5.2 at program startup - some other minor fixes Changes in 2.90 (16 Jun 1999, 43 games) * added 19 new games (2 games disabled) * implemented a nice select-game tree dialog * starting a new game is noticeably faster now * documentation updated - PySol now requires Python 1.5.2 Changes in 2.14 (26 May 1999, 24 games) - fixed rules of Calculation which got broken in 2.02 Changes in 2.13 (13 May 1999, 24 games) - fixed a small bug in \"Select game by number...\" Changes in 2.12 (20 Apr 1999, 24 games) - another small bug fix Changes in 2.11 (07 Apr 1999, 24 games) - some finor fixes Changes in 2.10 (11 Mar 1999, 24 games) * major display speed improvements * added support for background table tiles * rearranged source code to prepare for a future Gnome, KDE, wxWindows or JPython/Swing version - fixed rules of Spider and Divorce which got broken in 2.02 Changes in 2.02 (20 Jan 1999, 24 games) * 1 new game: Canfield * new assist function: autoplay * new assist function: automatic face up * new assist function: highlight all matching cards (control-click the left mouse button) * can change card background * support for timer-based animations * improved interaction with the window manager (X11) Changes in 2.01 (21 Dec 1998, 23 games) * 4 new games: Eight Off, Dead King Golf, Relaxed Golf and Grandfather's Clock * created new package PySol-Cardsets - get it from the PySol home page * implemented a statusbar * new assist function: highlight all moveable piles * enabled tearoff menus under Unix * improved table layout with small and large cardsets Changes in 2.00 (30 Nov 1998, 19 games) * 2 new games: Calculation and Numerica * implemented support for plugins - now you can easily add your own games * new option to automatically shade legal moves * added additional cardsets for low and high screen resolutions * major source code rearrangements Changes in 1.12 (13 Oct 1998, 17 games) * display a progress bar during startup Changes in 1.11 (09 Oct 1998, 17 games) * 3 new games: Big Harp, Eiffel Tower and Matriarchy * enhanced statistics, can change player name * added \"Select game by number\" * implemented tooltips - some fixes for Windows (vanishing menubar, problems when $HOME was not set, better toplevel geometry) - corrected rules of Ground for a Divorce Changes in 1.10 (02 Oct 1998, 14 games) * 1 new game: Ground for a Divorce * added a toolbar * implemented shadows Changes in 1.03 (26 Sep 1998, 13 games) * 4 new games: Spider, Relaxed Spider, Braid and Forty Thieves * middle mouse button (or Control-left) shows partially hidden cards * menus restructured * major source code rearrangements Changes in 1.02 (16 Sep 1998, 9 games) * 1 new game: Picture Gallery * added strict-rules variants of FreeCell and Seahaven Towers * added a small manual page * improved animation speed Changes in 1.01 (14 Sep 1998, 6 games) * 2 new games: FreeCell and Seahaven Towers * the Undo key is now bound both to 'z' as well as 's' Changes in 1.00 (10 Sep 1998, 4 games) * includes 4 games: Gypsy, Irmgard, 8x8 and Klondike * first public release"
msgstr "================================================================== PySol 使用者可見變更——接龍遊戲合集 ================================================================== 4.82 版變更（2003 年 09 月 02 日，202 個遊戲） * 支援 Python 2.3 - 若干小錯誤修正 + 敬請期待 *改進超多* 的 Pysol 5 :-) 4.81 版變更（2002 年 06 月 24 日，202 個遊戲） * 配合新的 pysol-sound-server 3.00 - 修正 Spider 類遊戲 4.80 版變更（2001 年 11 月 28 日，202 個遊戲） * 支援 Python 2.2 4.73 版變更（2001 年 09 月 28 日，202 個遊戲） - 修正 Irmgard 的規則 - 若干其他錯誤修正 4.72 版變更（2001 年 05 月 31 日，202 個遊戲） - 修正 Black Hole 中使用提示時的錯誤 4.71 版變更（2001 年 04 月 20 日，202 個遊戲） * 改進動態捲軸處理 * 同一套件中同時支援 Python 1.5、Python 2.0 與 Python 2.1 4.70 版變更（2001 年 03 月 05 日，202 個遊戲） * 1 個新遊戲 * 加入動態捲軸 * 同一套件中同時支援 Python 1.5 與 Python 2.0 * 修正若干小問題 4.60 版變更（2000 年 08 月 02 日，201 個遊戲） * 6 個新遊戲 * 加入永久書籤 * 實作保留重做歷史的智慧出牌 * 新的統計對話窗，提供真正的 3D 長條圖 - Windows：修正音效可能導致當機的問題 - 更正多項遊戲規則與說明 4.50 版變更（2000 年 06 月 11 日，195 個遊戲） * 加入小工具列圖示支援 * 遊戲選擇對話窗加入「別名」 * 改進音效對話窗 - 把麻將遊戲移到新的 PyJongg 套件 4.41 版變更（2000 年 05 月 30 日，195 個遊戲） * 6 個新遊戲 - Windows：避免載入系統目錄中不相容的 DLL 4.30 版變更（2000 年 05 月 23 日，189 個遊戲） * 6 個新遊戲 - 修正 Grasshopper 與 Double Grasshopper 的內部錯誤 - 更正 Penguin 的規則 4.20 版變更（2000 年 04 月 27 日，183 個遊戲） * 14 個新遊戲，包含 HexADeck 與記憶類變體 * 加入「最近遊戲」選單列項目 * 改進統計對話窗 - 真正修正撲克類遊戲中順子的偵測 - 修正變更牌背背景時的問題 4.10 版變更（2000 年 04 月 18 日，169 個遊戲） - 修正記憶體洩漏 4.00 版變更（2000 年 04 月 12 日，169 個遊戲） * PySol 現在可玩塔羅（Tarock）類遊戲 * 試玩示範遊戲時顯示浮動「Demo」標誌 * 選項現在會在程式退出時自動保存 - 撲克類遊戲：順子的牌現在可以是任意順序 - 修正 Casino Klondike 與 Vegas Klondike 的計分問題 3.40 版變更（2000 年 02 月 12 日，161 個遊戲） * 3 個新遊戲 * 更新 pysol-sound-server - 修正高爾夫類遊戲獲勝的問題 - 若干其他小修正 3.30 版變更（2000 年 01 月 26 日，158 個遊戲） * 7 個新遊戲 * 把 pysol-sound-server 轉成 Python 延伸模組 3.21 版變更（2000 年 01 月 21 日，151 個遊戲） * 2 個新遊戲 * 更新 pysol-sound-server - Windows：在 setup 檔案補上遺失的 PyWinTypes15.dll 3.20 版變更（2000 年 01 月 18 日，149 個遊戲） * 加入 8 個花札類遊戲（Oonsoo、Pagoda、MatsuKiri……） * 加入 2 個撲克類遊戲（Poker Shuffle、Poker Square） * 加入 13 個其他新遊戲（Der Katzenschwanz、Perpetual Motion、Die Schlange、Three Shuffles and a Draw、Vegas Klondike……） * Win32 下也支援背景音樂 - 更正 La Belle Lucie 與 Trefoil 的循環發牌規則 - 更正 Aces Up 的規則 3.10 版變更（1999 年 12 月 21 日，126 個遊戲） * 17 個新遊戲 * 新的音效支援（含 Unix 下的背景 MP3 與 MOD 音樂） * 加入可試玩的預覽對話窗（是的，在那裡真的可以玩 :-) * 精美的牌組與桌布選擇對話窗 * 加入「保留並結束」，可在下次啟動時繼續遊戲 - 修正大量錯誤與功能問題 3.00 版變更（1999 年 11 月 04 日，111 個遊戲） * 買了一本新的接龍書，實作了 67 個新遊戲 :-) * 為熱門遊戲加入選單列項目 * 新增輔助功能：高亮顯示所有同點數的牌（Shift + 滑鼠左鍵） * 加入牌山循環發牌狀態的圖片 * FreeCell 遊戲編號現在與 FreeCell FAQ 相容 * 遊戲編號對話窗加入「下一個編號」鈕 * 改進統計與記錄檢視 * 隨附版本現在以預編譯的 Python 位元組碼發行，因為載入更快、也更省記憶體 - 修正若干版面配置問題 2.99 版變更（1999 年 10 月 13 日，44 個遊戲） * 1 個新遊戲：Lara's Game * 重新啟用寬鬆遊戲變體 * 應眾多要求，我終於實作了「快速游玩」 * 統計與記錄可以匯出到檔案 * 大量其他改進 - 存檔遊戲與前版不相容 - 按鍵與滑鼠綁定有些變更 2.91 版變更（1999 年 06 月 23 日，43 個遊戲） - 程式啟動時檢查 Python 1.5.2 - 若干其他小修正 2.90 版變更（1999 年 06 月 16 日，43 個遊戲） * 加入 19 個新遊戲（停用 2 個遊戲） * 實作精美的樹狀選遊戲對話窗 * 現在啟動新遊戲明顯更快 * 說明文件更新 - PySol 現在需要 Python 1.5.2 2.14 版變更（1999 年 05 月 26 日，24 個遊戲） - 修正 2.02 起被弄壞的 Calculation 規則 2.13 版變更（1999 年 05 月 13 日，24 個遊戲） - 修正「按編號選擇遊戲…」中的小錯誤 2.12 版變更（1999 年 04 月 20 日，24 個遊戲） - 另一個小錯誤修正 2.11 版變更（1999 年 04 月 07 日，24 個遊戲） - 若干小修正 2.10 版變更（1999 年 03 月 11 日，24 個遊戲） * 顯示速度大幅改進 * 加入桌布背景支援 * 重新整理原始碼，為未來的 Gnome、KDE、wxWindows 或 JPython/Swing 版本預作準備 - 修正 2.02 起被弄壞的 Spider 與 Divorce 規則 2.02 版變更（1999 年 01 月 20 日，24 個遊戲） * 1 個新遊戲：Canfield * 新增輔助功能：自動出牌 * 新增輔助功能：自動翻開牌面 * 新增輔助功能：高亮顯示所有相符的牌（Control + 滑鼠左鍵） * 可以變更牌背背景 * 支援計時器驅動的動畫 * 改進與視窗管理員的互動（X11） 2.01 版變更（1998 年 12 月 21 日，23 個遊戲） * 4 個新遊戲：Eight Off、Dead King Golf、Relaxed Golf 與 Grandfather's Clock * 建立新套件 PySol-Cardsets - 請由 PySol 首頁取得 * 實作狀態列 * 新增輔助功能：高亮顯示所有可移動的牌列堆 * 在 Unix 下啟用可撕式選單 * 改進大小牌組下的桌面配置 2.00 版變更（1998 年 11 月 30 日，19 個遊戲） * 2 個新遊戲：Calculation 與 Numerica * 實作插件支援 - 現在你可以輕鬆加入自己的遊戲 * 新增自動暗掉合法移牌的選項 * 為低與高螢幕解析度加入額外牌組 * 原始碼大幅重新整理 1.12 版變更（1998 年 10 月 13 日，17 個遊戲） * 啟動期間顯示進度列 1.11 版變更（1998 年 10 月 09 日，17 個遊戲） * 3 個新遊戲：Big Harp、Eiffel Tower 與 Matriarchy * 增強統計功能，可以更改玩家名稱 * 加入「按編號選擇遊戲」 * 實作工具提示 - 為 Windows 做些修正（選單列消失、$HOME 未設定時的問題、較好的上層視窗幾何） - 更正 Ground for a Divorce 的規則 1.10 版變更（1998 年 10 月 02 日，14 個遊戲） * 1 個新遊戲：Ground for a Divorce * 加入工具列 * 實作陰影 1.03 版變更（1998 年 09 月 26 日，13 個遊戲） * 4 個新遊戲：Spider、Relaxed Spider、Braid 與 Forty Thieves * 中間鍵（或 Control + 左鍵）可顯示被遮住的牌 * 選單重新結構 * 原始碼大幅重新整理 1.02 版變更（1998 年 09 月 16 日，9 個遊戲） * 1 個新遊戲：Picture Gallery * 加入 FreeCell 與 Seahaven Towers 的嚴格規則變體 * 加入一頁小型說明 * 加快動畫速度 1.01 版變更（1998 年 09 月 14 日，6 個遊戲） * 2 個新遊戲：FreeCell 與 Seahaven Towers * 撤銷鍵現在同時綁定 'z' 與 's' 1.00 版變更（1998 年 09 月 10 日，4 個遊戲） * 收錄 4 個遊戲：Gypsy、Irmgard、8x8 與 Klondike * 首次公開發行"

msgid "A \"Standard Interface\" means an interface that either is an official standard defined by a recognized standards body, or, in the case of interfaces specified for a particular programming language, one that is widely used among developers working in that language."
msgstr "「標準介面」指的是這樣的介面：由公認標準機構定義的官方標準；或者是為特定程式語言指定的介面中，在該語言的開發者之間廣泛使用者。"

msgid "A \"User Product\" is either (1) a \"consumer product\", which means any tangible personal property which is normally used for personal, family, or household purposes, or (2) anything designed or sold for incorporation into a dwelling. In determining whether a product is a consumer product, doubtful cases shall be resolved in favor of coverage. For a particular product received by a particular user, \"normally used\" refers to a typical or common use of that class of product, regardless of the status of the particular user or of the way in which the particular user actually uses, or expects or is expected to use, the product. A product is a consumer product regardless of whether the product has substantial commercial, industrial or non-consumer uses, unless such uses represent the only significant mode of use of the product."
msgstr "「使用者產品」是指 (1)「消費產品」，也就是通常用於個人、家庭或家務用途的任何有形個人財產，或 (2) 任何設計或販售目的是裝設於住宅中的東西。判斷產品是否屬於消費產品時，疑難案例應朝受涵蓋的方向認定。對特定使用者取得的特定產品而言，「通常用於」指的是那一類產品的典型或常見用途，與該使用者的身分、實際用法、期望用法或被期望的用法無關。即使產品有實質上的商業、工業或非消費用途，仍屬消費產品，除非那些用途是使用該產品唯一的重要方式。"

msgid "A \"contributor\" is a copyright holder who authorizes use under this License of the Program or a work on which the Program is based. The work thus licensed is called the contributor's \"contributor version\"."
msgstr "「貢獻者」指授權在本授權條款下使用本程式、或本程式所基於之作品的著作權人。如此受授權的作品，稱為該貢獻者的「貢獻版本」。"

msgid "A \"covered work\" means either the unmodified Program or a work based on the Program."
msgstr "「受涵蓋作品」指未經修改的本程式，或基於本程式的作品。"

msgid "A 52 card deck. There are four suits of thirteen cards each. Each suit contains an Ace, 2 through 10, Jack, Queen, and King. These suits are usually Clubs, Spades, Hearts and Diamonds. These suits can be grouped into two colors, usually black and red. The Clubs and the Spaces are black while the Hearts and the Diamonds are red. PySol allows the possibility of using different decks. In this case, the new colors and/or suits are substituted into this paradigm."
msgstr "52 張牌的牌組。共四個花色，每種十三張。每個花色包含 A、2 到 10、J、Q 與 K。這些花色通常是梅花、黑桃、紅心與方塊，可分成兩種顏色，通常是黑色與紅色：梅花與黑桃是黑色，紅心與方塊是紅色。PySol 允許使用不同的牌組；這種情況下，新的顏色與花色會按相同模式取代原來的設定。"

msgid "A Mahjongg set consists of 42 tiles, containing three suits (bamboos, characters, and dots), and nine ranks. Plus, three dragons (green, red, and white), four winds, and a set of four seasons and flowers. Most of PySol's Mahjongg deck games involve matching identical tiles, with the seasons being matched with any season, and same for the flowers."
msgstr "一副麻將由 42 個牌塊組成，包含三種花色（索子、萬子、筒子）與九個點數；另有三張三元牌（青龍、紅中、白板）、四張風牌，以及一組四季與一組四花。PySol 多數麻將牌組遊戲要配對相同的牌塊，四季與任何四季相符，四花也一樣。"

msgid "A STANDARD DECK with a reduced number of cards. Usually, this means that one or more suits or ranks are removed from the deck."
msgstr "牌數較少的標準牌組（STANDARD DECK）。通常指從牌組中移除一個或多個花色或點數。"

msgid "A bonus of 25 points is scored each time a tile is placed next to four adjacent tiles, forming a four-way match."
msgstr "每當一個牌塊放好後與四個相鄰牌塊形成四方配對，就得到 25 分獎勵。"

msgid "A card can be moved to an adjacent empty space, horizontally or vertically, similar to"
msgstr "一張牌可以移到相鄰的空格，橫向或垂直皆可，類似"

msgid "A card is dealt from the stock to replace each card moved to the foundation. The game is won if the entire deck is moved to the foundation in a single sequence."
msgstr "每有一張牌移到王牌區，就從牌山發一張牌補齊。整副牌若能以單一順子全部移入王牌區，就算獲勝。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of eight separate piles, arranged in a square shape. The bottom-most pile is the foundation, and the remaining seven piles are reserves."
msgstr "各發一張牌到排成正方形的八個獨立牌堆。最下面一堆是王牌區，其餘七堆是預備堆。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of eight tableau piles, and eight cards are dealt to a single reserve. No building is allowed on the tableau, and empty tableau piles are filled from the waste pile immediately."
msgstr "八個牌列堆各發一張牌，另發八張牌到單一預備堆。牌列不允許疊放，空的牌列堆立即由棄牌堆補齊。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of eight tableau piles, and four cards are dealt to each of twelve reserves - these are the titular twelve sleeping maids. The tableau piles are built down by same suit, and any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles. When there is an empty tableau pile, flip the top card in the leftmost of the maid piles if it is not flipped already. This card can be moved to the foundations or tableau."
msgstr "八個牌列堆各發一張牌，十二個預備堆各發四張——這些就是遊戲名稱裡那十二名睡覺的女僕。牌列堆按同花色遞減疊放，任何牌或有效的整疊順子都能在牌列堆之間移動。當有牌列堆變空時，若最左邊女僕堆的頂牌還沒翻開，就把它翻開。這張牌可以移到王牌區或牌列。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of eight tableau piles, and one card is dealt to the foundations to determine the base rank of the foundations. The tableau piles are built down by alternate color, turning the corner from ace to king as necessary. Only single cards can be moved between tableau piles. Any card can be used to fill an empty tableau pile."
msgstr "八個牌列堆各發一張牌，並發一張牌到王牌區，用以決定王牌區的基礎點數。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，必要時從 A 回繞到 K。牌列堆之間只能一張一張移動。任何牌都能補進空的牌列堆。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of eight tableau piles. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to tableau piles, which are built regardless of suit and rank, but once in the tableau, cards can only be moved to the foundation."
msgstr "八個牌列堆各發一張牌。牌每次一張從牌山發出，可以移到牌列堆；牌列堆不拘花色與點數疊放，但牌一旦進入牌列，就只能移到王牌區。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of eight tableau piles. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color. Cards cannot be moved between tableau piles - only cards from the waste pile can be moved to the tableau. Empty tableau piles can be filled with any card from the waste pile."
msgstr "八個牌列堆各發一張牌。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放。牌列堆之間不能移牌——只有棄牌堆的牌可以移到牌列。空的牌列堆可以用棄牌堆的任何牌補齊。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of eight tableau piles. Tableau piles are built up by rank, regardless of suit, turning the corner from king to ace as necessary. Only single cards can be moved between tableau piles, and empty piles can be filled by any card. A max of 13 cards is allowed in each tableau pile."
msgstr "八個牌列堆各發一張牌。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞增疊放，必要時從 K 回繞到 A。牌列堆之間只能一張一張移動，空列可用任何牌補齊。每個牌列堆最多 13 張。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of five piles. Any top card that is of lower rank and of the same suit of another top card may be dropped to the foundation. Aces rank high. For the trumps, the skiz, or the fool, is the highest rank."
msgstr "五個牌堆各發一張牌。任何頂牌若點數較低且與另一張頂牌同花色，就可放到王牌區。A 算最大。將牌之中，skiz 也就是 fool，點數最高。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of five tableau piles. Cards are built down, regardless of suit. However, sequences that are all of the same suit are preferred because these are available for further movement. A space can be filled by any card or legal group of cards."
msgstr "五個牌列堆各發一張牌。牌不分花色一律遞減疊放。不過整疊同花色的順子較為理想，因為它們還能再移動。空列可由任何牌或合法的一組牌補齊。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of five tableau piles. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit. Only single cards can be moved between tableau piles, and any card can fill an empty pile. The foundations are built up by same suit from ace to king."
msgstr "五個牌列堆各發一張牌。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞減疊放。牌列堆之間只能一張一張移動，任何牌都能補進空列。王牌區從 A 到 K 按同花色遞增疊放。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of four foundations and four tableau piles. Building on the tableau is not allowed. The foundations are built up or down by rank regardless of suit. If there are no moves left, you can deal a card from the talon to each of the tableau piles. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "四個王牌區與四個牌列堆各發一張牌。牌列不允許疊放。王牌區不分花色，按點數遞增或遞減疊放。若沒有牌可移，可以從牌山各發一張牌到四個牌列堆。全部牌移入王牌區就算獲勝。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of four piles. A single card is dealt to a waste pile. Cards can be moved to the four piles, building down by same suit. If a pile is empty, it is filled by the card on the waste."
msgstr "四個牌堆各發一張牌，並發一張牌到棄牌堆。牌可以移到那四個牌堆，按同花色遞減疊放。若某堆空了，就由棄牌堆那張牌補齊。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of four piles. Any top card that is of lower rank and of the same suit of another top card may be dropped to the foundation. Aces rank high."
msgstr "四個牌堆各發一張牌。任何頂牌若點數較低且與另一張頂牌同花色，就可放到王牌區。A 算最大。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of four tableau piles and four reserve piles. The tableau piles are built down by alternate color, arranged so only the top card is visible. Empty tableau piles are immediately filled with the reserve card directly below it, and empty reserve cards are filled from the waste, or the stock if the waste is empty. Cards from the reserve can be moved to the tableau, but not foundations."
msgstr "四個牌列堆與四個預備堆各發一張牌。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，擺成只看得見頂牌。空的牌列堆立即由正下方的預備牌補齊，空的預備格則由棄牌堆補齊，棄牌堆也空時由牌山補。預備堆的牌可以移到牌列，但不能移到王牌區。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of four tableau piles, and eight reserve piles. The aces are all dealt to the foundations. The tableau piles are built down by same suit, and any card or sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles. Any card or sequence can be moved to an empty tableau pile. You cannot build on the reserves, and cards can only be moved from the reserves to the tableau or foundation one at a time."
msgstr "四個牌列堆與八個預備堆各發一張牌。所有的 A 都直接發到王牌區。牌列堆按同花色遞減疊放，任何牌或整疊順子都能在牌列堆之間移動。任何牌或順子都能移到空的牌列堆。預備堆上不能疊放，且預備堆的牌只能一次一張移到牌列或王牌區。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of four tableau piles, and four reserve cards are set aside. The tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and only single cards can be moved between tableau piles. Empty tableau piles can be filled with one of the reserve cards. Cards from the reserve can also be moved to the tableau. An empty reserve card is immediately replaced from the stock."
msgstr "四個牌列堆各發一張牌，另擱下四張預備牌。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，牌列堆之間只能一張一張移動。空的牌列堆可以用其中一張預備牌補齊。預備牌也能移到牌列。預備格一旦空了，立即由牌山補上一張。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of four tableau piles, and one card is dealt face-down to two reserve piles, one on each side of the tableau. Building on the tableau is not allowed, and cards in the tableau can only be moved to foundations."
msgstr "四個牌列堆各發一張牌，牌列兩側的兩個預備堆各發一張面朝下的牌。牌列不允許疊放，牌列中的牌只能移到王牌區。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of four tableau piles, and thirteen cards are dealt to a reserve pile, arranged so all cards are visible."
msgstr "四個牌列堆各發一張牌，並發十三張牌到一個預備堆，擺成全部可見。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of four tableau piles, and three cards are dealt to each of four reserves. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any card or sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles. Any card or sequence can fill an empty tableau pile. Cards from the top of the reserve piles can be moved to the tableau or foundation, but cards cannot be moved back to the reserves."
msgstr "四個牌列堆各發一張牌，四個預備堆各發三張。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，任何牌或整疊順子都能在牌列堆之間移動。任何牌或順子都能補進空的牌列堆。預備堆的頂牌可以移到牌列或王牌區，但不能移回預備堆。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of four tableau piles. No building on the tableau is allowed - cards can only be moved from the tableau to foundations. The foundations are built up by rank, regardless of suit, with the sevens played on the aces. With the exception of the aces and queens, a card can only be moved to the foundation from the tableau pile directly below it."
msgstr "四個牌列堆各發一張牌。牌列不允許疊放——牌只能從牌列移到王牌區。王牌區不分花色按點數遞增疊放，7 要放在 A 上。除了 A 與 Q 之外，牌只能從正下方的牌列堆移到王牌區。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of four tableau piles. Three cards are dealt to each of four reserve piles. At the start of the game, one card from the top of the reserve must be moved to a foundation pile. This card is used as the base rank for the foundations. No other cards can be moved until this is done."
msgstr "四個牌列堆各發一張牌，四個預備堆各發三張。開局時必須先從某個預備堆頂移一張牌到王牌區，這張牌就是王牌區的基礎點數；在此之前不能移動其他牌。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of fourteen tableau piles. The tableau piles are built down by same suit, arranged so only the top card of each is visible. Only single cards can be moved between piles and empty piles can be filled by any card."
msgstr "十四個牌列堆各發一張牌。牌列堆按同花色遞減疊放，擺成只看得見每堆頂牌。堆之間只能一張一張移動，空列可由任何牌補齊。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of seven tableau piles. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any card or sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles. Cards can be dealt from the talon one at a time and moved to an appropriate tableau or foundation pile."
msgstr "七個牌列堆各發一張牌。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，任何牌或整疊順子都能在牌列堆之間移動。牌可以一次一張從牌山發出，移到合適的牌列堆或王牌區。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of six tableau piles, forming the \"garden\", and thirteen cards are dealt to a reserve called the \"beehive\"."
msgstr "六個牌列堆各發一張牌，構成「花園」，另發十三張牌到名為「蜂窩」的預備堆。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of ten tableau piles. Tableau piles are built up by same suit. Any card or sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles, and an empty pile can be filled by any card or sequence."
msgstr "十個牌列堆各發一張牌。牌列堆按同花色遞增疊放。任何牌或整疊順子都能在牌列堆之間移動，空列可由任何牌或順子補齊。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of thirty-two tableau piles, arranged in two 4x4 grids of sixteen cards, with two empty foundation columns placed between them. Tableau piles are built down by same suit, arranged so only the top card is visible, though a card can only be moved if it's the top card of a pile with no cards between it and the foundation column. Empty tableau piles can only be filled from the waste."
msgstr "三十二個牌列堆各發一張牌，排成兩組 4x4 的十六張網格，兩組中間留有兩列空的王牌區直欄。牌列堆按同花色遞減疊放，擺成只看得見頂牌；不過一張牌必須是某堆的頂牌，且它與王牌區直欄之間沒有其他牌，才能移動。空的牌列堆只能由棄牌堆補齊。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of three rows of four cards each. This forms the picture. Fourteen cards are then dealt around the picture, four cards above and below, and three cards to the left and right. This forms the frame. The foundations are in the corners."
msgstr "三排、每排四張，各發一張牌，構成那幅「圖畫」。接著再發十四張圍繞圖畫，上下各四張、左右各三張，構成「外框」。王牌區位在四個角落。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of twelve tableau piles, and thirteen cards are dealt to a reserve pile. The tableau is built down by rank, regardless of suit, turning the corner from ace to king as necessary, and only single cards can be moved between tableau piles. Empty tableau piles can only be filled from the waste pile."
msgstr "十二個牌列堆各發一張牌，並發十三張牌到一個預備堆。牌列不分花色按點數遞減疊放，必要時從 A 回繞到 K，堆之間只能一張一張移動。空的牌列堆只能由棄牌堆補齊。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of twelve tableau piles. The tableau piles are built up or down by alternate color, arranged so only the top card of each is visible. Only single cards can be moved between piles. Empty piles are immediately filled with a card from the talon. When the talon is empty, empty piles cannot be filled."
msgstr "十二個牌列堆各發一張牌。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞增或遞減疊放，擺成只看得見每堆頂牌。堆之間只能一張一張移動。空列會立即由牌山補上一張；牌山空了之後就不能再補。"

msgid "A card is dealt to each of twenty tableau piles, arranged in a circle. In the middle of the circle are three rows of foundations. The top and bottom rows are built down by same suit from ten to ace, then turning the corner from ace to king and down to jack, in the hearts, clubs, and spades. The middle row is for diamonds, and one foundation is built up from ace to king and the other down from jack to queen, turning the corner as necessary."
msgstr "二十個牌列堆各發一張牌，排成圓圈。圓圈中央是三排王牌區。上排與下排按同花色從 10 遞減到 A，然後回繞到 K 並續減到 J，分別是紅心、梅花與黑桃。中間一排給方塊，其中一堆從 A 遞增到 K，另一堆從 J 遞增到 Q，必要時回繞。"

msgid "A card of each rank from ace to eight is dealt to the eight foundation piles. Each pile is built up by the rank of that card, subtracting thirteen when the total exceeds thirteen, so the foundations are ultimately built as follows:"
msgstr "從 A 到 8 的每個點數各發一張牌到八個王牌區。每堆都以那張牌的點數為基礎遞增疊放，總數超過 13 時就減 13，因此王牌區最終的疊法如下："

msgid "A card of each rank is dealt to each of thirteen foundation piles, arranged like the letter S. These foundations are built up by rank, regardless of suit, with a max of 8 cards in each pile."
msgstr "每個點數各發一張牌到十三個王牌區，排成像字母 S 的樣子。這些王牌區不分花色按點數遞增疊放，每堆最多 8 張。"

msgid "A card or valid sequence of cards can be moved to one of six free cells, but while multiple cards can be moved to free cells, they must be moved as a unit, and cards can only be moved to empty free cells - additional cards cannot be moved to occupied cells. However, any part of the sequence can be moved back to the tableau, or another free cell."
msgstr "一張牌或有效的整疊順子可以移到六個自由格之一，但即使可以一次移多張到自由格，也必須整疊一起移動，而且只能移到空的自由格——已有牌的格子不能再放。不過，順子的任何部分都可以移回牌列，或移到另一個自由格。"

msgid "A card that can be treated as being of whatever suit or rank is most appropriate for the situation. Often, the JOKERS are used as wild cards."
msgstr "可以依當下情況當成任意花色或任意點數使用的牌。常用 JOKER（鬼牌）擔任萬用牌。"

msgid "A card that works like the JOKER in a HEX A DECK. The deck contains four wizards. Each wizard has a rank, with the higher ranked wizards usually identified by having a larger hat, or a fancier card design."
msgstr "在 HEX A DECK 中作用類似 JOKER 的牌。這種牌組含四張法師（wizard）。每個法師都有自己的點數，點數較高的通常以更大的帽子或較華麗的牌面設計辨識。"

msgid "A circle of twelve cards are dealt out to the foundations. The two of clubs is dealt in the nine o'clock position, each pile clockwise dealt with a rank one higher, in suit order clubs-hearts-spades-diamonds, leading to the king of diamonds in the eight o'clock position. The remaining cards are dealt out to eight piles of five cards each."
msgstr "王牌區發成一個十二張牌的圓圈。梅花 2 發在九點鐘位置，之後沿順時針每堆點數加一，花色順序為梅花—紅心—黑桃—方塊，一路到方塊 K 落在八點鐘位置。剩下的牌發成八堆、每堆五張。"

msgid "A circle of twelve cards are dealt out to the foundations. The two of spades is dealt in the five o'clock position, each pile clockwise dealt with a rank one higher, in suit order spades-hearts-clubs-diamonds, leading to the king of diamonds in the four o'clock position. The remaining cards are dealt out to eight piles of five cards each."
msgstr "王牌區發成一個十二張牌的圓圈。黑桃 2 發在五點鐘位置，之後沿順時針每堆點數加一，花色順序為黑桃—紅心—梅花—方塊，一路到方塊 K 落在四點鐘位置。剩下的牌發成八堆、每堆五張。"

msgid "A combination of"
msgstr "是以下玩法的組合"

msgid "A compilation of a covered work with other separate and independent works, which are not by their nature extensions of the covered work, and which are not combined with it such as to form a larger program, in or on a volume of a storage or distribution medium, is called an \"aggregate\" if the compilation and its resulting copyright are not used to limit the access or legal rights of the compilation's users beyond what the individual works permit. Inclusion of a covered work in an aggregate does not cause this License to apply to the other parts of the aggregate."
msgstr "將受涵蓋作品與其他各自獨立的作品彙編在一起，若這些作品本質上不是該作品的延伸，也未與之合併成更大的程式，而只是放在同一個儲存或散布媒體中，則稱為「匯集作品」，前提是彙編本身及其著作權不致限制該彙編使用者的使用權或法律權利，超出各作品本身允許的範圍。在匯集作品中放入受涵蓋作品，不會使本授權條款適用於該匯集的其他部分。"

msgid "A config.txt file, the format described below."
msgstr "一個 config.txt 檔案，格式如下述。"

msgid "A contributor's \"essential patent claims\" are all patent claims owned or controlled by the contributor, whether already acquired or hereafter acquired, that would be infringed by some manner, permitted by this License, of making, using, or selling its contributor version, but do not include claims that would be infringed only as a consequence of further modification of the contributor version. For purposes of this definition, \"control\" includes the right to grant patent sublicenses in a manner consistent with the requirements of this License."
msgstr "貢獻者的「必要專利請求項」指該貢獻者擁有或控制的全部專利請求項，無論現在已取得或日後取得，而若以本授權條款所允許的某種方式製作、使用或販售其貢獻版本就會侵害到的請求項；但不包括只因進一步修改貢獻版本才會侵害的請求項。就本定義而言，「控制」包含以符合本授權條款要求的方式授予專利再授權的權利。"

msgid "A copyright file, containing copyright info."
msgstr "一個著作權檔案，含著作權資訊。"

msgid "A couple sample plugins are available for download on the PySolFC website"
msgstr "PySolFC 網站上提供幾個範例插件可下載"

msgid "A deck of cards consisting of a STANDARD DECK and two jokers making a total of 54 cards."
msgstr "由標準牌組（STANDARD DECK）加兩張鬼牌組成、共 54 張牌的牌組。"

msgid "A deck of cards consisting of two STANDARD DECKS making a total of 104 cards."
msgstr "由兩副標準牌組（STANDARD DECK）組成、共 104 張牌的牌組。"

msgid "A deck that contains a number of pieces that are to be assembled to form a picture."
msgstr "牌組中含許多拼圖塊，要拼組成一幅圖畫。"

msgid "A deck that contains a variable number of cards, with no suits or ranks - matching deck games involve pairing off identical cards."
msgstr "牌數不定、沒有花色與點數的牌組；配對牌組類遊戲要把完全相同的兩張牌配對。"

msgid "A deck that contains a variable number of cards, with no suits, only TRUMPS."
msgstr "牌數不定、沒有花色、只有將牌（TRUMPS）的牌組。"

msgid "A designated area where cards can exist."
msgstr "指定的區域，牌可以存放的地方。"

msgid "A few of the games in PySol use a different type of deck. For more info about some of the other decks PySol games can use, see the following:"
msgstr "PySol 中少數遊戲使用不同類型的牌組。關於 PySol 遊戲可用的其他牌組，更多資訊見以下說明："

msgid "A free space can be filled by any single card or sequence."
msgstr "任何單張牌或順子都可以補進自由格。"

msgid "A french deck variant of"
msgstr "以法式牌組進行的變體玩法，改編自"

msgid "A ganjifa deck consists of a large number of suits, with twelve ranks, including an ace through nine, and two picture cards - the Wazir and the Mir (see"
msgstr "甘尼法（ganjifa）牌組含為數眾多的花色，每種十二個點數，包括 A 到 9 與兩張人頭牌——Wazir 與 Mir（見"

msgid "A good player can win about one out of three games without taking back moves."
msgstr "熟練的玩家不移回走過的步，大約能贏三分之一的局。"

msgid "A hanafuda deck consists of twelve suits, with four ranks in each suit. The suits represent a different flower, and the twelve months of the year, so the suits have a specific order (see"
msgstr "花札（hanafuda）牌組含十二種花色，每種四個點數。花色代表不同的花與一年的十二個月，因此花色有特定順序（見"

msgid "A hex a deck is a unique deck that has sixteen ranks, marked with hexadecimal characters, along with a series of four WIZARDS, that function similar to JOKERS (see"
msgstr "Hex A Deck 是很特別的牌組，有十六個點數，以十六進位字符標示，另有四張法師（WIZARD），作用類似 JOKER（鬼牌）（見"

msgid "A king of each suit is dealt to a row of four foundations. An ace of each suit is similarly dealt to a second row of foundations below the first. There are twelve tableau piles dealt in a circle around the foundations, with four above the first row of foundations, four below the bottom row, and two on each side. The remaining cards are dealt evenly to these foundations, starting from the pile above the leftmost king."
msgstr "每個花色各發一張 K 到一排四個王牌區。每個花色各發一張 A，發到第一排下方的第二排王牌區。十二個牌列堆圍著王牌區發成圓圈，第一排王牌區上方四堆、下方四堆，兩側各兩堆。剩下的牌平均發到這些牌列堆，從最左邊 K 上方的那堆開始。"

msgid "A moment's reflection will show that this game cannot take more than 12 redeals. But only 2 redeals are allowed..."
msgstr "稍加思考就會發現，這遊戲最多不會超過 12 次循環發牌。但這裡只允許 2 次…"

msgid "A new macOS package."
msgstr "新的 macOS 套件。"

msgid "A number of cards are dealt in a square grid, with some face-up and others face-down. Any single card can be flipped - if a card is flipped, all of its adjacent cards horizontally or vertically are flipped as well."
msgstr "若干牌以方形網格排列，有些面朝上、有些面朝下。任何一張牌都可以翻開——一旦翻開某張牌，它在橫向或縱向相鄰的所有牌也會一併翻開。"

msgid "A number of command line options are available for special run options, i.e."
msgstr "有幾個命令列選項可用於特殊的執行選項，例如"

