msgstr "若某專利授權未把本授權條款特別授予的一項或多項權利的行使納入其涵蓋範圍、禁止其行使、或以不行使該等權利為條件，即屬「歧視性」授權。若你是與從事軟體散布的第三者所簽安排的一方，而該安排是你依散布作品的活動規模向該第三者付款、且該第三者會就你散布的受涵蓋作品副本（由該等副本重製的副本亦同），或主要關於及涉及含受涵蓋作品的特定產品或彙編，向將自你取得受涵蓋作品的任何一方授予歧視性專利授權，則你不得散布該受涵蓋作品，除非你加入該安排或取得該專利授權是在 2007 年 3 月 28 日之前。"

msgid "A pile cannot have more than four cards, and an empty slot can be filled with any card or group of cards with the same rank."
msgstr "每個牌堆不得超過四張牌，空格可由任何牌或同點數的一組牌補齊。"

msgid "A pile of four cards of the same rank can be moved to the single foundation."
msgstr "同點數的四張牌組成一疊後，可移到那個王牌區。"

msgid "A row of eight cards is dealt to a tableau. This is called the \"heads\" row. Below this, a row of eight piles of eleven cards is dealt as a reserve face-down. Below the reserve, a second row of eight cards is dealt to a second tableau row, called the \"tails\" row."
msgstr "發一排八張牌到牌列，稱為「頭」排。其下發八列、每列十一張牌作為面朝下的預備堆。預備堆下方再發第二排八張牌到第二個牌列排，稱為「尾」排。"

msgid "A separable portion of the object code, whose source code is excluded from the Corresponding Source as a System Library, need not be included in conveying the object code work."
msgstr "物件碼中可分離的一部分，其原始碼依系統函式庫的定義被排除在對應來源之外，在散布該物件碼作品時不必一併提供。"

msgid "A sequence can be moved from one set to the other, regardless of whether it matches the rules of the piles it moved to, but in this case, the sequence cannot be moved further."
msgstr "順子可以從一組移到另一組，不論是否符合目的堆的規則；但這種情況下，該順子就不能再往下移動。"

msgid "A sequence of cards is played on the leftmost of three stacks, all of the same suit, in order highest to lowest on top."
msgstr "一疊同花色的牌依點數由高到低排好，放到三個疊牌中最左邊的那一疊。"

msgid "A series of extra cards that exist outside of the usual suits and ranks. These are often present in non-standard decks, such as a TAROCK DECK."
msgstr "位於一般花色與點數之外的一組額外牌。常見於非標準牌組，例如塔羅牌組（TAROCK DECK）。"

msgid "A set of Mahjongg tiles has three suits of nine tiles plus three Dragons and four Winds, each of which is repeated four times. And there four Seasons and four Flowers. This makes a total of 144 tiles in a complete set. The three suits are usually called Sticks, Coins and Strings although other names are sometimes used. A three of Sticks will only match another three of Sticks. The Dragons are known by their colors which are usually red, green and white. A green Dragon will only match another green Dragon. The Winds are North, South, East and West. North will only match North etc. Any Flower will match any other Flower and any Season will match any other Season."
msgstr "一副麻將牌塊含三種花色、每種九個牌塊，另有三張三元牌與四張風牌，每種各重複四次；還有四季與四花。完整一副共 144 個牌塊。三種花色通常稱索子、筒子與萬子，不過有時也用其他名稱。三索只會與另一張三索相符。三元牌以顏色為名，通常是紅、青、白；青龍只會與另一張青龍相符。風牌是北、南、東、西，北只會與北相符，其餘依此類推。任何花可與任何花相符，任何季也可與任何季相符。"

msgid "A shade file - shade.png, for example."
msgstr "一個陰影檔案，例如 shade.png。"

msgid "A single card is dealt in the center of a seven by seven grid. One by one, deal the remaining cards into the grid, each next to another card, either horizontally, vertically, or diagonally. Non-face cards in the grid must be played in sequences that total up to even numbers. Once a card is played, it cannot be moved."
msgstr "在 7 x 7 網格正中央發一張牌。接著一張一張把剩下的牌發入網格，每張都要與另一張牌相鄰，橫向、縱向或對角皆可。網格中非人頭牌的牌必須以總和為偶數的順子出牌。牌一旦放下就不能再移動。"

msgid "A single card is dealt to a foundation, and nine cards are dealt to tableau piles in a circle around the foundation. The foundation is built up by rank, regardless of suit, turning the corner from king to ace as necessary."
msgstr "王牌區發一張牌，九張牌發成圍著王牌區的九個圓圈牌列堆。王牌區不分花色按點數遞增疊放，必要時從 K 回繞到 A。"

msgid "A single card is dealt to each of eight tableau piles, and four cards are dealt to each of eight reserves. The tableau piles are built down by alternate colors, and single cards can be moved between tableau piles. Any card can fill an empty tableau pile No building on the reserves is allowed - cards from the reserves can only be moved to foundations or the tableau."
msgstr "八個牌列堆各發一張牌，八個預備堆各發四張。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，堆之間只能一張一張移動。任何牌都能補進空的牌列堆。預備堆上不能疊放——預備堆的牌只能移到王牌區或牌列。"

msgid "A single card is dealt to each of nine tableau piles. The tableau piles are built up by same suit, and empty piles are immediately filled from the talon."
msgstr "九個牌列堆各發一張牌。牌列堆按同花色遞增疊放，空列立即由牌山補齊。"

msgid "A single card is dealt to each of twenty-four tableau piles. Tableau piles are built up or down by same suit, cards placed so only the top one is visible. Empty tableau piles are immediately filled from the stock. If the stock is empty, tableau piles can't be filled."
msgstr "二十四個牌列堆各發一張牌。牌列堆按同花色遞增或遞減疊放，擺成只看得見頂牌。空的牌列堆立即由牌山補齊；牌山空了之後就不能再補。"

msgid "A single card is dealt to the first foundation, and four cards are dealt to each of four tableau rows, with only the top card visible. No building in this tableau is allowed. The remaining cards are dealt three at a time from the stock. On this first foundation, any card of the same suit as the first card can be played."
msgstr "第一個王牌區發一張牌，四個牌列排各發四張，只看得見頂牌。這個牌列不允許疊放。剩下的牌每次三張從牌山發出。在第一王牌區上，任何與那張第一牌同花色的牌都可以放上。"

msgid "A single card is dealt to the foundation. The foundation is built up with cards of the same rank. Once all four cards of that rank are in the foundation, you may place cards with the next rank up - so if a three is dealt first, all four threes can be added to the foundation, and once they're there, you can start placing fours. Once kings are played, the sequence turns the corner and continues from ace."
msgstr "王牌區發一張牌。該王牌區以相同點數的牌遞增疊放，該點數的四張牌都進入後，才能放下一點數的牌——所以若先發出 3，就能把四張 3 都放進王牌區，放齊之後就可以開始放 4。K 出完之後順序回繞，從 A 繼續。"

msgid "A single foundation is built up from ace to king, then wrapping around from king to ace as needed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundation."
msgstr "單一王牌區從 A 遞增疊放到 K，必要時從 K 回繞到 A。全部牌都移入王牌區就算獲勝。"

msgid "A single foundation is built up starting with the rank one higher than the top card of the reserve, regardless of suit, turning the corner from ace to king as necessary (if the top card of the reserve is a king, the foundation starts from an ace)."
msgstr "單一王牌區不分花色，從比預備堆頂牌高一點的點數開始遞增疊放，必要時從 A 回繞到 K（若預備堆頂牌是 K，就從 A 開始）。"

msgid "A single redeal is allowed. During this redeal, the cards set aside are used to form a new talon, and these cards are dealt one at a time (in the normal manner), and can be moved to the tableau or foundations."
msgstr "允許一次循環發牌。循環發牌時，先前擱下的牌會組成新的牌山，並依正常方式一次一張發出，可以移到牌列或王牌區。"

msgid "A special TRUMPS suit card in a TAROCK DECK. Depending on the game, it can act as the highest trump, the lowest, or like the JOKER in a STANDARD DECK. Also called the SKIZ."
msgstr "塔羅牌組（TAROCK DECK）中的一張特殊將牌（TRUMPS）。依遊戲而異，它可以是最高的將牌、最低的將牌，或像標準牌組中的 JOKER 那樣運作。也稱為 SKIZ。"

msgid "A special move where you move a sequence of cards at once, in a game that does not normally allow it. However, if there are enough open reserves and empty stacks to perform the move by moving cards between them one at a time, you can make it as a single move as a shortcut."
msgstr "一種特殊移法：在不允許整疊移動的遊戲中，一次移動一疊順子。不過若空預備堆與空牌列足夠多、本來就能逐張移牌完成這個動作，就可以把它當成一步捷徑一次完成。"

msgid "A stack of cards face up, usually next to the TALON. Top card usually in play."
msgstr "一疊面朝上的牌，通常在牌山（TALON）旁邊。頂牌一般可以出牌。"

msgid "A string of beads can be added to from both ends, and so should your piles. Make good use of any empty slots to append cards. With a little perseverance, this game can be a lot of fun!"
msgstr "一串珠子可以從兩端接上去，你的牌列堆也應該如此。好好利用任何空列來接牌。只要有點耐心，這遊戲會很好玩！"

msgid "A tarock deck consists of fourteen ranks, with the Cavalier, or Knight existing as a fourth picture card, usually ranked between the Jack and Queen. Tarock decks also include a series of twenty-two numbered trump cards."
msgstr "塔羅牌組含十四個點數，其中 Cavalier（騎士）是第四張人頭牌，通常排在 J 與 Q 之間。塔羅牌組另有共二十二張的編號將牌。"

msgid "A two deck variant of"
msgstr "兩副牌的變體玩法，改編自"

msgid "A type of GANJIFA DECK with eight suits."
msgstr "八花色種類的甘尼法（GANJIFA）牌組。"

msgid "A type of GANJIFA DECK with ten suits."
msgstr "十花色種類的甘尼法（GANJIFA）牌組。"

msgid "A variant of"
msgstr "變體玩法，改編自"

msgid "A, 2, 4, 8, 3, 6, Q, J, 9, 5, 10, 7, A, repeat..."
msgstr "A, 2, 4, 8, 3, 6, Q, J, 9, 5, 10, 7, A, 重複…"

msgid "Abandon Hope"
msgstr "放棄希望（Abandon Hope）"

msgid "Ability to add table tile backgrounds from your own images, through the app itself."
msgstr "可以直接在 app 中用自己的圖片加入桌布背景。"

msgid "Ability to change the style of virtually any of the graphics in PySol."
msgstr "幾乎可以更換 PySol 中任何圖形的風格。"

msgid "Ability to run the test suite without python 2.x and/or pygtk"
msgstr "不必 Python 2.x 及／或 pygtk 也能執行測試套件"

msgid "About"
msgstr "關於"

msgid "About this document:"
msgstr "關於本文件："

msgid "Above the free lands are multiple columns of foundations/reserves, which accept different cards according depending on which other piles have been played to. There is one row of these piles for each suit. From left to right, these are:"
msgstr "自由格上方有多列王牌區／預備堆，會依其他牌列堆已放過哪些牌而接受不同的牌。每個花色各有這樣一排牌堆。由左至右依序是："

msgid "Abstract = 35"
msgstr "抽象 = 35"

msgid "Accessibility features including the ability to play by keyboard only, and support for some text to speech services."
msgstr "無障礙功能，包括可用純鍵盤遊玩，以及對部分文字轉語音服務的支援。"

msgid "According to the"
msgstr "依照"

msgid "Accordion's Revenge is unwinnable if the first or second card is declared. As such, PySol will never select either of those cards as the target."
msgstr "手風琴的復仇（Accordion's Revenge）若目標牌是第一或第二張，遊戲必定無解，因此 PySol 絕不會選這兩張當目標牌。"

msgid "Accordion, and its related games, can be played with cards dealt manually by the player one at a time, or all cards dealt at once. This option can be set in the options menu."
msgstr "手風琴（Accordion）及其相關遊戲，可以由玩家一張一張自己發牌，也可以一次全部發完。這個選項可在選項選單中設定。"

msgid "Ace Through King"
msgstr "從 A 到 K"

msgid "Aces are instead built by same rank, with only sequences of aces that are the same color being able to be moved together. Four aces of the same color in a sequence can be moved as a unit to a foundation."
msgstr "A 改為以相同點數疊放，只有同色的 A 順子才能一起移動。同色四張 A 排成一列時，可整組移到王牌區。"

msgid "Aces are placed in a separate castoff pile. This pile is built up by alternating colors."
msgstr "A 會放到獨立的擲棄堆。該堆以紅黑交替遞增疊放。"

msgid "Aces are worth one and Jacks, Queens, and Kings are worth 11, 12, and 13, respectively."
msgstr "A 值 1，J、Q、K 分別值 11、12、13。"

msgid "Aces can be moved to the foundations, which are built up by same suit from ace to king."
msgstr "A 可以移到王牌區，王牌區從 A 到 K 按同花色遞增疊放。"

msgid "Aces can be moved to the foundations, which are then built up by suit."
msgstr "A 可以移到王牌區，之後王牌區按花色遞增疊放。"

msgid "Aces have a value of one, jacks a value of of 11, queens are 12, and kings are 13."
msgstr "A 的值是 1，J 是 11，Q 是 12，K 是 13。"

msgid "Acht Karten"
msgstr "Acht Karten"

msgid "Achtmal Acht"
msgstr "Achtmal Acht"

msgid "Add Up Tens"
msgstr "湊十（Add Up Tens）"

msgid "Add auto-scaling support to the game and cardset previews."
msgstr "為遊戲與牌組預覽加入自動縮放支援。"

msgid "Add the -g and --deal command line options."
msgstr "加入 -g 與 --deal 命令列選項。"

msgid "Added a NEWS.asciidoc file."
msgstr "新增 NEWS.asciidoc 檔案。"

msgid "Added tests, bug fixes and refactorings."
msgstr "加入測試、錯誤修正與重構。"

msgid "Addiction"
msgstr "成癮（Addiction）"

msgid "Additional cardsets, music, and settings are stored under"
msgstr "其他牌組、音樂與設定存放在"

msgid "Additional documentation for a number of PySol's features."
msgstr "PySol 若干功能的額外說明。"

msgid "Additional terms, permissive or non-permissive, may be stated in the form of a separately written license, or stated as exceptions; the above requirements apply either way."
msgstr "額外條款不論寬鬆與否，都可以另行寫成獨立的授權條款，或以例外方式聲明；上述要求在兩種情況下都適用。"

msgid "Additionally, at the start of the game, one card is dealt to a foundation. One set of foundations is built down by suit from that rank while the other is built up by suit from the rank one higher. Foundation piles wrap from ace to king as necessary."
msgstr "此外，開局時會發一張牌到王牌區。其中一組王牌區從那個點數起按花色遞減疊放，另一組則從下一點數起按花色遞增疊放。王牌區必要時從 A 回繞到 K。"

msgid "Additionally, building on the tableau piles is allowed. Tableau piles are built up or down by rank, regardless of suit, also wrapping between king and ace as necessary. But once the talon is empty, empty tableau piles can no longer be filled."
msgstr "此外，牌列堆允許疊放。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞增或遞減疊放，必要時也在 K 與 A 之間回繞。但牌山一空，空的牌列堆就不能再補牌。"

msgid "Additionally, every card from the reserve piles is available to play. Hitting the redeal button will shift the topmost card of each reserve."
msgstr "此外，預備堆裡的每一張牌都可以出牌。按循環發牌鈕會讓每個預備堆的頂牌往下換一張。"

msgid "Additionally, if there is a tableau pile with only a single card left in it while there are still cards in the talon, that tableau card can't be moved to another tableau pile, and no cards can be moved on top of it. Single cards can only be moved to the foundation, and once a pile is empty, three additional cards are dealt from the talon to fill the pile (with the bottom one face-down, like the initial deal). Once the talon has been emptied, single card tableau piles can be played normally."
msgstr "此外，若牌山還有牌、而某個牌列堆只剩一張牌，那張牌就不能移到別的牌列堆，別的牌也不能放到它上面。單張牌只能移到王牌區；一旦該堆空了，就從牌山再發三張補滿（最下面那張面朝下，跟開局時一樣）。牌山發完之後，只剩一張牌的牌列堆就能正常遊玩。"

msgid "Additionally, once the talon is empty, a single reserve pile becomes available to use. Cards can be moved from the tableau to the reserve pile, and the top card can be moved back to the tableau. A max of three cards can be in this reserve."
msgstr "此外，牌山一空，其中一個預備堆就會開放使用。牌可以從牌列移到該預備堆，頂牌也能移回牌列。這個預備堆最多放三張。"

msgid "Additionally, the following keys will trigger additional screen reader messages, containing additional information that may be needed by specific games. These are not used by all games, and for the games that use them, the message info will vary from game to game:"
msgstr "此外，下面這些按鍵會觸發額外的螢幕報讀訊息，內容是特定遊戲可能需要的額外資訊。並非所有遊戲都會用到；有使用的遊戲，訊息內容也各遊戲不同："

msgid "Additionally, the position of two cards on the tableau can be swapped if both of them would end up in the correct row as a result."
msgstr "此外，若交換牌列上的兩張牌後，兩張都能落到正確的橫排，就可以把它們對調。"

msgid "Additionally, there is a single reserve pile. Two cards are dealt to this pile at the start of the game, and any cards may be moved to it. However, only the top card from the reserve can be played back to the tableau."
msgstr "此外，另有一個預備堆。開局時發兩張牌進去，之後任何牌都可以移到那裡。但預備堆只有頂牌能移回牌列。"

msgid "Additionally, when there are only four cards left in the talon, they can be dealt straight to four reserve piles, and freely moved to the tableau or foundations when possible."
msgstr "此外，當牌山只剩四張時，可以直接發到四個預備堆，之後於可行時自由移到牌列或王牌區。"

msgid "Adult = 1"
msgstr "成人 = 1"

msgid "Advanced search feature - the ability to search for games, cardsets, or table tiles based on many different criteria."
msgstr "進階搜尋功能——可以依多種條件搜尋遊戲、牌組或桌布。"

msgid "Advanced: 10 columns"
msgstr "進階：10 列"

msgid "Affinity"
msgstr "親和（Affinity）"

msgid "After all cards have been dealt click on the talon for a redeal. The cards are not re-shuffled, but re-dealt in a certain pattern. The piles are stacked together, with the rightmost pile flipped and placed on the bottom, and each of the other piles flipped and placed on top, going from right to left."
msgstr "全部牌發完後，點牌山即可循環發牌。牌不重新洗牌，而是以固定模式重發。各堆疊在一起，最右邊的堆翻面放到最下面，其餘各堆也由右至左逐一翻面疊到上面。"

msgid "After dealing five sets of cards from the talon, shuffle the tableau piles with the remainder of the talon, to create a new talon before continuing. This can be done a max of twice."
msgstr "從牌山發完五組牌後，把牌列堆與牌山剩下的牌一起洗成新的牌山再繼續。這個動作最多可做兩次。"

msgid "After each four-way match is formed, the aforementioned scoring is doubled for the rest of the game."
msgstr "每形成一次四方配對之後，前述計分在剩下的遊戲中加倍。"

msgid "After each hand, repeat the process four more times to deal a total of five hands. You win if after all five hands, your score reaches 80 points."
msgstr "每局結束後，再把同樣流程重複四次，共發五局。五局都結束後分數達到 80 分即獲勝。"

msgid "After each move a new card is dealt from the talon to the waste. There is one redeal."
msgstr "每移一次牌，就從牌山發一張到棄牌堆。有一次循環發牌。"

msgid "After removing a pair of cards, cards are dealt to fill in the gaps. Once the stock is empty, the cards are shifted up to fill in."
msgstr "拿走一組配對後，會發牌補上空缺。牌山空了之後，就把後面的牌往前移位補齊。"

msgid "After the king of diamonds is played, the suit changes back to clubs, and so on until all the cards have been moved to the foundation, and the game is won."
msgstr "方塊 K 出完後，花色換回梅花，如此繼續，直到全部牌都移入王牌區，遊戲就算獲勝。"

msgid "After the stock is empty, flip the waste pile and go through the stock again, including the new cards that were added in that round. Two redeals are allowed, so you can go through the deck up to three times total."
msgstr "牌山發完後，把棄牌堆翻面再走一遍，並包括該回合中新加入的牌。允許兩次循環發牌，因此整副牌最多可以走三遍。"

msgid "After the talon is exhausted, you can use the reserve stack for storing any card or legal sequence (this process is called"
msgstr "牌山用盡後，可以把預備堆拿來存放任何牌或合法的順子（這個動作稱為"

msgid "After twenty cards have been moved (or the talon is empty), cards may be moved from the reserves to the foundations again, though this time, empty reserves are not filled immediately. Once no more cards can be moved, you can deal another twenty from the talon in the same manner as described above. This cycle continues until the talon is empty."
msgstr "移走 20 張牌（或牌山空了）之後，可以再把預備堆的牌移到王牌區，但這一次空預備堆不會立即補滿。無法再移牌時，就能用上述同樣方式再從牌山發 20 張。如此循環，直到牌山為空。"

msgid "All Rights Reserved."
msgstr "版權所有。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to 9 piles at the start of the game, each King or \"Ten\" (hexadecimal) starting a new pile. Rows build down in rank and alternate colors. The Wizards play as any color. Empty rows cannot be filled."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發成 9 堆，每張 K 或「10」（十六進位）各起一新堆。橫排按點數遞減、紅黑交替疊放。法師可當任意顏色。空的橫排無法補牌。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to 9 piles at the start of the game, each King or \"Ten\" (hexadecimal) starting a new pile. Rows build down in rank and suit. The Wizards will play as any color. Empty rows cannot be filled."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發成 9 堆，每張 K 或「10」（十六進位）各起一新堆。橫排按點數與花色遞減疊放。法師可當任意顏色。空的橫排無法補牌。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to 9 piles at the start of the game, each King or \"Ten\" (hexadecimal) starting a new pile. Rows build down in rank regardless of color and empty rows cannot be filled. The Wizards play as any color."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發成 9 堆，每張 K 或「10」（十六進位）各起一新堆。橫排按點數遞減疊放、不拘花色，空的橫排無法補牌。法師可當任意顏色。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to 9 piles at the start of the game, each King or Skiz starting a new pile. Rows build down in rank and suit. The trumps will only play on other trumps. Empty rows cannot be filled. The eight free cells will hold one card each."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發成 9 堆，每張 K 或 Skiz 各起一新堆。橫排按點數與花色遞減疊放。將牌只能放在其他將牌上。空的橫排無法補牌。八個自由格各放一張牌。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to 9 piles at the start of the game, each King or Skiz starting a new pile. Rows build down in rank by alternate color. The trumps will play as any color. Empty rows cannot be filled. The eight free cells will hold one card each."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發成 9 堆，每張 K 或 Skiz 各起一新堆。橫排按點數遞減、紅黑交替疊放。將牌可當任意顏色。空的橫排無法補牌。八個自由格各放一張牌。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to 9 piles at the start of the game, each King or Skiz starting a new pile. Rows build down in rank regardless of suit. Empty rows cannot be filled. The eight free cells will hold one card each."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發成 9 堆，每張 K 或 Skiz 各起一新堆。橫排按點數遞減疊放、不拘花色。空的橫排無法補牌。八個自由格各放一張牌。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to 9 piles at the start of the game, each King starting a new pile. To compensate for this there are 7 free cells which can hold any - and just one - card."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發成 9 堆，每張 K 各起一新堆。為補償起見，另有 7 個自由格，每個可放任意、但僅限一張牌。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to 9 piles at the start of the game, each King starting a new pile. To compensate for this there are 8 free cells which can hold any - and just one - card."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發成 9 堆，每張 K 各起一新堆。為補償起見，另有 8 個自由格，每個可放任意、但僅限一張牌。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to 9 piles at the start of the game, each Raja or King starting a new pile. Rows build down in rank and alternate color. Refer to the general"
msgstr "開局時全部牌發成 9 堆，每張 Raja 或 K 各起一新堆。橫排按點數遞減、紅黑交替疊放。請參閱通用"

msgid "All cards are dealt to 9 piles at the start of the game, each Raja or King starting a new pile. Rows build down in rank and suit. Refer to the general"
msgstr "開局時全部牌發成 9 堆，每張 Raja 或 K 各起一新堆。橫排按點數與花色遞減疊放。請參閱通用"

msgid "All cards are dealt to 9 piles at the start of the game, each Raja or King starting a new pile. Rows build down in rank by alternate force suits. Refer to the general"
msgstr "開局時全部牌發成 9 堆，每張 Raja 或 K 各起一新堆。橫排按點數遞減疊放，採強制花色交替。請參閱通用"

msgid "All cards are dealt to 9 piles at the start of the game, each Raja or King starting a new pile. Rows build down in rank regardless of suit. Empty rows cannot be filled. The eight free cells will hold one card each."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發成 9 堆，每張 Raja 或 K 各起一新堆。橫排按點數遞減疊放、不拘花色。空的橫排無法補牌。八個自由格各放一張牌。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to 9 piles at the start of the game, each Raja or King starting a new pile. Rows build down in rank regardless of suit. Empty rows cannot be filled. The ten free cells will hold one card each."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發成 9 堆，每張 Raja 或 K 各起一新堆。橫排按點數遞減疊放、不拘花色。空的橫排無法補牌。十個自由格各放一張牌。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to 9 piles at the start of the game, each first rank card starting a new pile."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發成 9 堆，每張第一級牌各起一新堆。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to the fourteen rows when the games begins. Cards on the tableau build down by suit in descending rank order. The foundations build up by suit. Any card or movable pile may be played on an empty row. The four reserve stacks hold one card each."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發到十四排。牌列的牌按花色、點數由高到低遞減疊放。王牌區按花色遞增疊放。任何牌或可移動的整疊牌都能放到空的橫排。四個預備堆各放一張牌。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to the fourteen rows when the games begins. Cards on the tableau build down in descending rank order. The foundations build up by suit. Any card or movable pile may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發到十四排。牌列的牌按點數由高到低遞減疊放。王牌區按花色遞增疊放。任何牌或可移動的整疊牌都能放到空的橫排。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to the sixteen rows when the games begins. Cards on the tableau build down in rank in alternating colors. See the general"
msgstr "開局時全部牌發到十六排。牌列的牌按點數遞減疊放、紅黑交替。請參閱通用"

msgid "All cards are dealt to the sixteen rows when the games begins. Cards on the tableau build down in rank in alternating force. See the general"
msgstr "開局時全部牌發到十六排。牌列的牌按點數遞減疊放、強制交替。請參閱通用"

msgid "All cards are dealt to the sixteen rows when the games begins. Cards on the tableau build down in rank only. The foundations build up by suit. Only a Raja or sequence may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發到十六排。牌列的牌只按點數遞減疊放。王牌區按花色遞增疊放。只有 Raja 或順子能放到空的橫排。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to the sixteen rows when the games begins. Cards on the tableau build down in rank only. The foundations build up by suit. Only a Raja or sequence may be played on an empty row. The four reserve stacks hold one card each."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發到十六排。牌列的牌只按點數遞減疊放。王牌區按花色遞增疊放。只有 Raja 或順子能放到空的橫排。四個預備堆各放一張牌。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to the thirty two rows when the games begins. Cards on the tableau build down by suit in descending rank order. The foundations build up by suit. Any card may be played on an empty row. The reserve stacks hold one card each. Only one card at a time may be moved."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發到三十二排。牌列的牌按花色、點數由高到低遞減疊放。王牌區按花色遞增疊放。任何牌都能放到空的橫排。預備堆各放一張牌。每次只能移動一張。"

msgid "All cards are dealt to the twenty four rows when the games begins. Cards on the tableau build down by suit in descending rank order. The foundations build up by suit. Any card may be played on an empty row. The reserve stacks hold one card each. Only one card at a time may be moved."
msgstr "開局時全部牌發到二十四排。牌列的牌按花色、點數由高到低遞減疊放。王牌區按花色遞增疊放。任何牌都能放到空的橫排。預備堆各放一張牌。每次只能移動一張。"

msgid "All eight sixes and sevens are dealt out to sixteen foundation piles. Nine additional cards are dealt to the tableau. No building on the tableau is allowed."
msgstr "所有的 6 與 7（各八張）發到十六個王牌區。另發九張牌到牌列。牌列不允許疊放。"

msgid "All of the cards are dealt into three reserve piles (2 with 17 cards and one with 18). Cards can be moved from these reserve piles to one of five tableau piles or the foundations."
msgstr "全部牌發成三個預備堆（兩個 17 張、一個 18 張）。可以從這些預備堆移牌到五個牌列堆之一，或移到王牌區。"

msgid "All of the cards are dealt to twelve piles of eight cards each. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles. Any card or sequence can be moved to an empty pile."
msgstr "全部牌發成十二堆、每堆八張。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，任何有效的整疊順子都能在牌列堆之間移動。任何牌或順子都能移到空堆。"

msgid "All of the cards in one of two decks are dealt out to ten tableau piles of five cards each, with the last two cards put aside as reserve cards. The second deck is used as the talon. Tableau piles are built down by same suit, and only single cards can be moved between tableau piles. The reserve cards can be moved to the foundations or tableau at any time."
msgstr "兩副牌其中一副的全部牌發到十個牌列堆、每堆五張，最後兩張擱下當作預備牌。另一副牌當作牌山。牌列堆按同花色遞減疊放，堆之間只能一張一張移動。預備牌隨時都可以移到王牌區或牌列。"

msgid "All of the cards in the tableau are dealt face down. Any face-down card can be left face-down or flipped face-up. Face-down cards cannot be moved but any card can be played on a face-down card. Face-up cards can be moved one at a time, and face-up cards are built down in sequence by alternating colors."
msgstr "牌列的全部牌都面朝下發出。任何面朝下的牌可以保持面朝下或翻開。面朝下的牌不能移動，但任何牌都可以放到它上面。面朝上的牌一次可移動一張，並按紅黑交替依序遞減疊放。"

msgid "All of the fives and sixes are dealt to the foundations. The foundations with fives are built down by suit to ace, with the kings then placed on the aces, while the foundations with sixes are built up by suit to queen."
msgstr "所有的 5 與 6 都發到王牌區。放 5 的王牌區按花色遞減疊放到 A，然後把 K 放到 A 上；放 6 的王牌區則按花色遞增疊放到 Q。"

msgid "All of the queens are dealt to four foundation piles on the right, while the jacks are dealt to four reserve piles on the left. A card is dealt to each of six tableau piles. The tableau piles are built down by alternate color, turning the corner from ace to king as necessary, and only single cards can be moved between tableau piles. Empty tableau piles are immediately filled from talon. Once the talon is empty, they can be filled with any card."
msgstr "所有的 Q 發到右邊四個王牌區，J 發到左邊四個預備堆。六個牌列堆各發一張牌。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，必要時從 A 回繞到 K，堆之間只能一張一張移動。空的牌列堆立即由牌山補齊；牌山空了之後，就能用任何牌補齊。"

