msgstr "所有其他不寬鬆的額外條款，都屬第 10 條所稱的「進一步限制」。若你收到的本程式或其任何部分含有聲明，表示它受本授權條款以及某項進一步限制的約束，你可以移除該限制條款。若某授權文件含有進一步限制，但允許在本授權條款下再授權或散布，你就可以把受該文件條款約束的材料加入受涵蓋作品，只要該進一步限制不會在再授權或散布後繼續存在。"

msgid "All rights granted under this License are granted for the term of copyright on the Program, and are irrevocable provided the stated conditions are met. This License explicitly affirms your unlimited permission to run the unmodified Program. The output from running a covered work is covered by this License only if the output, given its content, constitutes a covered work. This License acknowledges your rights of fair use or other equivalent, as provided by copyright law."
msgstr "本授權條款授予的所有權利，其期間等於本程式的著作權期間，且只要符合所述條件即不可撤回。本授權條款明確確認你可以不受限制地執行未經修改的本程式。只有在執行受涵蓋作品的輸出內容本身構成受涵蓋作品時，該輸出才受本授權條款規範。本授權條款承認你依著作權法所享有的合理使用或其他相當權利。"

msgid "All the aces are dealt to the foundations. A card is dealt to each of four tableau piles and four free cells. The tableau piles are built down by alternate color, arranged so only the top card is visible. Cards from the free cells can only be moved to the tableau, and cards can only be moved to the free cells from the waste pile."
msgstr "所有的 A 都發到王牌區。四個牌列堆與四個自由格各發一張牌。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，擺成只看得見頂牌。自由格的牌只能移到牌列，且只有棄牌堆的牌可以移到自由格。"

msgid "Also note that because of these changes, upgrading your version of PySolFC Cardsets is required even if you're using the minimal package. If you are using the Windows or Mac installer, this will be handled automatically, but you'll need to upgrade if you're setting it up manually."
msgstr "另請注意，由於這些變更，即使你使用的是最小套件，也必須升級 PySolFC Cardsets。若你使用 Windows 或 Mac 安裝程式，這件事會自動處理，但自行手動設定的人就需要自己升級。"

msgid "Also note that the Solitaire Wizard may not be enabled in mobile versions of PySol."
msgstr "另請注意，接龍法師（Solitaire Wizard）在 PySol 的手機版本中可能無法使用。"

msgid "Also, a two, three, and four are dealt to the leftmost tableau piles at the start of the game."
msgstr "此外，開局時會把 2、3、4 各一張發到最左邊的幾個牌列堆。"

msgid "Also, one redeal is allowed."
msgstr "此外，允許一次循環發牌。"

msgid "Also, the tableau piles are built up or down by alternate color."
msgstr "此外，牌列堆按紅黑交替遞增或遞減疊放。"

msgid "Also, there are four free cells."
msgstr "此外，有四個自由格。"

msgid "Also, there are no restrictions as to which tableau piles cards can be moved to foundations from, and tableau piles are built up or down by same suit."
msgstr "此外，對於哪些牌列堆可以把牌移回王牌區沒有限制，且牌列堆按同花色遞增或遞減疊放。"

msgid "Alternatively, you can report bugs on SourceForge on the discussion forum at"
msgstr "或者，你也可以在 SourceForge 的討論區回報錯誤，網址是"

msgid "Amazons is played with only the Aces and Sevens through queens of each suit. The remaining cards are removed."
msgstr "亞馬遜（Amazons）只用每個花色的 A 與 7 到 Q 來玩，其餘的牌都拿掉。"

msgid "American Patience"
msgstr "美國接龍（American Patience）"

msgid "An \"entity transaction\" is a transaction transferring control of an organization, or substantially all assets of one, or subdividing an organization, or merging organizations. If propagation of a covered work results from an entity transaction, each party to that transaction who receives a copy of the work also receives whatever licenses to the work the party's predecessor in interest had or could give under the previous paragraph, plus a right to possession of the Corresponding Source of the work from the predecessor in interest, if the predecessor has it or can get it with reasonable efforts."
msgstr "「實體交易」指移轉某組織控制權、該組織幾乎全部資產、分割某組織、或合併各組織的交易。若受涵蓋作品的散布是實體交易的結果，則該交易中收到作品副本的每一方，也取得其前手依前一條所擁有或可給予的各種授權，並取得向前手取得該作品對應來源的權利（若前手持有它，或經合理努力即可取得）。"

msgid "An Android package is available to install from"
msgstr "另有 Android 套件，可從"

msgid "An Ishido set consists of 36 tiles, containing six different colors and six symbols. Ishido games usually involve matching the colors and symbols of adjacent tiles."
msgstr "一套 Ishido 含 36 個牌塊，包括六種顏色與六種符號。Ishido 遊戲通常要配對相鄰牌塊的顏色與符號。"

msgid "An ace and a king of each suit is dealt to the foundations, and the remaining cards are dealt to twelve piles of eight cards each. Tableau piles are built up or down by same suit, and only single cards can be moved between tableau piles. Any card can fill empty tableau piles."
msgstr "每個花色的一張 A 與一張 K 發到王牌區，剩下的牌發成十二堆、每堆八張。牌列堆按同花色遞增或遞減疊放，堆之間只能一張一張移動。任何牌都能補進空的牌列堆。"

msgid "An ace is dealt to each of five foundation piles, arranged in an X pattern in the center of the play area. Ten cards are dealt to each of 6 tableau piles, arranged so only the top card is visible, with one above and below the foundations, and two each to the left and right."
msgstr "五個王牌區各發一張 A，排成遊戲區中央的 X 形。六個牌列堆各發十張，擺成只看得見頂牌；王牌區上下各一堆，左右各兩堆。"

msgid "An ace of each color is dealt to two foundations, and cards are dealt to eight tableau piles of six cards. The remaining two cards are dealt to two free reserve cells."
msgstr "每種顏色各發一張 A 到兩個王牌區，另發八個牌列堆、每堆六張牌。剩下兩張發到兩個自由預備格。"

msgid "An empty row is more useful than the reserve stacks. Try for an empty row."
msgstr "空的橫排比預備堆更有用。設法做出空的橫排。"

msgid "An empty row is somewhat more useful than the reserve stacks. Try for an empty row."
msgstr "空的橫排多少比預備堆有用一些。設法做出空的橫排。"

msgid "An extra card with no suit or rank. JOKER DECK games can contain up to two jokers, which often function as WILD CARDS."
msgstr "一張沒有花色與點數的額外牌。JOKER DECK 牌組最多含兩張鬼牌，通常可當萬用牌使用。"

msgid "An image for each card - these images should be the same format and the same size, as defined in the config.txt file (described below). These files should be named something like 01s.png for the ace of spades. The first two (or more) digits represent the rank, and the letter after represents the suit. The suits are labeled hcds in French decks or decks that use French suits (i.e. Hex A or Tarock decks), and the suits are alphabetical for other decks. The suit letter z is used for jokers or trumps."
msgstr "每張牌對應的圖片——這些圖片的格式與大小必須相同，如 config.txt 檔案（下述）所定義。檔案名稱應採黑桃 A 用 01s.png 這類形式。前兩碼（或更多）數字代表點數，後面的字母代表花色。使用法式花色（即 Hex A 或塔羅牌組）的牌組，花色代號為 hcds；其他牌組則依字母順序排列。鬼牌或將牌的花色代號為 z。"

msgid "An interactive user interface displays \"Appropriate Legal Notices\" to the extent that it includes a convenient and prominently visible feature that (1) displays an appropriate copyright notice, and (2) tells the user that there is no warranty for the work (except to the extent that warranties are provided), that licensees may convey the work under this License, and how to view a copy of this License. If the interface presents a list of user commands or options, such as a menu, a prominent item in the list meets this criterion."
msgstr "互動式使用者介面會顯示「適當的法律聲明」，其程度指介面中必須包含一個方便且顯眼可見的功能，能 (1) 顯示適當的著作權聲明，以及 (2) 告知使用者本作品沒有保固（提供了保固的範圍除外）、被授權人可以依本授權條款散布本作品，以及如何查看本授權條款的副本。若介面列出使用者指令或選項（例如選單），列表中一項顯目的項目即符合此要求。"

msgid "An open game is one that starts with all cards visible."
msgstr "開放式遊戲指開局時所有牌都可見。"

msgid "An open variant of"
msgstr "開放式變體玩法，改編自"

msgid "An untested macOS package (we need testers)"
msgstr "未經測試的 macOS 套件（我們需要測試人員）"

msgid "And finally always remember that this is a"
msgstr "最後，永遠記得這是一個"

msgid "And more."
msgstr "以及更多。"

msgid "Andreas Sauer"
msgstr "Andreas Sauer"

msgid "Android"
msgstr "Android"

msgid "Andy Markebo &lt;flognat@fukt.hk-r.se&gt;"
msgstr "Andy Markebo &lt;flognat@fukt.hk-r.se&gt;"

msgid "Animals = 2"
msgstr "動物 = 2"

msgid "Anime = 3"
msgstr "動漫 = 3"

msgid "Another interpretation of the game involves the Jack being a suitor trying to save the queen of hearts from her father, the evil king. In this variant, the foundation is built separately from the Jack, and the Jack and Queen remain the last two cards at the end of the game."
msgstr "另一種解讀是：J 是一位求婚者，設法把紅心 Q 從她父親——邪惡的 K——手中救出。在這個變體玩法中，王牌區獨立於 J 之外疊放，遊戲最後剩下的兩張牌就是 J 與 Q。"

msgid "Antares is a combination of"
msgstr "Antares 是以下玩法的組合"

msgid "Any card can be moved to an empty tableau pile, but otherwise, no building on the tableau is allowed. The foundation piles are built up from nine to king, then ace, regardless of suit. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "任何牌都可以移到空的牌列堆，但除此之外牌列不允許疊放。王牌區從 9 開始遞增疊放到 K，接著放 A，不分花色。全部牌都移入王牌區就算獲勝。"

msgid "Any card from the tableau can be moved to a single reserve pile. This pile can hold an unlimited number of cards, but only the topmost card in this reserve can be moved, and only to a foundation or an empty tableau pile."
msgstr "牌列的任何一張牌都可以移到單一預備堆。該堆可以容納不限數量的牌，但只有最上面那張能移動，而且只能移到王牌區或空的牌列堆。"

msgid "Any card or sequence can fill empty spaces."
msgstr "任何牌或順子都可以補進空列。"

msgid "Any card or sequence may be played on an empty row. The four reserve stacks hold one card each."
msgstr "任何牌或順子都能放到空的橫排。四個預備堆各放一張牌。"

msgid "Any card or valid sequence can be moved between tableau piles. A sequence can be moved from one set to the other, regardless of whether it matches the rules of the piles it moved to, but in this case, the sequence cannot be moved further. Cards from the reserve can be moved to an appropriate foundation or tableau pile at any time."
msgstr "任何牌或有效的整疊順子都能在牌列堆之間移動。順子可以從一組移到另一組，不論是否符合目的堆的規則；但這種情況下，該順子就不能再往下移動。預備堆的牌隨時都可以移到合適的王牌區或牌列堆。"

msgid "Any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between piles. Piles may be switched with each other in order to get a sequence starting with a 2, 3, or 4 into the correct row. Empty piles are immediately filled from the waste or talon (this is the only way the remaining 2s, 3s, and 4s can be moved into the rows)."
msgstr "任何牌或有效的整疊順子都能在牌堆之間移動。必要時可以互換兩個牌堆，讓以 2、3 或 4 開頭的順子進入正確的橫排。空堆會立即由棄牌堆或牌山補齊（這是剩下的 2、3、4 進入橫排的唯一方法）。"

msgid "Any other card: Place in any empty space."
msgstr "其他任何牌：可放到任何空位。"

msgid "Any single card can be moved onto an exposed king in the tableau, but otherwise, there is no building on the tableau. The game is won if all cards other than the kings are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "任何單張牌都可移到牌列中露出的 K 上，但除此之外牌列不能疊牌。除 K 以外的牌全部移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "AppVeyor"
msgstr "AppVeyor"

msgid "Archway is a variant of"
msgstr "拱門（Archway）是下列玩法的變體："

msgid "Arrange 25 cards into 5 poker \"pat hands\" - straights or better."
msgstr "把 25 張牌排成 5 副撲克「固定牌型」，每副都要是順子或更大。"

msgid "Arrange 49 cards into a seven by seven grid."
msgstr "把 49 張牌排成 7 × 7 的網格。"

msgid "Arrange all cards in four columns with complete sequences built down in alternate color from king to ace."
msgstr "把全部牌排成四欄，每欄都是 K 到 A 完整順子，按紅黑交替遞減疊放。"

msgid "Arrange all cards into four columns with complete sequences from king to ace, built down by alternate color."
msgstr "把全部牌排成四欄，每欄是從 K 到 A 的完整順子，按紅黑交替遞減疊放。"

msgid "Arrange all the cards on the rows."
msgstr "把全部牌排到各橫排上。"

msgid "Arrange the 10 Cribbage hands for a total score of 61 points or more."
msgstr "排出 10 副克比（Cribbage）牌組，總分 61 點以上。"

msgid "Arrange the 10 Poker hands for a total score of 100 points or more."
msgstr "排出 10 副撲克牌型，總分 100 點以上。"

msgid "Arrange the 10 Poker hands for a total score of 200 points or more."
msgstr "排出 10 副撲克牌型，總分 200 點以上。"

msgid "Arrange the 10 Poker hands for a total score of 61 points or more."
msgstr "排出 10 副撲克牌型，總分 61 點以上。"

msgid "Arrange the Eight Guardians in order."
msgstr "依順序排好八大護法。"

msgid "Arrange the Flower Cards in suit order."
msgstr "依花色順序排好花牌。"

msgid "Arrange the Ten Avatars in order."
msgstr "依順序排好十化身。"

msgid "Art = 4"
msgstr "美術 = 4"

msgid "As You Like It"
msgstr "如你所願（As You Like It）"

msgid "As a special rule you may place an Ace of any suit to the right of a Queen."
msgstr "依特殊規則，你可把任一花色的 A 放到 Q 的右側。"

msgid "As not all aces are dealt to the foundations, a thirteenth reserve pile on the far left is used for extra aces."
msgstr "由於並非所有 A 都會發到王牌區，最左側另有第十三個預備堆，用來多放 A。"

msgid "As play continues, the cards will slowly move into sequence. The game is won if all the cards can be organized into four same suit columns."
msgstr "隨著出牌進行，牌會逐步排成順子。全部牌能排成四欄同花色即獲勝。"

msgid "As the first card was taken from the center pile, if the four kings are found before the other eleven piles are completed, there will be no more cards to play and the game is lost."
msgstr "因為第一張牌取自中心堆，若在其餘十一堆完成前先找到四張 K，就再也無牌可出，遊戲失敗。"

msgid "As the name implies, the eight playing piles in the tableau all start with eight cards face-up."
msgstr "顧名思義，牌列中八個牌列堆一開始都是八張面朝上。"

msgid "As with Gypsy you are allowed to make heavy use of the Undo key."
msgstr "與吉普賽（Gypsy）一樣，你可以大量使用復原鍵。"

msgid "As you draw cards from the talon, one at a time, declare a card rank in sequence (ace to king, then start over from ace). If the drawn card matches the declared rank, that is a \"Hit\", and the card may be moved to the foundation. Otherwise, it is a \"Miss\". You can continue to redeal as many times as you need, until you go through the entire deck twice in a row without getting a single \"Hit\"."
msgstr "從牌山逐張翻牌時，依順序宣告一個點數（A 到 K，然後再從 A 重來）。翻到的牌與宣告點數相符就是「命中（Hit）」，可移到王牌區；否則就是「落空（Miss）」。你可以無限次循環發牌，直到連續兩輪把整副牌翻完都沒有一次「命中」為止。"

msgid "Astrocyte was invented by Jan Wolter, and first appeared in his app"
msgstr "Astrocyte 由 Jan Wolter 設計，最先出現在他的應用中，"

msgid "At any time, you can deal more cards by clicking on the talon. One card will be added to each of the playing piles."
msgstr "隨時可點擊牌山繼續發牌，每個牌列堆會各加入一張。"

msgid "At game start 12 pairs of cards are dealt to the tableau piles."
msgstr "遊戲開始時發到牌列堆 12 對牌。"

msgid "At game start 15 pairs of cards are dealt to the tableau piles."
msgstr "遊戲開始時發到牌列堆 15 對牌。"

msgid "At game start 16 cards are dealt to the tableau piles and one card is flipped face up to be used as the starter, which for most purposes, is treated as a fifth card for all hands."
msgstr "遊戲開始時發到牌列堆 16 張，另翻開一張作為起始牌；除少數情況外，這張牌視為所有牌組的第五張共用牌。"

msgid "At game start 20 pairs of cards are dealt to the tableau piles."
msgstr "遊戲開始時發到牌列堆 20 對牌。"

msgid "At game start 26 pairs of cards are dealt to the tableau piles."
msgstr "遊戲開始時發到牌列堆 26 對牌。"

msgid "At game start 52 cards are dealt to the tableau piles."
msgstr "遊戲開始時發到牌列堆 52 張。"

msgid "At game start 8 pairs of cards are dealt to the tableau piles."
msgstr "遊戲開始時發到牌列堆 8 對牌。"

msgid "At game start the four Aces are dealt to the foundations."
msgstr "遊戲開始時 4 張 A 發到王牌區。"

msgid "At game start, all the cards of a single suit (spades in PySol) are dealt face-down. Cards can be flipped over one at a time, each card flipped over is worth 10 points, but if the next card is not one rank above the previous card, all are flipped face-down. If a card doesn't match, all of the points from that sequence are lost, and a 2 point penalty is applied."
msgstr "遊戲開始時同一花色（在 PySol 中是黑桃）的牌全部面朝下發出，可逐張翻開，每翻開一張得 10 分；但下一張若不比上一張大一點，就全部翻回面朝下。牌若不符，該段順子已得的分數全部扣回，另扣 2 點。"

msgid "At least one back image, as defined in the config.txt file below."
msgstr "至少要有一張背面圖，定義如下方的 config.txt 檔案。"

msgid "At the end of the game, an additional bonus is given when there are only a few tiles left to place - only the highest of these bonuses is received:"
msgstr "遊戲結束時，若只剩少量牌塊可放，會給予額外加分，以下加分只取最高一項："

msgid "At the start of the game, a card is dealt to each of five reserve piles, and thirteen more cards are dealt to a face-down stack above. Cards from the reserve can be moved to an appropriate tableau or foundation pile, and are immediately replaced from the above stack."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，五個預備堆各一張，上方再面朝下疊十三張。預備堆的牌可移到合適的牌列或王牌區，並立即由上方那疊補牌。"

msgid "At the start of the game, a single queen is dealt to the tableau."
msgstr "遊戲開始時發到牌列一張 Q。"

msgid "At the start of the game, all of the queens from two decks are dealt in a row. Deal cards from the talon, and appropriate cards can be placed on the queens. Cards are placed on Queens in descending order, following suit. Kings are placed on the empty spaces above the queens, and then cards are placed on the Kings in ascending order, starting with Ace, also following suit."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，兩副牌中所有的 Q 排成一直列。從牌山發牌，合適的牌可放到 Q 上。Q 上按花色遞減疊放；K 放到 Q 上方的空位，接著 K 上從 A 開始按花色遞增疊放。"

msgid "At the start of the game, an ace and a king of each suit are dealt to the foundations, and eight piles of four cards are dealt as reserves."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，各花色的 A 和 K 各一張發到王牌區，另發八堆各四張作為預備堆。"

msgid "At the start of the game, an ace and a king of each suit are dealt to the foundations. The remaining aces and kings are dealt out to the bottom of the tableau piles. Sixteen cards are dealt in an additional pile, containing alternating rows of one and two cards, located in the center, between the fourth and fifth piles. The remaining cards are dealt to the tableau, but any card that can be moved to the foundations is moved there immediately after each row is dealt."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，各花色的 A 和 K 各一張發到王牌區，其餘的 A 和 K 發到各牌列堆的最底部。另發十六張排成一堆，該堆一張兩張交錯成排，位於第四與第五堆之間的中央。剩下的牌發到牌列，但每發完一橫排，能移到王牌區的牌會立即移過去。"

msgid "At the start of the game, an ace and king of each suit is dealt to the foundations, and a card is dealt to each of nine reserves. Cards cannot be moved between reserves, but reserve cards can be moved to the foundations. The foundations with the aces are built up by same suit from ace to king, while the foundations with the kings are built down by same suit from king to ace. Empty reserve cards are immediately replaced from the waste pile."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，各花色的 A 和 K 各一張發到王牌區，九個預備堆各一張。預備堆之間不能移牌，但預備堆的牌可移到王牌區。有 A 的王牌區按同花色從 A 遞增疊到 K，有 K 的王牌區按同花色從 K 遞減疊到 A。空的預備堆會立即由棄牌堆補牌。"

msgid "At the start of the game, cards are dealt to ten tableau piles, with the first pile having one card, the second having two, and so on. Tableau piles are built down by alternating colors. Cards can be moved to foundations which are built up by same suit, starting with the aces."
msgstr "遊戲開始時發到十個牌列堆，第一堆一張、第二堆兩張，依此類推。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放。牌可移到王牌區，從 A 開始按同花色遞增疊放。"

msgid "At the start of the game, cards from the reserve piles can be moved to the foundation. At this point, any cards moved to the foundation are replaced from the talon."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，預備堆的牌可移到王牌區。從此時起，移到王牌區的牌改由牌山補入。"

msgid "At the start of the game, eleven cards are dealt into a reserve pile, and four cards are dealt into the first of nine tableau piles. One of these four cards must be played to the foundation. This card serves as the starting rank for building the foundation for the remainder of the game."
msgstr "遊戲開始時發十一張成一預備堆，九個牌列堆的第一堆發四張，其中一張必須移到王牌區。這張決定其餘遊戲期間王牌區的起始點數。"

msgid "At the start of the game, one card is dealt face-down as a reserve pile. This is the last chance card."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，一張牌面朝下作為預備堆，即最後機會牌。"

msgid "At the start of the game, one card is dealt to the foundations. The foundations are built up by suit, starting from the rank of that first dealt card, wrapping from king to ace as necessary. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，一張牌發到王牌區。王牌區按花色從那張牌的點數開始遞增疊放，必要時從 K 繞回 A。全部牌移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "At the start of the game, one card is dealt to the leftmost of thirteen foundations."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，一張牌發到十三個王牌區中最左側的那一列。"

msgid "At the start of the game, one king in each suit is placed in the rightmost of the eight foundations - these foundations are built down by suit while the remaining foundations are built up by suit, starting with an ace."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，每個花色各一張 K 放到八個王牌區中最右側的那些，這些王牌區按花色遞減疊放；其餘的王牌區則按花色從 A 開始遞增疊放。"

msgid "At the start of the game, one king is moved to the leftmost of eight foundations."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，一張 K 移到八個王牌區中最左側的那一列。"

msgid "At the start of the game, one random card of each suit is placed on each of the foundations."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，每個花色各一張隨機牌放到各王牌區上。"

msgid "At the start of the game, seven cards are dealt to seven tableau piles. Cards are dealt from the talon three at a time. For each three cards dealt, the top one must be moved to one of the tableau piles before three more cards can be dealt. Moving the remaining cards is optional."
msgstr "遊戲開始時發七張到七個牌列堆。從牌山每次發三張，每發三張中最上面那張必須先移到某個牌列堆才能再發下三張，其餘兩張是否移動自選。"

msgid "At the start of the game, single cards are dealt to 13 reserve piles, and nine tableau piles directly below the reserve. The tableau piles are called the \"lower step\" while the reserves are called the \"middle step\". A single card is dealt to a foundation pile above - the foundations are called the \"upper step\". This first card determines the base rank of the foundation."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，13 個預備堆各發單張，正下方是九個牌列堆。牌列堆稱為「下階」，預備堆稱為「中階」。上方王牌區各發一張，王牌區稱為「上階」。這第一張牌決定王牌區的基準點數。"

msgid "At the start of the game, the Jack of Spades is placed aside, along with the King of Spades and Queen of Hearts. Eight cards are dealt in a circle around the queen, and a pile of seven cards is dealt face-down below the king."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，黑桃 J 與黑桃 K、紅心 Q 放到一旁。Q 周圍八張發成圓形，K 下方七張面朝下成堆。"

msgid "At the start of the game, the aces and twos are dealt to sixteen foundation piles. Nine cards are dealt to nine tableau piles."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，A 和 2 發到十六個王牌區。九張發到九個牌列堆。"

msgid "At the start of the game, the aces are dealt to eight foundations. Four tableau piles of twelve cards are dealt, with only the top card of each pile visible. The remaining cards are dealt to twelve reserve piles, forming an arch around the tableau, with each pile being dealt the cards of a different rank - twos on the far left, leading up to kings on the far right."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，A 發到八個王牌區。發四堆各十二張，只有每堆最上面那張可見。其餘的牌發到十二個預備堆，圍成拱形環繞牌列，每堆發同一點數的牌，最左側是 2，一路到最右側的 K。"

msgid "At the start of the game, the aces are dealt to the foundations."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，A 發到王牌區。"

msgid "At the start of the game, the queens are dealt to an upper row of foundations, and a single king is dealt to the tableau. No further cards are dealt to the queen foundation."
msgstr "遊戲開始時，Q 發到上方一列王牌區，牌列則發一張 K。Q 的王牌區不再發到牌。"

msgid "Australia = 1021"
msgstr "澳洲 = 1021"

msgid "Austria = 1001"
msgstr "奧地利 = 1001"

msgid "Author's note: These definitions are meant as a guideline only. See individual game rules as any game has the right to redefine or modify the rules to make it fun."
msgstr "作者備註：這些定義僅作參考。請參照各遊戲的規則，任何遊戲都有權重新定義或修改規則，讓玩法更好玩。"

msgid "Auto Drop"
msgstr "自動放置"

msgid "Auto deal"
msgstr "開局自動發牌"

msgid "Auto drop"
msgstr "自動放置"

msgid "Auto drop is disabled for certain games where it is not relevant, or if it would make winning the game too much of a cheat. Using auto drop does not disqualify you from getting a perfect game."
msgstr "在某些不適用、或會讓你太輕鬆獲勝的遊戲裡，自動放置是關閉的。使用自動放置不會讓你的完美牌局失效。"

msgid "Auto drop will automatically move all cards that can be moved to foundations to the foundations. It can also be enabled in the options menu to auto drop all the time without needing to select the option."
msgstr "自動放置會把能移到王牌區的牌全部移到王牌區。也可以在選項選單裡設定一律自動放置，不必每次選擇。"

msgid "Automatic play"
msgstr "自動出牌"

msgid "Autumn Leaves was invented by Toby Ord, and the name comes from how the cards can flutter between the stacks. More details can be found on"
msgstr "秋葉（Autumn Leaves）由 Toby Ord 設計，名稱來自紙牌能在各堆之間飄落的樣子。更多細節可在下列網站找到："

