msgid "Black cards represent monsters. Each monster's strength is based on its rank - Jack is 11, Queen is 12, King is 13, and Ace is 14. You may slay a monster with either your fists, or the played diamond/weapon. If using your fists, discard the monster and reduce your health by its strength. If using a weapon, reduce the damage you take by the strength of the weapon. Then, play the monster next to the weapon. You cannot slay another monster with the same weapon unless its strength is the same or lower."
msgstr "黑色的牌代表怪物。每個怪物的戰力依點數而定：J 是 11、Q 是 12、K 是 13、A 是 14。你可以用拳頭或打出的方塊/武器殺死怪物。用拳頭時，捨棄那張怪物牌，你的生命值扣掉它的戰力。用武器時，受到的傷害扣掉武器的戰力，然後把怪物牌打到武器旁邊。除非強度相同或更低，同一把武器不能殺第二隻怪物。"

msgid "Boomerang is only played with the cards from seven through king of each suit, plus the four aces, from two decks. A card is dealt to each of twelve tableau piles. Cards in the tableau can be built either up or down in suit. However, each pile must follow only one of these rules."
msgstr "回鏢（Boomerang）只用兩副牌中每個花色 7 到 K 的牌，加上四張 A。十二個牌列堆各發一張。牌列中的牌可按花色遞增或遞減疊放，但每堆只能固定採其中一種。"

msgid "Boomerang was invented by Albert Morehead and Geoffrey Mott-Smith."
msgstr "回鏢（Boomerang）由 Albert Morehead 與 Geoffrey Mott-Smith 設計。"

msgid "Both queens of clubs, diamonds and spades, plus one queen of hearts, are dealt in an inverted U pattern in the center of the play area. A king of hearts is dealt in the center of the queens. These form the foundations. Then, a card is dealt to each of ten tableau piles, five to the left of the foundations and five to the right."
msgstr "梅花、方塊、黑桃的 Q 各兩張，加上紅心的 Q 一張，在出牌區中央排成反 U 形，中央再放一張紅心 K，這些構成王牌區。然後十個牌列堆各發一張，王牌區左右各五堆。"

msgid "Bottom - Ace of Clubs"
msgstr "底部 - 梅花 A"

msgid "Bottom images. A number of images for the bottoms of stacks. These are not used unless your PySol install does not support generating stack bottoms, or you enable them manually (currently only possible through editing the options.cfg file). Which bottoms are used depend on the cardset type. Each bottom has a version with a suffix of -n, indicating the negative bottom that gets used if the appropriate option is enabled."
msgstr "底部圖像。一堆供牌堆底部使用的圖片。只有你的 PySol 安裝不支援產生牌堆底部，或你手動啟用時才會用到（目前只能透過編輯 options.cfg 檔案）。實際使用哪些底部圖要看卡牌套裝的類型。每張底部圖都有一個加 -n 後綴的版本，代表負片底部，啟用對應選項時會改用那個版本。"

msgid "Braid (Der Zopf)"
msgstr "辮子（Braid，Der Zopf）"

msgid "Braid type. 2 decks. Two redeals."
msgstr "辮子（Braid）遊戲類型。2 副牌。兩次循環發牌。"

msgid "Braid type. 4 decks. Two redeals."
msgstr "辮子（Braid）遊戲類型。4 副牌。兩次循環發牌。"

msgid "Brazilian Patience"
msgstr "巴西接龍（Brazilian Patience）"

msgid "Brian Lenihan"
msgstr "Brian Lenihan"

msgid "Bridget's Game Doubled"
msgstr "布麗吉特遊戲加倍版（Bridget's Game Doubled）"

msgid "British Square"
msgstr "英式方陣（British Square）"

msgid "Broken Intervals"
msgstr "斷裂間隔（Broken Intervals）"

msgid "Bugfixes, cleanup, and other enhancements."
msgstr "錯誤修復、清理與其它增強。"

msgid "Bugfixes, cleanup, enhancements, etc."
msgstr "錯誤修復、清理、增強等。"

msgid "Bugfixes, code cleanup, etc."
msgstr "錯誤修復、程式碼清理等。"

msgid "Bugfixes."
msgstr "錯誤修復。"

msgid "Build a pile containing all 9 cards down by sequence."
msgstr "建出一堆含全部 9 張的牌，按順子遞減。"

msgid "Build a pile containing all 9 cards."
msgstr "建出一堆含全部 9 張的牌。"

msgid "Build complete suits in descending rank order on the tableau then move them to the single foundation in ascending rank and suit order. Refer to the general"
msgstr "先在牌列把整個花色按點數遞減建好，再按點數與花色遞增的順序移到單一的王牌區。請參照通用"

msgid "Build evenly on to foundations. Try to get an empty pile."
msgstr "平均地在王牌區建牌，設法弄出一個空列。"

msgid "Build on the waste stack in sequence either up or down regardless of suit."
msgstr "在棄牌堆上按順子疊放，不分花色，遞增或遞減皆可。"

msgid "Build sequences on the rows that will play when the correct card turns over from the talon. Don't fill the Wizard stacks until you need to."
msgstr "在橫排上建順子，等牌山翻出對的牌時就能出牌。別太早把施法者堆填滿。"

msgid "Build sequences on the tableau."
msgstr "在牌列上建順子。"

msgid "Build sequences on the tableau. Since the trash cards are interchangeable it's possible to build a valid sequence that has more than four cards in a two deck game."
msgstr "在牌列上建順子。因為垃圾牌可以互換，兩副牌的玩法裡有可能建出超過四張的有效順子。"

msgid "Build so that cards can only be played on other cards of the same rank, regardless of suit."
msgstr "疊牌時只能放到點數相同的牌上，不計花色。"

msgid "Build the foundation stacks up by suit, starting with a king, then the ace, and the remaining cards in sequence up to the queen. There are seven cards above the first seven foundations - these cards are locked, and may be flipped face-up and used only once the foundation below them has been filled. Once placed in a foundation, cards cannot be moved."
msgstr "王牌區按花色遞增疊放，先放 K，接著放 A，再按順子一路疊到 Q。前七個王牌區上方各壓著七張牌，這些牌是鎖住的，只有下方王牌區放滿後才能翻開使用。牌一旦放到王牌區就不能再移走。"

msgid "Build the tableau piles down by same suit. Any group of cards can be moved, regardless of sequence. Only a king or a group of cards starting with a king can be moved to an empty pile. When there are no moves left, you can deal a card from the talon to each pile."
msgstr "牌列堆按同花色遞減疊放。任何一組牌都可整體移動，不計順子。只有 K，或以 K 開頭的一組牌，才能移到空列。無牌可動時，可從牌山每張牌列堆各發一張。"

msgid "Build the tableau stacks down by the same suit, turning the corner as needed (aces can be played on kings and vice versa). Any card can be placed in an empty tableau stack."
msgstr "牌列按同花色遞減疊放，必要時可轉角（A 可放在 K 上，反之亦然）。空的牌列可放任何單張牌。"

msgid "Build up the foundations by alternating colors, starting with the first chosen rank, turning the corner from king to ace as necessary. The top card of the reserve may be played to an appropriate foundation pile, but not the tableau."
msgstr "王牌區按紅黑交替，從自選的起始點數開始遞增疊放，必要時從 K 繞回 A。預備堆最上面的牌可移到合適的王牌區，但不能移到牌列。"

msgid "Building by placing a card of a higher rank on to a card of a lower rank by * is permitted. Example: If * is 2, placing a 10 on an 8 is good, but placing a 10 on a 9 is not."
msgstr "允許按 * 把點數較高的牌放到點數較低的牌上。例：* 為 2 時，把 10 放在 8 上可以，放在 9 上不行。"

msgid "Building by placing a card of a higher rank on to a card of a lower rank is permitted. Usually implies a difference of only one ranking between the two cards. Example: Placing a Queen on a Jack is good, but placing a Queen on a King is not."
msgstr "允許把點數較高的牌放到點數較低的牌上，通常指兩張牌點數只差一點。例：把 Q 放在 J 上可以，放在 K 上不行。"

msgid "Building by placing a card of a lower rank on to a card of a higher rank by * is permitted. Example: If * is 2, placing a 10 on a Queen is good, but placing a 10 on a Jack is not."
msgstr "允許按 * 把點數較低的牌放到點數較高的牌上。例：* 為 2 時，把 10 放在 Q 上可以，放在 J 上不行。"

msgid "Building by placing a card of a lower rank on to a card of a higher rank is permitted. Usually implies a difference of only one ranking between the two cards. Example: Placing a 10 on a Jack is good, but placing a 10 on a 9 is not."
msgstr "允許把點數較低的牌放到點數較高的牌上，通常指兩張牌點數只差一點。例：把 10 放在 J 上可以，放在 9 上不行。"

msgid "Building by placing a card on to a card of one higher or one lower rank is permitted. Example: Placing a Jack on a Queen or a 10 is good, but placing a 10 on a Queen is not."
msgstr "允許把牌放到點數高一點或低一點的牌上。例：J 放在 Q 或 10 上可以，但 10 放在 Q 上不行。"

msgid "Building by placing a card on to another card of any suit but the suit of the original card is permitted. Example: Placing a Diamond on a Heart is good, but placing a Heart on a Heart is not."
msgstr "允許把牌放到其他花色的牌上（不得與原牌同花色）。例：方塊放在紅心上可以，但紅心放在紅心上不行。"

msgid "Building by placing a card on to another card of the opposite color is permitted. Example: Placing a Diamond on a Spade is good, but placing a Diamond on a Heart is not."
msgstr "允許把牌放到相反顏色的牌上。例：方塊放在黑桃上可以，但方塊放在紅心上不行。"

msgid "Building by placing a card on to another card of the same color is permitted. Example: Placing a Diamond on a Heart is good, but Placing a Diamond on a Club is not."
msgstr "允許把牌放到相同顏色的牌上。例：方塊放在紅心上可以，但方塊放在梅花上不行。"

msgid "Building by placing a card on to another card of the same suit is permitted. Example: Placing a Spade on a Spade is good, but placing a Spade on a Club is not."
msgstr "允許把牌放到相同花色的牌上。例：黑桃放在黑桃上可以，但黑桃放在梅花上不行。"

msgid "Building is not allowed on those four cards, though they can be moved to the foundations at the end of the game."
msgstr "那四張牌上不允許疊牌，但遊戲結束時可以把它們移到王牌區。"

msgid "Building on the tableau is not allowed, cards can only be moved to the foundations. If there are no moves left, you can deal one card to each of the twelve piles. If the talon is empty, you can pick up the tableau piles to make a new talon, and redeal. Two redeals are allowed."
msgstr "牌列上不允許疊牌，牌只能移到王牌區。無牌可動時，可給十二堆各發一張。牌山空了，可收起牌列堆組成新牌山重新發牌。允許兩次循環發牌。"

msgid "Building on the tableau is otherwise not allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "除此之外，牌列上不允許疊牌。全部牌移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Bush Clover - July"
msgstr "胡枝子 - 七月"

msgid "CC0/Public Domain/MIT License/GPL terms"
msgstr "CC0／公有領域／MIT 授權／GPL 條款"

msgid "COPYRIGHT"
msgstr "著作權"

msgid "Calculation type"
msgstr "計算型（Calculation）"

msgid "Canada = 1010"
msgstr "加拿大 = 1010"

msgid "Canfield is played with one deck. The object is to build all four of the foundations at the top right from the rank of the first card dealt into there (varies from game to game), all in the same suit."
msgstr "康菲尔德（Canfield）用一副牌玩。目標是把右上角四個王牌區全部建成，各從發到該區第一張牌的點數開始（每局不同）並採同花色疊放到底。"

msgid "Canfield type"
msgstr "康菲尔德（Canfield）遊戲類型"

msgid "Canfield type. 2 decks. 1 redeal."
msgstr "康菲尔德（Canfield）遊戲類型。2 副牌。1 次循環發牌。"

msgid "Canfield type. 2 decks. 2 redeals."
msgstr "康菲尔德（Canfield）遊戲類型。2 副牌。2 次循環發牌。"

msgid "Canfield type. 2 decks. No redeal."
msgstr "康菲尔德（Canfield）遊戲類型。2 副牌。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Canfield type. 3 decks. Unlimited redeals."
msgstr "康菲尔德（Canfield）遊戲類型。3 副牌。無限循環發牌。"

msgid "Canfield type. 4 decks. Unlimited redeals."
msgstr "康菲尔德（Canfield）遊戲類型。4 副牌。無限循環發牌。"

msgid "Capricious"
msgstr "反覆無常（Capricious）"

msgid "Capuchin"
msgstr "嘉布遣（Capuchin）"

msgid "Card shadow"
msgstr "卡牌陰影"

msgid "Cards (other than diamonds) can be built down in sequence regardless of suit. Builds of cards can be moved as a unit. Empty slots can be filled by any card (except for diamonds) or build of cards."
msgstr "方塊以外的牌可按順子遞減疊放，不計花色。疊好的牌可整體移動。空格可由任何牌（方塊除外）或牌組填滿。"

msgid "Cards are built down, regardless of suit. A space can be filled by any card or legal group of cards."
msgstr "牌按遞減疊放，不計花色。空列可由任何牌或合法牌組填滿。"

msgid "Cards are dealt face-up in seven piles of ascending length. An additional card is dealt to a foundation. This card determines the base rank of the foundations."
msgstr "牌面朝上發到七堆，一堆比一堆長。另發一張牌到王牌區，那張牌決定王牌區的基準點數。"

msgid "Cards are dealt face-up in seven piles of ascending length. Seven cards are set aside to be reserve piles and one card is dealt to a foundation. This card determines the base rank of the foundations."
msgstr "牌面朝上發到七堆，一堆比一堆長。另留七張作預備堆，並發一張牌到王牌區，那張牌決定王牌區的基準點數。"

msgid "Cards are dealt four at a time, one card into each of four piles. A card can be moved onto the end of another pile, if it is the same suit and follows in sequence. The rest of the pile moves with the card. Only an Ace (with the rest of its pile) can move to an empty space."
msgstr "每次發四張，四堆各一張。牌若同花色且接得上順子，可移到另一堆的末端，該堆其餘的牌會跟著一起移動。只有 A（連同它那一堆）可移到空列。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the Stock to the Reserve. Each deal places one card on each pile of the Reserve."
msgstr "牌從牌山發到預備堆，每輪發牌就是預備堆每堆各一張。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the deck one at a time, and can be moved to one of three rows of foundations. The top row of foundations is built down by same suit from five to ace, with the kings then played on the aces. The bottom row of foundations is built up by same suit from six to jack. The middle row of foundations just contains the queen of each suit."
msgstr "牌從副牌逐張發出，可移到三橫排王牌區之壹。上方橫排按同花色從 5 遞減疊到 A，然後把 K 放在 A 上。下方橫排按同花色從 6 遞增至 J。中間橫排只放各花色的 Q。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock 13 at a time. These cards can be moved to one of five tableau stacks. Tableau piles can be built up regardless of suit or rank, but cards on the tableau can only be moved to foundations."
msgstr "牌從牌山每次發十三張，可移到五個牌列堆之一。牌列堆不分花色與點數任意往上疊，但牌列上的牌只能移到王牌區。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock in a sequence. Any sequence of two or more consecutive cards with a total rank of 10, 20, or 30 may be removed. Face cards are valued at 10. The game is won if all cards are removed."
msgstr "牌從牌山依序發出。點數合計為 10、20 或 30 的兩張以上連續牌可移除。人頭牌計 10 點。全部移除即獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock in a sequence. Any sequence of two to four cards with a total rank of 7, or any multiple of seven, may be removed. Sevens can be removed singly. Jacks are valued at 11, Queens at 12, and Kings at 13. The game is won if all cards are removed."
msgstr "牌從牌山依序發出。點數合計為 7 或 7 的倍數的兩到四張牌可移除，7 可單獨移除。J 計 11 點、Q 計 12 點、K 計 13 點。全部移除即獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock in a sequence. If there are one or two cards between two cards of the same rank or suit, those cards may be removed."
msgstr "牌從牌山依序發出。點數相同或花色相同的兩張牌之間只有一到兩張牌時，那些中間牌可移除。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock in a sequence. If two cards of the same suit or rank are next to each other, or separated by exactly two cards, the card that is further to the left (in PySol, this is the card that is further from the deck) may be moved on top of the other."
msgstr "牌從牌山依序發出。花色或點數相同的兩張牌相鄰、或恰好隔著兩張牌時，較靠左的那張（在 PySol 中就是離副牌較遠的那張）可移到另一張上面。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock in threes. Cards from the waste pile can be moved to the foundation, building up or down by rank, of the same colors."
msgstr "牌從牌山每次發三張。棄牌堆的牌可移到王牌區，按點數、同色遞增或遞減疊放。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock one at a time and are immediately moved to the tableau or foundation piles. Cards cannot be moved between tableau piles, and empty piles are filled from the stock immediately."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，立即移到牌列或王牌區。牌列堆之間不可移牌，空堆立即由牌山補牌。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock one at a time and can be moved to the tableau or foundation piles. Though each tableau pile can only have a max of two cards. Cards cannot be moved between tableau piles, and empty piles are filled from the stock immediately. A single redeal is allowed."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到牌列或王牌區，但每個牌列堆最多放兩張。牌列堆之間不可移牌，空堆立即由牌山補牌。允許一次循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock one at a time and can be moved to the tableau or foundations. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到牌列或王牌區。不允許循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock one at a time and can be moved to the tableau or foundations. No redeal is allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到牌列或王牌區。不允許循環發牌。全部移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock one at a time and can be moved to the tableau or foundations. You can only flip the deck and go through the deck once."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到牌列或王牌區。整副牌只能翻一次、過一輪。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock one at a time to the waste pile. Cards from the reserves can be moved to the waste pile, which is built up or down by same suit. Cards from the reserve and waste pile can also be moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發到棄牌堆。預備堆的牌可移到棄牌堆，棄牌堆按同花色遞增或遞減疊放。預備堆與棄牌堆的牌也可移到王牌區。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock one at a time, and can be moved to appropriate tableau piles. No redeal is allowed. The game is won if you manage to get all the cards to the tableau, forming eight piles of thirteen cards."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到合適的牌列堆。不允許循環發牌。設法讓全部牌進入牌列，形成八堆各十三張，即為獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock one at a time, and can be moved to foundations or exposed tableau piles. You can go through the deck as many times as needed."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到王牌區，或牌列最上面可見的牌上。牌山可循環使用任意多次。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock one at a time, and can be moved to one of nine tableau piles, which are built down by rank, regardless of suit, with only the top card visible. Though single cards can be moved between tableau piles, empty piles can only be filled from the waste pile. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到九個牌列堆之一。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞減疊放，只有最上面那張可見。單張可在牌列堆間移動，但空堆只能由棄牌堆填滿。不允許循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock one at a time, and waste cards can be moved to one of four tableau stacks. The tableau stacks are built up or down by rank, regardless of suit. Cards may only be moved one at a time. There is no redeal."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出到棄牌堆，棄牌堆的牌可移到四個牌列堆之一。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞增或遞減疊放，一次只能移一張，無循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock three at a time, and can be moved to foundations or exposed tableau piles. You can go through the deck as many times as needed."
msgstr "牌從牌山每次發三張，可移到王牌區，或牌列最上面可見的牌上。牌山可循環使用任意多次。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the stock three at a time. These cards may be moved to the foundations as appropriate, or to one of seven tableau piles. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color. Sequences of cards may be moved between tableau piles."
msgstr "牌從牌山每次發三張。這些牌可視情況移到王牌區，或七個牌列堆之一。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，接成順子的牌可在牌列堆間移動。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time and can be moved to an appropriate foundation. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到合適的王牌區。全部牌移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time and can be moved to foundation or tableau piles. When the talon is empty, it can be flipped for a second deal. During this second round, eight cards are dealt from the talon to eight waste piles, and a new card is dealt to fill empty piles from these waste piles."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到王牌區或牌列堆。牌山空了可翻過來再發一輪。第二輪期間，從牌山發八張到八個棄牌堆，空堆再從這些棄牌堆補牌。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be dealt to one of four tableau piles in the corners of the play area, or an appropriate foundation. Cards moved to the tableau piles can only be moved to the foundations. If the talon is empty, these four piles can be combined to make a new talon. This can only be done once."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可發到出牌區四角的四個牌列堆之一，或合適的王牌區。進入牌列堆的牌只能移到王牌區。牌山空了，這四堆可合成新牌山，但僅限一次。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to an appropriate foundation. Two redeals are allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到合適的王牌區。允許兩次循環發牌。全部移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to appropriate foundations. You can redeal once, so you are allowed to go through the deck twice at most. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundation."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到各個王牌區。牌山可循環一次，也就是整副最多過兩輪。全部移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to foundations, or one of four free cells. There are four foundations, built up from seven to king by rank, regardless of suit, located in the corners, and a fifth foundation, built down from six to ace by rank, regardless of suit, then wrapping from ace to six, with the sequence ultimately being built four times in a row."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到王牌區或四個自由格之一。四角有四個王牌區，不分花色按點數從 7 遞增至 K；另有第五個王牌區，不分花色按點數從 6 遞減到 A，再從 A 繞回 6，整段順子最終要連續建成四遍。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to one of three foundations. Any card can be used to start the foundations, and they are then built up by same suit or rank. No redeal is allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到三個王牌區之一。王牌區可用任意牌起疊，之後按同花色或同點數遞增疊放。不允許循環發牌。全部移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to the foundation, tableau, or one of three reserve piles. The card on the top of each reserve pile can be moved to an appropriate tableau or foundation, but cards can only be moved to these reserves from the talon directly."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到王牌區、牌列或三個預備堆之一。每個預備堆最上面的牌可移到合適的牌列或王牌區，但只能從牌山直接發到這些預備堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to the foundations, or one of two tableau piles. Building on these tableau piles is not allowed, and the top card of either can be moved to an appropriate foundation. No redeal is allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到王牌區或兩個牌列堆之一。這些牌列堆不允許疊牌，任一堆最上面的牌可移到合適的王牌區。不允許循環發牌。全部移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to the foundations. Two redeals are allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundation on the right."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到王牌區。允許兩次循環發牌。全部牌移到右邊那個王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to the tableau or foundation. Two redeals are allowed."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到牌列或王牌區。允許兩次循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to the tableau or foundations. No redeal is allowed. The red foundations are built up by same suit, while the black foundations are built down by same suit. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到牌列或王牌區。不允許循環發牌。紅色王牌區按同花色遞增疊放，黑色王牌區按同花色遞減疊放。全部移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to the tableau or foundations. You have two redeals, so you can go through the deck three times."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到牌列或王牌區。牌山可循環兩次，也就是整副可過三輪。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to the tableau. Two redeals are allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the tableau in eight sequences of the same suit, from ace to king."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到牌列。允許兩次循環發牌。全部牌以八段同花色從 A 到 K 的順子進入牌列就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be played to the foundations."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張出牌，可移到王牌區。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon three at a time, and can be moved to foundations. Unlimited redeals are allowed. There are eight foundations, four built up by suit from ace to king, and four built down by suit from king to ace. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations - it doesn't matter how many cards are in each foundation."
msgstr "牌從牌山每次發三張到王牌區，可無限循環發牌。八個王牌區裡，四個按花色從 A 遞增至 K，另外四個按花色從 K 遞減到 A。全部移到王牌區就獲勝，每堆各放幾張不拘。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon three at a time, one to each of three waste piles. These cards can be moved to the tableau or foundations. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "牌從牌山每次發三張，三個棄牌堆各一張。這些牌可移到牌列或王牌區。不允許循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon three at a time. These cards can be moved to the monsters on the tableau, or moved to a single reserve pile. The top card of this reserve pile can also be moved to the tableau. Once all three cards have been moved to either the tableau or the reserve, three additional cards are dealt."
msgstr "牌從牌山每次發三張，可移到牌列上的怪物，或移到單一的預備堆。這個預備堆最上面的牌也可移到牌列。三張都移到牌列或預備堆之後，再發三張。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon to a tableau pile one at a time. While dealing to the tableau, any exposed cards can be moved to the foundations. One set of foundations is built up from sixes to jacks, and the other set is built down from five to ace, with the kings then played on the aces. All foundations are built by rank, regardless of suit."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發到牌列堆。發到牌列期間，最上面可見的牌都可移到王牌區。一組王牌區按點數從 6 疊到 J，另一組從 5 遞減疊到 A，然後把 K 放在 A 上。全部王牌區不分花色，按點數疊放。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon to a tableau pile one at a time. While dealing to the tableau, any exposed cards can be moved to the lower foundations, which are built up by rank from ace to jack, regardless of suit, if a king is beneath them."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發到牌列堆。發到牌列期間，只要下方壓著 K，最上面可見的牌都可移到下方的王牌區，按點數從 A 遞增至 J，不計花色。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon to the foundation five at a time. When there are only two cards left in the talon, they are placed in two reserve piles."
msgstr "牌從牌山每次發五張到王牌區。牌山只剩兩張時，分别放到兩個預備堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon to the tableau four at a time. The tableau piles build by"
msgstr "牌從牌山每次發四張到牌列，牌列堆按"

msgid "Cards are dealt from the talon to the waste, two at a time. The topmost card from the waste can be moved to a foundation or tableau pile. No further cards can be dealt from the talon until both of the previous cards have been played."
msgstr "牌從牌山每次發兩張到棄牌堆。棄牌堆最上面那張可移到王牌區或牌列堆。前一輪的兩張都出完之後才能再發牌。"

msgid "Cards are dealt in a four by four grid. Pairs of cards of the same rank, except picture cards, can be removed. Picture cards can be moved to the edges of the tableau - jacks to the corners, kings to the top and bottom, and queens to the sides."
msgstr "牌發到 4 × 4 的網格。點數相同的成對牌可移除，人頭牌除外。人頭牌可移到牌列邊緣：J 放四角，K 放上、下兩側，Q 放左右兩側。"

msgid "Cards are dealt in eight columns of six cards, with no two cards of the same rank allowed in each column. The remaining four cards are placed aside as reserve."
msgstr "牌發到八個欄位、每欄六張，每欄不允許出現兩張同點數。剩餘四張放在一旁作預備。"

msgid "Cards are dealt in piles of two to three. Cards may be removed from the tableau in sequences of three consecutive ranks. Turning the corner is allowed, so ace can follow king and vice versa."
msgstr "牌按兩張或三張成堆發出。牌列中可移除點數連續三張的順子。允許轉角，即 A 可接在 K 之後，反之亦然。"

msgid "Cards are dealt in seven tableau piles, each with a different number of cards, from one to seven, all face-up."
msgstr "牌發到七個牌列堆，每堆張數從一到七各不相同，全部面朝上。"

msgid "Cards are dealt in ten columns of five cards, plus one column of two."
msgstr "牌發到十個欄位，每欄五張，另加一欄兩張。"

msgid "Cards are dealt in twelve piles of four cards, and the aces are dealt to four foundation piles. Tableau piles are built up or down by the same suit. Cards can be moved between tableau piles one at a time. Empty tableau piles can't be filled."
msgstr "牌發到十二個四張的堆，A 發到四個王牌區。牌列堆按同花色遞增或遞減疊放。牌列堆之間一次只能移一張，空牌列堆不能填滿。"

msgid "Cards are dealt into 13 tableau piles, 10 of 4 and 3 of 3. The last three cards are dealt to reserves, and can be freely moved to the tableau or foundations. Tableau piles are built down by alternating colors. Empty tableau piles can only be filled by kings."
msgstr "牌發到 13 個牌列堆，10 個四張、3 個三張。最後三張發到預備堆，可自由移到牌列或王牌區。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，空牌列堆只能由 K 填滿。"

msgid "Cards are dealt into 16 piles of three cards. Tableau piles are built down by same suit, only one card can be moved at a time. Empty piles can be filled by kings."
msgstr "牌發到 16 個三張的堆。牌列堆按同花色遞減疊放，一次只能移一張，空堆可由 K 填滿。"

msgid "Cards are dealt into 17 piles of three cards each, with only the top card of each pile face-up. The final card is dealt to a single reserve pile."
msgstr "牌發到 17 個三張的堆，每堆只有最上面那張面朝上。最後一張發到單一的預備堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt into 18 piles of three (with the last pile only having one card). During the initial deal, aces are skipped and sent directly to the foundation."
msgstr "牌發到 18 個堆，每堆三張，最後一堆只有一張。初始發牌時跳過 A，直接送到王牌區。"

msgid "Cards are dealt into eight columns of six cards, and the remaining four cards are dealt to the foundations. Building on the tableau is not allowed. Cards in the tableau may be moved to an appropriate foundation at any time. The game is won when all cards have been moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌發到八個欄位、每欄六張，其餘四張發到王牌區。牌列上不允許疊牌，隨時可把牌列中的牌移到合適的王牌區。全部移過去就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt into nine tableau piles, eight cards in the outermost four, four cards in the next two, two cards in the next two, and the middle pile is empty. The remaining eight cards are dealt to a reserve."
msgstr "牌發到九個牌列堆：最外四堆各八張，接著兩堆各四張，再兩堆各兩張，中間那堆留空。剩餘八張發到預備堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt into ten tableau piles, most with five cards, but the outermost piles have four. Four cards of the same rank are dealt to the foundations."
msgstr "牌發到十個牌列堆，多數五張，最外兩堆四張。四張同點數的牌發到王牌區。"

msgid "Cards are dealt into thirteen piles of four cards. Exposed cards of the same rank in the tableau can be removed."
msgstr "牌發到十三個四張的堆。牌列中最上面可見、點數相同的牌可移除。"

msgid "Cards are dealt one at a time from the stock, and are moved to one of five tableau stacks, or the foundations. These stacks can be built regardless of suit or rank, but once a card is in the stacks, it can only be moved to the foundations. Cards in the reserve can only be moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到五個牌列堆之一或王牌區。這些堆不分花色與點數任意疊放，但牌一旦進入，就只能移到王牌區。預備堆的牌也只能移到王牌區。"

msgid "Cards are dealt one at a time from the stock, and can be moved to the bottommost tableau row only. Empty spaces in the bottom row of the tableau are immediately filled from the waste pile. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，只能移到牌列最下面那橫排。該橫排空出的位置立即由棄牌堆補滿。不允許循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards are dealt one at a time from the talon and can be moved to an appropriate tableau pile or foundation. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，可移到合適的牌列堆或王牌區。不允許循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards are dealt one at a time from the talon. Cards in the talon can be moved to free cells or foundations. After the initial cards are moved, only cards of the same suit as the adjacent foundation can be moved back to those cells. Only one redeal is allowed."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張發出，牌山裡的牌可移到自由格或王牌區。初始那批移完後，只有與相鄰王牌區同花色的牌才能移回那些格子。只允許一次循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards are dealt three at a time from the talon to three tableau piles. Any clubs can be moved to the foundation. When a card is moved to the foundation, another card is dealt from the talon to replace it."
msgstr "牌從牌山每次發三張到三個牌列堆。任意梅花可移到王牌區，有牌移入王牌區時就從牌山再補一張。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to 10 piles of four cards each. Tableau piled are built down, regardless of suit. However, only sequences that are all of the same suit can be moved as a sequence. A space can be filled by any card or legal group of cards."
msgstr "牌發到 10 個四張的堆。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞減疊放，但只有全同花色的順子才能整段移動。空列可由任何牌或合法牌組填滿。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to 14 piles. The piles are organized Ace through five, six through ten, and then the three face cards, followed by the Talon. [Yes, cards are dealt to the talon!] The rules for this deal are as follows:"
msgstr "牌發到 14 個堆，依 A 到 5、6 到 10、三張人頭牌的順序排列，接著是牌山。[是的，牌也會發到牌山！] 這種排列的發牌規則是："

msgid "Cards are dealt to 18 piles - 17 with three cards and the last one with one."
msgstr "牌發到 18 個堆：17 個三張，最後一堆一張。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to 25 piles of four cards each. Tableau piles are built up or down by same suit, and only single cards can be moved between tableau piles. Empty piles are immediately filled with one of the four remaining cards from the talon, and can be filled with any single card once the talon is empty."
msgstr "牌發到 25 個四張的堆。牌列堆按同花色遞增或遞減疊放，堆間只能移單張。空堆立即由牌山剩餘的四張補牌，牌山空了之後任何單張都能填空堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to 26 piles of four cards each. No building on the tableau is allowed. Cards in the tableau can only be moved to foundations or one of eight free cells. Four foundations are built up by same suit from ace to king, while the other four are built down by same suit from king to ace, with one foundation of each type for each suit. Single cards can be moved to each of the free cells, and can only be moved to a foundation from there."
msgstr "牌發到 26 個四張的堆。牌列上不允許疊牌，牌列中的牌只能移到王牌區或八個自由格之一。四個王牌區按同花色從 A 遞增至 K，另外四個按同花色從 K 遞減到 A，每種花色各有一增一減兩堆。自由格每次只放單張，且只能從那裡移到王牌區。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to a square of four rows of four cards each. You can remove pairs of cards of the same suit that are in the same row or column, and do not contain aces. Empty spaces are immediately filled from the talon, and can no longer be filled when they're empty."
msgstr "牌發到四行四列的正方形。同行或同列中花色相同、且不含 A 的成對牌可移除。空位立即由牌山補滿，牌山沒了就不再填。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to eight piles of eight cards each, with only the top cards face-up. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit, and any valid sequence of cards can be moved to an appropriate tableau pile."
msgstr "牌發到八個八張的堆，只有最上面那張面朝上。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞減疊放，任何合法順子可移到合適的牌列堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to eight piles of five cards each. The left four tableau piles are built down by alternate color, while the right four tableau piles are built up by alternate color."
msgstr "牌發到八個五張的堆。左邊四個牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，右邊四個按紅黑交替遞增疊放。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to eight piles of four cards each. An additional sixteen cards are dealt in an additional pile, containing alternating rows of one and two cards, located in the center, between the fourth and fifth piles."
msgstr "牌發到八個四張的堆，另加十六張排成一堆，該堆一張兩張交錯成排，位於第四與第五堆之間的中央。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to eight piles of four cards each. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit, turning the corner from ace to king as necessary. Any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles. If a tableau pile is empty, a single card is dealt from the talon to that pile. If the talon is empty, any card or sequence can be moved to fill empty piles."
msgstr "牌發到八個四張的堆。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞減疊放，必要時從 A 繞回 K。任何單張或合法順子可在牌列堆間移動。牌列堆空時，從牌山發到該堆一張；牌山空了，任何單張或順子都能填空堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to eight piles of four cards each. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit. Any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved. Any card or sequence can fill an empty space. If there are no moves left, you can deal one card from the talon to each tableau pile."
msgstr "牌發到八個四張的堆。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞減疊放。任何單張或合法順子都可移動，任何單張或順子都能填空位。無牌可動時，可從牌山逐張發到每個牌列堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to eight piles of six cards. The four aces are dealt to the foundations. No building on the tableau is allowed, cards can only be moved to the foundations or a single reserve stack. The top card of the reserve can be moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌發到八個六張的堆，四張 A 發到王牌區。牌列上不允許疊牌，牌只能移到王牌區或單一的預備堆。預備堆最上面的牌可移到王牌區。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to eight piles of three cards each, with the middle card of each pile dealt face-down. Tableau piles are built down by color, and face-up cards can be moved regardless of sequence, though a face-down card or a card with a face-down card on top of it cannot be moved. Any card or sequence can be moved to an empty pile."
msgstr "牌發到八個三張的堆，每堆中間那張面朝下。牌列堆按顏色遞減疊放，面朝上的牌不顧順子也能移動，但面朝下的牌、或壓著面朝下牌的那張不能移動。任何單張或順子都可移到空堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to eight piles of three cards, and the aces are dealt to the foundations. Tableau piles are built down by alternate colors, and only single cards can be moved between tableau piles."
msgstr "牌發到八個三張的堆，A 發到王牌區。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，堆間只能移單張。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to eight tableau piles - four with six cards and four with seven. Tableau piles are built up or down by alternate color and only single cards can be moved between tableau piles. Empty tableau piles can't be filled."
msgstr "牌發到八個牌列堆，四堆六張、四堆七張。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞增或遞減疊放，堆間只能移單張，空牌列堆不能填滿。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to eight tableau piles of five cards each. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit. Only single cards can be moved between tableau piles, and only queens can fill empty piles."
msgstr "牌發到八個牌列堆，每堆五張。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞減疊放，堆間只能移單張，且只有 Q 能填空堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to eight tableau piles of thirteen cards each. The tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles. Empty tableau piles cannot be filled."
msgstr "牌發到八個牌列堆，每堆十三張。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，任何單張或合法順子可堆間移動，空牌列堆不能填滿。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to eight tableau piles of three cards each. Only the top card of each pile is face-up. Eight cards are dealt to eight reserve piles, one below each tableau pile."
msgstr "牌發到八個牌列堆，每堆三張，只有最上面那張面朝上。八張發到八個預備堆，每個牌列堆下方各一堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to eight tableau piles, each with one more card than the previous one (the first has one card, the second has two, up to the last one with eight). Only the top card of each pile is face-up. The remaining cards are dealt out to sixteen reserves."
msgstr "牌發到八個牌列堆，每堆比前一堆多一張（第一堆一張、第二堆兩張，依此到最後一堆八張）。只有最上面那張面朝上。其餘的牌發到十六個預備堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to fifteen tableau piles of six cards each. The remaining fourteen cards are set aside as reserve cards. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between piles, and any card or sequence can be moved to fill empty tableau piles. Cards from the reserve cards can be moved to appropriate tableau or foundation piles."
msgstr "牌發到十五個牌列堆，每堆六張。剩餘十四張留作預備牌。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，任何單張或合法順子可堆間移動，任何單張或順子可填滿空牌列堆。預備牌可移到合適的牌列或王牌區。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to four stacks of thirteen cards each, with six empty tableau piles. Piles are built down by alternate color, and any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles. Empty piles can be filled with any card or sequence. The game is won if all the cards can be arranged in four alternate color sequences that build down from king to ace."
msgstr "牌發到四個十三張的堆，另有六個空的牌列堆。堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，任何單張或合法順子可在堆間移動，空堆可由任何單張或順子填滿。全部牌能排成四段紅黑交替、從 K 遞減到 A 的順子就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to four tableau piles of seven cards, and four of six cards. The remaining cards are dealt to four reserve piles of thirteen cards each."
msgstr "牌發到四個七張的牌列堆與四個六張的牌列堆。其餘的牌發到四個預備堆，每堆十三張。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to four tableau piles of six cards, and four of seven cards. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit. Any appropriate sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles."
msgstr "牌發到四個六張的牌列堆與四個七張的牌列堆。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞減疊放，任何合適的順子可堆間移動。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to four tableau piles, with each pile containing all the cards of a single suit. There are also three additional empty tableau piles. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any valid sequence can be moved between piles."
msgstr "牌發到四個牌列堆，每堆都是同一花色的全部牌，另有三個空的牌列堆。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，任何合法順子可堆間移動。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to nine of ten tableau piles, with the first containing eight cards, and each additional pile containing one less than the previous pile, until the last pile contains only one card. Only the top cards are face-up The tenth pile starts empty."
msgstr "牌發到九個牌列堆：第一堆八張，之後每堆比前一堆少一張，直到最後一堆只剩一張。只有最上面的牌面朝上。第十堆一開始是空的。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to nine piles of four cards each, with alternating cards face-up and face-down. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit, and any card or sequence of cards can be moved between piles."
msgstr "牌發到九個四張的堆，面朝上與面朝下交錯排列。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞減疊放，任何單張或順子可堆間移動。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to nine tableau piles. One set of foundations is located above the leftmost four tableau piles, and these are built up by rank from ace to king, regardless of suit. A second set is located above the rightmost four piles, built down by rank from king to ace, regardless of suit. A card can only be moved to a foundation from the pile directly under it, or from the middle pile, and cards that can be moved to the foundations are moved there immediately."
msgstr "牌發到九個牌列堆。左側四堆上方有一組王牌區，不分花色按點數從 A 遞增至 K；右側四堆上方有另一組，不分花色按點數從 K 遞減到 A。只有正下方那堆或中間那堆的牌能移到王牌區，能移的牌會立即移過去。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to seven piles in the tableau, one card in the first pile, two in the second, and so on. Only the top card of each pile is face-up."
msgstr "牌發到七個牌列堆，第一堆一張、第二堆兩張，依此類推。每堆只有最上面那張面朝上。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to seven piles in the tableau, one card in the first pile, two in the second, and so on. Only the top card of each pile is face-up. Then, the remaining cards are dealt evenly to the second through seventh pile, all face-up."
msgstr "牌發到七個牌列堆，第一堆一張、第二堆兩張，依此類推。每堆只有最上面那張面朝上。然後其餘的牌平均分發到第二到第七堆，全部面朝上。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to seven piles of five cards each. The tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and only single cards can be moved between piles. There are also two free cells that any single card can be moved to/from freely."
msgstr "牌發到七堆，每堆五張。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，堆間只能移單張。另有兩個自由格，任何單張都能自由移進移出。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to seven piles of four cards each, with only the top card of each pile face-up. These are the free lands, and may be built up by same suit. Any valid sequence can be moved, and any card or sequence can be played in an empty space."
msgstr "牌發到七堆，每堆四張，只有最上面那張面朝上。這些是自由地，可按同花色遞增疊放。任何合法順子都可移動，空格裡可放任何單張或順子。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to seven piles of four cards each, with the first and third card in each pile face-down and the second and top card face-up. Eleven cards are dealt to a reserve pile, with only the top one face-up. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between piles. Empty piles can only be filled by kings."
msgstr "牌發到七堆，每堆四張，每堆第一張與第三張面朝下、第二張與最上面那張面朝上。十一張發到一個預備堆，只有最上面那張面朝上。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，任何單張或合法順子可堆間移動，空堆只能由 K 填滿。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to seven piles of seven cards each, with three face-down cards at the bottom of four piles, and all cards face-up in the other three. The remaining three cards remain in the talon."
msgstr "牌發到七堆，每堆七張，其中四堆底部三張面朝下，另外三堆全部面朝上。剩餘三張留在牌山。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to seven piles of seven cards. The cards in the first pile are all face-up while the bottom two cards of the remaining piles are face-down. The remaining three cards are placed in reserves."
msgstr "牌發到七堆，每堆七張。第一堆全部面朝上，其餘各堆底部兩張面朝下。剩餘三張放到預備堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to seven piles, with an ascending number of cards in each pile (1 in the first, 2 in the second, etc.), all face-up."
msgstr "牌發到七堆，每堆張數依序遞增（第一堆一張、第二堆兩張，依此類推），全部面朝上。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to seven tableau piles, each with one more card than the previous, with the first pile having one, and the last seven. Only the top card of each is face-up. Seven cards are dealt to seven reserves, These are called the seven devils. These devil cards can only be moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌發到七個牌列堆，每堆比前一堆多一張，第一堆一張、最後一堆七張。每堆只有最上面那張面朝上。七張發到七個預備堆，這七堆稱為七惡魔。惡魔牌只能移到王牌區。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to seven tableau piles, four with four cards, and three with seven. Tableau piles are built down by same suit. Groups of cards can be moved regardless of sequence."
msgstr "牌發到七個牌列堆，四堆每堆四張、三堆每堆七張。牌列堆按同花色遞減疊放，牌組不顧順子也能整體移動。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to seven tableau piles, with each card having one more than the card before it, so the first pile has one, second has two, up to the seventh which has seven. Only the top card of each pile is face-up. The remaining cards are then dealt face-up evenly to piles two through seven."
msgstr "牌發到七個牌列堆，每堆比前一堆多一張，第一堆一張、第二堆兩張，直到第七堆七張。每堆只有最上面那張面朝上。然後其餘的牌面朝上平均分發到第二到第七堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to six columns of six cards each. The individual columns are called the flower beds, with the entire tableau being called the garden. An additional sixteen cards are placed aside in a reserve called the bouquet."
msgstr "牌發到六個欄位，每欄六張。各欄稱為花壇，整個牌列稱為花園。另有十六張放在一旁的預備堆，稱為花束。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to six piles of four cards each. Tableau piles are built down by same suit. Only single cards can be moved between tableau piles. Empty spaces are filled immediately from the waste pile, but if the stock is empty, any card can fill an empty tableau pile."
msgstr "牌發到六堆，每堆四張。牌列堆按同花色遞減疊放，堆間只能移單張。空格立即由棄牌堆補滿，但牌山已空時，任何牌都能填滿空牌列堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to six piles of six cards each. The remaining sixteen cards are dealt out on both sides of the tableau as reserve cards. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color and any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between piles. Reserve cards can be moved to the foundations of tableau, but cards cannot be moved to the reserve."
msgstr "牌發到六堆，每堆六張。剩餘十六張分到牌列兩側作預備牌。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，任何單張或合法順子可堆間移動。預備牌可移到王牌區或牌列，但不能把牌移進預備堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to six piles of three cards each and the aces are dealt to the foundations. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and only single cards can be moved between tableau piles. Any card can fill empty tableau piles."
msgstr "牌發到六堆，每堆三張，A 發到王牌區。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，堆間只能移單張。任何牌都能填滿空牌列堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to six tableau piles of six cards each. During the initial deal, any ace that would be dealt is instead moved to the foundation immediately. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit."
msgstr "牌發到六個牌列堆，每堆六張。初始發牌時，原本要發到 A 的牌會立即直接移到王牌區。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞減疊放。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to six tableau piles, two with eight cards and four with nine. Tableau piles can be built up or down by rank, regardless of suit, and only single cards can be moved between piles. Any single card can fill an empty tableau pile."
msgstr "牌發到六個牌列堆，兩堆八張、四堆九張。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞增或遞減疊放，堆間只能移單張。任何單張都能填滿空牌列堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to sixteen piles of four cards each. An additional card is dealt to the foundation, this determines the base rank of the foundations."
msgstr "牌發到十六個四張的堆，另發一張到王牌區，那張決定王牌區的基準點數。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to sixteen piles of three cards, and the aces are dealt to the foundations. The tableau piles are built by same rank. Empty tableau piles are not filled. The foundations are built up by same suit."
msgstr "牌發到十六個三張的堆，A 發到王牌區。牌列堆按同點數疊放，空牌列堆不補滿。王牌區按同花色遞增疊放。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to ten piles of five cards each, with all cards face-up. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit, but only single cards or sequences of the same suit can be moved between tableau piles. Any card or sequence can fill empty piles."
msgstr "牌發到十堆，每堆五張，全部面朝上。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞減疊放，但堆間只能移單張或同花色的順子。任何單張或順子都能填滿空堆。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to ten piles of five cards each. The remaining two cards are dealt to two reserves. Tableau piles are built up or down by same suit, and only single cards can be moved between tableau piles. You can move cards from the reserve to the tableau or the foundations, and empty reserve piles can be used as free cells."
msgstr "牌發到十堆，每堆五張。剩餘兩張發到兩個預備堆。牌列堆按同花色遞增或遞減疊放，堆間只能移單張。可把預備堆的牌移到牌列或王牌區，空的預備堆可當自由格使用。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to ten piles of three cards each, along with three additional single cards. Pair off cards whose ranks total 14, and discard them to the foundation. Cards from the three single cards are replaced from the stock, but the piles of three are not replaced when emptied."
msgstr "牌發到十堆，每堆三張，另有三張單張。點數合計 14 的兩張配對後丟到王牌區。三張單張的位置由牌山補牌，三張的堆空了不補牌。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to ten tableau piles - four with six cards and six with five. Only the top card of each pile is face-up. Tableau piles are built down by rank or by same rank. Only single cards or sequences of cards that are the same rank or built down by suit can be moved between tableau piles."
msgstr "牌發到十個牌列堆，四堆六張、六堆五張。每堆只有最上面那張面朝上。牌列堆按點數遞減或按同點數疊放。堆間只能移單張，或同點數的順子、或按花色遞減的順子。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to ten tableau piles of four cards each. Tableau piles are built down by same suit. Only single cards can be moved between tableau piles."
msgstr "牌發到十個牌列堆，每堆四張。牌列堆按同花色遞減疊放，堆間只能移單張。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to ten tableau piles, each with a different number of cards, 1-3-5-7-9-10-8-6-4-2 from left to right. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and only kings can fill empty tableau piles. Any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between piles."
msgstr "牌發到十個牌列堆，每堆張數各不相同，由左到右為 1-3-5-7-9-10-8-6-4-2。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，只有 K 能填滿空牌列堆。任何單張或合法順子可堆間移動。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to ten tableau piles, with the first pile containing one card, the second containing two, and so on, up until the last three piles containing eight cards each."
msgstr "牌發到十個牌列堆，第一堆一張、第二堆兩張，依此類推，直到最後三堆每堆八張。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to ten tableau piles, with the first pile containing one card, the second containing two, and so on, up until the last two piles containing nine cards."
msgstr "牌發到十個牌列堆，第一堆一張、第二堆兩張，依此類推，直到最後兩堆每堆九張。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to the first thirteen piles in order, until the 104 cards have been used up. If the dealt card matches the place of the pile it is placed on, one card is dealt to the talon. If the card is a face card, one card is dealt to the talon. If the card is an Ace, two cards are dealt to the talon. Each time the deal reaches the King pile, two cards are dealt to the talon and the deal starts over at the Ace pile."
msgstr "依序發到前十三個堆，直到 104 張用盡。發到的牌若與該堆的位置相符，就發一張到牌山；發到的牌若是人頭牌，也發一張到牌山；若是 A，就發兩張到牌山。每次發到 K 的堆時，發兩張到牌山，並從 A 的堆重新開始。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to thirteen piles of four cards each, arranged so only the top card is visible. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit. Only single cards can be moved between piles, and empty piles cannot be filled. The foundations are built up by same suit from ace to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌發到十三個四張的堆，排列後只有最上面那張可見。牌列堆不分花色按點數遞減疊放，堆間只能移單張，空堆不能填滿。王牌區按同花色從 A 遞增至 K。全部牌移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to thirteen piles of four cards each, with alternating cards face-up and face-down. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any card or sequence of cards can be moved between piles."
msgstr "牌發到十三個四張的堆，面朝上與面朝下交錯排列。牌列堆按紅黑交替遞減疊放，任何單張或順子可堆間移動。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to thirteen piles of four cards each. All Kings are placed at the bottom of a pile during the initial dealing."
msgstr "牌發到十三個四張的堆。初始發牌時所有 K 都放在堆的底部。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to thirteen piles of four cards each. Tableau piles are built down by either same suit or rank. Any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved, but combined sequences that contain groups that are both the same rank or suit cannot be moved."
msgstr "牌發到十三個四張的堆。牌列堆按同花色或同點數遞減疊放。任何單張或合法順子都可移動，但同時含有同點數與同花色兩類牌組的合併順子不能移動。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to thirteen piles of four cards each. Tableau piles are built up or down by same suit. Only single cards can be moved between piles, and only kings can fill empty piles. The foundations are built up by same suit from ace to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌發到十三個四張的堆。牌列堆按同花色遞增或遞減疊放，堆間只能移單張，且只有 K 能填滿空堆。王牌區按同花色從 A 遞增至 K。全部牌移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to thirteen piles of three cards each, and the other thirteen cards are dealt to the row above them. Building on these tableau piles is not allowed - cards can only be moved from the tableau to the foundations."
msgstr "牌發到十三個三張的堆，另外十三張發到它們上方的橫排。這些牌列堆不允許疊牌，牌只能從牌列移到王牌區。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to thirteen piles of three cards each. Cards from twos through kings are built down by twos, though only sequences of the same suit can be moved as a unit. So sequences can be built down as K-J-9-7-5-3 or Q-10-8-6-4-2. A full same suit sequence following either of these patterns can be moved to a foundation."
msgstr "牌發到十三個三張的堆。從 2 到 K 的牌按每次減二的點數疊放，但只有同花色的順子才能整體移動。所以順子可疊成 K-J-9-7-5-3 或 Q-10-8-6-4-2。任一模式下完整的同花色順子可移到王牌區。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to twelve piles of four cards each, with only the top card of each pile face-up. Pairs of exposed cards in the tableau of the same rank can be moved to the foundation. Empty tableau piles can be filled with one of the remaining four cards from the talon. You win if all cards can be paired off."
msgstr "牌發到十二個四張的堆，每堆只有最上面那張面朝上。牌列中最上面可見且點數相同的兩張可移到王牌區。空牌列堆可由牌山剩餘四張中的一張填滿。全部牌都能配對就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards are dealt to two columns of six cards each. The top and bottom cards are the corner cards, and are placed slightly separate from the rest of the tableau. There are two columns of foundations between the middle four cards of each column."
msgstr "牌發到兩欄，每欄六張。最上面與最下面那兩張是角牌，擺得與牌列其餘部分略微分開。每欄中間四張之間夾著兩欄王牌區。"

msgid "Cards build down in rank on the rows and up in rank on the foundations. Third and fourth rank (trash) cards are not interchangeable. Only a first rank card or correctly ordered pile may be played on an empty row."
msgstr "牌在橫排上按點數遞減疊放，在王牌區按點數遞增疊放。第三與第四點的垃圾牌不可互換。空的橫排只能放第一點的牌，或排列正確的整堆。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the stock one at a time. No redeal is allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundation."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山發出。不允許循環發牌。全部移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the stock to the waste one at a time. No redeal is allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山發到棄牌堆。不允許循環發牌。全部移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the tableau one at a time and moved to the tableau, free cell, or foundations. The foundations are built up by suit from ace to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌列發出，移到牌列、自由格或王牌區。王牌區按花色從 A 遞增至 K。全部移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the tableau one at a time. Exposed cards from the walls can be moved from the tableau if they are one rank higher or lower than the card currently on the foundation. Turning the corner is allowed, so kings can be played on aces, and vice versa. After a card is played, the next card cannot be played from the same wall. The cards in the corners are treated as part of both walls they overlap."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌列發出。牆上最上面可見的牌，若比王牌區現有的牌高一點或低一點，就可從牌列移出。允許轉角，即 K 可放在 A 上，反之亦然。出過一張後，下一張不能從同一面牆出。四角的牌視為同時屬於它所疊的兩面牆。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the talon one at a time and moved to the tableau or foundations. Two redeals are allowed, so you can go through the talon three times."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山移到牌列或王牌區。允許兩次循環發牌，也就是牌山可過三輪。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the talon one at a time, and moved to an appropriate pile in the free lands, or any of the aforementioned foundation/reserve piles. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山移到自由地裡的合適一堆，或前述任何王牌區或預備堆。不允許循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the talon one at a time, and moved to an appropriate tableau or foundation pile. There is no redeal."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山移到合適的牌列堆或王牌區。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the talon one at a time, and moved to the foundation or tableau piles. Any card can be moved to the tableau, regardless of rank, but once a card is moved to the tableau, it can only be moved to the foundation."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山移到王牌區或牌列堆。任何牌不顧點數都能移到牌列，但一旦移進牌列，就只能移到王牌區。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the talon one at a time, and moved to the foundations or tableau piles. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山移到王牌區或牌列堆。不允許循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the talon one at a time, and moved to the tableau or foundations. Two redeals are allowed, so you can go through the talon three times at most."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山移到牌列或王牌區。允許兩次循環發牌，也就是牌山最多可過三輪。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the talon one at a time. Cards from the waste can be moved onto an appropriate available card. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山發出。棄牌堆的牌可移到能接上的合適牌上。不允許循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the talon one at a time. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山發出。不允許循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the talon one at a time. The last dealt card can be moved to an appropriate tableau pile or foundation. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山發出。最後發到的那張可移到合適的牌列堆或王牌區。不允許循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the talon one at a time. These cards can be moved to a tableau or foundation pile. You are allowed one redeal, so you can go through the stock twice."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山發出，這些牌可移到牌列堆或王牌區。允許一次循環發牌，也就是牌山可過兩次。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the talon three at a time, one to each of three waste piles. Cards from the waste piles can be moved to tableau piles or foundations."
msgstr "牌可每次從牌山發三張，三個棄牌堆各一張。棄牌堆的牌可移到牌列堆或王牌區。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt from the talon to the waste one at a time, though if there is an empty pile in the middle step, only three cards can be dealt from the talon before it must be filled. Cards from the waste can be dealt to any of the three steps. No redeal is allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the upper step/foundations."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山發到棄牌堆，但若中階有空堆，只能從牌山發三張就必須把它填滿。棄牌堆的牌可發到三個階層的任何一處。不允許循環發牌。全部移到上階（王牌區）就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards can be dealt three at a time from the tableau to the waste pile. The top card of the waste pile can be moved to the tableau or foundations."
msgstr "牌可每次從牌列發三張到棄牌堆。棄牌堆最上面的那張可移到牌列或王牌區。"

msgid "Cards can be flipped singly from the talon to the waste. There is no redeal."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山翻到棄牌堆。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards can be flipped singly from the talon to the waste. Top card of waste is available for play. There is no redeal."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山翻到棄牌堆，棄牌堆最上面的那張可供出牌。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards can be moved between tableau piles one at a time, building them down by alternate color, and any card can be used to fill empty piles. Foundations are built up by suit, starting with aces."
msgstr "牌可在牌列堆之間逐張移動，按紅黑交替遞減疊放，任何牌都能用來填滿空堆。王牌區按花色從 A 開始遞增疊放。"

msgid "Cards can be moved from the top of the seven piles to the reserves. There is no limit to how many cards can be in the reserves, but only cards of the same suit can be played to it, and only the top card of each reserve can be moved. Moving cards between reserves is not allowed."
msgstr "牌可從七堆的最上面移到預備堆。預備堆張數不限，但只有同花色的牌才能放入，且每個預備堆只能移動最上面那張。預備堆之間不能移牌。"

msgid "Cards can be moved on top of any other card or cards of the same rank. Groups of cards can be moved if they are of the same rank."
msgstr "牌可放在任意其他牌上，或同點數的牌、牌組上。點數相同的牌組可整體移動。"

msgid "Cards can be placed in tableau piles regardless of rank or suit, but cards in tableau piles can only be moved to foundations."
msgstr "牌可放進牌列堆，不顧點數與花色，但牌列堆裡的牌只能移到王牌區。"

msgid "Cards can be played on the tableau by suits or by rank. Plum 1 plays on Pine 1, Maple 3 on Mum 3, Pine 2 on Phoenix 2, etc. Any second rank card can be played on any first. The third and fourth ranks are interchangeable for all suits. Only first rank cards can be played on the canvas. There can be no more than 26 cards in a row."
msgstr "牌可按花色或點數在牌列出牌：李 1 放在松 1 上、楓 3 放在菊 3 上、松 2 放在鳳 2 上，依此類推。任何第二點的牌都可放在任何第一點的牌上，第三與第四點在各花色間可互換。只有第一點的牌能放在王牌區。一橫排最多不超過 26 張。"

msgid "Cards cannot be moved between reserve piles at any time. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "任何時候都不能在預備堆之間移牌。全部牌移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards from the \"Devil's Six\" on the top of the board can only be moved directly to the foundations, and has to be played in order of the stack."
msgstr "棋盤上方「惡魔六張」的牌只能直接移到王牌區，且必須依照堆疊順序出牌。"

msgid "Cards from the reserve can only be moved to an appropriate foundation pile. If there are no moves left, deal cards from the talon one at a time. No redeal is allowed - you can only go through the deck once."
msgstr "預備堆的牌只能移到合適的王牌區。無牌可動時，從牌山逐張發牌。不允許循環發牌，整副牌只能過一次。"

msgid "Cards from the reserve can only be moved to the foundations."
msgstr "預備堆的牌只能移到王牌區。"

msgid "Cards from the reserves or tableau can be moved to foundation piles, building the foundation piles up by rank, regardless of suit. No building on the tableau is allowed. The game is won when all cards have been moved to the foundations."
msgstr "預備堆或牌列的牌可移到王牌區，王牌區不分花色按點數遞增疊放。牌列上不允許疊牌。全部牌移到王牌區就獲勝。"

msgid "Cards from the tableau can be moved to appropriate foundations, but building on the tableau is not allowed. When there are no moves left, you can deal one card from the talon to each of the tableau piles."
msgstr "牌列的牌可移到合適的王牌區，但牌列上不允許疊牌。無牌可動時，可從牌山逐張發到每個牌列堆。"

msgid "Cards from the tableau can be moved to foundations. The foundations that start from aces are built up by suit, while the foundations that start from kings are built down by suit."
msgstr "牌列的牌可移到王牌區。從 A 開始的王牌區按花色遞增疊放，從 K 開始的王牌區按花色遞減疊放。"

msgid "Cards from the tableau can be moved to foundations. The four foundations on the left are built up by suit from ace to king, while the four on the right are built down by suit from king to ace."
msgstr "牌列的牌可移到王牌區。左側四個王牌區按花色從 A 遞增至 K，右側四個按花色從 K 遞減到 A。"

msgid "Cards from the talon are turned over to the waste pile, one at a time. You can move the top card to the playing piles or the foundations. There is one redeal."
msgstr "牌從牌山逐張翻到棄牌堆，可把最上面那張移到牌列堆或王牌區。有一次循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards from the talon are turned over to the waste pile, two at a time. There is only one redeal."
msgstr "牌從牌山每次翻兩張到棄牌堆，只有一次循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards from the waste pile or reserves may be moved to foundations, which are built down by rank, wrapping down from ace to king as necessary. A card cannot be placed in a foundation unless the foundation to the left of it has cards in it. Each foundation starts with a card one rank lower than the foundation to the left of it, and can hold eight cards max."
msgstr "棄牌堆或預備堆的牌可移到王牌區，王牌區按點數遞減疊放，必要時從 A 繞回 K。若左邊那堆是空的，就不能把牌放到該王牌區。每個王牌區的起始牌比左邊那堆低一點，每堆最多放八張。"

msgid "Cards in Tableau are built down by alternate color. Groups of cards can be moved regardless of sequence. An empty space can be filled with any card or sequence."
msgstr "牌列中的牌按紅黑交替遞減疊放，牌組不顧順子也能移動，空列可由任何單張或順子填滿。"

msgid "Cards in Tableau are built down by suit, the ranks going the opposite way as the foundations: Club down by one, Spade down by two, Heart down by three and Diamond down by four."
msgstr "牌列中的牌按花色遞減疊放，點數與王牌區相反：梅花每次減 1、黑桃每次減 2、紅心每次減 3、方塊每次減 4。"

msgid "Cards in tableau are built down by alternate color. Groups of cards can be moved regardless of sequence. An empty space can be filled with any card or sequence."
msgstr "牌列中的牌按紅黑交替遞減疊放，牌組不顧順子也能移動，空列可由任何單張或順子填滿。"

msgid "Cards in tableau are built down by alternate color. Groups of cards can be moved regardless of sequence. Any card or sequence can be used to fill an empty pile."
msgstr "牌列中的牌按紅黑交替遞減疊放，牌組不顧順子也能移動，任何單張或順子都能填滿空堆。"

msgid "Cards in tableau are built down by alternate color. Groups of face-up cards can be moved regardless of sequence. An empty pile in the tableau can be filled with a King or a group of cards with a King on the bottom."
msgstr "牌列中的牌按紅黑交替遞減疊放，面朝上的牌組不顧順子也能移動。牌列中的空堆可由 K，或由底部為 K 的牌組填滿。"

msgid "Cards in tableau are built down by same suit. Groups of cards can be moved regardless of sequence. An empty pile in the tableau can be filled with a King or a group of cards with a King on the bottom."
msgstr "牌列中的牌按同花色遞減疊放，面朝上的牌組不顧順子也能移動。牌列中的空堆可由 K，或由底部為 K 的牌組填滿。"

msgid "Cards in tableau can be built either up or down in suit. However, each pile must follow only one of these rules. For example, if a tableau pile has a three of clubs over a two of clubs, one can only play a four of clubs on this pile. Any available card can be played on to an empty tableau pile."
msgstr "牌列中的牌可按花色遞增或遞減疊放，但每堆只能依其中一種規則。例如梅花 3 上壓梅花 2 的牌列堆，只能再放梅花 4。任何可用的牌都可放到空的牌列堆上。"

msgid "Cards in the Tableau are built down by alternate color. Groups of cards in sequence can be moved together."
msgstr "牌列中的牌按紅黑交替遞減疊放，接成順子的牌組可一起移動。"

msgid "Cards in the Tableau are built down by alternating color. Groups of cards can be moved. An empty pile in the Tableau can be filled with a card whose rank is one lower than the base card or with a group of cards starting with a card with this rank."
msgstr "牌列中的牌按紅黑交替遞減疊放，牌組可整體移動。空牌列可由點數比基準牌小一的牌，或以該點數開頭的牌組填滿。"

msgid "Cards in the Tableau are built down by same color. Groups of cards in sequence and same color can be moved as a unit."
msgstr "牌列中的牌按同色遞減疊放，接成順子且同色的牌組可整體移動。"

msgid "Cards in the heads row are built up by same suit, while cards in the tails row are built down by same suit. Empty piles are immediately filled with the reserve pile directly above or below that pile. If that reserve pile is empty, they can be filled by any card. Cards cannot be moved from the reserves at any other time."
msgstr "頭排的牌按同花色遞增疊放，尾排的牌按同花色遞減疊放。空堆立即由該堆正上方或正下方的預備堆補滿，若那個預備堆已空，則可由任何牌填滿。其他時候不能從預備堆移牌。"

msgid "Cards in the reserve are usually available to play anywhere. Usually cannot be built on."
msgstr "預備堆的牌通常隨處可出，通常不能在它上面疊牌。"

msgid "Cards may be dealt from the stock three at a time, and may be played on the tableau piles. The top card of the reserve/beehive may also be moved to a matching tableau pile."
msgstr "牌可每次從牌山發三張到牌列堆。預備堆（蜂箱堆）最上面的牌也可移到花色相符的牌列堆。"

msgid "Cards may be dealt one at a time from the stock, and the card from the waste may be played to an appropriate foundation or tableau pile. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "牌可逐張從牌山發出，棄牌堆的牌可移到合適的王牌區或牌列堆。不允許循環發牌。"

msgid "Cards may be moved between the tableau piles, moving one card at a time. The tableau piles are built up or down by alternating colors."
msgstr "牌可在牌列堆之間逐張移動，牌列堆按紅黑交替遞增或遞減疊放。"

msgid "Cards may be moved to an empty space if they are the same suit as the card directly to the left and higher in rank. Kings are high, so no cards may be placed to their right (they create dead spaces)."
msgstr "若牌與正左方那張同花色且點數較高，就可移到空位。K 為最大，所以右側不能再放牌（會造成死位）。"

msgid "Cards may be moved to one of the six foundations one at a time. Any card may be used to start one of the foundations, but after that, the foundations are built in sequence up or down in rank. Turning the corner is allowed, so aces may be played on kings, and vice versa."
msgstr "牌可逐張移到六個王牌區之一。任意牌都能用來開創王牌區，之後王牌區按點數順子遞增或遞減疊放。允許轉角，即 A 可放在 K 上，反之亦然。"

msgid "Cards may only be moved onto cards of the same suit."
msgstr "牌只能移到同花色的牌上。"

msgid "Cards may only be played on top of a higher valued card. Only the top card may be moved, and spaces may be filled with any single card."
msgstr "牌只能放在點數較高的牌上。只有最上面那張能移動，空格可由任何單張填滿。"

msgid "Cards on the tableau build down by suit. Only two cards can be placed on a row stack. Only one card can be moved at a time. Any card can be played on an empty row stack. The foundations build up in rank from the Ace by suit. Cards are dealt from the talon two at a time."
msgstr "牌列上的牌按花色遞減疊放，一個橫排堆只能放兩張，一次只能移一張，任何牌都能放到空的橫排堆。王牌區按花色從 A 開始按點數遞增疊放。牌從牌山每次發兩張。"

msgid "Cards on the tableau must be captured by one of their left, right, top or bottom neighbour. The captured card is then moved to the foundations or Reserves, and the capturing card moves into place."
msgstr "牌列上的牌必須被其左、右、上、下相鄰的一張吃掉。被吃掉的牌接著移到王牌區或預備堆，吃牌的那張補進那個位置。"

msgid "Cards play on the four foundation stacks by rank, in ascending suit order. Cards play on the four row stacks in descending suit order. The row stacks will hold no more than three cards. Only one card can be move at a time. Any card can be played on an empty row stack, but only cards of the same rank can play on partly filled rows. There are only two passes through the talon."
msgstr "牌在四個王牌堆上按點數以花色升序疊放，在四個橫排堆上以花色降序疊放。橫排堆最多放三張，一次只能移一張。任何牌都能放到空的橫排堆，但已放過牌的橫排只能放同點數的牌。牌山只過兩次。"

msgid "Cards will play on the tableau in descending rank order without regard to suit. They can only be moved to the single foundation when a complete suit of twelve cards is finished and only in ascending suit order. The suit of the Fish Incarnation is first, the Tortoise next etc. When a suit is ready to be moved to the foundation, press (a)uto or play with auto drop enabled and all twelve cards will move there in order. Four cards are dealt to each of the ten rows when the game begins. Press (d)eal or click the talon to deal the next round of one card to each row. The reserve stacks to either side of the foundation will take one card each. Cards on the reserves may only be played to the rows."
msgstr "牌在牌列上按點數遞減疊放，不分花色。只有湊齊一整套十二張的花色時才能移到單一的王牌區，且必須依花色升序：魚化身（Fish Incarnation）的花色最先，其次是烏龜，依此類推。某花色已可移走時，按 (a)uto，或開啟自動放置來玩，十二張會依序全部移過去。遊戲開始時給十個橫排各發四張，按 (d)eal 或點擊牌山發下一輪、每橫排一張。王牌區兩側的預備堆各只能放一張，預備堆的牌只能移到橫排。"

