msgid "Double Lara's Game"
msgstr "雙拉拉的遊戲"

msgid "Double Mahjongg Big Castle"
msgstr "雙麻將大城堡"

msgid "Double Mahjongg Big Square"
msgstr "雙麻將大方形"

msgid "Double Mahjongg Big Traditional"
msgstr "雙麻將大傳統"

msgid "Double Mahjongg Eight Squares"
msgstr "雙麻將八個方形"

msgid "Double Mahjongg Faro"
msgstr "雙麻將法羅"

msgid "Double Mahjongg Roost"
msgstr "雙麻將棲架"

msgid "Double Mahjongg Rows"
msgstr "雙麻將橫排"

msgid "Double Mahjongg Sphere"
msgstr "雙麻將球體"

msgid "Double Mahjongg Twin Picks"
msgstr "雙麻將雙選"

msgid "Double Mahjongg Two Squares"
msgstr "雙麻將兩方形"

msgid "Double or Quits"
msgstr "孤注一擲"

msgid "Drag cards around"
msgstr "拖曳移動卡牌"

msgid "Draw cards from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to the foundations or tableau. No redeal is allowed. The foundations are built up by same suit from ace to king, and the game is won when all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌山每次摸一張，這些牌可移到王牌區或牌列。不准循環發牌。王牌區依同花色從 A 遞增疊放到 K，所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Dress Parade"
msgstr "閱兵式"

msgid "Drew Csillag"
msgstr "Drew Csillag"

msgid "Drop cards to the Foundations"
msgstr "放牌到王牌區"

msgid "Duchess"
msgstr "女公爵"

msgid "Duchess de Luynes"
msgstr "呂訥公爵夫人"

msgid "Due to the increased number of cards per hand, only four hands are dealt per game."
msgstr "因為每手牌數增加，一局只發四手。"

msgid "Dungeon - Aces represent dragons - no card can be played on an ace, as such, an ace will essentially block its pile until it can be \"banished\" to a dungeon. The ace can only be moved to the dungeon if the king, queen, jack, and ten of the same suit are played in the tower/castle for that suit, appropriately."
msgstr "地牢——A 代表龍——任何牌都不能放在 A 上，所以 A 基本上會卡住該牌堆，直到它被「驅逐」進地牢為止。只有該花色的 K、Q、J、10 都已放到對應的塔／城堡裡，那張 A 才能移進地牢。"

msgid "During each game, you can set up to nine bookmarks. After setting each bookmark, you can return to each of them, restoring the game to the state it was in when the bookmark was set. Bookmarks are saved for each game, and reset when you start a new game."
msgstr "每一局最多可設九個書籤。設好之後，你可以隨時回到任一書籤，把遊戲恢復到設定當下的狀態。書籤會跟著該局保存，開始新遊戲時會重置。"

msgid "During the initial deal, after dealing each row, any cards that can be moved to a foundation are moved there immediately."
msgstr "初次發牌時，每發完一排，能移到王牌區的牌會立刻移過去。"

msgid "Dutchess is a Canfield variation that was invented by Albert Morehead and Geoffrey Mott-Smith. It also goes by the name Glenwood."
msgstr "女公爵（Dutchess）是坎菲爾德的變化玩法，由阿爾伯特·莫里黑德（Albert Morehead）與傑弗里·莫特-史密斯（Geoffrey Mott-Smith）發明，又叫格倫伍德（Glenwood）。"

msgid "Dylan Thurston &lt;Dylan.Thurston@math.unige.ch&gt;"
msgstr "Dylan Thurston &lt;Dylan.Thurston@math.unige.ch&gt;"

msgid "END OF TERMS AND CONDITIONS"
msgstr "條款與條件到此結束"

