msgstr "每位貢獻者依其本身必要的專利主張，授予你一項非獨佔、全球免權利金的專利授權，得製作、使用、銷售、提供銷售、輸入，以及以其他方式執行、修改並流傳其貢獻版本的內容。"

msgid "Each deal flips one card from the Stock to each pile of the Tableau. There are no redeals."
msgstr "每次發牌從牌山翻一張到每個牌列堆。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Each deal flips one card from the Stock to the top of each of the reserve piles. There is no redeal."
msgstr "每次發牌從牌山翻一張到每個預備堆的最上面。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Each foundation must be started with a card with the same suit as the card in the foundation directly to the left (except in the leftmost column, of course)."
msgstr "每個王牌區的第一張牌，花色必須與左邊相鄰王牌區裡那張相同（最左邊那一列當然除外）。"

msgid "Each tile placed on the board scores depending on the number of adjacent tiles. Tiles placed on the edge of the play area do not score:"
msgstr "每放上一塊牌塊的分數，取決於相鄰牌塊的數量。放在遊戲區邊緣的牌塊不計分："

msgid "Each time you convey a covered work, the recipient automatically receives a license from the original licensors, to run, modify and propagate that work, subject to this License. You are not responsible for enforcing compliance by third parties with this License."
msgstr "你每次傳遞受涵蓋的作品，接收方就會自動從原始授權人取得依本授權條款執行、修改並流傳該作品的授權。你沒有義務要求第三方遵守本授權條款。"

msgid "Each version is given a distinguishing version number. If the Program specifies that a certain numbered version of the GNU General Public License \"or any later version\" applies to it, you have the option of following the terms and conditions either of that numbered version or of any later version published by the Free Software Foundation. If the Program does not specify a version number of the GNU General Public License, you may choose any version ever published by the Free Software Foundation."
msgstr "每個版本都有各自的版本編號。若程式指定適用某一編號的 GNU 通用公共授權條款「或任何後續版本」，你可以選擇遵循該編號版本，或自由軟體基金會後續發布的任何版本。若程式未指明 GNU 通用公共授權條款的版本編號，你可以選用自由軟體基金會發布過的任一版本。"

msgid "Earn enough points within 30 moves."
msgstr "在 30 步內賺到足夠的分數。"

msgid "Easy option to clear advanced search options."
msgstr "提供方便的方式清除進階搜尋選項。"

msgid "Easy."
msgstr "簡單。"

msgid "Egyptian Solitaire"
msgstr "埃及接龍"

msgid "Eight Cards"
msgstr "八張牌"

msgid "Eight Cards (Acht Karten)"
msgstr "八張牌（Acht Karten）"

msgid "Eight Guardians"
msgstr "八大守護"

msgid "Eight Legions"
msgstr "八大兵團"

msgid "Eight Times Eight"
msgstr "八八"

msgid "Eight Times Eight (Achtmal Acht)"
msgstr "八八（Achtmal Acht）"

msgid "Eight cards are dealt out to two columns of four free cells. These cards must contain at least one ace or king - if they do not, they are immediately redealt. Then, cards are dealt to six tableau piles of four cards each."
msgstr "八張牌發到兩排、每排四個自由格。這八張至少要有一張 A 或 K，否則立刻重新發牌。接著再發六個牌列堆，每堆四張。"

msgid "Eight cards are dealt to eight free cells in a row. This forms the \"equator\". Twenty-four additional cards are dealt to twenty-four tableau piles both above and below the equator, called the \"zodiac\"."
msgstr "八張牌發到一排的八個自由格，這一行就是「赤道」。另外 24 張發到赤道上下共 24 個牌列堆，稱作「黃道」。"

msgid "Eight cards are dealt to eight reserves, and a single card is dealt to each of eight tableau piles. The foundations build up by rank ignoring suit. The base rank for each foundation is one higher than the reserve above it."
msgstr "八張牌發到八個預備堆，另外八個牌列堆各發一張。王牌區依點數遞增疊放、不計花色，每個王牌區的基準點數比它上方那個預備堆大 1。"

msgid "Eight cards are dealt to eight reserves, and the remaining cards are dealt to eight tableau piles. The foundations build up by rank ignoring suit. The base rank for each foundation is one higher than the reserve above it."
msgstr "八張牌發到八個預備堆，剩下的牌發到八個牌列堆。王牌區依點數遞增疊放、不計花色，每個王牌區的基準點數比它上方那個預備堆大 1。"

msgid "Eight cards are dealt to eight tableau piles, and the black aces and red deuces are dealt to the foundations. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit, building by every other rank, wrapping from two to king or ace to queen as necessary. Any card can fill an empty pile."
msgstr "八張牌發到八個牌列堆，黑色的 A 與紅色的 2 發到王牌區。牌列堆依點數遞減疊放、不計花色，每次遞減隔一個點數，必要時從 2 循環到 K、或從 A 循環到 Q。空列可用任意牌填補。"

msgid "Eight cards are dealt to eight tableau piles, positioned to resemble a bird's wings. In the middle, thirteen cards are dealt to a reserve face-down. Tableau piles are built down by same suit, wrapping from ace to king as needed, though a max of three cards can be in each tableau pile. Only single cards can be moved between tableau piles, and empty tableau piles are filled immediately from the top card of the reserve."
msgstr "八張牌發到八個牌列堆，排得像鳥的翅膀。中間的預備堆反面發十三張。牌列堆依同花色遞減疊放，需要的話可從 A 循環到 K，但每堆最多三張。牌列堆之間只能移動單張牌，空的牌列堆會立刻用預備堆最上面那張補滿。"

msgid "Eight cards are dealt to form eight tableau piles. These tableau piles are built by alternate color. A card may be moved to a tableau pile if it is the same rank or one rank lower than the card it's placed on top of. Any single card or an entire pile can be moved, but partial tableau stacks cannot be moved. Any card or sequence can fill an empty pile."
msgstr "八張牌發成八個牌列堆，各堆採紅黑交替疊放。要移到牌列堆的牌，點數必須與它要壓的那張相同或小一級。可以移動單張牌或整堆，但不能只移半堆。空列可用任意牌或任意順子填補。"

msgid "Eight cards are dealt to tableau piles, and two sets of eleven cards are dealt to two reserve piles - one additional reserve card is placed on top of both piles, overlapping them. This card must be moved before any card from the other reserve piles is moved. Only the top card from the reserves can be moved."
msgstr "八張牌發到牌列堆，另外兩組各十一張發到兩個預備堆，並在兩堆交界上面多放一張預備牌，橫跨兩堆。必須先把這張移走，才能移動預備堆裡其他的牌。預備堆只有最上面那張可以移動。"

msgid "Eight cards are dealt to the tableau. Cards with a total rank of 11 are removed, and replaced from the tableau. Picture cards can be removed on their own. Up to twice during the game, you are allowed to draw a single card from the talon as a ninth card, which can then be paired with an appropriate tableau card."
msgstr "八張牌發到牌列。點數合計為 11 的牌會被移除，並從牌列補牌。人頭牌可單獨移除。一局之中最多兩次，你可以從牌山摸一張作為第九張，再拿它和牌列裡合適的牌配對。"

msgid "Eight cards are dealt to the tableau. Pairs of cards of consecutive rank can be removed and discarded to the single foundation, and the spaces are filled from the talon."
msgstr "八張牌發到牌列。點數相連的兩張牌可以移除，丟到那個唯一的王牌區，空出來的位子再由牌山補滿。"

msgid "Eight legions"
msgstr "八大兵團"

msgid "Eight stacks of four cards are dealt. The top card of each of these piles may be played to an appropriate foundation. You may turn over cards in the talon to the waste pile one at a time, and the top card of the waste pile may also be played to an appropriate foundation."
msgstr "發八堆、每堆四張。各堆最上面那張可移到合適的王牌區。你可以從牌山一次翻一張到棄牌堆，棄牌堆最上面那張同樣可移到合適的王牌區。"

msgid "Eight tableau cards are dealt in a circle around the talon. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time and can be moved to tableau piles which are built up by rank, regardless of suit. Cards cannot be moved between piles. One redeal is allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the tableau circle."
msgstr "八張牌列牌發成環形繞著牌山。牌山每次發一張，可移到依點數遞增疊放、不計花色的牌列堆。牌不能在牌列堆之間移動。允許循環發牌 1 次。所有牌都移到牌列圓環即獲勝。"

msgid "Eighteen tableau piles of three cards are dealt. Any ace that would be dealt is dealt to the foundation instead, and a new card is dealt to replace it. The remaining cards are set aside in the talon."
msgstr "發十八個牌列堆、每堆三張。若發到 A，會改放到王牌區，並另發一張補上。剩下的牌擱在牌山。"

msgid "Eights"
msgstr "八（Eights）"

msgid "Eights (Les Huits)"
msgstr "八（Les Huits）"

msgid "Eleven Away"
msgstr "移除十一"

msgid "Eliminator"
msgstr "消除者"

msgid "Emperor of Germany"
msgstr "德國皇帝"

msgid "Empty piles can be filled by a card that's the same rank as the final card that would be played to the foundation built up by the same amount."
msgstr "空列可以放一張牌，其點數要與依相同增量遞增的王牌區最後該放進去的那張相同。"

msgid "Empty piles formed from the initial seven piles cannot be filled. The game is won if all of the piles are empty or converted to foundations, and all of the cards have been moved to foundations."
msgstr "開局那七堆所形成的空列不能再補牌。所有牌堆都變空或轉成王牌區，且所有牌都移到王牌區，即算獲勝。"

msgid "Empty piles in the antechamber are filled from the waste pile, or the talon if the waste is empty. Cards can be dealt from the talon one at a time to the waste pile - no redeal is allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "前廳的空列由棄牌堆補，棄牌堆也空了就從牌山補。牌山每次發一張到棄牌堆，不准循環發牌。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Empty spaces in the tableau will be filled automatically from the reserve (the pile below the talon) until it is exhausted. When the reserve is exhausted, the empty spaces can be filled with any card."
msgstr "牌列的空位會自動從預備堆（牌山下方那堆）補滿，直到預備堆耗盡。預備堆空了之後，空位就能放任意牌。"

msgid "Empty tableau piles are filled from the stock. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "空的牌列堆由牌山補牌。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Empty tableau piles are immediately filled by three cards from the talon. Once the talon is empty, only kings can fill the piles. The game is won if all the cards are arranged in four same suit sequences from king to ace."
msgstr "空的牌列堆會立刻從牌山補三張。牌山一空，就只有 K 能補堆。把所有牌排成四組同花色、從 K 到 A 的順子即獲勝。"

msgid "Empty tableau piles are immediately filled from one of the gate-posts (whichever has more cards), or the waste pile if both are empty."
msgstr "空的牌列堆會立刻由張數較多的那根門柱補牌，兩根都空時改由棄牌堆補。"

msgid "Empty tableau piles may not be filled."
msgstr "空的牌列堆不能補牌。"

msgid "Empty tableau spaces can normally only be filled by kings. However, if all four kings are on the bottom of tableau piles, they can be filled by any card."
msgstr "牌列的空位通常只能由 K 補。但如果四張 K 都已經在牌列堆最底層，空位就能放任意牌。"

msgid "Engines = 10"
msgstr "Engines = 10"

msgid "England = 1003"
msgstr "England = 1003"

msgid "Enhancements"
msgstr "改進"

msgid "Enhancements and Feature Requests"
msgstr "改進與功能需求"

msgid "Enhancements to many images and graphical displays."
msgstr "改進大量圖片與圖形顯示。"

msgid "Enhancements to the tree select dialogs for selecting games, cardsets, and table tiles."
msgstr "改進選擇遊戲、牌組與桌面圖案的樹狀選取對話框。"

msgid "Epic: 8 columns"
msgstr "史詩級：8 列"

msgid "Eularia - August"
msgstr "尤拉莉亞 - 八月"

msgid "Everyone is permitted to copy and distribute verbatim copies of this license document, but changing it is not allowed."
msgstr "每個人都可以複製並散布本授權條款的逐字副本，但不准修改。"

msgid "Exactly like"
msgstr "完全比照"

msgid "Express is a three deck variant of"
msgstr "快車（Express）是三副牌版的"

msgid "Extremely easy."
msgstr "非常容易。"

msgid "F-Droid"
msgstr "F-Droid"

msgid "FACE CARD"
msgstr "人頭牌"

msgid "FOOL"
msgstr "愚者"

msgid "FOUNDATION"
msgstr "王牌區"

msgid "Face cards played in the grid separate the different sequences, similar to how the black spaces separate words in an actual crossword puzzle. As such, when a face card is played, it is flipped face down. Two face cards cannot be played directly adjacent to each other horizontally or vertically (though them touching diagonally is allowed)."
msgstr "格陣中的人頭牌用來隔開不同的順子，就像真的填字遊戲裡的黑色空格隔開字一樣。因此人頭牌放上後會翻成面朝下。兩張人頭牌不能水平或垂直緊貼（斜角相接則允許）。"

msgid "Fair Lucy"
msgstr "麗人露西"

msgid "Families is played with eight sets of Jack, Queen, and King - two of each suit, along with six black jokers and two red jokers. All of the cards are dealt face-down."
msgstr "家族（Families）用八組 J、Q、K 來玩——每個花色兩組，另有六張黑色鬼牌與兩張紅色鬼牌。所有牌都反面發出。"

msgid "Fan Fifteen"
msgstr "扇形十五"

msgid "Fan game type. 1 deck. 6 redeals."
msgstr "扇形遊戲類型。1 副牌。6 次循環發牌。"

msgid "Fan type. 1 deck. No redeal."
msgstr "扇形類型。1 副牌。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Fan type. 1 deck. No redeals."
msgstr "扇形類型。1 副牌。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Fan type. 2 decks. 2 redeals."
msgstr "扇形類型。2 副牌。2 次循環發牌。"

msgid "Fan type. 2 decks. No redeals."
msgstr "扇形類型。2 副牌。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Fantasy = 11"
msgstr "Fantasy = 11"

msgid "Fastness"
msgstr "要塞"

msgid "Father Time"
msgstr "時間之父"

msgid "Fatimeh's Game Relaxed"
msgstr "寬鬆法蒂梅的遊戲"

msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能"

msgid "Felix Bellaby &lt;felix@pooh.u-net.com&gt;"
msgstr "Felix Bellaby &lt;felix@pooh.u-net.com&gt;"

msgid "Fifteen Puzzle"
msgstr "十五推盤"

msgid "Fifteen Puzzle Cell"
msgstr "十五推盤空格"

msgid "Fifteen cards are dealt to fifteen reserve piles, arranged in a triangle shape. Four foundations are built up by same suit from ace to king. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to empty reserve piles or foundations. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "十五張牌發到十五個預備堆，排成三角形。四個王牌區依同花色從 A 遞增疊放到 K。牌山每次發一張，可移到空的預備堆或王牌區。不准循環發牌。"

msgid "Fifty cards are dealt into ten piles of five cards. The remaining 54 cards are dealt to a reserve pile."
msgstr "發十堆每堆五張，共五十張。剩下的 54 張發到一個預備堆。"

msgid "Fill Byte stacks by matching the goal card's byte value, fill bit stacks by matching the corresponding bit value."
msgstr "位元組堆依目標牌的位元組值湊滿，位元堆依對應的位元值湊滿。"

msgid "Fill all row stacks."
msgstr "填滿所有橫排堆。"

msgid "Fill the entire Gallery with pictures."
msgstr "把畫廊全部填滿圖片。"

msgid "Finally there is one extra free cell that can hold any single card. But to move a card back from the free cell at least one of the two \"blocking\" reserve stacks must have been cleared."
msgstr "另外還有一個自由格，可以放任意一張單牌。但要把牌從自由格移出來，兩個「阻擋」預備堆至少要清空一個。"

msgid "Finally, a card of the same suit as the face card must be played to it to finish the attack."
msgstr "最後必須打上一張與那張人頭牌同花色的牌，才能完成攻擊。"

msgid "Finally, a single tile is placed on top. The next two tiles are placed on the bottom layer, in the middle of the two middle rows of 12 on the left and right to make points. A second tile is placed to the rightmost of these two files."
msgstr "最後在頂層放一塊牌塊。接著兩塊放在底層，位於左右兩側那兩排 12 塊的中間以取得分數。這兩列的最右端各再放一塊。"

msgid "Financier"
msgstr "金融家"

msgid "Find Card"
msgstr "尋找卡牌"

msgid "Finnish Solitaire"
msgstr "芬蘭接龍"

msgid "Fire and Ice was invented by David Bernazzani."
msgstr "冰與火（Fire and Ice）是大衛·貝納扎尼（David Bernazzani）發明的。"

msgid "Firecracker"
msgstr "鞭炮"

msgid "First Law"
msgstr "第一定律"

msgid "First card sets base cards"
msgstr "第一張牌決定基準牌"

msgid "First, all of the kings are set aside, with four additional cards. The kings are placed on top of these cards, face-down, forming a stack called the Bastille."
msgstr "先把所有 K 挑出來，另加四張牌。K 反面蓋在這四張牌上，堆成一疊，稱作巴士底獄（Bastille）。"

msgid "First, an ace and king of each suit must be moved to the foundations, with the aces on the left and kings on the right, and cards of the same suit next to each other. Once an ace and king of each suit is in the foundation, the piles can be built further, with the ace piles built up by same suit to king and the king piles built down by same suit to ace. A card can only be moved to the foundation pile next to it, though corner cards can be moved to any foundation."
msgstr "先把每個花色的 A 與 K 移到王牌區，A 放左邊、K 放右邊，同花色的兩堆要相鄰。各花色的 A 與 K 都進王牌區後才能繼續疊：A 堆依同花色遞增疊到 K，K 堆依同花色遞減疊到 A。牌只能移到相鄰的王牌堆，但四角的牌可以移到任何王牌區。"

msgid "First, set up the bottom layer of tiles. There are eight rows of tiles, containing 12, 8, 10, 12, 12, 10, 8, and 12 tiles in them, from top to bottom, aligned to the center."
msgstr "先排底層的牌塊。共八排，由上到下分別是 12、8、10、12、12、10、8、12 塊，且都對齊中央。"

msgid "Fission was invented by Albert Morehead and Geoffrey Mott-Smith during the atomic age. The concept is based around splitting card stacks like a scientist would split atoms."
msgstr "分裂（Fission）是阿爾伯特·莫里黑德與傑弗里·莫特-史密斯在原子時代發明的。概念是把牌堆像科學家分裂原子那樣拆開。"

msgid "Five Piles"
msgstr "五堆"

msgid "Five cards are dealt into each of four tableau piles, located in the corners of the play area. The eight aces are dealt to eight foundations, each located on the edges of the play area. The tableau piles are built down by same suit. Cards can be dealt from the talon (placed in the middle of the play area) one at a time, and can be moved to the tableau or foundations. Three redeals are allowed."
msgstr "四個牌列堆各位於遊戲區角落，各發五張。八張 A 發到八個王牌區，王牌區都在遊戲區邊緣。牌列堆依同花色遞減疊放。中央的牌山每次發一張，可移到牌列或王牌區。允許循環發牌 3 次。"

msgid "Five cards are dealt to each of nine tableau piles. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit, and only single cards can be moved between tableau piles. Only kings can fill empty tableau piles."
msgstr "九個牌列堆各發五張。牌列堆依點數遞減疊放、不計花色，堆之間只能移動單張牌。空的牌列堆只能放 K。"

msgid "Five cards are dealt to each of ten tableau piles, with the leftmost and rightmost piles receiving an extra card. Any card or sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles, building down by rank, regardless of suit."
msgstr "十個牌列堆各發五張，最左與最右那兩堆多發一張。任意牌或順子都能在牌列堆之間移動，依點數遞減疊放、不計花色。"

msgid "Five cards are dealt to each of ten tableau piles. In the first pile, all cards are face-up. The bottom card of the second pile is face-down, and each pile has one more face-down card up to the fifth. The remaining piles follow the pattern in reverse. The last two cards are dealt to two free cells."
msgstr "十個牌列堆各發五張。第一堆全部正面朝上；第二堆最底那張反面朝下，之後每堆多一張反面，到第五堆為止。其餘各堆反過來依同樣規律排列。最後兩張發到兩個自由格。"

msgid "Five cards are dealt to each of two reserve piles, called the \"gate-posts\". A single card is dealt to each of eight tableau piles, called the \"rails\". The rails/tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any card or valid sequence can be moved between them. Cards from the gate-posts can also be moved to the tableau or foundations."
msgstr "兩個預備堆各發五張，稱作「門柱」。八個牌列堆各發一張，稱作「軌道」。軌道（牌列堆）依紅黑交替遞減疊放，任意牌或合法順子都能在它們之間移動。門柱的牌也可移到牌列或王牌區。"

msgid "Five cards are dealt to the tableau, in a cross shape. The four foundations are in the corners of the tableau. A single card is dealt to one of the foundations - this is the base rank for the foundations for this game."
msgstr "五張牌發到牌列，排成十字形。四個王牌區位於牌列四角。其中一個王牌區會先發一張牌，那就是本局王牌區的基準點數。"

msgid "Fix for"
msgstr "修正"

msgid "Fix moving cards in the Scorpion Tail game."
msgstr "修正蠍子尾（Scorpion Tail）移動卡牌的問題。"

msgid "Fixed"
msgstr "已修正"

msgid "Fixed Hanafuda games ("
msgstr "已修正花札遊戲（"

msgid "Fixed the help system and removed the need for the sgmllib module."
msgstr "修正說明系統，並不再需要 sgmllib 模組。"

msgid "Fixes for the Windows and macOS packages."
msgstr "修正 Windows 與 macOS 套件。"

msgid "Fixes for the board export / solver input, and for redealing upon restart of the \"ms*\" deals."
msgstr "修正局面匯出／解題器輸入，以及重開 \"ms*\" 牌局時的循環發牌問題。"

msgid "Flathub"
msgstr "Flathub"

msgid "Flip all cards face-down."
msgstr "把所有牌翻成面朝下。"

msgid "Flip all of the cards in sequence from ace to king, and get a score of 75 or more."
msgstr "依從 A 到 K 的順序把所有牌翻開，並得到 75 點以上的分數。"

msgid "Flip all pairs of matching cards and get a score of 30 points or more."
msgstr "翻開所有成對的相同牌，得到 30 點以上的分數。"

msgid "Flip all pairs of matching cards and get a score of 40 points or more."
msgstr "翻開所有成對的相同牌，得到 40 點以上的分數。"

msgid "Flip all pairs of matching cards and get a score of 45 points or more."
msgstr "翻開所有成對的相同牌，得到 45 點以上的分數。"

msgid "Flip any 2 cards that match in rank."
msgstr "翻開任意兩張點數相同的牌。"

msgid "Flip three cards. If you flip a sequence of Jack, Queen, and King of the same suit, the cards are removed. If not, they are flipped face-down again."
msgstr "翻三張牌。若翻出同花色的 J、Q、K 順子，就把它們移除；否則再翻回面朝下。"

msgid "Folders for saved games, options, and statistics"
msgstr "存放存檔、選項與統計資料的資料夾"

msgid "Following the initial deal, the tableau piles are built up or down by rank, regardless of suit. Only single cards can be moved between tableau piles, and any card can fill empty piles. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "開局發牌之後，牌列堆可依點數遞增或遞減疊放、不計花色。牌列堆之間只能移動單張牌，空列可用任意牌補。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "For Mahjongg, $A must always be 6 or 7 and the $F field must be included in the line; however, you can put"
msgstr "麻將類的 $A 一定要是 6 或 7，$F 欄位也必須出現在這一行裡；不過你可以把"

msgid "For More Information"
msgstr "更多資訊"

msgid "For a given number of cards, the minimum number of moves to solve the puzzle is one less than two to a power of the number of cards (2^n - 1)."
msgstr "對固定的牌數而言，解開此謎題所需的最少步數是 2 的牌數次方減 1（2^n - 1）。"

msgid "For a variation that allows unlimited redeals (often seen in other solitaire apps), see"
msgstr "想看可無限循環發牌的版本（其他接龍 app 常見），請參照"

msgid "For each of the first four cards played from the tableau in a sequence one point is added."
msgstr "從牌列依序打出的前四張，每張加 1 分。"

msgid "For each of the second four cards played from the tableau in a sequence two points are added."
msgstr "接著的四張依序打出，每張加 2 分。"

msgid "For each rank you complete, (that is, having one card of each value) you get an extra chance at going through the talon. You are permitted to move cards from one pile to another, as long as you still follow the rules. The first time you go through the talon, the cards are given two at a time. The second time, it is three cards, and so on up to twelve. If there are not enough cards to deal the full required amount, the cards from previous deals are flipped immediately and used to deal the remaining cards. If by that time you have completed any ranks, your bonus runs start at eleven, then ten, and so on."
msgstr "每完成一個點數（也就是每個點數都各湊到一張），就多一次走牌山的機會。只要仍合乎規則，你可以在牌堆之間移牌。第一次走牌山每次發兩張，第二次三張，依此數到十二張為止。若剩下的牌不夠發滿要求的張數，就立刻把之前發過的牌翻回來，用它補發剩下的牌。如果那時你已經完成若干點數，多出來的輪次就從十一張開始，接著十張，依此類推。"

msgid "For more info about black-hole-solve:"
msgstr "black-hole-solve 的更多資訊："

msgid "For more info about fc-solve:"
msgstr "fc-solve 的更多資訊："

msgid "For more information, see:"
msgstr "更多資訊請見："

msgid "Forbid illegal moves in Spider and some other variants."
msgstr "在蜘蛛與部分其他變體中禁止違規移動。"

msgid "Formic"
msgstr "蟻族"

msgid "Fortune's Favor is named because the odds of winning are strongly in the player's favor. It is a variation on the game"
msgstr "命運垂青（Fortune's Favor）得名於玩家的贏面大好。它是下列玩法的變化版"

msgid "Forty Bandits"
msgstr "四十盜匪"

msgid "Forty Thieves type. 1 deck. 1 redeal."
msgstr "四十賊類型。1 副牌。1 次循環發牌。"

msgid "Forty Thieves type. 2 decks. 2 redeals."
msgstr "四十賊類型。2 副牌。2 次循環發牌。"

msgid "Forty Thieves type. 2 decks. One redeal."
msgstr "四十賊類型。2 副牌。1 次循環發牌。"

msgid "Forty Thieves type. 2 decks. Unlimited redeals."
msgstr "四十賊類型。2 副牌。無限循環發牌。"

msgid "Forty Thieves type. 3 decks. Unlimited redeals."
msgstr "四十賊類型。3 副牌。無限循環發牌。"

msgid "Forty Thieves type. 4 stripped decks. No redeal."
msgstr "四十賊類型。4 副精簡牌組。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Forty cards are dealt to 10 piles. These piles are built down in suit. Only the top card of a pile is available for playing, and spaces can be filled by any card."
msgstr "四十張牌發到 10 堆，各堆依花色遞減疊放。每堆只有最上面那張可以使用，空列可用任意牌補。"

msgid "Forty cards are dealt to the tableau in ten piles of four cards each, all face-up. Tableau piles are built down by same suit, and any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles. Empty tableau piles can be be filled by card or sequence."
msgstr "四十張牌發到牌列，十堆每堆四張，全部正面朝上。牌列堆依同花色遞減疊放，任意牌或合法順子都能在堆之間移動。空的牌列堆可用單張牌或順子補。"

msgid "Forty points are added for emptying the last peak."
msgstr "清空最後一座峰加 40 分。"

msgid "Forty thieves game type. 2 decks. No redeal."
msgstr "四十賊遊戲類型。2 副牌。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Forum discussion"
msgstr "論壇討論"

msgid "Foundation piles are built up by rank regardless of suit from ace to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依點數從 A 遞增疊放到 K、不計花色。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundation piles are built up by suit from ace to king. The game is won when all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依花色從 A 遞增疊放到 K。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundation piles are built up by suit in the same manner."
msgstr "王牌區同樣依花色遞增疊放。"

msgid "Foundation piles are built up in suit from Ace to King. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依花色從 A 遞增疊放到 K。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundation piles are to be built in suit from Ace to King, followed by another King, then back down to Ace, giving 26 cards per pile when game is won. Cards in foundation piles are no longer in play."
msgstr "王牌區依花色從 A 疊到 K，再放一張 K，然後遞減回到 A，獲勝時每堆共 26 張。移入王牌區的牌不再參與遊戲。"

msgid "Foundation piles are to be built in suit, first up from seven to king, then an ace is played on the king, and it is built back down from king to seven, with the other ace placed on top to finish the pile. So they are ultimately built in the order 7-8-9-10-J-Q-K-A-K-Q-J-10-9-8-7-A."
msgstr "王牌區要先依花色從 7 疊到 K，再在 K 上放一張 A，然後從 K 倒疊回 7，最後把另一張 A 蓋在上面完成該堆。所以整堆的順序是 7-8-9-10-J-Q-K-A-K-Q-J-10-9-8-7-A。"

msgid "Foundations are built up by rank, regardless of suit, starting with the ace."
msgstr "王牌區從 A 開始依點數遞增疊放、不計花色。"

msgid "Foundations are built up by same suit, and the game is won when all cards are moved to the foundation."
msgstr "王牌區依同花色遞增疊放，所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundations are built up by same suit, by every other rank, wrapping in the same manner as necessary."
msgstr "王牌區依同花色、每次遞增跳一級疊放，必要時以同樣方式循環。"

msgid "Foundations are built up by same suit. Once all 13 cards are moved to a tableau or foundation pile, 13 more cards are dealt from the stock."
msgstr "王牌區依同花色遞增疊放。13 張牌全部移到牌列或王牌區後，會再從牌山發 13 張。"

msgid "Foundations are built up by same suit. The game is won when all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依同花色遞增疊放。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundations are built up by suit from ace to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依花色從 A 遞增疊放到 K。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundations are built up by suit from ace to queen. An additional foundation, placed below the talon, accepts the kings. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依花色從 A 遞增疊放到 Q。牌山下方另有一個王牌區專門收 K。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundations are built up by suit, from ace to king. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依花色從 A 遞增疊放到 K。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundations are built up by suit, starting from ace."
msgstr "王牌區從 A 開始依花色遞增疊放。"

msgid "Foundations are built up by suit, starting from aces. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區從 A 開始依花色遞增疊放。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundations are built up by suit, starting with aces. The game is won if all cards are moved to foundations."
msgstr "王牌區從 A 開始依花色遞增疊放。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundations are built up by suit. The game is won when all cards are moved to the foundation."
msgstr "王牌區依花色遞增疊放。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundations are built up by the same suit. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依同花色遞增疊放。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundations are built up from Ace to King, regardless of suit. One must move an entire Ace-to-King sequence to a foundation as one move."
msgstr "王牌區從 A 遞增疊到 K、不計花色。必須把 A 到 K 的整組順子一次移入王牌區。"

msgid "Foundations are built up from ace to king by same suit. The game is won when all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依同花色從 A 遞增疊放到 K。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundations are built up from ace to king, regardless of suit. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區從 A 遞增疊放到 K、不計花色。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundations are built up in suit from Ace to King. Cards in foundations are no longer in play. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依花色從 A 遞增疊放到 K。移入王牌區的牌不再參與遊戲。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundations are built up in suit from Ace to King. Cards in the Foundations are no longer available for play in the Tableau. It is not compulsory to play any card to the Foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依花色從 A 遞增疊放到 K。進入王牌區的牌就不能再用於牌列。不強制一定要把牌打到王牌區。"

msgid "Foundations are built up in suit from Ace to King. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依花色從 A 遞增疊放到 K。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundations are built up in suit from the base card. New Foundations are started when a card of the same rank as the first card placed during the dealing period are placed on empty Foundation piles. Aces are placed on Kings, and twos on Aces. Cards in Foundations are still in play. Double clicking on a card will move it to the appropriate Foundation pile if such a move is possible."
msgstr "王牌區從基準牌開始依花色遞增疊放。把與發牌階段第一張同點數的牌放到空的王牌區，就等於開新的王牌區。A 可以放在 K 上、2 可以放在 A 上。進入王牌區的牌仍然可以參與遊戲。雙擊某張牌，若有合法移動就會自動移到適合的王牌區。"

msgid "Foundations are built up or down by same suit, starting with the rank initially dealt there, turning the corner as needed. All four foundations must be built in the same direction, which is determined by which card is moved to a foundation first. THe game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "王牌區依同花色從初始發入的點數開始，可遞增也可遞減，必要時從 K 轉回 A。四個王牌區必須採相同方向，而方向取決於哪張牌先進王牌區。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Foundations must be started in sequence, starting with the leftmost column and moving right. Within each column, the topmost row must be started first, and moving down."
msgstr "王牌區必須依序開頭，從最左一列往右；同一列之中要先開最上面那排，再往下。"

msgid "Four Color = 37"
msgstr "Four Color = 37"

msgid "Four Corners"
msgstr "四角"

msgid "Four Free"
msgstr "四自由格"

msgid "Four Kingdoms was invented by David Bernazzani. It was designed to try and reclaim some of the original historical feel for the cards."
msgstr "四國（Four Kingdoms）是大衛·貝納扎尼發明的，設計目的是找回紙牌原本的一些歷史風味。"

msgid "Four Rivers"
msgstr "四河"

msgid "Four Rivers (No Gravity) 14x6"
msgstr "四河（無重力）14x6"

msgid "Four Rivers (No Gravity) 18x8"
msgstr "四河（無重力）18x8"

msgid "Four Rivers (No Gravity) 24x12"
msgstr "四河（無重力）24x12"

msgid "Four Rivers 14x6"
msgstr "四河 14x6"

msgid "Four Rivers 18x8"
msgstr "四河 18x8"

msgid "Four Rivers 24x12"
msgstr "四河 24x12"

msgid "Four Rivers is a variation of"
msgstr "四河是下列玩法的變化版"

msgid "Four adjacent tiles: 8 points"
msgstr "四塊相鄰：8 分"

msgid "Four cards are dealt to each of 26 tableau piles. Tableau piles are built down by suit, and any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles. Empty tableau piles cannot be filled."
msgstr "26 個牌列堆各發四張。牌列堆依花色遞減疊放，任意牌或合法順子都能在堆之間移動。空的牌列堆不能補牌。"

msgid "Four cards are dealt to each of ten tableau piles. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color. Only single cards can be moved between tableau piles, and any single card can fill an empty pile. An additional six cards are dealt to a reserve, with only the top card face-up. These reserve cards can only be moved to the foundations."
msgstr "十個牌列堆各發四張，依紅黑交替遞減疊放。堆之間只能移動單張牌，空列可放任意單張。另有六張發到預備堆，只有最上面那張正面朝上。預備堆的牌只能移到王牌區。"

msgid "Four cards are dealt to each of twelve tableau piles, with alternating cards face-up and face-down (the bottom and third from the bottom cards are face-down). Tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles. Only kings or sequences of cards starting with them can fill empty piles."
msgstr "十二個牌列堆各發四張，正反面交錯（最底層與由下第三張反面朝下）。牌列堆依紅黑交替遞減疊放，任意牌或合法順子都能在堆之間移動。空列只能放 K，或以 K 開頭的順子。"

msgid "Four cards are dealt to four tableau piles, and 13 cards are dealt to a reserve. The aces are dealt to four foundation piles."
msgstr "四張牌發到四個牌列堆，13 張發到一個預備堆。A 則發到四個王牌區。"

msgid "Four cards are dealt to four tableau piles. Build the tableau piles down in rank, regardless of suit. Single cards may be moved between tableau piles. Empty spaces in the tableau can only be filled from the waste pile."
msgstr "四張牌發到四個牌列堆。牌列堆依點數遞減疊放、不計花色，堆之間只能移動單張牌。牌列的空位只能由棄牌堆補。"

msgid "Four cards are dealt to four tableau piles. If two of these cards are of the same suit, they can be discarded and two new cards are dealt from the stock to fill it."
msgstr "四張牌發到四個牌列堆。其中有兩張同花色時，可以把它們棄掉，並從牌山補發兩張新的。"

msgid "Four cards are dealt to four tableau piles. If two of these cards are of the same suit, they can be discarded. At any point, four additional cards can be dealt from the stock to these four piles."
msgstr "四張牌發到四個牌列堆。其中有兩張同花色時可以棄掉。任何時候都能從牌山再發四張到這四個牌列堆。"

msgid "Four cards are dealt to reserves from the talon at the start of the game. Cards from the reserves may be moved to foundations."
msgstr "開局時從牌山發四張到預備堆。預備堆的牌可以移到王牌區。"

msgid "Four different kinds in a STANDARD DECK. Usually Clubs, Spades, Hearts, and Diamonds."
msgstr "標準牌組裡的四種花色，通常是梅花、黑桃、紅心與方塊。"

msgid "Four foundations are dealt in a square, with an ace dealt to each. The foundations are built up by same color from ace to king."
msgstr "四個王牌區排成正方形，各放一張 A。王牌區依同色從 A 遞增疊放到 K。"

msgid "Four tableau stacks of 13 cards each are dealt. The queens are placed at the bottom of these stacks, and a single face-down card is dealt on top of the queens. The remaining cards are dealt face-up."
msgstr "四個牌列堆各 13 張。Q 放在各堆最底層，Q 上面再蓋一張反面牌。剩下的牌都正面朝上發出。"

msgid "Four-Deck game type. 4 decks. No redeal."
msgstr "四副牌遊戲類型。4 副牌。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Fourteen Out"
msgstr "十四消除"

msgid "Fourteen Puzzle"
msgstr "十四推盤"

msgid "Foxfire 13"
msgstr "狐火 13"

msgid "France = 1004"
msgstr "France = 1004"

msgid "Fred's Spider is a Spider variant invented by Fred Lunde."
msgstr "弗雷德蜘蛛（Fred's Spider）是弗雷德·倫德（Fred Lunde）發明的蜘蛛變體。"

msgid "Free Software Foundation, Inc."
msgstr "自由軟體基金會"

msgid "FreeCell is played with one deck. All cards are dealt at the start of the game - in four piles of seven cards and four piles of six, all dealt face-up. To compensate for this there are 4 free cells which can hold any - and just one - card."
msgstr "FreeCell 使用一副牌。開局就把所有牌發完——四堆七張、四堆六張，全部正面朝上。為彌補這一點，另有 4 個自由格，每格只能放任意的一張牌。"

msgid "FreeCell type"
msgstr "FreeCell 類型"

msgid "FreeCell type game"
msgstr "FreeCell 類型遊戲"

msgid "FreeCell type. 1 joker deck. No redeal."
msgstr "FreeCell 類型。1 副含鬼牌的牌組。不循環發牌。"

msgid "FreeCell type. One Dashavatara Ganjifa Deck. No redeal."
msgstr "FreeCell 類型。1 副達薩瓦塔拉甘吉發牌組。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Freezes"
msgstr "卡死"

msgid "French = 1"
msgstr "French = 1"

msgid "From John Stoneham, Sanibel's inventor:"
msgstr "以下是桑尼貝（Sanibel）的發明人約翰·史東漢（John Stoneham）所寫："

msgid "Funnel"
msgstr "漏斗"

msgid "Further additions/improvements to the"
msgstr "進一步新增與改進"

msgid "Furthermore, note that we believe that many anti-malware applications are harmful by themselves, and that they are all an incomplete (non-)solution to an issue that does not exist in"
msgstr "此外要注意的是，我們認為許多反惡意程式軟體本身就有危害，而它們對一個其實並不存在的問題，都只是不完整的解法（甚至根本不是解法），該問題並不存在於"

msgid "GANJIFA DECK"
msgstr "甘吉發牌組"

msgid "GNU GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE"
msgstr "GNU 通用公共授權條款"

msgid "GNU GPL"
msgstr "GNU GPL"

msgid "Galen Brooks"
msgstr "Galen Brooks"

msgid "Game Rules"
msgstr "遊戲規則"

msgid "Game contributors are"
msgstr "遊戲貢獻者如下："

msgid "Game numbers in the range 1 to 32000 are compatible to the ones in the"
msgstr "1 到 32000 的遊戲編號，與下列出處所列的編號相容："

msgid "Game play is like 8 x 8. The rows build down in rank in alternate color. The Wizards will play in their proper rank position on the tableau as the alternate of either red or black. Any card or sequence may be played on an empty row. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "玩法類似 8 x 8。各行依紅黑交替按點數遞減疊放。法師在牌列上依本身點數放置，顏色為紅或黑的相反色。空行可放任意牌或順子。牌山每次發一張。也可以把牌從王牌區移回。"

msgid "Game play is like Baker's Dozen. The rows build down in rank in alternate color. The Wizards will play in their proper rank position on the tableau as the alternate of either red or black. Any card or sequence may be played on an empty row. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "玩法類似貝克一打（Baker's Dozen）。各行依紅黑交替按點數遞減疊放。法師在牌列上依本身點數放置，顏色為紅或黑的相反色。空行可放任意牌或順子。也可以把牌從王牌區移回。"

msgid "Game play is like Blind Alleys. The rows build down in rank in alternate color. Any card or sequence may be played on an empty row. The Wizards will play in their proper rank position on the tableau as the alternate of either red or black. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time. The four suit Aces are dealt to the foundations at the start of the game. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "玩法類似死巷（Blind Alleys）。各行依紅黑交替按點數遞減疊放。空行可放任意牌或順子。法師在牌列上依本身點數放置，顏色為紅或黑的相反色。牌山每次發一張。開局時四個花色的 A 會先發到王牌區。也可以把牌從王牌區移回。"

msgid "Game play is like Braid. In the Hex A Deck variation the Wizards don't have their own foundations. There are two reserve stacks to the left of the foundations that will hold up to three Wizards each. The game is won when all the suit cards have been moved to the foundations."
msgstr "玩法類似辮子（Braid）。在六角牌（Hex A Deck）變體中，法師沒有自己的王牌區。王牌區左側有兩個預備堆，各可容納最多三張法師。所有花色牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Game play is like Braid. In this variation there are two Braid stacks that each have their own set of Braid reserve stacks. The game lay out starts with the eight foundations in the outer most columns. The next two columns inwards are the eight Braid reserves. Then there are two columns with four general reserves each. The inner most two columns are the two Braid stacks. Each Braid starts with twelve cards. When one of the Braid reserves becomes open the card at the top of the corresponding Braid will be moved there. When all the cards from one of the Braids are removed a card from the other Braid will be used."
msgstr "玩法類似辮子（Braid）。這個變體有兩個辮子堆，各自都有一組辮子預備堆。版面最外側兩列是八個王牌區，往內兩列是八個辮子預備堆，再往內兩列各是四個一般預備堆，最內側兩列就是兩個辮子堆。每個辮子先以十二張牌開始。其中一個辮子預備堆空出來時，對應辮子最上面那張會移到該處。某個辮子的牌全部移完後，會改用另一個辮子的牌。"

msgid "Game play is like Braid. In this variation there are two Braid stacks that each have their own set of Braid reserve stacks. The game lay out starts with the sixteen foundations in the outer most columns. The next two columns inwards are the eight Braid reserves. Then there are two columns with four general reserves each. The inner most two columns are the two Braid stacks. Each Braid starts with sixteen cards. When one of the Braid reserves becomes open the card at the top of the corresponding Braid will be moved there. When all the cards from one of the Braids are removed a card from the other Braid will be used."
msgstr "玩法類似辮子（Braid）。這個變體有兩個辮子堆，各自都有一組辮子預備堆。版面最外側兩列是十六個王牌區，往內兩列是八個辮子預備堆，再往內兩列各是四個一般預備堆，最內側兩列就是兩個辮子堆。每個辮子先以十六張牌開始。其中一個辮子預備堆空出來時，對應辮子最上面那張會移到該處。某個辮子的牌全部移完後，會改用另一個辮子的牌。"

msgid "Game play is like Braid. In this variation there are two Braid stacks that each have their own set of Braid reserve stacks. The game lay out starts with the ten foundations in the outer most columns. The next two columns inwards are the ten Braid reserves. Then there are two columns with five general reserves each. The inner most two columns are the two Braid stacks. Each Braid starts with fifteen cards. When one of the Braid reserves becomes open the card at the top of the corresponding Braid will be moved there. When all the cards from one of the Braids are removed a card from the other Braid will be used."
msgstr "玩法類似辮子（Braid）。這個變體有兩個辮子堆，各自都有一組辮子預備堆。版面最外側兩列是十個王牌區，往內兩列是十個辮子預備堆，再往內兩列各是五個一般預備堆，最內側兩列就是兩個辮子堆。每個辮子先以十五張牌開始。其中一個辮子預備堆空出來時，對應辮子最上面那張會移到該處。某個辮子的牌全部移完後，會改用另一個辮子的牌。"

msgid "Game play is like Braid. In this variation there are two Braid stacks that each have their own set of Braid reserve stacks. The game lay out starts with the twenty foundations in the outer most columns. The next two columns inwards are the ten Braid reserves. Then there are two columns with five general reserves each. The inner most two columns are the two Braid stacks. Each Braid starts with twenty cards. When one of the Braid reserves becomes open the card at the top of the corresponding Braid will be moved there. When all the cards from one of the Braids are removed a card from the other Braid will be used."
msgstr "玩法類似辮子（Braid）。這個變體有兩個辮子堆，各自都有一組辮子預備堆。版面最外側兩列是二十個王牌區，往內兩列是十個辮子預備堆，再往內兩列各是五個一般預備堆，最內側兩列就是兩個辮子堆。每個辮子先以二十張牌開始。其中一個辮子預備堆空出來時，對應辮子最上面那張會移到該處。某個辮子的牌全部移完後，會改用另一個辮子的牌。"

msgid "Game play is like Klondike with the Wizards being wild. They can be played on the tableau as any rank or color. Once a Wizard is played on a row however that row may become unmovable. If a Wizard is played in it's proper rank position the row can still be moved. A stack with two Wizards can be moved only if they are both in their rank position and they are not adjacent to each other. The Wizards will not move off of the tableau until all the other cards have been moved to the foundations. Cards are dealt from the talon three at a time. Any card or sequence may be played on the canvas. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "玩法類似克朗代克，但法師可當萬用牌。它們在牌列上能以任何點數、任何顏色放置。一旦把法師放到某一行，該行可能就動不了了；但若法師擺在它本身的點數位置，該行仍可移動。同時有兩張法師的牌堆，只有兩張都在自己的點數位置、而且彼此不相鄰時才能移動。在其他牌都移到王牌區之前，法師不會離開牌列。牌山每次發三張。任意牌或順子都能放到王牌區。也可以把牌從王牌區移回。"

msgid "Game play is like Klondike with the Wizards being wild. They can be played on the tableau as any rank or color. Once a Wizard is played on a row however that row may become unmovable. If a Wizard is played in it's proper rank position the row can still be moved. A stack with two Wizards can be moved only if they are both in their rank position and they are not adjacent to each other. The Wizards will not move off of the tableau until all the other cards have been moved to the foundations. Only Kings may be played on the canvas. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "玩法類似克朗代克，但法師可當萬用牌。它們在牌列上能以任何點數、任何顏色放置。一旦把法師放到某一行，該行可能就動不了了；但若法師擺在它本身的點數位置，該行仍可移動。同時有兩張法師的牌堆，只有兩張都在自己的點數位置、而且彼此不相鄰時才能移動。在其他牌都移到王牌區之前，法師不會離開牌列。只有 K 能放到王牌區。也可以把牌從王牌區移回。"

msgid "Game play is like Klondike with the Wizards being wild. They can be played on the tableau as any rank or color. Once a Wizard is played on a row however that row may become unmovable. The Wizards have ranks like the suit cards corresponding to Ace through Four. If a Wizard is played in it's proper rank position the row can still be moved. The rank can be determined by the height of the hat. The Ace Wizard has the tallest hat. A stack with two Wizards can be moved only if they are both in their rank position and they are not adjacent to each other. The Wizards will not move off of the tableau until all the other cards have been moved to the foundations."
msgstr "玩法類似克朗代克，但法師可當萬用牌。它們在牌列上能以任何點數、任何顏色放置。一旦把法師放到某一行，該行可能就動不了了。法師和花色牌一樣有點數，對應 A 到 4。若法師擺在本身的點數位置，該行仍可移動。點數高低可由帽子的高度判斷，戴最高帽子的就是 A 法師。同時有兩張法師的牌堆，只有兩張都在自己的點數位置、而且彼此不相鄰時才能移動。在其他牌都移到王牌區之前，法師不會離開牌列。"

msgid "Game play is like Klondike with the Wizards being wild. They can be played on the tableau as any rank or color. Once a Wizard is played on a row however that row may become unmovable. The Wizards have ranks like the suit cards corresponding to Ace through four. If a Wizard is played in it's proper rank position the row can still be moved. The rank can be determined comparing some distinctive element of the images. The first rank Wizard will be the most elaborate in some way such as the fattest, the tallest hat etc. A stack with two Wizards can be moved only if they are both in their rank position and they are not adjacent to each other. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time. Only Kings may be played on an empty row. The Wizards may be played to the foundation at any time in their proper rank order. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "玩法類似克朗代克，但法師可當萬用牌。它們在牌列上能以任何點數、任何顏色放置。一旦把法師放到某一行，該行可能就動不了了。法師和花色牌一樣有點數，對應 A 到 4。若法師擺在本身的點數位置，該行仍可移動。點數可從圖案的某個特徵分辨：第一點的法師必定制工最講究，例如最胖、帽子最高等。同時有兩張法師的牌堆，只有兩張都在自己的點數位置、而且彼此不相鄰時才能移動。牌山每次發一張。空行只能放 K。法師隨時都能依本身的點數順序打進王牌區。也可以把牌從王牌區移回。"

msgid "Game play is like Klondike. The rows build down in rank in alternate color. Any card or sequence may be played on an empty row. The Wizards will play in their proper rank position on the tableau as the alternate of either red or black. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "玩法類似克朗代克。各行依紅黑交替按點數遞減疊放。空行可放任意牌或順子。法師在牌列上依本身點數放置，顏色為紅或黑的相反色。牌山每次發一張。也可以把牌從王牌區移回。"

msgid "Game play is like Klondike. The rows build down in rank in alternate color. Any card or sequence may be played on an empty row. The Wizards will play in their proper rank position on the tableau regardless of color. While two or more Wizards will play on top of each other, the stack must still be of alternating colors to be a movable sequence. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time. There is no redeal. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "玩法類似克朗代克。各行依紅黑交替按點數遞減疊放。空行可放任意牌或順子。法師在牌列上依本身點數放置，不計顏色。兩張以上的法師可以疊在一起，但整堆仍必須紅黑交替才算可移動的順子。牌山每次發一張。不循環發牌。也可以把牌從王牌區移回。"

msgid "Game play is like Klondike. The rows build down in rank in alternate color. The color of the Wizards is the alternate of either red or black. Only the Tens (top rank cards) may be played on an empty row. There is one reserve stack that will hold up to three Wizards. No suit cards can be played there. The Wizards will also play in their proper rank position on the tableau. They play as the alternate of either red or black. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time. Cards may be played from the foundations."
msgstr "玩法類似克朗代克。各行依紅黑交替按點數遞減疊放。法師的顏色為紅或黑的相反色。空行只能放 10（點數最高的牌）。有一個預備堆最多可容納三張法師，花色牌不能放到那裡。法師在牌列上仍依本身點數放置，顏色為紅或黑的相反色。牌山每次發一張。也可以把牌從王牌區移回。"

msgid "Game play is like Yukon with the Wizards being wild. They can be played on the tableau as any rank or color. However, wizards can only be moved as individual cards, meaning any cards behind a wizard are blocked until the Wizard is moved. Wizards can be moved to a separate foundation at any time, in order by their rank. Wizards' ranks can be identified by the size of their hats, with the one with the tallest hat being the one, and the remaining wizards' ranks have increasingly smaller hats."
msgstr "玩法類似育空，但法師可當萬用牌。它們在牌列上能以任何點數、任何顏色放置。不過法師只能單張移動，也就是法師後面的牌會被擋住，直到那張法師移開為止。法師隨時都能依點數順序移到另一個專屬的王牌區。法師的點數可由帽子大小辨識：帽子最高的那張是 1，其餘法師的帽子一個比一個小。"

msgid "Gameplay is identical to"
msgstr "玩法完全比照"

msgid "Gameplay is similar except cards are not dealt to replace empty piles in the bottom row of the tableau. Additionally, if any empty spaces are left in the top three rows of the tableau, they must be filled immediately. If they cannot, no additional cards can be drawn from the stock until they are filled."
msgstr "玩法大致相同，只差在牌列最底排的空堆不補牌。此外，牌列最上面三排若有空位，必須立刻補滿；補不滿之前，不能再從牌山摸牌。"

msgid "Games contributors"
msgstr "遊戲貢獻者"

msgid "Ganjifa are playing cards from India and other nations in the region. Usually round, some rectangular decks have been produced. The most significant difference between Ganjifa and other types of cards is that Ganjifa cards have traditionally been individually hand painted. There are any where from eight to twelve or more suits per deck, each suit having usually twelve ranks. The two most common Ganjifa decks are the Mughal which has eight suits and the Dashavatara which has ten. The suits have pip cards numbered from Ace through ten and two court cards, the Wazir and the Mir. The order of the suits is: Matsya, Kuchha, Varaha, Narsingha, Vamana, Parashurama, Rama, Krishna, Buddha, and Kalanki. Ganjifa solitaire games play the same as games that use the standard deck but the larger number of different cards in a deck (96 or 120) adds an element of complexity. The fact that each suit has it's own color makes things quite interesting in games that use \"Alternate Color\" row stacks."
msgstr "甘吉發（Ganjifa）是印度及周邊地區的紙牌，通常是圓形，也有做成方形的牌組。甘吉發與其他紙牌最大的不同，在於歷來都是逐張手繪。一副牌的花色少則八種、多可十二種以上，每種花色通常有十二個點數。最常見的兩種甘吉發牌組，是八花色的莫臥兒（Mughal）與十花色的達薩瓦塔拉（Dashavatara）。每種花色有點數牌從 A 排到 10，另有瓦吉爾（Wazir）與米爾（Mir）兩張人頭牌。花色順序為：摩磋（Matsya）、庫恰（Kuchha）、瓦拉哈（Varaha）、那辛哈（Narsingha）、婆摩那（Vamana）、帕拉舒拉摩（Parashurama）、羅摩（Rama）、克里希那（Krishna）、佛陀（Buddha）、卡蘭基（Kalanki）。甘吉發接龍的玩法與使用標準牌組的遊戲相同，但一副牌的牌種更多（96 或 120 張），複雜度也隨之上昇。每個花色各有自己的顏色，這讓使用「紅黑交替」橫排堆的遊戲變得饒有趣味。"

msgid "Ganjifa= 30"
msgstr "Ganjifa= 30"

