msgstr "使用無障礙功能時，多半需要改用鍵盤操作。PySol 的遊戲也能完全只用鍵盤遊玩，指令如下："

msgid "German Clock (Die Uhr)"
msgstr "德國時鐘（Die Uhr）"

msgid "German Clock is more commonly known as The Clock. It is not to be confused with"
msgstr "德國時鐘通常叫作時鐘（The Clock）。別和下列玩法搞混："

msgid "Germany = 1006"
msgstr "Germany = 1006"

msgid "Getting a free row stack should be one of your highest priorities."
msgstr "設法取得一個空的橫排堆，應該是你最優先的目標之一。"

msgid "GitHub repository"
msgstr "GitHub 倉庫"

msgid "Giza is an open variation of Pyramid invented by Michael Keller."
msgstr "吉薩（Giza）是米高·凱勒（Michael Keller）發明的金字塔開放式變體。"

msgid "Glenwood"
msgstr "格倫伍德"

msgid "Golf type game. 1 deck. No redeal."
msgstr "高爾夫類型遊戲。1 副牌。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Golf type. 1 joker deck. No redeal."
msgstr "高爾夫類型。1 副含鬼牌的牌組。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Golf type. 2 decks. 1 redeal."
msgstr "高爾夫類型。2 副牌。1 次循環發牌。"

msgid "Golf type. 2 decks. Unlimited redeals."
msgstr "高爾夫類型。2 副牌。無限循環發牌。"

msgid "Good Thirteen"
msgstr "十三為妙"

msgid "Good for mindless playing as sooner or later every game should come out."
msgstr "適合不動腦地玩，因為早晚都會通關。"

msgid "Grampus"
msgstr "灰海豚"

msgid "Grandmother's Game is a complex strategic solitaire game which cannot be solved very often. A good way to get to a satisfactory solution is to establish at least one, better two or even more, free spaces to get room for moving the cards and fit them together to descending suits."
msgstr "奶奶的遊戲（Grandmother's Game）是一款複雜的策略接龍，不常能解開。想解得漂亮，最好先騰出至少一個、理想是兩個甚至更多空位，才有空間移動牌、把它們湊成同花色的遞減順子。"

msgid "Great Britain = 1014"
msgstr "Great Britain = 1014"

msgid "Group all cards on the tableau in sets of 13 cards in ascending sequence by suit from Ace to King. The first row in Club, the second in Spade, the third in Heart and the last in Diamond."
msgstr "把牌列上所有牌整理成 13 張一組、依花色從 A 遞增排到 K。第一排梅花、第二排黑桃、第三排紅心、最後一排方塊。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 12 cards in ascending sequence by suit from Ace to King."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成 12 張一組、依花色從 A 遞增排到 K。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 12 cards in ascending sequence by suit from Ace to Queen. There may be empty spaces between but not within such sequences. The tableau wraps around."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成 12 張一組、依花色從 A 遞增排到 Q。順子之間可以有空位，但順子內部不行。牌列是首尾相連的。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 13 cards in ascending sequence by suit from Two to King, plus one of 22 with the trump of 2 to the Fool/Skiz."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成 13 張一組、依花色從 2 遞增排到 K，另加一組 22 張，把點數 2 的將牌一直排到愚者／Skiz。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 13 cards in descending sequence by same suit and move such sets to the foundations. The sequence may wrap around."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成同花色 13 張一組的遞減順子，並將這些組移到王牌區。順子可以循環相接。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 13 cards in descending sequence by suit and move such sets to the foundations."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成依花色 13 張一組的遞減順子，再移到王牌區。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 13 cards in descending sequence by suit from King to Ace and move such sets to the Foundations."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成依花色從 K 遞減到 A 的 13 張一組，再移到王牌區。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 17 cards in ascending sequence by suit from 1 to 16, with a wizard at the end of each row."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成 17 張一組、依花色從 1 遞增排到 16，每排最後再放一張法師。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 8 cards in ascending sequence by suit from Seven to King."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成 8 張一組、依花色從 7 遞增排到 K。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of 9 cards in ascending sequence by suit from Two to Ten."
msgstr "把所有牌整理成 9 張一組、依花色從 2 遞增排到 10。"

msgid "Group all the cards in sets of cards in descending sequence by suit or color, as described below, and move these sequences to the foundations."
msgstr "依下述規則，把所有牌整理成依花色或顏色的遞減順子，再移到王牌區。"

msgid "Group all the cards into four sets of 13 cards by suit in ascending sequence from Ace to King."
msgstr "把所有牌分成四組同花色 13 張，依點數從 A 遞增排到 K。"

msgid "Groups of cards can be moved regardless of sequence, and an empty space can be filled with any card or sequence."
msgstr "牌組可以不依順子規律搬移，空格可以用任意一張牌或任意順子填入。"

msgid "Guest Chamber - The guest chamber acts as a free cell for each suit. Any single card other than the ace of that suit can be temporarily played to the guest chamber, until it can be moved to a space in the free lands or another foundation later. It can only be used if the king and queen of the same suit are played to the castle."
msgstr "客房 - 客房對每個花色等同一個自由格。除該花色的 A 之外，任何單張牌都可暫放到客房，之後再移到自由地的空格或其他王牌區。只有當同花色的 K 與 Q 都已放到城堡後，客房才可使用。"

msgid "Guido van Rossum for the initial example program"
msgstr "Guido van Rossum（最初的範例程式）"

msgid "Gypsy is my all time favorite - it is probably the reason that I started writing PySol at all..."
msgstr "吉普賽是我一直以來最愛的 - 那大概就是我開始寫 PySol 的起因..."

msgid "Gypsy type. 3 decks. No redeal."
msgstr "吉普賽類型。3 副牌。不循環發牌。"

