msgstr "豎琴（Harp）"

msgid "Hearts represent healing potions. If you play one, increase your health by its face value. But your health cannot increase above 20. You can only use one heart per room. If you were to play a second heart before clearing the room, it is simply discarded with no health increase."
msgstr "紅心代表治療藥水。打出紅心時，你的生命值增加其牌面點數，但不能超過 20。一個房間只能使用一顆紅心。若同一個房間尚未清完前打出第二顆，它會被直接丟棄，生命值不會增加。"

