msgstr "六角牌類型。2 副牌。1 次循環發牌。"

msgid "Highlight Piles"
msgstr "標示牌堆"

msgid "Highlight all cards with the same rank."
msgstr "標示所有相同點數的牌。"

msgid "Highlight all cards with the same suit."
msgstr "標示所有相同花色的牌。"

msgid "Highlight all matching cards on the table"
msgstr "標示盤面上所有能配對的牌"

msgid "Highlight piles highlights any sequences of cards in the tableau that can be moved as a unit. Using this does not disqualify you from getting a perfect game."
msgstr "「標示牌堆」會把牌列中可以整體搬移的任何順子全部標示出來。使用它不會使你失去獲得完美遊戲的資格。"

msgid "Hint"
msgstr "提示"

msgid "Hint points out a recommended move that you can make (or at least one possible valid move - the intelligence of the hints can vary from game to game)."
msgstr "提示會指出建議你走的一步（或至少一個合法的可行著 - 提示的智能程度各遊戲不一）。"

msgid "Hint: don't play all your first rank cards on the foundations until all the cards are face up."
msgstr "提示：在所有牌都翻開之前，不要把各花色首階點數的牌全部放到王牌區。"

msgid "Hint: it's important to keep one or more reserve stacks open during the early stages of the game."
msgstr "提示：前期設法讓一個以上的預備堆保持空的，十分重要。"

msgid "Hint: try not to let the waste stack get too deep."
msgstr "提示：盡量別讓棄牌堆積得太深。"

msgid "Hint: try to build more than one suit on the tableau at a time."
msgstr "提示：設法同時在牌列上疊放一種花色以上的牌。"

msgid "Hint: try to keep one row stack open."
msgstr "提示：設法保持一個橫排堆空的。"

