msgid "If enabled, this can also be used to peek at face-down cards"
msgstr "若啟用，也可以用它偷看暗牌的內容"

msgid "If one of the eight stacks is empty, deal four cards from the top of the waste pile to form a new stack to replace it. If there are no cards in the waste pile, deal from the talon instead."
msgstr "若八堆之中有一堆是空的，就從棄牌堆頂發四張牌成新堆補上。若棄牌堆沒有牌，改從牌山發牌。"

msgid "If one peak is empty the points added are doubled."
msgstr "若其中一個峰是空的，加分會加倍。"

msgid "If row two cards will play on the same foundation pick the card that is on the row that holds the most cards. Move cards from one set of foundations to the other to get extra plays."
msgstr "若第二排的牌能放進同一個王牌區，選取所在橫排張數最多的那張。把牌從一組王牌區移到另一組，可創造更多步。"

msgid "If the Program specifies that a proxy can decide which future versions of the GNU General Public License can be used, that proxy's public statement of acceptance of a version permanently authorizes you to choose that version for the Program."
msgstr "若本程式指定可由代理決定未來可使用哪個版本的 GNU 通用公共許可證，該代理公開表明接受某一版本，即永久授權你為本程式選擇該版本。"

