msgid "In Mahjongg games, you can use the shuffle tiles option to reshuffle all of the remaining tiles and redeal the remaining parts of the layout."
msgstr "在麻將遊戲中，你可以使用「重排牌塊」選項，把剩下的全部牌塊重新洗牌並重排版面的其餘部分。"

msgid "In PySol, a sequence is removed by selecting the first and last card of the sequence."
msgstr "在 PySol 中，移除順子的方式是選取順子的第一張與最後一張牌。"

msgid "In PySol, a sequence is removed by selecting the first and last card of the sequence. Royal Marriage, and its related games, can be played with cards dealt manually by the player one at a time, or all cards dealt at once. This"
msgstr "在 PySol 中，移除順子的方式是選取順子的第一張與最後一張牌。皇家婚姻（Royal Marriage）及其相關遊戲，可由玩家一張一張手動發牌，或一次發完全部。這"

msgid "In a hanafuda deck, the suits have their own ranking, arranged by the month they represent, and in many games, the order of the suits plays an important role. The order of the suits is as follows:"
msgstr "花札牌組中，各花色有依其所代表月份排列的專屬點數順序，且許多遊戲裡花色的順序影響很大。花色順序如下："

msgid "In all four foundations, the wizards represent a rank of 17, and a wizard is the last card played to close each foundation. Which wizard is played to which foundation does not matter."
msgstr "在四個王牌區中，法師代表點數 17，且法師是每個王牌區收尾的最後一張牌。哪個法師放到哪個王牌區並不重要。"

msgid "In all of the games, you deal cards from the Talon to the discard pile by clicking once on the Talon with the left mouse button, or pressing &lt;D&gt;. Where permitted by the rules, you can turn over any face-down card with a single click of the left mouse button. You pick up and move a card by clicking on it and holding the button down while you drag it to its intended destination. If the move would violate the rules, the card will not go anywhere. If any card or cards can be put on a Foundation, or in the Ace discard pile of Picture Gallery, a single press of the &lt;A&gt; key will do all of them, a handy way to quickly finish certain games. Sometimes the &lt;A&gt; key will build up the Foundations more than you would like, and these rules allow you to put cards back into the Tableau from the Foundations. Of course, you can also use the Undo key &lt;Z&gt;."
msgstr "在所有遊戲中，你把牌山牌發到棄牌堆的方式，是左鍵點一下牌山，或按 &lt;D&gt;。凡規則允許處，單擊左鍵即可翻開任意暗牌。要拿起並移動一張牌，請點住滑鼠左鍵不放，把牌拖到目的地。若那一步會違反規則，牌就不會動。若有牌能放到王牌區，或像在畫廊（Picture Gallery）那樣能放到 A 棄牌堆，按一次 &lt;A&gt; 鍵便會一次全部放好，那是快速完成某些遊戲的好方法。有時 &lt;A&gt; 鍵會把王牌區疊超過你想要的量，這些規則讓你把牌從王牌區放回牌列。當然，你也可以使用復原鍵 &lt;Z&gt;。"

msgid "In going through the talon, you are limited to three rounds, and an indicator reports on that status."
msgstr "過牌山最多限三輪，並有指示器顯示該狀態。"

msgid "In puzzle type games, the show full picture option will give you an image of what the puzzle looks like when it's completed. Using this does not disqualify you from getting a perfect game."
msgstr "在謎題類遊戲中，「顯示完整圖片」選項會給你完成時樣貌的圖片。使用它不會使你失去獲得完美遊戲的資格。"

msgid "In some games (typically Mahjongg), you can use shift plus the up and down arrow to navigate between layers in the game layout."
msgstr "在某些遊戲（通常是麻將）中，你可以按 shift 加上、下方向鍵，在版面各層間切換。"

msgid "In some games card sequences may wrap around. When BUILDING UP this means you can place an Ace on a King. When BUILDING DOWN this means you can place a King on an Ace. Also called TURN THE CORNER."
msgstr "某些遊戲中牌的順序可以環繞接回。「遞增疊放」時，這代表你可以把 A 放在 K 上；「遞減疊放」時，這代表你可以把 K 放在 A 上。也稱 TURN THE CORNER。"

msgid "In some games, you can use shift plus the up and down arrow to navigate between layers in the game layout."
msgstr "在某些遊戲中，你可以按 shift 加上、下方向鍵，在版面各層間切換。"

msgid "In the first column, each row must be started with a card of a different suit."
msgstr "在第一欄中，每一橫排都要以不同花色的牌起頭。"

msgid "In the first row, you build up sequences starting with a Four,"
msgstr "在第一橫排，你要疊出從 4 起頭的遞增順子，"

msgid "In the first row, you build up sequences starting with a Two,"
msgstr "在第一橫排，你要疊出從 2 起頭的遞增順子，"

msgid "In the following three paragraphs, a \"patent license\" is any express agreement or commitment, however denominated, not to enforce a patent (such as an express permission to practice a patent or covenant not to sue for patent infringement). To \"grant\" such a patent license to a party means to make such an agreement or commitment not to enforce a patent against the party."
msgstr "在本節以下三段中，「專利許可」指任何明示的協議或承諾（無論名稱為何），表明不執行某專利（例如明示允許實施專利的許可，或不提起專利侵害訴訟的承諾）。向一方「授予」此種專利許可，意即作出不在該方行使專利的此種協議或承諾。"

msgid "In the game, the Queen of Hearts represents Fair Rosamund, the King represents King Henry II, with the Jack representing a sinister assailant who wants to take Rosamund for himself. The circle of cards around the queen are the guards of her bower, and the face-down stack under the king are the king's guards. At the end of the game, the king and queen are together at the bottom of the deck, symbolizing Henry II united in love with Fair Rosamund."
msgstr "遊戲中，紅心 Q 代表美女羅莎蒙（Fair Rosamund），K 代表亨利二世國王，J 代表想強奪羅莎蒙的邪惡歹徒。包圍王后的一圈牌是她涼亭的侍衛，國王下方暗扣的牌堆是國王的衛兵。遊戲結尾，國王與王后同處牌組最底，象徵亨利二世與美女羅莎蒙因愛結合。"

msgid "In the rules written by Lady Cadogan, the queen of diamonds and eight kings are placed above the foundations, with the queen being the \"Sovereign\", the red kings being the \"Judges\", and the black kings the \"Bishops\". Since their role is entirely thematic and decorative, this is left out of most modern variants of the game, though it does explain why they are omitted from the deck."
msgstr "在卡多根夫人（Lady Cadogan）撰寫的規則裡，方塊 Q 與八張 K 放在王牌區上方，其中 Q 是「君主」，紅色 K 是「法官」，黑色 K 是「主教」。由於這些角色純屬主題與裝飾，多數現代變體都略去了它們，但這也解釋了為什麼牌組中沒有這些牌。"

msgid "In this game, the foundations are often called the \"Government\" with the tableau called the \"Constitution\", the top row being the \"Privy Council\" and the bottom being the \"People Row\"."
msgstr "在這個遊戲中，王牌區常被稱為「政府」，牌列稱為「憲法」，第一橫排是「樞密院」，最後一橫排是「平民列」。"

msgid "In this game, the red cards are called \"fire\" cards and the black cards are called \"ice\" cards. The object is to move all of the \"fire\" cards to the leftmost five tableau piles, and all the \"ice\" cards to the rightmost five. When dealing, a gap is left between the two sets of tableau piles to show this clearer."
msgstr "這個遊戲中，紅牌稱作「火」牌，黑牌稱作「冰」牌。目標是把所有「火」牌移到最左側的五個牌列堆，把所有「冰」牌移到最右側的五個。發牌時兩組牌列堆之間會留一個空檔，讓分野更清楚。"

msgid "In variations with scoring, undo is disabled in this game."
msgstr "在有計分的變體中，這個遊戲停用復原。"

