msgid "Keep one of the piles clear as much as possible. Don't allow a pile of three cards to build up on top of a single card, especially if the final card from the set is not a bottom card in another pile."
msgstr "設法讓其中一堆盡量保持空的。別讓三張的牌堆疊在單張牌上，尤其當該堆最後一張不是另一堆底牌時。"

msgid "Keep the Wizards off of piles that contain face down cards. Once all the cards on the tableau are face up try to get the Wizards out of the way. Put them all on one row stack until the suit cards have been moved to the foundations. Since the Wizards will not play to the foundation until all the suit cards are on the foundations, and since only Kings will play on an empty row, one Wizard is dealt to the bottom of the second row from the left. If you move that Wizard and there is no other Wizard on the canvas, you will not be able to win the game."
msgstr "法師不要放在含暗牌的牌堆上。一旦牌列全部翻開，就想辦法把法師挪開。在花色牌移到王牌區之前，把法師全部集中到同一個橫排堆上。由於法師要等到所有花色牌都進王牌區才能入區，且空的橫排只收 K，因此由左數第二排的最底層會有一張法師。若你移開那張法師，而王牌區上別無法師，就贏不了這局。"

msgid "Keeping one or more open row stacks is critical in the early stages of the game since the cards are dealt two at a time. It's also important not to let low ranked cards get buried too deep in the waste stack. Do all you can to place as many cards as possible on the row stacks."
msgstr "前期保持一或多個空的橫排堆至關重要，因為牌一次發兩張。也別讓低點數的牌在棄牌堆埋得太深。盡可能把愈多牌放到橫排堆上愈好。"

