msgid "New game and cardset categories."
msgstr "新增遊戲與牌組分類。"

msgid "New high resolution default display. This new display uses high resolution cardsets and scaling to make the games look impressive on larger monitors, but will still scale for smaller displays too."
msgstr "新增高解析度預設顯示。這個新顯示使用高解析度牌組並加上縮放，讓遊戲在大螢幕上更氣派，在小螢幕上也能縮放顯示。"

msgid "New options in the Solitaire Wizard."
msgstr "接龍法師（Solitaire Wizard）新增選項。"

msgid "Nicola Larosa"
msgstr "Nicola Larosa"

msgid "Nightbeat"
msgstr "夜之節拍（Nightbeat）"

msgid "Nine cards are dealt into the tableau. Pairs of cards that total ten can be removed, and are then replaced from the talon. Face cards can be removed in pairs. Tens cannot be removed, so they block that spot in the tableau for the rest of the game."
msgstr "發 9 張牌到牌列。合計為 10 的牌對可以移除，再由牌山補牌。人頭牌要成對移除。10 無法移除，因此會占住牌列中那個位置直到遊戲結束。"

msgid "Nine cards are dealt to nine tableau piles. Tableau piles are built by the same rank. Once all four cards of the same rank are in a tableau pile, that pile may be moved to the foundation. Any card can be moved to an empty tableau pile."
msgstr "發 9 張牌到 9 個牌列堆。牌列堆依相同點數疊放。同一點數的 4 張牌齊於一堆後，該堆便可移到王牌區。任何牌都可移到空的牌列堆。"

msgid "Nine cards are dealt to the tableau. Pairs of cards that total eleven can be moved to the foundation, and the spaces are filled from the talon."
msgstr "發 9 張牌到牌列。合計為 11 的牌對可移到王牌區，空缺由牌山補上。"

msgid "Nine cards are laid out into nine foundation cards, with the kings of diamonds, clubs, and spades in the left and right columns, with the center column consisting of an ace of hearts in the top, and the two kings of hearts below. The center king of hearts is called the Sultan, and no cards can be played on it. Aces can be played on the remaining kings, and these foundations are built up by suit to queens."
msgstr "9 張牌排成 9 個王牌區：方塊、梅花與黑桃的 K 放在左右兩欄，中央一欄上方是一張紅心 A，下方是兩張紅心 K。中央的紅心 K 稱為蘇丹（Sultan），任何牌都不能放在它上面。其餘的 K 上面可以放 A，這些王牌區依花色遞增疊到 Q。"

msgid "Nine tableau piles are dealt, with five cards in the centermost pile, and descending numbers of cards going left and right."
msgstr "發成 9 個牌列堆，最中間的堆有 5 張，向左、向右逐堆遞減。"

msgid "Nineteen cards are dealt to each of four reserve piles, all face-down. The next eight cards are dealt in a reserve row below - two below each of the four reserve piles. The remaining twenty cards are dealt to ten tableau piles of two cards each."
msgstr "4 個預備堆各發 19 張牌，全部反面朝下。接著在下方發 8 張成一排預備堆 - 四個預備堆下方各 2 張。剩下的 20 張發到 10 個牌列堆，每堆 2 張。"

msgid "No building is allowed in this center pile, and cards can only be moved from it if all of their covering cards are removed. The remaining tableau piles are built down by same suit, with only individual cards allowed to be moved between tableau piles, and only kings can fill empty spots."
msgstr "這個中央堆不准疊牌，而且必須先把蓋在上面的牌全部移走，才能從中移牌。其餘牌列堆依同花色遞減疊放，只能在牌列堆之間移動單張牌，且只有 K 可以補空位。"

msgid "No building is allowed in this center pile, and cards can only be moved from it if all of their covering cards are removed. The remaining tableau piles are built up or down by rank, regardless of suit, with only individual cards allowed to be moved between tableau piles. Empty piles cannot be filled."
msgstr "這個中央堆不准疊牌，而且必須先把蓋在上面的牌全部移走，才能從中移牌。其餘牌列堆不分花色，依點數遞增或遞減疊放，只能在牌列堆之間移動單張牌。空列不得補牌。"

msgid "No building on the tableau is allowed. When there are no moves left, one card can be dealt from the talon to each tableau pile. When the talon is empty, all the tableau piles are placed together to make a new talon. This can only be done once."
msgstr "牌列不准疊牌。當無步可走時，可從牌山對每個牌列堆各發一張牌。牌山空了，就把所有牌列堆收攏成新的牌山。這只能做一次。"

msgid "No covered work shall be deemed part of an effective technological measure under any applicable law fulfilling obligations under article 11 of the WIPO copyright treaty adopted on 20 December 1996, or similar laws prohibiting or restricting circumvention of such measures."
msgstr "在任何為履行 1996 年 12 月 20 日採納的 WIPO 著作權條約第 11 條義務的適用法律，或禁止或限制規避此類措施的類似法律下，任何受涵蓋的作品均不得視為有效科技保護措施的一部分。"

msgid "No redeal is allowed. The game is won if all cards have been discarded."
msgstr "不准循環發牌。所有牌都捨棄後即獲勝。"

msgid "No tiles left: 1000 points"
msgstr "沒有剩餘牌塊：1000 分"

msgid "Nomad was created to be more strategic than Gypsy (hence all the open cards), and be solvable more often than it under optimal play. From empiric data, I find it's solvable in all but one in ten games, where I was solving only slightly above a quarter of the Gypsy games. At the same time, the single free cell gives it a very rich complexity."
msgstr "遊牧者（Nomad）是比吉普賽（Gypsy）更重策略而設計出來的遊戲（因此牌全為明牌），在最佳玩法下也比吉普賽更常有解。根據實測數據，吉普賽我只能解開略超過四分之一，遊牧者則十局只有一局無解。同時，那個唯一的自由格賦予它極豐富的複雜度。"

msgid "Normal: 11 columns"
msgstr "標準：11 欄"

msgid "Normandy"
msgstr "諾曼底（Normandy）"

msgid "Not Shisen-Sho"
msgstr "非四川省（Not Shisen-Sho）"

msgid "Not Shisen-Sho 14x6"
msgstr "非四川省 14x6（Not Shisen-Sho 14x6）"

msgid "Not Shisen-Sho 18x8"
msgstr "非四川省 18x8（Not Shisen-Sho 18x8）"

msgid "Not Shisen-Sho 24x12"
msgstr "非四川省 24x12（Not Shisen-Sho 24x12）"

msgid "Not Shisen-Sho is a variation of"
msgstr "非四川省（Not Shisen-Sho）是以下遊戲的變化版"

msgid "Not Shisen-Sho is played like"
msgstr "非四川省（Not Shisen-Sho）的玩法類似"

msgid "Not all Four Seasons hands are solvable. Try to get an open row."
msgstr "並非所有四季（Four Seasons）牌局都有解。設法取得一個空的橫排。"

msgid "Note that automatic play can spoil the gameplay, so purists should not enable any option but maybe"
msgstr "請注意，自動出牌會破壞玩法，講究純正的玩家不應啟用任何選項，或许可用的只有"

msgid "Note that the new high-resolution options will not override your currently selected options for existing users. If you want to use the new settings, you can delete or rename your options.cfg file."
msgstr "請注意，對既有使用者而言，新的高解析度選項不會覆蓋你目前已選的設定。若想使用新設定，可以刪除或重新命名 options.cfg 檔。"

msgid "Note that you are allowed to move cards from one foundation to another. In fact, it's pretty much necessary to win."
msgstr "請注意，你可以把牌從一個王牌區移到另一個。事實上，這幾乎是獲勝的必經之路。"

msgid "Nothing in this License shall be construed as excluding or limiting any implied license or other defenses to infringement that may otherwise be available to you under applicable patent law."
msgstr "本授權中的任何規定，均不得解釋為排除或限制你在適用專利法下本來可主張的任何默示授權或其他侵權抗辯。"

msgid "Notwithstanding any other provision of this License, for material you add to a covered work, you may (if authorized by the copyright holders of that material) supplement the terms of this License with terms:"
msgstr "儘管本授權另有其他規定，對於你新增到受涵蓋作品的材料，你可以（若該材料的著作權人授權）用以下條款補充本授權的條款："

msgid "Notwithstanding any other provision of this License, you have permission to link or combine any covered work with a work licensed under version 3 of the GNU Affero General Public License into a single combined work, and to convey the resulting work. The terms of this License will continue to apply to the part which is the covered work, but the special requirements of the GNU Affero General Public License, section 13, concerning interaction through a network will apply to the combination as such."
msgstr "儘管本授權另有其他規定，你獲准將任何受涵蓋作品與依 GNU Affero 通用公共授權第 3 版授權的作品連結或結合為單一結合作品，並散布結果作品。本授權的條款將繼續適用於作為受涵蓋作品的那一部分，但 GNU Affero 通用公共授權第 13 條關於網路互動的特殊要求，將適用於該結合作品。"

msgid "Novice: 12 columns"
msgstr "新手：12 欄"

msgid "Number Twelve is a three deck variant of"
msgstr "十二號（Number Twelve）是以下遊戲的三副牌變化版"

msgid "Number of Decks"
msgstr "副數"

msgid "Number of Redeals"
msgstr "循環發牌次數"

msgid "Number of reserves"
msgstr "預備堆數量"

msgid "Number of tableau piles"
msgstr "牌列堆數量"

msgid "Numerica type. 1 deck. 1 redeal."
msgstr "數字類型。1 副牌。1 次循環發牌。"

msgid "Numerica type. 1 stripped deck. Unlimited redeals."
msgstr "數字類型。1 副精簡牌組。無限循環發牌。"

msgid "Numerica type. 2 decks. 1 redeal."
msgstr "數字類型。2 副牌。1 次循環發牌。"

msgid "Numerica type. 2 decks. 2 redeals."
msgstr "數字類型。2 副牌。2 次循環發牌。"

msgid "Numerica type. 2 decks. 8 redeals."
msgstr "數字類型。2 副牌。8 次循環發牌。"

msgid "OFL"
msgstr "OFL"

msgid "OPEN"
msgstr "OPEN"

msgid "Object is like in"
msgstr "目標如同"

msgid "Obstruction is an original game by PySol developer Joe R. It is designed as a more strategic version of Michael Keller's Ephemeral FreeCell, requiring the player to block two of the free cells as the game progresses."
msgstr "阻斷（Obstruction）是 PySol 開發者 Joe R. 的原創遊戲，設計為比 Michael Keller 的 Ephemeral FreeCell 更具策略性的版本，要求玩家隨著牌局推進封鎖兩個自由格。"

msgid "Ocean Towers"
msgstr "海洋高塔（Ocean Towers）"

msgid "Of the remaining cards, they are dealt to eight piles of four cards each, with only the top cards face-up, and nine cards are dealt to a reserve. Tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles, and single cards from the top of the reserve can be moved to the tableau or foundations."
msgstr "剩下的牌發成 8 堆，每堆 4 張，只有頂牌正面朝上，另發 9 張到預備堆。牌列堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放，牌列堆之間可移動單張牌或有效順子，預備堆頂端可拿單張牌移到牌列或王牌區。"

msgid "Old Mole"
msgstr "老鼴鼠（Old Mole）"

msgid "Old Patience"
msgstr "老式接龍（Old Patience）"

msgid "Oliver Xymoron &lt;oxymoron@waste.org&gt;"
msgstr "Oliver Xymoron &lt;oxymoron@waste.org&gt;"

msgid "On the bottom row, a set of found foundations built up by same suit using odd-numbered ranks, from ace to jack. These are built in the sequence A-3-5-7-9-J. The remaining four aces are dealt to these foundations."
msgstr "底排是一組王牌區，依同花色用奇數點從 A 遞增疊到 J，順序為 A-3-5-7-9-J。其餘 4 張 A 發到這些王牌區上。"

msgid "On the bottom row, two pairs of foundations on each side of the ace foundation mentioned above. These are built up by suit from twos, using the even numbered ranks, in the sequence 2-4-6-8-10-Q. A two of each suit is dealt to each of these."
msgstr "底排另有兩對王牌區，位於上述 A 王牌區的兩側。這些王牌區依花色從 2 起、用偶數點遞增疊放，順序為 2-4-6-8-10-Q。每個王牌區各發一張該花色的 2。"

msgid "On the top row, four foundations built up by same suit from ace to king. An ace of each suit is dealt to each of these."
msgstr "上排有四個王牌區，依同花色從 A 遞增疊到 K。每種花色的 A 各發到一個王牌區。"

msgid "On the top row, to the left and right of the first foundations, two pairs of foundations that only accept a single king of each suit each."
msgstr "上排中，最初那組王牌區的左右兩側各有兩對王牌區，每個王牌區對每種花色只收一張 K。"

msgid "Once a card from the seven piles is moved, that pile is split into two separate piles, with the top card of both being playable. Piles with only one card that are formed this way turn into foundations, and are built up by same suit, turning the corner from king to ace as necessary."
msgstr "七個堆中任何一堆被移走一張牌後，該堆就拆成兩堆，兩堆的頂牌都可出。這樣形成的單張牌堆會轉成王牌區，依同花色遞增疊放，必要時從 K 轉回 A 循環。"

msgid "Once a foundation is filled, cards are no longer dealt to the tableau pile directly below it. The game is won if all the cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "一旦王牌區疊滿，就不再直接發牌到它正下方的牌列堆。把所有牌移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Once all of the cards have been dealt to the tableau, tableau piles containing only the queens can be treated as empty piles, and any single card can be moved to them."
msgstr "所有牌都發入牌列後，只剩 Q 的牌列堆可視為空列，任何單張牌都能移到上面。"

msgid "Once all of the cards have been moved into the grid, another card from the deck is flipped up to be used as the starter. The starter is mostly treated as a fifth card for each hand. The starter cannot be moved to reserve or waste stacks."
msgstr "所有牌都移進格子後，從牌組再翻出一張作為起手牌。起手牌大致視為每手牌的第五張。起手牌不能移到預備堆或棄牌堆。"

msgid "Once all of the cards have been moved to the zodiac and equator, and the talon and waste pile are both empty, you can start to move cards to the foundations. Also, at this point, cards can be moved between piles in the zodiac."
msgstr "所有牌都移到黃道與赤道，且牌山與棄牌堆都空之後，才可以開始把牌移到王牌區。也是從這時起，黃道各堆之間可以互相移牌。"

msgid "Once all three cards have been played correctly, the monster is slain, and all four cards are immediately removed (to the foundation). Cards in the tableau cannot be moved or removed otherwise."
msgstr "三張牌都正確打出後，怪獸即被斬殺，四張牌立刻移除（移到王牌區）。除此之外，牌列的牌不能移動或移除。"

msgid "Once no more cards can be moved, twenty cards are dealt from the talon, one at a time, and can be moved to reserve piles. Until all twenty cards have been moved (or the talon is empty) no further cards can be moved from the reserve to the foundation. Cards dealt from the talon may be moved directly to foundations, but these do not count towards the twenty."
msgstr "當無牌可移時，從牌山一次一張共發 20 張，可移到預備堆。在這 20 張全部移走（或牌山發完）之前，不能從預備堆移任何牌到王牌區。從牌山發的牌可直接移到王牌區，但不算在那 20 張之內。"

msgid "Once the first foundation card is chosen, deal five cards into the remaining five tableau piles. Cards may be moved between tableau piles one at a time, building down by alternating colors. Sequences can turn the corner, so kings can be played on aces. If a tableau pile is empty, fill the pile using the card from the top of the waste pile, or the stock if it's empty. If both are empty, any other card from the tableau may be moved there to fill the space."
msgstr "選定第一張王牌區基牌後，發 5 張牌到剩餘的 5 個牌列堆。牌列堆之間一次只能移動一張牌，採紅黑交替遞減疊放。順子可以首尾循環，所以 A 上可以放 K。若牌列堆空了，用棄牌堆頂牌補，棄牌堆也空就從牌山補。兩邊都空時，可從牌列拿任何其他牌過去補位。"

msgid "Once the stock and waste piles are empty, the last chance card is flipped up and can be played to a foundation pile."
msgstr "牌山與棄牌堆都空後，會翻開最後機會牌，可打到王牌區。"

msgid "Once the talon is empty, you are allowed additional redeals, by taking the pile in the bottom right, and dealing the cards from it to other tableau piles, one each, starting with the pile directly to the right of it (or the top left pile for the bottom right pile). After this, you can do the same for each tableau pile, going right to left, bottom to top, until you've redealt each pile once."
msgstr "牌山空了後，允許額外的循環發牌：拿起右下角的堆，把牌逐張發到其他牌列堆，從它正右邊的堆開始（右下角那堆則從左上堆開始）。之後每個牌列堆依樣處理，由右至左、由下至上，直到每堆都重發過一次。"

msgid "Once the talon is empty, you can combine the tableau piles, placing the rightmost one on top of the next rightmost one, and so on. You can redeal like this twice in the game."
msgstr "牌山空了後，你可以合併牌列堆，把最右的堆疊到右數第二堆上，依此類推。一局裡可以這樣循環發牌兩次。"

msgid "Once the talon is empty, you can pick up the tableau piles and combine them to form a new talon. You can do this as many times as necessary."
msgstr "牌山空了後，你可以收起牌列堆，合併成新的牌山。需要的話可以做任意多次。"

msgid "Once the talon is empty, you may move cards between the stacks, building down by suit, or playing any card on empty stacks once the waste pile is empty. The game is won when all of the foundations are filled."
msgstr "牌山空了後，你可以在各堆之間移牌，依花色遞減疊放；棄牌堆也空之後，任何牌都可以放到空堆。所有王牌區都疊滿即獲勝。"

msgid "Once there is only one open space in the grid remaining, the last four cards in the deck are dealt out and you can play any one of them into the last space. The game is won if 49 cards can be successfully played into the grid."
msgstr "當格子裡只剩最後一個空格時，會發出牌組最後 4 張牌，你可以任選一張填入那個空格。成功填入 49 張牌即獲勝。"

msgid "Once three cards have been played, deal three new cards from the talon to replace them to set up the next room."
msgstr "打出 3 張牌後，從牌山發 3 張新牌補上，布置下一個房間。"

msgid "Once you've set the configuration options, you can start the solver, and then demo the found solution."
msgstr "設定完配置選項後，就可以啟動解題器，再演示找到的解法。"

msgid "One Away Three Away"
msgstr "差一差三（One Away Three Away）"

msgid "One Dashavatara Ganjifa deck. No redeal."
msgstr "1 副達薩瓦塔拉甘吉發牌。不循環發牌。"

msgid "One Foundation"
msgstr "單一王牌區（One Foundation）"

msgid "One Jack and Queen of diamonds are dealt to the foundations. An additional card is dealt to each of sixteen tableau piles. There are two sets of foundations, one built down by rank from Jack to Queen, and the other built up from Queen to Jack, all turning the corner from King to Ace or Ace to King as necessary. Each set contains one foundation of each suit."
msgstr "方塊 J 與方塊 Q 各一張發到王牌區。另發一張牌到 16 個牌列堆。王牌區分成兩組：一組依點數從 J 遞減疊到 Q，另一組從 Q 遞增疊到 J，必要時從 K 轉到 A 或從 A 轉到 K 循環。每組王牌區各含每種花色一個。"

msgid "One Mughal Ganjifa deck. No redeal."
msgstr "1 副莫臥兒甘吉發牌。不循環發牌。"

msgid "One adjacent tile: 1 point"
msgstr "相鄰 1 個牌塊：1 分"

msgid "One can deal all"
msgstr "玩家可以一次全部發出"

msgid "One can optionally load the Freecell Solver and the Black Hole Solver using their DLLs (for better speed)."
msgstr "可以選擇透過 DLL 載入 Freecell Solver 與 Black Hole Solver（速度更快）。"

msgid "One card is dealt to the foundations at the start of the game. This card determines the base rank of the foundations. The foundations are built up by suit, wrapping from king to ace as necessary."
msgstr "開局發一張牌到王牌區，這張牌決定王牌區的基礎點數。王牌區依花色遞增疊放，必要時從 K 循環到 A。"

msgid "One card is flipped over at a time and moved onto one of eight the row stacks. There are no restrictions on which card may go where on the stacks. Once on a stack, a card can only be moved onto a foundation."
msgstr "每次翻開一張牌，移到八個橫排堆之一。哪張牌能放哪個堆沒有限制。牌一旦上了堆，就只能再移到王牌區。"

msgid "One card is flipped over at a time and moved onto one of four stacks. There are no restrictions on which card may go where on the stacks. Once on a stack, a card can only be moved onto a foundation."
msgstr "每次翻開一張牌，移到四個堆之一。哪張牌能放哪個堆沒有限制。牌一旦上了堆，就只能再移到王牌區。"

msgid "One card is flipped over at a time and moved onto the stacks. There are no restrictions on which card may go where on the stacks. Once on a stack, a card can only be moved onto a foundation."
msgstr "每次翻開一張牌，移到堆上。哪張牌能放哪個堆沒有限制。牌一旦上了堆，就只能再移到王牌區。"

msgid "One deck type. 1 deck. 2 redeals."
msgstr "單副牌類型。1 副牌。2 次循環發牌。"

msgid "One deck type. 1 deck. Varying number of redeals."
msgstr "單副牌類型。1 副牌。循環發牌次數不定。"

msgid "One deck type. 1 stripped deck. No redeal."
msgstr "單副牌類型。1 副精簡牌組。不循環發牌。"

msgid "One king and ace of each suit are dealt to the foundations. Ten cards are dealt to a row in the tableau. Cards from the tableau can be moved to the foundations, with the foundations with the aces built up by same suit to king, and the foundations with the kings are built down by same suit to ace. There is no building in the tableau."
msgstr "每種花色各一張 K 與一張 A 發到王牌區。發 10 張牌到牌列的一橫排。牌列的牌可移到王牌區：有 A 的王牌區依同花色從 A 遞增疊到 K，有 K 的王牌區依同花色從 K 遞減疊到 A。牌列不可疊牌。"

msgid "One nine is dealt to the first foundation pile, and a tableau pile of cards is dealt underneath it. When each nine is dealt, that is dealt to the next foundation, and the next tableau pile is started underneath it, until all cards are dealt."
msgstr "一張 9 發到第一個王牌區，其下再發一疊牌。之後每張 9 發到下一個王牌區，並在下方另起牌列堆，直到所有牌發完。"

msgid "One set of foundations for each suit is built up by suit from ace to king, and one set is built down by suit from king to ace."
msgstr "每種花色的一組王牌區依花色從 A 遞增疊到 K，另一組依花色從 K 遞減疊到 A。"

msgid "One set of foundations is built up by same suit from ace to king, and a second is built down by same suit from king to ace. Each set of foundations gets one sequence for each suit. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "一組王牌區依同花色從 A 遞增疊到 K，另一組依同花色從 K 遞減疊到 A。每組王牌區每種花色各一條順子。所有牌移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "One set of foundations is built up by same suit from ace to king, and the other is built down from king to ace. Each set of foundations gets one sequence for each suit. The game is won if all cards can be moved to the foundations."
msgstr "一組王牌區依同花色從 A 遞增疊到 K，另一組依同花色從 K 遞減疊到 A。每組王牌區每種花色各一條順子。所有牌都能移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "One tile left: 500 points"
msgstr "剩一個牌塊：500 分"

msgid "One-Deck game type. 1 deck. 3 redeals."
msgstr "單副牌遊戲類型。1 副牌。3 次循環發牌。"

msgid "One-Deck game type. 1 deck. Varying number of redeals."
msgstr "單副牌遊戲類型。1 副牌。循環發牌次數不定。"

msgid "One-Deck game type. 1 decks. 2 redeals."
msgstr "單副牌遊戲類型。1 副牌。2 次循環發牌。"

msgid "One-Deck game type. 1 stripped deck. No redeal."
msgstr "單副牌遊戲類型。1 副精簡牌組。不循環發牌。"

msgid "One-Handed"
msgstr "單手（One-Handed）"

msgid "Only a single card can be in the waste pile at a time. If there are no more moves, you can place the four tableau piles at the bottom of the deck, without shuffling them, then move the waste card to one of the piles, and deal a single card from the stock to the other three."
msgstr "棄牌堆一次只能放一張牌。若無步可走，可把四個牌列堆放到牌組最底而不洗牌，然後把棄牌堆那張移到其中一堆，並從牌山各發一張牌到其他三堆。"

msgid "Only kings or sequences that begin with kings can be moved to empty tableau piles. The game is won if all the cards can be arranged in four same suit sequences from king to ace."
msgstr "只有 K 或以 K 開頭的順子可以移到空的牌列堆。所有牌排成四條從 K 到 A 的同花色順子即獲勝。"

msgid "Only once all the other cards have been moved to the foundation can the Queen of Hearts or King of Spades be moved. Once they are moved to the foundation, and all cards have been moved to the foundation, the game is won."
msgstr "只有先把其他牌全部移入王牌區後，才能移動紅心 Q 或黑桃 K。等這兩張移到王牌區、且所有牌都已進入王牌區，即獲勝。"

msgid "Only one card can be moved at a time and empty piles can be filled with any single card."
msgstr "一次只能移動一張牌，空列可用任何單張牌補上。"

msgid "Only the card that is of the same rank and suit as the top card of the waste can be moved. This card can be exchanged with any card on the same row or on the same column of the tableau."
msgstr "只有與棄牌堆頂牌點數、花色都相同的牌才能移動。這張牌可以與牌列中同一橫排或同一直行上的任何牌交換。"

msgid "Only the next smaller card may be played, so that the stacks are in descending sequence except when the previous card is an Ace, in which only the King may be played."
msgstr "只能打出點數小一號的牌，因此各堆呈遞減順序；但上一張是 A 時，只能放 K。"

msgid "Only the top card is available for play on the piles. When no more moves are possible, click on the talon to deal a new card."
msgstr "每堆只有頂牌可以出牌。當無步可走時，點擊牌山發一張新牌。"

