msgstr "配對類型。2 副牌。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Pairs of cards can be removed when the numerical values of the two cards adds up to 13. Queen is worth 12 and Jack is worth 11. You do not have to follow suit."
msgstr "當兩張牌的點數合計為 13 時，該牌對可以移除。Q 值 12，J 值 11。不必同一花色。"

msgid "Pairs of exposed cards between the top card of each column and the four reserve cards may be moved to the foundation. You win if all cards can be paired off."
msgstr "各直行頂牌與四張預備牌之間露出的牌對可移到王牌區。所有牌都能配對移除即獲勝。"

msgid "Pairs of exposed number cards can be removed if they total up to 11. Jacks are removed in pairs. A queen can be removed if it is paired off with a king, but not if they are of the same suit. Removed cards are moved to a single foundation, and the game is won if all cards are paired off."
msgstr "露出的數字牌合計為 11 時可成對移除。J 要成對移除。Q 與 K 配對可移除，但同花色時不行。移除的牌移到同一王牌區，全部配對移除即獲勝。"

