msgid "Picture cards are removed in a set of Jack, Queen, King. A single picture card of each type can be moved to the three reserves, and the tableau pile is filled behind it. Once the three reserves contain one of each picture card, they are all removed to the foundation."
msgstr "人頭牌以 J、Q、K 為一組移除。每種人頭牌各一張可移到三個預備堆，牌列堆隨即在其後補滿。一旦三個預備堆中 J、Q、K 各齊一張，就全部移除到王牌區。"

msgid "Picture cards are removed in a set of Jack, Queen, King. A single picture card of each type can be moved to the three reserves, but they must all be discarded at the same time - no further cards can be dealt from the talon or filled from the waste until a set of three has been removed."
msgstr "人頭牌以 J、Q、K 為一組移除。每種人頭牌各一張可移到三個預備堆，但三張必須同時捨棄 - 一組三張移除之前，不能從牌山再發牌或由棄牌堆補牌。"

msgid "Pigtail"
msgstr "辮子（Pigtail）"

msgid "Piles build down by suit, and you can only move Kings to empty slots."
msgstr "各堆依花色遞減疊放，只有 K 可以移到空位。"

msgid "Piles build from first rank to fourth, and an empty space cannot be filled."
msgstr "各堆從第一級點數疊到第四級點數，空格不可補牌。"

msgid "Piles in the frame are built up or down by same suit, but you cannot switch direction mid-sequence. Cards from the frame can be moved to another pile. Cards from the picture can be moved to a frame pile, but only if it's in the same row or column. The piles in the picture are then immediately filled from the waste, or the talon if the waste is empty."
msgstr "外框中的各堆依同花色遞增或遞減疊放，但順子中途不可變向。外框的牌可以移到其他堆。圖片區的牌可移到外框的堆，但必須與該堆同一橫排或同一直行。接著圖片區的堆立即由棄牌堆補滿，棄牌堆空則由牌山補。"

msgid "Piles in the lower step are built down by alternating color, wrapping from ace to king as needed. Any card can be used to fill an empty pile in the lower step, but only single cards may be moved. No building is allowed in the middle step. Cards from the lower step can be moved to empty piles in the middle step, but not the other way around. Cards can only be moved to the foundation from the middle step or the waste (they may be moved directly from the lower step if there's an empty pile in the middle step)."
msgstr "下階的各堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放，必要時從 A 循環到 K。下階的空堆可用任何牌補，但只能移動單張牌。中階不准疊牌。下階的牌可以移到中階的空堆，反之不行。牌只能從中階或棄牌堆移到王牌區（中階若有空堆，下階的牌也可直接移到中階）。"

msgid "Piles in the tableau/garden are built by the same rank. Once all four cards of the same rank are in a tableau pile, that pile may be moved to the foundation. If a tableau pile is empty, the top card from the reserve/beehive is dealt in its place. If the reserve is empty, any card from the tableau or waste pile may be dealt in its place."
msgstr "牌列／花園中的各堆依相同點數疊放。同一點數的 4 張牌齊於一堆後，該堆便可移到王牌區。若牌列堆空了，就從預備堆／蜂巢頂端發一張補位。預備堆空時，可從牌列或棄牌堆拿任何一張牌補位。"

msgid "Pine - January"
msgstr "松 - 一月（Pine - January）"

msgid "Pirate Gold"
msgstr "海盜黃金（Pirate Gold）"

msgid "Place the 16 cards on the tableau to get a score of 61 points or more."
msgstr "把 16 張牌放到牌列上，取得 61 分以上。"

msgid "Place the 25 cards on the tableau to get a score of 100 points or more."
msgstr "把 25 張牌放到牌列上，取得 100 分以上。"

