msgid "Rearrange the cards so that each pile contains four cards with the same rank. This should leave two piles empty."
msgstr "重新排列牌，讓每一堆都含有四張點數相同的牌。這樣應該會剩下兩堆空的。"

msgid "Red cards may be only played on black cards, and black only on red."
msgstr "紅牌只能放到黑牌上，黑牌也只能放到紅牌上。"

msgid "Refer to the description of the deal in Lara's Game. The difference is the use of four Hanafuda decks instead of two 52 card standard decks When a first rank card is dealt to the rows two cards are dealt to the talon. There are twelve first rank cards in a Hanafuda deck. There are 16 rows in this Lara's game version. Cards are dealt to all sixteen rows based on their rank and which deck they are from. The four decks are shuffled together on the talon."
msgstr "發牌方式請參照拉拉的遊戲（Lara's Game）的說明。不同之處在於使用四副花札牌，而非兩副 52 張的標準牌。當第一點的牌發到各行時，就另發兩張到牌山。一副花札牌有十二張第一點的牌。這個拉拉的遊戲版本有 16 行。牌會依點數以及來自哪副牌，發到全部十六行。四副牌一起洗混放在牌山。"

msgid "Refer to the description of the deal in Lara's Game. The difference is the use of two Hanafuda decks instead of two 52 card standard decks When a first rank card is dealt to the rows two cards are dealt to the talon. There are twelve first rank cards in a Hanafuda deck. There are 8 rows in this Lara's game version. Cards are dealt to all eight rows based on their rank and which deck they are from. The decks are shuffled together on the talon."
msgstr "發牌方式請參照拉拉的遊戲（Lara's Game）的說明。不同之處在於使用兩副花札牌，而非兩副 52 張的標準牌。當第一點的牌發到各行時，就另發兩張到牌山。一副花札牌有十二張第一點的牌。這個拉拉的遊戲版本有 8 行。牌會依點數以及來自哪副牌，發到全部八行。兩副牌一起洗混放在牌山。"

msgid "Refer to the description of the deal in Lara's Game. The differences are the use of a redeals, and a reserve stack. Otherwise, the play and dealing rules are the same."
msgstr "發牌方式請參照拉拉的遊戲（Lara's Game）的說明。不同之處在於有循環發牌，以及一個預備堆。其餘玩法與發牌規則相同。"

msgid "Refer to the description of the deal in Lara's Game. The differences are the use of four decks instead of two, two redeals, and a reserve stack. Otherwise, the play and dealing rules are the same."
msgstr "發牌方式請參照拉拉的遊戲（Lara's Game）的說明。不同之處在於使用四副牌而非兩副、2 次循環發牌，以及一個預備堆。其餘玩法與發牌規則相同。"

