msgid "Sequences are built in a series of three free cells, and are then moved to the foundation once the sequence is complete. The game is won when there is only one card left on the tableau."
msgstr "順子先在三個自由格中依序建成，完成後移至王牌區。當牌列只剩一張牌時即獲勝。"

msgid "Sequences do not wrap around, i.e. only Twos may be placed on Aces and only Queens may be placed on Kings."
msgstr "順子不循環，也就是只有 2 能放在 A 上，只有 Q 能放在 K 上。"

msgid "Sequences follow suit, so once a single card is played in a row, the remaining cards of that suit go in the same row."
msgstr "順子跟隨花色，所以一旦在某橫排放了一張牌，該花色剩下的牌也要放在同一橫排。"

msgid "Sequences starting in a two must be in the top row, sequences starting with a three must be in the middle row, and sequences starting with a four must be in the bottom row. You may start building sequences even if they are in the wrong row, but they must ultimately be moved to the correct row to win the game."
msgstr "從 2 起的順子必須放在最上排，從 3 起的必須放在中間排，從 4 起的必須放在最下排。位置不對也可以先建順子，但最後必須移到正確的排才能過關。"

msgid "Sequences wrap around, i.e. Kings may be placed on Aces."
msgstr "順子可循環，也就是 K 能放在 A 上。"

