msgstr "設定牌組"

msgid "Sevastopol was invented by Jan Wolter, and first appeared in his app"
msgstr "塞瓦斯托波爾（Sevastopol）由簡·沃爾特發明，最早出現在他的應用程式"

msgid "Seven Devils is widely regarded as one of the most difficult solitaire games, due to the high likelihood of unwinnable games if certain key cards are inaccessible due to one of the devils."
msgstr "七惡魔（Seven Devils）被公認為最難的接龍遊戲之一；一旦某些關鍵牌被其中一疊惡魔壓住拿不到，這局就很容易無解。"

msgid "Seven Up, and its related games, can be played with cards dealt manually by the player one at a time, or all cards dealt at once. This option can be set in the options menu."
msgstr "七升（Seven Up）及其相關玩法，可以由玩家一張一張手動發牌，也可以一次發完所有牌。這個選項可在選項選單中設定。"

msgid "Seven cards are dealt into a layout of four rows, and the remaining four cards are set aside to form the stock. A card is dealt in the stock, and may be played in its correct position in the layout, depending on its rank. Eights go in the leftmost column, with aces on the far right, and the remaining cards in sequence. Sevens are played in a column to the left of the main layout."
msgstr "發 7 張牌排成四橫排的佈局，剩下 4 張擱置作為牌山。每次從牌山發一張牌，可依其點數放到佈局中的正確位置。8 放在最左欄，A 放在最右欄，其餘點數依順序排列。7 則放在主佈局左側的一欄。"

msgid "Seven cards are dealt to each of seven piles. The remaining three cards are dealt to three of four reserve piles."
msgstr "七個牌堆各發 7 張牌。剩餘 3 張牌發到 4 個預備堆中的 3 個。"

msgid "Seven cards are dealt to each of seven tableau piles, with every other card dealt face-down (the second, fourth, and sixth cards in each pile will be face-down). Tableau piles are built down by same suit. Any card or valid sequence of cards can be moved between tableau piles."
msgstr "七個牌列堆各發 7 張牌，其中隔一張蓋一張（每堆第 2、4、6 張面朝下）。牌列堆依同花色遞減疊放。任何牌或有效順子都能在牌列堆間移動。"

msgid "Seven cards are dealt to seven tableau piles. The tableau piles are built down by alternate color, and any valid sequence of cards can be moved between piles. Empty tableau spaces are immediately filled from the top card of the waste."
msgstr "7 張牌發到七個牌列堆。牌列堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放，任何有效順子可在堆間移動。牌列出現空列時，立即以棄牌堆的頂牌補滿。"

