msgid "Similarly, the layout consists of three rows of playing piles, a row for newly-dealt cards, and a castoff pile for Aces."
msgstr "同樣地，佈局由三橫排牌列堆、一排新發的牌，以及一個存放 A 的捨牌堆組成。"

msgid "Simple Spark"
msgstr "小火花（Simple Spark）"

msgid "Since any particular card will usually play in several different places on the tableau it's probably possible to win every hand of Great Wall."
msgstr "由於任何一張牌通常都能在牌列的多個位置放置，長城（Great Wall）每一局應該都有機會過關。"

msgid "Since there are only four cards of any one rank, it's important to fill the byte columns first."
msgstr "由於每個點數只有 4 張牌，先填滿 byte 欄至關重要。"

msgid "Single card waste"
msgstr "單張棄牌"

msgid "Six additional cards are dealt to six reserve piles. Cards from the reserve can be moved to appropriate foundations. Cards are dealt from the talon one at a time, and can be moved to the foundations as well, or to empty reserves. You can redeal up to twice per game, meaning you can go through the deck a total of three times."
msgstr "另外發 6 張牌到六個預備堆。預備堆的牌可移到對應的王牌區。牌山一張一張發，發出的牌可移到王牌區或空的預備堆。每局最多循環發牌兩次，也就是整副牌總共可以過三遍。"

msgid "Six cards are dealt face-up, and two cards are dealt face-down to the crib. Move two cards from the six face-up cards to the crib, then flip the face-down cards. Then, one card is dealt face-up to be the starter."
msgstr "6 張牌正面朝上，另 2 張面朝下發到捨牌堆。從 6 張明牌中移 2 張到捨牌堆，然後翻開原本蓋著的 2 張。接著再發 1 張明牌作為引牌。"

msgid "Six cards are dealt out to form the initial tableau. Cards may be moved to foundations, which are built up in rank, in a specific sequence of suits, in the following order:"
msgstr "發 6 張牌組成初始牌列。牌可移到王牌區，王牌區依點數遞增疊放，且花色有固定順序，如下："

msgid "Six cards are dealt to each of six tableau piles. Tableau piles are built down by rank, regardless of suit. Single cards can be moved between tableau piles. Any card can be moved to empty piles. Cards can be dealt from the talon one at a time and played to foundations or tableau piles. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "六個牌列堆各發 6 張牌。牌列堆不分花色依點數遞減疊放。單張牌可在牌列堆間移動。任何牌都能移到空列。牌山可一張一張發，移到王牌區或牌列堆。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Six cards are dealt to six tableau piles. Cards are dealt from the stock one at a time, and are immediately played to a tableau or foundation pile. Tableau piles can be built regardless of suit or rank. Empty tableau piles can be filled by cards from other tableau piles, but otherwise, cards on tableau piles can't be moved."
msgstr "6 張牌發到六個牌列堆。牌山一張一張發，發出後立即移到牌列堆或王牌堆。牌列堆不講花色與點數，可任意疊放。空的牌列堆可用其他牌列堆的牌填補，除此之外牌列堆上的牌不能移動。"

msgid "Sixteen cards are dealt in a square, forming a tableau called the \"antechamber\". No building on these tableau piles is allowed."
msgstr "發 16 張牌排成正方形，形成名為「前室」的牌列。這些牌列堆上不允許疊放。"

msgid "Sixteen cards are dealt out to a \"hand\", and one card is moved to the foundation as a starter. Cards can be moved from this hand to the foundation, if it meets one of the following rules:"
msgstr "發 16 張牌成一手「手牌」，再移 1 張到王牌堆作為引牌。手牌的牌若符合下列任一規則，就能移到王牌堆："

msgid "Sixteen cards are dealt out, forming sixteen tableau piles. Only single cards can be moved between tableau piles, which are built down by alternate color. Empty piles are immediately filled from the talon - cards cannot be dealt from the talon any other way. The game is won if all cards from the talon have been moved to the tableau."
msgstr "發 16 張牌形成 16 個牌列堆。牌列堆採紅黑交替遞減疊放，只能單張移動。空列立即由牌山補牌——牌山不能以其他方式發牌。只要牌山的牌全部移入牌列即獲勝。"

msgid "Sixteen cards are dealt to reserve piles. Cards from these reserves can only be moved to the foundation. Empty reserve piles are filled from the waste pile. Cards are dealt one at a time from the talon to the waste pile, and can also be moved to the foundations. No redeal is allowed. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "16 張牌發到預備堆。這些預備堆的牌只能移到王牌堆。空的預備堆由棄牌堆補牌。牌山一張一張發到棄牌堆，牌也可移到王牌區。不循環發牌。所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "Sixteen cards are dealt to the tableau. Pairs of cards that are both ranked 9 or lower that total fifteen can be moved to the foundation, and the spaces are filled from the talon. Larger groups of cards that total 15 can also be discarded by moving all of them to a special reserve pile."
msgstr "16 張牌發到牌列。兩張都不超過 9 點、合計 15 點的牌可移到王牌堆，騰出的空位由牌山補上。合計 15 點的更多張牌組合，也可全數移到特殊的預備堆來棄掉。"

