msgid "Skillful tableau play with the trumps can make all the difference in this game. You can move a trump from a red card to a black card of the same rank. This will open the red card for a black one of the next lower rank."
msgstr "這遊戲的關鍵在於會用將牌經營牌列。你可以把將牌從紅色的牌移到同點數的黑色牌上，如此便能空出紅牌的位置，讓下一點數的黑牌放進來。"

