msgid "When you get stuck, you can deal cards one at a time from the stock. You can go through the stock a total of three times."
msgstr "卡住時，可從牌山一張一張發牌。牌山總共可發完三輪。"

msgid "Whether the cardset is a 3D Mahjongg cardset - 1 if it is, 0 if it isn't. For cardsets with a version less than 7, version 6 cardsets treat this value as 1, and older version cardsets treat it as 0."
msgstr "此牌組是否為 3D 麻將牌組——是為 1，否為 0。低於 7 版的牌組中，6 版牌組把此值視為 1，更舊版牌組視為 0。"

msgid "Willow - November"
msgstr "柳 - 十一月"

msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

msgid "Winning at Four Winds requires a bit of luck and a lot of skill at using the row stacks to the best advantage."
msgstr "要贏四風（Four Winds），需要一點運氣，更需要善加運用橫排堆的功力。"

msgid "Wisteria - April"
msgstr "藤 - 四月"

msgid "With five piles, but only four suits, all deals will come out eventually. Though still very satisfying."
msgstr "五個牌堆卻只有四個花色，所以每副牌最終都出得完。不過玩起來仍然很過癮。"

msgid "With skillful play and a bit of luck it's possible to sweep this one without needing the redeal. The first priority is to empty the reserve stack. Once that's done try to keep one or more row stacks open. Play high rank cards on the rows and build down on them. The same goes for the Trumps only rows."
msgstr "技巧純熟再加一點運氣，這一局有可能完全不必循環發牌就收清。首要之務是清空預備堆。接著設法保留一個以上的空橫排堆。把高點數的牌放到橫排上，再往下遞減疊放。僅限將牌的橫排也一樣。"

msgid "With this scoring system, it is possible to gain higher scores without successfully placing all the tiles than you can earn by placing the tiles. Try and get the highest score possible."
msgstr "用這套計分系統，就算沒把所有牌塊成功擺完，也可能比單靠擺牌塊拿到更高的分數。設法衝出最高分。"

msgid "Wolfpack"
msgstr "狼群（Wolfpack）"

msgid "Wrapping"
msgstr "循環"

msgid "XOFF:"
msgstr "XOFF:"

msgid "Xantia"
msgstr "贊提亞（Xantia）"

msgid "Xerxes is played with only the nines through kings of each suit from two decks, plus the aces. The remaining cards are removed."
msgstr "薛西斯（Xerxes）只用兩副牌中各花色的 9 到 K，再加上 A 來玩，其餘的牌都拿掉。"

msgid "YOFF:"
msgstr "YOFF:"

msgid "Yield"
msgstr "讓出"

msgid "You are also permitted to move cards back out of the Foundations."
msgstr "你也可以把王牌區的牌移出來。"

