msgstr "你無需為了接收或執行本程式的複本而接受本授權條款。僅因使用點對點傳輸收到複本而發生的附隨傳播，同樣無需接受。然而，除本授權條款外，沒有任何東西授予你傳播或修改任何受保護著作的許可。若你不接受本授權條款，這些行為即侵害版權。因此，修改或傳播受保護著作，即表示你接受本授權條款並同意據此進行。"

msgid "You build up sequences incrementing by three, up to the face cards. Thus, in the first row, each pile is 2-5-8-Jack, in the second row 3-6-9-Queen, and in the third row, 4-7-10-King. Once a sequence has been started, you have to follow suit."
msgstr "你要以點數每次加三的方式建遞增順子，一直建到人頭牌為止。所以第一排每堆是 2-5-8-J，第二排 3-6-9-Q，第三排 4-7-10-K。順子一起頭，就必須跟隨花色。"

msgid "You build up sequences incrementing by three, up to the face cards. Thus, in the first row, each pile is 4-7-10-King, in the second row 3-6-9-Queen, and in the third row, 2-5-8-Jack. Once a sequence has been started, you have to follow suit."
msgstr "你要以點數每次加三的方式建遞增順子，一直建到人頭牌為止。所以第一排每堆是 4-7-10-K，第二排 3-6-9-Q，第三排 2-5-8-J。順子一起頭，就必須跟隨花色。"

msgid "You can check for new versions on the PySolFC website, the news page in the online documentation, along with the SourceForge/Flathub/F-Droid sites. Statistics, options, and user data in your PySolFC user folder will be retained across updates."
msgstr "你可以在 PySolFC 官網、線上說明的新聞頁，以及 SourceForge/Flathub/F-Droid 網站查看新版本。PySolFC 使用者目錄中的統計、選項與使用者資料在更新後會保留。"

msgid "You can deal cards from the stock one at a time, and move cards to the tableau and foundations. Only one redeal is allowed."
msgstr "你可以從牌山一張一張發牌，把牌移到牌列和王牌區。只能循環發牌一次。"

msgid "You can deal cards from the talon one at a time, and move them to the tableau or foundations. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "你可以從牌山一張一張發牌，移到牌列或王牌區。不循環發牌。"

msgid "You can deal cards from the talon one at a time, and move these cards to the tableau or foundation. No redeal is allowed."
msgstr "你可以從牌山一張一張發牌，把這些牌移到牌列或王牌區。不循環發牌。"

msgid "You can download a .DMG package from SourceForge, and install it like any Mac application. Like with the Windows installer, a basic and full package are both available."
msgstr "你可以從 SourceForge 下載 .DMG 套件，安裝方式跟任何 Mac 應用程式一樣。就像 Windows 安裝程式，也分基本與完整兩種套件。"

msgid "You can download additional content from SourceForge, though the full collection is already included if you downloaded a full Windows/Mac package or the Flathub version:"
msgstr "你可以從 SourceForge 下載額外內容，不過只要下載的是完整 Windows/Mac 套件或 Flathub 版，全集已經包含在內："

msgid "You can download the latest Windows installer from"
msgstr "最新 Windows 安裝程式可從"

msgid "You can go through the talon three times. The game is won if all cards are moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌山可以發完三輪。所有牌移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "You can only put a card on top of another card when the numerical values of the two cards adds up to 13. Queen is worth 12 and Jack is worth 11. You do not have to follow suit."
msgstr "只有當兩張牌的數值加起來等於 13，才能把一張放到另一張上。Q 值 12、J 值 11。無需跟隨花色。"

msgid "You can only put a card on top of another card when the two cards are touching horizontally, vertically or diagonally (i.e. the cards have to be neighbours)."
msgstr "只有兩張牌橫向、垂直或對角相接時，才能把一張放到另一張上（也就是兩張必須相鄰）。"

msgid "You can restart any time to get another chance to win this game."
msgstr "你可以隨時重新開始，換一次贏這局的機會。"

msgid "You can use the helper fields to temporarily store cards you expect to use soon, and you can leave them open until the right card comes up from the Talon."
msgstr "你可以用輔助格暫存一下就會用到的牌，也可以讓輔助格空著，等牌山翻出合適的牌。"

msgid "You choose whether the sequences on the foundations will be ascending or descending, and your choice is displayed in an indicator. The choice is made when you place the first card on a foundation which is not the already-determined base card. It must follow suit and must have a numerical value of either one more or one less than the base card. Ace is considered one higher than King, and at the same time one less than Two."
msgstr "王牌區順子要遞增或遞減由你選，你的選擇會顯示在指示器上。當你把一張不是既定基準牌的牌放到王牌區時，選擇就確定了。它必須跟隨花色，且數值要比基準牌大 1 或小 1。A 視為比 K 大 1，同時比 2 小 1。"

msgid "You could add a number prefix (e.g. 123-cardset-name) )"
msgstr "你可以加上數字前綴（例如 123-cardset-name）)"

msgid "You do not have to follow suit. Jack is worth 11 and Queen is worth 12. All Kings go off alone."
msgstr "無需跟隨花色。J 值 11、Q 值 12。所有的 K 都要單張移走。"

msgid "You don't have to draw the lines by yourself, the game does this for you. Just mark two matching tiles on the board, if they can be connected with a maximum of three lines, the lines will be drawn and the tiles are removed."
msgstr "你不用自己畫線，遊戲會幫你畫。只要在盤面上選取兩個相符的牌塊，若它們能以最多三條線連起來，線就會自動畫出、牌塊隨之移除。"

msgid "You may charge any price or no price for each copy that you convey, and you may offer support or warranty protection for a fee."
msgstr "你可以為你傳播的每一複本訂任何價格或不收費，也可以有償提供支援或保固保護。"

