msgid "You may move to a space only the card that matches the neighbor in suit, and is one greater in rank than the left neighbour or one less in rank than the right neighbour. Aces are high, so no cards may be placed to their right (they create dead spaces)."
msgstr "移到空位的牌，必須與相鄰的牌同花色，且點數比左鄰大一點、或比右鄰小一點。A 算最大，所以不能往 A 的右邊放牌（會形成死位）。"

