msgid "You may only go through the stock once. The game is won if all cards can be moved to the foundations."
msgstr "牌山只能發完一輪。所有牌都能移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "You may place cards on the foundation from anywhere on the table, including the end of the Braid. The eight helper fields can be filled from the waste pile but not from the Braid or the braid fields. When you move a card from a braid field to the foundation, that field is automatically filled with the last card on the Braid itself."
msgstr "你可以從桌面上任何地方（包括織鏈末端）把牌放到王牌區。八個輔助格只能從棄牌堆補牌，不能從織鏈或織鏈格補。當你將織鏈格的牌移到王牌區時，該格會自動用織鏈上的最後一張補滿。"

msgid "You only may deal new cards if there are no empty spaces."
msgstr "只有在沒有空位時，才能發新牌。"

msgid "You should also place a file called"
msgstr "你還應放置一個名為"

msgid "You should only install plugins from trusted sources. The PySolFC app maintainers can make no guarantees about the security of third-party scripts. Use at your own risk."
msgstr "你只應安裝來自可信來源的外掛。PySolFC 應用程式維護者無法保證第三方腳本的安全性，使用風險自負。"

msgid "You will lose a game if you consume a hint (unless free hints are enabled) or start demo mode."
msgstr "若使用了提示（除非開啟免費提示）或進入示範模式，該局就會判輸。"

msgid "You win if you complete all the ranks."
msgstr "完成所有點數即獲勝。"

msgid "You win if you get all the cards to the foundations except for the queens."
msgstr "把所有牌都移到王牌區（Q 除外）即獲勝。"

msgid "You win if you get all the cards to the foundations."
msgstr "把所有牌都移到王牌區即獲勝。"

msgid "You win if you manage to completely clear the dungeon by discarding all the cards before you run out of health."
msgstr "若能在生命值耗盡前丟光所有牌、完全清空地牢，即獲勝。"

msgid "You win if your final score reaches 30 points."
msgstr "最終分數達到 30 點即獲勝。"

msgid "You win if your final score reaches 40 points."
msgstr "最終分數達到 40 點即獲勝。"

msgid "You win if your final score reaches 45 points."
msgstr "最終分數達到 45 點即獲勝。"

msgid "You win if your score reaches 200 points."
msgstr "分數達到 200 點即獲勝。"

msgid "You win if your score reaches 61 points."
msgstr "分數達到 61 點即獲勝。"

msgid "You win when all of the cards have been moved to the rightmost stack."
msgstr "所有牌都移到最右一堆即獲勝。"

msgid "You win when the cards are all discarded."
msgstr "所有牌都捨完即獲勝。"

msgid "You win when the entire Gallery is filled with pictures, that is, face cards."
msgstr "整個畫廊都擺滿人像，也就是人頭牌時即獲勝。"

msgid "You win when the talon is all gone. There is no redeal."
msgstr "牌山全部清空即獲勝。不循環發牌。"

msgid "You win when there is only one card left."
msgstr "只剩一張牌時即獲勝。"

msgid "Your objective is to earn a certain score within 30 moves. The goal score depends on the size and number of colors, and will be shown in the play area."
msgstr "你的目標是在 30 步內拿到指定分數。達標分數取決於尺寸與顏色的數量，會顯示在遊戲區。"

msgid "Yukon / Forty Thieves hybrid. 2 decks. No redeal."
msgstr "育空（Yukon）／四十賊混合玩法。2 副牌。不循環發牌。"

msgid "Yukon is one of the classic solitaire card games."
msgstr "育空（Yukon）是經典接龍遊戲之一。"

msgid "Yukon type. 1 deck. 1 redeal."
msgstr "育空類型。1 副牌。1 次循環發牌。"

msgid "Yukon type. 1 deck. Unlimited redeals."
msgstr "育空類型。1 副牌。無限循環發牌。"

msgid "Yukon type. 4 decks. No redeal."
msgstr "育空類型。4 副牌。不循環發牌。"

