msgid "type game adapted to the Hanafuda cards. The tableau consists of six flower beds in two rows above and a Koi pond below with the foundations at the top. Cards build from first to fourth rank on the tableau by suit and from fourth to first on the foundations. Only first rank cards may be played on an empty row. No more than six cards may be played on a row. Cards may be moved from the Koi pond to either the rows or the foundations but may not be moved to the pond. Only one card may be moved at a time."
msgstr "類型遊戲，改用花札牌。牌列上方兩排共六座花壇、下方一座錦鯉池，王牌區在最上面。牌列依花色從第一點數疊到第四點數，王牌區則從第四點數疊回第一點數。空的橫排只能放第一點數的牌。每排最多放六張。錦鯉池的牌可以移到橫排或王牌區，但不能移入池中。一次只能移一張。"

msgid "type game adapted to the Hanafuda cards. The tableau consists of twelve rows. Any stack may be moved, but only a first rank card will play on an empty row. The trash cards are not interchangeable, and no more than eight cards can be played on a row. The game is won when all twelve suits are arranged in order in their respective places on the tableau."
msgstr "類型遊戲，改用花札牌。牌列共十二排。任何整堆都可移動，但空的橫排只能放第一點數的牌。廢牌不可互換，每排最多八張。十二個花色在牌列各自的定位排好順序即獲勝。"

msgid "type game elements."
msgstr "類型遊戲的元素。"

msgid "type game played with the 78 card Tarock deck. Piles build down in rank in alternate colors. The Trumps can play as either color."
msgstr "類型遊戲，使用 78 張的塔羅克牌組。各堆以紅黑交替、依點數遞減疊放。將牌可當任一顏色使用。"

msgid "type game played with the 78 card Tarock deck. Piles build down in rank in alternate colors. The Trumps can play as either color. The five Aces are dealt to the foundations at the start of the game."
msgstr "類型遊戲，使用 78 張的塔羅克牌組。各堆以紅黑交替、依點數遞減疊放。將牌可當任一顏色使用。開局時五張 A 會直接發到王牌區。"

msgid "type game. Play begins with a similar layout. There are seven row stacks with six foundations to either side. The Talon is in the middle. Cards are dealt from the talon to the waste stack one at a time. There is only one round. The cards play on the foundations from fourth rank to first by suits. They play on the rows from first to fourth, also by suits. Rank order is strict for all suits. Only first rank cards will play on the canvas. Cards cannot be removed from a foundation once played there."
msgstr "類型遊戲。開局排列類似。七個橫排堆，兩側各有六個王牌區。牌山在中間。牌山每次一張發到棄牌堆，只發一輪。王牌區依花色從第四點數放到第一點數；橫排也依花色從第一點數放到第四點數。所有花色的點數順序都必須嚴格。只有第一點數的牌能放入王牌區。牌一旦放到王牌區就不能再取出。"

msgid "type of game. Cards on the tableau build down in rank by suit. Cards build up in rank on the foundations. A stack can be moved if the cards are in descending rank order regardless of the suit. Any card or stack can be played on an empty row."
msgstr "類型的遊戲。牌列上的牌依花色以點數遞減疊放。王牌區以點數遞增疊放。點數呈遞減排列的整堆，不問花色皆可移動。任何一張牌或整堆都可放到空橫排。"

msgid "type of game. Cards on the tableau build down in rank by suit. Cards build up in rank on the foundations. A stack can be moved if the cards are in descending rank order regardless of the suit. Only a King or the highest trump can be played on an empty row."
msgstr "類型的遊戲。牌列上的牌依花色以點數遞減疊放。王牌區以點數遞增疊放。點數呈遞減排列的整堆，不問花色皆可移動。空橫排只能放 K 或最大的將牌。"

msgid "under the"
msgstr "依"

msgid "unlimited undo &amp; redo"
msgstr "無限復原 &amp; 重做"

msgid "using"
msgstr "使用"

msgid "using four decks."
msgstr "使用四副牌。"

msgid "variant that is actually a misinterpretation of the original game's rules. This variant is also known as Quasar to better distinguish it from the original game. In PySol, the original game can be found as"
msgstr "變體，其實是對原版遊戲規則的誤解。這個變體也稱為夸薩（Quasar），以便和原版遊戲區分。在 PySol 中，原版遊戲的名字是"

msgid "variant. Even more decisions, and with a fair chance of coming out. The original German name is"
msgstr "變體。要做更多決定，也有相當機會能出清。德文原名是"

msgid "variations. This is the same as"
msgstr "的變體。這與"

msgid "was updated to support Python 3.x."
msgstr "已更新以支援 Python 3.x。"

msgid "weaving"
msgstr "織牌"

msgid "with a redeal and a reserve stack."
msgstr "可循環發牌一次，並有一個預備堆。"

msgid "with a reserve stack."
msgstr "並有一個預備堆。"

msgid "with all cards face-up."
msgstr "全部牌都正面朝上。"

msgid "with as much detail as possible on what's happening, and we will investigate."
msgstr "並盡量詳述發生的情況，我們會追查。"

msgid "with flower cards."
msgstr "配有花牌。"

msgid "with four Hanafuda decks."
msgstr "使用四副花札牌。"

msgid "with four decks and two redeals."
msgstr "使用四副牌，可循環發牌兩次。"

msgid "with four decks, two redeals and a reserve stack."
msgstr "使用四副牌、兩次循環發牌與一個預備堆。"

msgid "with four foundations."
msgstr "並有四座王牌區。"

msgid "with one row of twelve alternate color row stacks and"
msgstr "並有一排十二個紅黑交替的橫排堆，以及"

msgid "with only two redeals. Experienced players probably will prefer this."
msgstr "只能循環發牌兩次。老玩家大概會偏好這種。"

msgid "with ten rows and"
msgstr "共有十排，以及"

msgid "with twelve rows, three redeals and a reserve stack."
msgstr "共有十二排、三次循環發牌與一個預備堆。"

msgid "with twenty two rows and one redeal, using the Tarock deck."
msgstr "共二十二排，可循環發牌一次，使用塔羅克牌組。"

msgid "with two Hanafuda decks."
msgstr "使用兩副花札牌。"

